window.AKK_FAKE_HEIRESS_THOUGHTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FAKE_HEIRESS_THOUGHTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Returning Home","paragraphs":["\"Beicheng, I have only one wish. I... I'm not asking you to treat Yi Yi as your own daughter, just please take her back with you and look after her from now on...\"","On the hospital bed, the old woman tightly gripped the man's hand, her tone pleading.","Deep wrinkles creased her forehead and the corners of her eyes. Her hair was streaked with silver, and she spoke with some difficulty.","At the foot of the bed, the young girl was still immersed in the grief of her relative's impending death. Her almond-shaped eyes were swollen and red. When she first heard the old woman's words, she didn't quite process them.","A few seconds later, her eyes widened in shock.","[What?! No way! They've finally reunited as a family, I shouldn't get in the way!]","The hospital room, which had been filled with quiet sobs, suddenly fell silent. Before the person on the bed could wonder why, the heart monitor flatlined.","Two years ago, Jing Yi had transmigrated into a novel.","To save a kidnapped child, Jing Yi had been stabbed in a vital area by a human trafficker.","One moment, she was on the brink of death, regretting not carrying more self-defense tools.","The next, she woke up in a soft bed with an elderly white-haired grandmother at her side, anxiously asking if she was feeling better.","Jing Yi awoke in a hospital room. The old grandmother told her she had been admitted after accidentally falling into a lake.","As Jing Yi regained consciousness, she repeatedly checked her chest for the wound, but found no trace of it...","Later, she realized she had transmigrated into a sweet romance novel she had read before.","And she was the story's biggest obstacle to the main couple's love - the vicious female antagonist, Jing Yi.","Because the character shared her name, Jing Yi had a particularly strong impression of this novel.","Jing Yi had spent two years abroad. During that time, apart from Grandma Jing, she hadn't met any other members of the Jing Family.","Of course, Jing Yi had lived quite comfortably those two years. The interest alone from her savings account was enough to support a good lifestyle.","Although she was deeply saddened by Grandma Jing's passing - after all, she was her only relative in this world - Jing Yi had also envisioned her future. She planned to live alone in her current villa, find a job somewhere, as she had enough money to support herself anyway.","However, surely the Jing Family wouldn't be so heartless as to take back the villa, right?","After all, when she had transmigrated, the original Jing Yi hadn't done anything yet, and hadn't even met the other members of the Jing Family.","She would just live out her lonely but affluent life in M Country!","Clearly, Jing Yi's wish wasn't going to come true, because at this moment, she was already on a plane back to China.","On the Jing Family's private jet.","The gazes of the Jing Family members occasionally fell on Jing Yi, who was seated diagonally in front of them, their eyes full of curiosity.","Jing Beicheng had rushed over to see his mother one last time. No matter how great the resentment, she was still the woman who had given birth to him and raised him.","But he hadn't expected to encounter such a surprising situation.","He was certain that in the hospital room that day, he had heard Jing Yi's voice, but she hadn't opened her mouth.","And he wasn't the only one who had heard it.","Jing Yi, leaning against her seat, was gazing out the window. She appeared calm, but her heart was filled with frustration.","[Goodbye, my lonely but affluent future life!]","Everyone else in the cabin looked up, their gazes converging on Jing Yi.","After many days, they had heard that voice again.","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly and was about to stand up when his older brother, Jing Zeyou, held him back.","Jing Zeyou shook his head slightly, signaling him not to act rashly.","His deep eyes moved to the flight attendant serving nearby. She showed no reaction, instead blushing slightly under Jing Zeyou's gaze.","Jing Zeyou shifted his gaze, took a sip of coffee from the cup in front of him, and discreetly looked back at Jing Yi.","It seemed only certain people could hear this voice, such as the five members of his family.","Sitting across from Jing Yi, Jing Zejun curiously looked up. Seeing that her parents and two brothers hadn't spoken, she also restrained the meaning in her eyes.","But Jing Yi still noticed her gaze and turned to give her a gentle smile.","[As expected of the female lead! She's truly beautiful!]","Jing Zejun was momentarily stunned. When she recovered, she hurriedly forced a smile and nodded slightly at Jing Yi.","Female lead? So she's seen the shows I've acted in?","Jing Zejun assumed Jing Yi's \"female lead\" comment referred to her roles in TV dramas and films.","However, what surprised her even more was Jing Yi's next thought.","[Money really does make things easier. If I hadn't hired a hacker, I would never have had the chance to send that email to Jing Zeyou's computer.]","All the Jing Family members in the cabin heard this sentence.","Lin Ruiqing's hand trembled slightly as she held her teacup, spilling some tea. The complex emotions in Jing Beicheng's eyes vanished in an instant as he quickly took the cup from her hand and wiped the water off her fingers with a napkin.","\"Did you get burned?\"","Lin Ruiqing shook her head, her gaze inevitably meeting Jing Yi's. She gave Jing Yi a slight smile, then lowered her eyes to look at her now-dry fingers, lost in thought.","Jing Beicheng held her hand tightly, silently comforting her.","The two brothers, Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian, were even more surprised. However, Jing Yi didn't notice as she turned back to admire the scenery, her heart still full of sighs.","Seeing that Jing Yi wasn't looking their way, Jing Zeqian leaned close to Jing Zeyou.","\"Brother, was that email really sent by her?\"","Jing Zeyou shook his head, his heart also extremely conflicted.","Three months ago, he had received an anonymous email. The subject line contained only three words - Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun was his sister who had gone missing twenty years ago. The family had been searching for her all these years, but without any results.","Then came this email, which only stated Jing Zejun's current location, with no other information.","He had traced the email's origin - it came from a foreign hacker.","But since it concerned his long-lost sister, he didn't want to ignore this uncertain lead.","Later, he sent people to the address mentioned in the email, and they truly found Jing Zejun!","He quickly informed his parents of this news, and they brought Jing Zejun back home.","He just never imagined that the email had been sent by Jing Yi.","Jing Zeyou looked up, staring at Jing Yi who was focused on admiring the scenery, listening to her dejected internal complaints.","This was his first time meeting this legendary 'sister', and she was quite different from what he had imagined.","Every year, their father would go back to visit Grandma, but he had never paid much attention to Jing Yi as a person, and had never mentioned her to them.","Their first meeting was in Grandma's hospital room. She had been very sad then, and also somewhat nervous upon seeing them, appearing beautiful and well-behaved.","If he hadn't heard her inner thoughts, that's what he would have thought.","When their father proposed taking her back to China, she had been very surprised, acting as if she didn't want to trouble anyone.","At the same time, Jing Zeyou had also heard Jing Yi's inner voice.","[You really don't have to trouble yourselves! It would be uncomfortable for both you and me if I went with you! Please! Just let me live out my lonely but affluent life on my own!]","Jing Zeyou clearly saw the stiffness on his father's face, though it was quickly masked.","This Jing Yi seemed quite different from what they had imagined."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: The True and False Heiress","paragraphs":["Jing Zejun had known from a young age that the parents who raised her were not her biological parents.","She hasn't seen her relatives since she was three years old.","Twenty years ago, Jing Zejun and her Grandma Jing went to an amusement park. That day, Grandma Jing went to a restroom and never saw three-year-old Jing Zejun again.","Jing Zejun was taken by a man.","Within just two days, she was shuttled around various places, before the police found them and she was placed into an orphanage.","That's where she met her adoptive parents.","Jing Zejun had some recollection of being kidnapped at a young age, and her adoptive parents never hid the incident from her.","Five years ago, both adoptive parents became seriously ill and she had to take the responsibility of supporting the family. After trying various part-time jobs, eighteen-year-old Jing Zejun entered the entertainment industry.","But, her adoptive parents passed away two years ago.","Three months ago, a man claiming to be her elder brother came looking for her, followed by a middle-aged couple and a slightly younger man.","After a paternity test, it turned out that these four were indeed her biological relatives.","However, before Jing Zejun could familiarize herself with her new family, Jing Beicheng told her they were going to visit their grandmother overseas.","Even though Jing Zejun understood the full picture of her kidnapping, she decided to go along and see the little girl that her grandmother brought back after she was kidnapped.","Looking back now, a lot has happened in the past few months. It seems like a lifetime's worth of events.","Jing Zejun glanced at Jing Yi, who was sleeping with her head tilted. She couldn't help but smile faintly. Jing Yi appeared like a sweet, obedient girl, yet somehow different.","Lin Ruiqing's gaze also fell on Jing Yi. She was thinking deeply, looking at the two girls ahead, as though in a daze.","Twenty years ago, Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng had to go out and left three-year-old Jing Zejun with Grandma Jing. Only Grandma Jing and Jing Zejun were at home that day.","Lin Ruiqing even brought gifts back for Jing Zejun, who was upset not being able to go with them.","But before she got home, she received a call from Grandma Jing that Junjun was missing.","She felt as though the sky had fallen upon hearing this. They checked the CCTV, filed a police report, and organized a search.","But there was no trace of Jing Zejun...","She blamed Jing Beicheng - why he had to go out that day. She blamed Grandma Jing for taking the child out alone and above all, she blamed herself...","In that period, the atmosphere in the Jing household was extremely gloomy. Lin Ruiqing was in tears almost every day. Jing Zeqian, too, cried every day, wanting his sister. Grandma Jing felt tremendous guilt.","However, what angered her was not only the fact that Grandma Jing lost her, but also that she brought another girl of the same age a month later!","The arrival of the girl was the last straw for Lin Ruiqing. Back then, she lost all sense of reason.","Outraged, she shouted at the little girl to get out, knocked everything off the table, and became uncontrollable.","Jing Beicheng held her tightly, leading the servants to take the other guests away until she was no longer agitated.","After that day, Lin Ruiqing never saw that girl again, nor saw Grandma Jing.","Every year, Jing Beicheng went to visit Grandma Jing abroad, but he never asked her to go with him. Occasionally, Jing Zeyou would accompany him.","But she never heard any news about that girl from them.","After Grandma Jing passed away, Jing Beicheng asked her if she would be willing to bring Jing Yi back with her. After a moment of hesitation, she nodded.","This was her mother-in-law's last wish before she passed away. No matter what resentment existed, it should end at this moment.","Seeing Jing Yi again, Lin Ruiqing felt conflicted and somewhat lost.","That once shy girl had grown into a young woman.","Lin Ruiqing realized that Jing Yi was the only innocent one in the past incidents. She didn't do anything wrong, but Lin Ruiqing didn't want her to take over the life that should have belonged to her own daughter. That's all.","However, upon hearing that it was because of Jing Yi that they found their daughter, Lin Ruiqing's feelings became even more complicated.","\"Ruiqing.\"","Jing Beicheng's voice drew Lin Ruiqing out of her memories. \"If you're still uncomfortable with her, I can arrange a separate place for her to stay after we go back.\"","Jing Beicheng's voice was soft as he drew his wife closer. He was worried about her feelings. Over the past few years, she had been anxious about Junjun and had taken umbrage at Jing Yi's existence.","Although he had promised his mother to take care of Jing Yi, if his wife was uncomfortable, he would choose to place Jing Yi a bit further away.","After all, it seemed that Jing Yi didn't really want to interact with them.","Thinking back to the voice he had heard that time, Jing Beicheng had a deep impression. Such a reserved expression coupled with a slightly playful voice, it was impossible for him not to remember.","Lin Ruiqing gently shook her head, watching Jing Yi, who was still sleeping soundly, and moved closer to Jing Beicheng.","\"No need, she can stay here at home. After all, there's enough room. Besides, it's not safe for a girl to live alone outside.”","Looking into his wife's eyes, Jing Beicheng saw no reluctance and he felt somewhat relieved.","\"Okay, you don't have to worry. She should be a good kid. It's good timing too since Junjun just came back and now she has a companion.”","\"But will Junjun be unhappy?\"","This concern wasn't in Lin Ruiqing's mind, not until the mention of Junjun. Now she couldn't avoid thinking about the interactions between the two girls.","Since they had promised Grandma Jing to take care of Jing Yi, they of course wouldn't neglect her.","But Junjun had just found her true family, and they weren't very familiar yet. With another girl suddenly appearing in the house, she was worried about how her daughter would feel.","Jing Beicheng looked up at Jing Zejun, who was staring at Jing Yi, and gestured for Lin Ruiqing to look in their direction.","\"Do you see how Junjun seems? Does she appear bothered to you?\"","Following his gaze, Lin Ruiqing found Jing Zejun. At this moment, her eyes were full of curiosity and she was unabashedly staring at the sleeping Jing Yi.","Seemingly to scrutinize what was so special about Jing Yi.","Jing Zejun bore no ill-will towards Jing Yi. Given how Jing Yi was an inadvertent pawn amidst the whole incident, and it was with Jing Yi's help that she could find her family more quickly, Jing Zejun's impression of Jing Yi only got better.","Moreover, she was genuinely curious. Why could she and her family hear what was going on in Jing Yi's mind?","It seemed like the gaze from the person in front was too intense. Jing Yi shifted slightly, which alarmed Jing Zejun into retracting her gaze.","After a moment, she looked up to find that the person had just changed his posture and continued to sleep."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: The Riverside Residence","paragraphs":["After some hassle, Jing Yi finally arrived at the Jing family residence.","The Jing family was one of the most prominent and influential families in North River. At the same time, their Hengjing Group was a renowned internet technology company both domestically and internationally.","\"Little Yi, your room is on the third floor, first door on the left after you turn. Junjun's room is on the same floor.\"","The speaker was Jing Beicheng, the chairman of Hengjing Group. Even though he had stepped back from the frontlines, and was now middle-aged, his every gesture still exuded a commanding presence that inspired admiration.","Jing Yi, gripping her suitcase, politely nodded to Jing Beicheng.","\"Alright, Uncle.\"","Indeed, from their very first meeting, Jing Yi had addressed the Jing couple as Uncle and Aunt.","Even though her grandmother had told her multiple times that they were her father and mother, she stubbornly insisted on addressing them this way.","She thought it would make both parties more comfortable.","\"Let me help you take your luggage upstairs.\"","This was Jing Zeyou, the current CEO of Hengjing Group and the eldest son of the Jing family.","Jing Zeyou was a strikingly handsome man, with excellent features that were both three-dimensional and proper, exuding an air of righteousness.","He stepped forward, ready to help Jing Yi with her suitcase, but she dodged him.","\"It's alright, Big Brother. I can manage it myself. The suitcase isn't heavy.\"","Jing Yi gave a tight-lipped smile, appearing shy and reserved.","Jing Zeqian, lounging on the sofa, turned his face sideways and smirked coldly.","\"Big Brother, she says she can handle it herself. No need to be so eager.\" He wanted to see if she could really manage three flights of stairs.","\"Zeqian!\" \"Little Qian!\"","Jing Zeqian was the second son of the Jing family, founder and CEO of Startrack Entertainment.","Compared to his elder brother's steady and proper demeanor, Jing Zeqian leaned more towards a lazy, bad-boy type, with a hint of frivolity in his manner.","He was the person in this family who was least welcoming towards her, Jing Yi had thought so since their first meeting.","After all, the malice in his eyes was still very obvious even now.","Jing Yi's lips curled slightly, her gaze meeting Jing Zeqian's, confronting the hostility in his eyes.","\"Big Brother, Second Brother is right. I can manage it myself.\"","[Such a snarky comment, I bet he grew up drinking wind oil!]","Jing Yi retracted the handle of her suitcase, gripped it firmly, and lifted it up. She glanced at Jing Zeqian, then turned and headed up the stairs.","Jing Zejun turned to look at Jing Zeqian, then quickly followed Jing Yi upstairs.","\"You!\"","Jing Zeqian had heard Jing Yi's inner thoughts. His eyes widened, and he was about to say something.","Jing Beicheng frowned and walked over, standing in front of him.","\"Jing Zeqian, before we returned to the country, I asked for everyone's opinion. If I remember correctly, your personal objection was overruled. As per our usual practice, you should accept Jing Yi living with us.\"","Indeed, regarding whether to allow Jing Yi to live in the house, Jing Beicheng had called a family meeting. Of course, except for Jing Zeqian's lone objection, the other four members had all agreed.","Following the family's long-standing principle of the minority submitting to the majority, Jing Zeqian's objection had been overruled.","He pressed his lips tightly together, his eyes filled with resistance.","Seeing this, Jing Zeyou and Lin Ruiqing also walked over.","Jing Zeyou furrowed his brows, his eyes conveying disapproval.","\"Zeqian, you don't have to like Jing Yi, but you can't keep treating her with this attitude.\"","\"That's right, Little Qian. Besides, you should be grateful to her. It's thanks to her that we were able to find Junjun.\"","Jing Zeqian opened his mouth, wanting to argue, but seeing the three of them standing united before him, he felt deflated.","\"Fine, fine. I'll just talk to her less in the future. Is that good enough?\"","Jing Yi had also thrown cold sarcasm at him and called him wind oil!","Even though she had only thought it in her mind, everyone had heard it!","Why was he the only one being scolded?","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms and leaned back on the sofa, his expression still somewhat dissatisfied.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi had managed to carry her suitcase up to the third floor in one go.","Placing the suitcase at the top of the stairs, Jing Yi dusted off her hands.","That was easy enough.","Jing Yi turned her head to look left, just about to pull her suitcase over, when Jing Zejun caught up.","\"Jing Yi\"","\"Miss Jing\"","Faced with the pretty young lady, Jing Yi was still very gentle.","Jing Zejun looked somewhat apologetic.","\"Um, about Second Brother...\"","Jing Yi interrupted her.","\"It's alright, Miss Jing. I don't mind.\"","[He's just wind oil personified, it's not worth getting upset over.]","Jing Zejun smiled sweetly. Jing Yi really was a peculiar person.","\"Then let me show you to your room.\"","She stepped forward to help Jing Yi push the suitcase. Feeling its weight, she gave a surprised look at the person beside her.","She had thought the suitcase wasn't heavy, since Jing Yi had carried it up three floors in one go, but she felt its weight as soon as she tried to push it.","Jing Yi's lips curved into an arc, blossoming into a shy smile.","Jing Zejun's smile became even more evident.","She led Jing Yi to the room and pushed the suitcase inside.","Jing Yi peered inside, her first reaction being that the room was huge.","The room was predominantly cream-colored. It didn't look like a bedroom, but more like a fully equipped suite.","Bedroom, walk-in closet, master bathroom, floor-to-ceiling balcony - it had everything.","Although Jing Yi had mentally prepared herself, having already been shocked once when she first arrived at the Jing residence, she still couldn't help feeling amazed at the sight before her.","\"The room has already been cleaned. This is the walk-in closet, with the dressing room inside. That's the bathroom, and the balcony offers a view of the Jiu River. The night view of North River is also spectacular.\"","Jing Zejun patiently introduced the layout of the room to Jing Yi.","Hearing her mention the river view, Jing Yi curiously moved closer.","\"Also, besides Dad, Mom, and your two brothers, you might see Uncle Li and Aunt Wang. Uncle Li is the middle-aged man you met when you got out of the car earlier. He's the family's butler, and you can ask him if you have any questions. Aunt Wang should still be busy in the kitchen...\"","Actually, Jing Zejun had only recently met the other two household members herself. When she first arrived, Lin Ruiqing had introduced everything to her in the same way.","Now she was doing the same for the newly arrived Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's eyes sparkled with amusement as she watched Jing Zejun continue her introduction.","[Jing Zejun is really such a gentle person. No wonder she's the female lead!]","Jing Yi could distinguish between showing off and genuine sincerity. Jing Zejun was truly concerned that she might feel out of place in the house, which was why she was explaining everything in such detail.","Jing Zejun froze, a blush rising to her cheeks, feeling a bit flustered.","\"Am I talking too much?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, her smile deepening.","\"Not at all. I'm very grateful for Miss Jing's introduction.\"","\"Then let's formally introduce ourselves. Hello Jing Yi, I'm Jing Zejun.\"","Jing Zejun extended her right hand, her smile serene, the corners of her lips exuding a gentle warmth.","Jing Yi's round almond eyes curved into crescents, her dimples showing slightly, her smile sweet and adorable.","\"Hello Jing Zejun, I'm Jing Yi.\""]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Family Recognition Banquet","paragraphs":["When Jing Yi and Jing Zejun came downstairs, Aunt Wang had already prepared the meal, and Jing Zeyou and the others were already seated in the dining room, waiting for them to eat.","\"Sorry for keeping everyone waiting,\" Jing Yi said as she naturally took a seat next to Jing Zejun.","Seeing this, Jing Zeqian wanted to say something, but Jing Zeyou gave him a warning look, causing him to swallow his words.","\"Now that everyone's here, let's eat,\" Jing Beicheng said.","\"Jing Yi, I wasn't sure what you like to eat, so I had Aunt Wang prepare some of her specialties. Try them and see if you like them,\" Lin Ruiqing said.","Jing Yi's dimples showed as she smiled, looking very sweet and obedient. \"Thank you, Auntie. Everything looks delicious. I'll help myself then.\"","[Wow, what's with this beef brisket? It's so good! And these shrimp are delicious too...]","Because of the new addition to the family, the Jing family's dining table seemed a bit quiet, but that was only on the surface.","Jing Zeyou and the others listened to Jing Yi's exclamations with twitching eyes, as the family meals had never been this 'lively' before.","Seeing that Jing Yi quite enjoyed the dishes, Lin Ruiqing relaxed a bit and began to have an appetite to enjoy dinner.","Jing Zeqian, however, was the only one at the table with a sour expression. He wanted to retort, but every time he tried to open his mouth, he was met with three pairs of eyes staring at him. Who could be happy in such a situation?","In any case, he had no appetite. Watching Jing Yi eat so happily only worsened his mood.","\"You must be exhausted these past couple of days. After dinner, go and get some good rest to recover,\" Jing Beicheng said as he placed a piece of mandarin fish on Lin Ruiqing's plate.","His wife's health hadn't been good for years, and she had been busy with various matters following Grandmother Jing's passing. Jing Beicheng was worried she might not be able to handle it.","Lin Ruiqing didn't refuse. It was indeed time to take care of her health.","She had just found her daughter and wanted to spend more time with her.","Her gaze inevitably shifted to Jing Yi, and she was relieved to see that she didn't seem uncomfortable.","\"Jing Yi, you should also rest well these few days. Once you're rested, we can have Zeyou and Zeqian show you around North river,\" Lin Ruiqing said.","That day, Jing Yi had cried very hard. Not loudly or dramatically, but silently kneeling to the side, with large tears falling continuously.","Lin Ruiqing thought she must be very sad. That was her only relative, and regardless of what kind of person Grandmother Jing actually was, in Jing Yi's eyes, she must have been a kind, loving, and doting family member.","She had grown up abroad all these years, so suddenly returning to the country would certainly take some getting used to. Lin Ruiqing wanted to make her feel as comfortable as possible.","Hearing Lin Ruiqing's voice, Jing Yi looked up, smiling and agreeing, still appearing obedient and shy.","Jing Zeqian, sitting nearby, couldn't stand it anymore.","\"She hasn't rested enough? On the plane, she was sleeping so deeply she was drooling,\" he said.","Jing Yi's smile froze for a moment, her eyebrows raised slightly as she turned to look at him with a dazzling smile.","Caught off guard, Jing Zeqian's gaze wavered for a moment.","\"I didn't realize Second Brother was paying so much attention to me. Thank you for your concern!\" Jing Yi said.","Jing Zeqian frowned, \"Who's paying attention to you?! Can you not be so full of yourself?\"","Jing Yi apologetically said, \"I'm sorry, Second Brother. I might be clumsy with my words. I just admire people like you who are so eloquent, saying whatever comes to mind without thinking... No, I don't mean that you speak without thinking, Second Brother. You won't be angry, will you?\"","[Really, did he drink too much peppermint oil? Has 'Startrack' turned into a company selling water pipes? Why is he meddling so much?!]","\"You...!\" Jing Zeqian's face began to turn a faint blue.","\"Ahem,\" Jing Zeyou cleared his throat, picking up his water glass and secretly kicking Jing Zeqian under the table, signaling him to be quiet.","Jing Zeqian was about to explode. Every time he tried to retaliate, he was interrupted by his family members. He had already been attacked several times by Jing Yi without being able to fight back.","However, seeing the warning looks from Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing, he swallowed his anger.","You win this time, Jing Yi!","Jing Zeqian glared at Jing Yi, his gaze inevitably falling on his sister, who was lowering her head, biting her lip to suppress her laughter, her body slightly shaking.","He felt a bit hurt. Even his sister was laughing at him!","In fact, not only Jing Zejun, but Jing Zeyou sitting next to him also had amusement dancing in his eyes. He just didn't voice it to save his younger brother's face.","The atmosphere at the dinner table became more natural.","After dinner, as Jing Zejun was about to take Jing Yi for a walk outside the villa, Jing Beicheng called out to stop them.","He had just remembered something he wanted to say, but had forgotten earlier when he was interrupted at the dinner table.","\"Oh, right. There's one more thing,\" he said, his gaze subtly sweeping over Jing Yi and Jing Zejun standing at the door.","\"The banquet arranged for Zejun is next Tuesday.\"","Jing Zejun instinctively glanced at Jing Yi beside him.","She knew that her father had prepared a banquet for her and planned to formally introduce her identity there.","Although she didn't care much about whose daughter she was, as finding her birth parents was already enough to make her happy, she hadn't refused her parents' good intentions. After all, this banquet had been in preparation for a long time.","She just hadn't expected to be informed in such a setting.","[A banquet! The legendary high-society banquet, and I'll get to attend! They should bring me along, right?]","Jing Yi didn't seem to mind. Having finally found their long-lost daughter, it was natural for a family of the Jings' social standing to announce it to the world, to avoid any slight to their daughter.","[Why is everyone looking at me? Aren't they talking about Jing Zejun's banquet?]","The five of them hurriedly averted their gazes, pretending to be occupied with something else.","Jing Zejun quickly spoke up, somewhat trying to cover up the situation.","\"Mom, Dad, actually, we could just keep it simple. Maybe just have a family dinner...\"","\"No,\" Jing Beicheng rejected Jing Zejun's suggestion. It wasn't just that the banquet was already prepared, but they also didn't want to shortchange Jing Zejun in any way.","Besides Jing Beicheng's objection, there was another out-of-place voice in the living room, particularly noticeable.","[No way! This is a must-have step for recognizing a long-lost child in a wealthy family. I'd regret it for life if I missed it!]","Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a smile, which he quickly suppressed when he noticed Jing Yi looking at him.","On the other side, Jing Zeqian let out a cold laugh.","He had seen carefree people before, but never someone so carefree. Did she really not understand the implication of their father saying this in front of her?","Looking at the children in the living room, Lin Ruiqing's mood improved slightly. After Jing Yi and Jing Zejun left, her smile faded. She glanced at Jing Beicheng before turning to go upstairs.","Jing Beicheng rubbed his nose, following her upstairs with his hands behind his back. His figure still looked upright and steady, but the hint of hesitation in his eyes betrayed his guilty conscience.","Jing Zeqian nudged Jing Zeyou beside him, gesturing towards Jing Beicheng's retreating figure with a look that suggested he was enjoying the drama.","Only when Jing Beicheng was out of sight did he turn back, lazily leaning back on the sofa with his long legs crossed.","His relaxed demeanor truly resembled that of a carefree young master."]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: The Wager","paragraphs":["\"Tone it down a bit, Dad might see you soon.\"","Jing Zeqian couldn't care less. He had just seen that Dad was too busy to pay attention to him right now.","Recalling Lin Ruiqing's expression earlier, Jing Zeqian sidled up to his brother, eyes full of gossip.","\"Bro, how long do you think it'll take Dad to appease Mom this time?\"","This was their go-to entertainment whenever Jing Beicheng upset Lin Ruiqing. They would guess how long it would take their father to make amends.","Jing Zeyou glanced up at him. Nearly thirty years old, yet still so childish in behavior.","\"One hour.\"","Might as well take the money offered.","Jing Zeqian didn't agree with this answer. An hour seemed too long for Dad; it surely underestimated the experience he had accumulated over the years.","His almond-shaped eyes glinted with mischief as his thin lips curled into a smirk. He held up two fingers to Jing Zeyou.","\"Half an hour, twenty thousand.\"","Mom didn't look too upset today. Given Dad's skills, he could sort it out in half an hour.","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow and upped the stakes.","\"Twenty thousand? That's too little. I'm more interested in your share of profits from that movie you invested in last time.\"","Jing Zeqian's eyes widened as he suddenly sat up straight, his earlier nonchalance gone.","\"Bro, that's too harsh!\"","In the past, this had just been a little game between brothers, so the amounts were never large. But this time, Jing Zeyou clearly wanted to teach him a lesson.","\"Not playing?\"","\"...Fine! Then I want a share of Hengjing's profits from that software development last time!\" Who's afraid of whom? Let's see who can play harder!","Jing Zeyou shrugged indifferently, not caring what his brother wanted. He was confident he'd win anyway.","He was certain that their parents wouldn't come down within the hour.","Upstairs, Jing Beicheng followed Lin Ruiqing into the bedroom.","Lin Ruiqing sat on the sofa, her face expressionless.","Jing Beicheng slowly walked over to sit beside her, but she immediately moved away.","She seemed extremely upset.","Jing Beicheng cleared his throat, pondering how to start appeasing her.","\"Why did you have to mention the banquet in front of Jing Yi?\"","Lin Ruiqing couldn't help but question him. This matter could have been discussed slowly, but there was no need to give the girl such a harsh welcome on her first day at home.","What truly angered her was that her husband would use such tactics on a girl in her early twenties.","Even if it was for their own daughter.","Jing Beicheng sighed, moving closer to Lin Ruiqing and firmly grasping her hand to prevent her from moving away again.","\"The banquet was already set in stone, whether we mentioned it earlier or later...\"","Seeing that he was about to gloss over it, Lin Ruiqing glared at him angrily, and Jing Beicheng stopped mid-sentence.","\"Alright, I'll be honest. I did want Jing Yi to understand certain things from the start.\"","For instance, that Jing Zejun should have more. It might be cruel, but Jing Beicheng had to do it. Perhaps now they knew Jing Yi wasn't a bad person, quite the opposite – she was extremely innocent. But he couldn't guarantee that over time, her innocence wouldn't change and affect Jing Zejun.","He had seen too many relatives turn against each other for fame and fortune throughout his life, let alone people who weren't even related.","Lin Ruiqing was exasperated, \"We could have explained it gradually. There was no need to treat her like this as soon as we brought her home...\"","\"Ruiqing, the longer we wait, the harder it becomes to bring it up. We had to say it anyway, so what's wrong with saying it earlier?\"","Lin Ruiqing opened her mouth to argue but stopped when she saw Jing Beicheng's serious expression.","She knew that what he said was right and that he was considering her and Jing Zejun's interests.","She just felt... more conflicted.","She didn't know whether to be relieved that Jing Yi was carefree enough not to dwell on the deeper implications of Jing Beicheng's words,","Or to feel guilty about her own selfishness...","\"Don't worry, I don't really want to make things difficult for her. I just want to nip any unnecessary troubles in the bud.\"","Perhaps due to his years in a high position, Jing Beicheng's approach to problems had become more direct. He preferred to use the most efficient method to achieve the same result.","Lin Ruiqing sighed, her mood growing heavier.","At this point, Jing Beicheng also felt a bit of regret for not considering his wife's feelings.","Although she hadn't said it, Jing Beicheng knew that his wife had always felt some guilt towards that child.","But in his view, they didn't owe Jing Yi anything. His mother had adopted her from the orphanage, given her a life of comfort and love, and they would continue to take care of her, as long as she didn't change.","Jing Beicheng put his arm around Lin Ruiqing's shoulders, letting her lean on him, slowly easing her mood as he continued to explain in a low voice.","As the atmosphere upstairs gradually improved, downstairs became particularly gloomy, though only for Jing Zeqian.","Watching the seconds tick by with Jing Beicheng and his wife still not coming down, Jing Zeqian's heart sank bit by bit.","The extra money he had worked so hard to earn was about to go to his brother.","Over the past half hour, Jing Zeqian's state had changed from confidently lounging on the sofa, to showing signs of anxiety and frequently glancing towards the stairs, to finally collapsing on the sofa as if his dreams had been shattered.","Jing Zeyou casually lifted his hand to check his watch, then shifted his gaze to Jing Zeqian, who was now sprawled on the sofa with a look of utter despair.","\"Five more minutes until it's a full hour.\"","\"If it goes over the hour you predicted, then this round is void!\"","Jing Zeqian suddenly sat up, his eyes wide open, a gleam of wild joy in them, as if he felt his extra cash hadn't yet left his pocket.","Jing Zeyou made no comment, silently waiting for a few minutes until he heard the footsteps of Jing Beicheng and his wife.","He smirked, tapped his watch, and raised an eyebrow at Jing Zeqian, who once again looked utterly dejected.","\"Transfer the money to my account.\"","Then he leaned back in his chair lazily, looking completely at ease.","In stark contrast to Jing Zeqian on the sofa beside him.","Lin Ruiqing came downstairs to find the two brothers in this state and looked puzzled.","\"Zeqian, what's wrong?\"","His head was tilted back on the sofa, swaying slightly, his mood very low.","\"It's nothing, Mom. I just suddenly realized that life's greatest disappointment is when you think you're about to succeed, but instead you fall into an even deeper abyss.\"","Jing Beicheng shared the same confused look, not knowing what nonsense his son was spouting now.","Lin Ruiqing thought her younger son had encountered some major problem and was about to inquire further.","Jing Zeyou lowered his head and chuckled, the smile spreading across his face.","\"Don't worry about him, Mom. He's fine.\"","Since her elder son said it was nothing, it probably wasn't anything serious.","Lin Ruiqing decided not to dwell on Jing Zeqian's melancholy and instead pulled Jing Beicheng along to check on the two girls who hadn't returned from their outing yet."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Life of the Wealthy","paragraphs":["Early morning, Jing Yi awoke from her soft bed.","Though it wasn't 500 meters wide, she could still roll around freely!","Jing Yi rolled from the head of the bed to the foot, then rolled back again.","Only then did she lazily stretch, preparing to get up.","This was how she had spent the past few days - sleeping comfortably until naturally waking, then going downstairs for breakfast, playing racing or fighting games in the basement game room, having dinner, and thus passing the day.","\"Ah, another decadent day begins!\"","Though her tone was sighing, Jing Yi's eyes were clearly sparkling, wondering what delicious food Aunt Wang had prepared for breakfast today!","Life in the Jing family home was much better than she had imagined.","After washing up, Jing Yi changed clothes and prepared to go downstairs.","She thought it would be like usual, with everyone else having left except for her.","Jing Zeyou was always the first to leave punctually for Hengjing Group. Though Jing Zeqian seemed rather laid-back, he was after all the CEO of an entertainment company, so naturally couldn't slack off.","Jing Zejun had also gone to film on set, while as for Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing, though they had both stepped back from the limelight, they still had invitations they couldn't refuse, so their presence was rarely seen these days.","But Jing Yi had just come downstairs when she encountered Jing Zeyou.","Her surprise was evident on her face, impossible for Jing Zeyou to ignore.","He also hadn't expected Jing Yi to only get up at this hour every day.","\"Big brother? You're not going to work today?\"","\"No, I worked overtime last night.\"","Jing Yi widened her eyes as she looked at the person before her, an expression of disbelief on her face.","\"So, you were working overtime all night, and only just got back to rest?\"","Jing Zeyou nodded.","Only then did Jing Yi notice the dark circles under his eyes, and couldn't help but feel admiration.","[Being a CEO isn't something just anyone can do, this is too intense!]","\"Then big brother, you should hurry upstairs to rest. Work is important, but so is your health.\"","Jing Yi moved to the side to let Jing Zeyou go upstairs, her expression full of concern.","The polite smile at the corner of Jing Zeyou's mouth hadn't fully formed when he heard another voice.","[Big brother really lives up to the title of 'workaholic', the Jing family is lucky to have you! Keep it up! My second half of life depends on you!]","He was momentarily at a loss for words, but quickly concealed the emotions in his eyes, smiling and thanking Jing Yi before heading upstairs.","Left downstairs, Jing Yi shook her head in admiration, then cheerfully went to find Aunt Wang to solve the breakfast issue.","At two in the afternoon, Jing Zeyou finally woke up.","Actually, he wasn't always this intense, otherwise why would the company hire so many technical experts?","Last night's overtime was because the company secretary suddenly called, saying the company's system had been hacked, so he rushed back to the company overnight.","Thanks to the layers of system protection, the hacker hadn't obtained any information, but it was enough to make Jing Zeyou take it seriously.","As a result, he had been busy until now.","Jing Zeyou came downstairs but didn't see Jing Yi, thinking she must have gone to the basement to play games again.","Aunt Wang came over, \"Zeyou, you're awake? Come quickly, I've prepared lunch for you.\"","\"Thank you, Aunt Wang.\"","Aunt Wang had been with the Jing family even longer than Jing Zeyou, so she was quite close with the family members.","Jing Zeyou sat at the dining table, watching as Aunt Wang brought out the dishes one by one.","\"Aunt Wang, these dishes... are they new recipes you're trying out?\"","Before him were various grain porridges and health soups, as well as a cup of tea with unknown ingredients - he certainly couldn't smell what was in it.","Aunt Wang wiped her hands and walked over with a smile.","\"You child, working overtime and not even telling Aunt Wang. It was little Yi who told me you just got back from work, so I quickly prepared some food for you, to help you recover.\"","Jing Zeyou looked at the grain porridge before him, the corners of his mouth turning up. At least she knew to fight for his future.","\"Then what's this cup?\"","Aunt Wang looked at the cup of health tea on the table, whose ingredients were indiscernible, with a somewhat troubled expression.","\"This is... a health tea that little Yi brewed for you.\"","So?","Jing Zeyou was waiting for Aunt Wang to tell him what was in it.","Aunt Wang smiled apologetically, \"I'm sorry, Zeyou, I don't know what little Yi put in it either, but she said it's all good for the body.\"","She had been preparing the grain porridge when she turned around to see Jing Yi had already brewed the health tea and placed it nearby, saying it was for big brother to drink.","Jing Zeyou's smile froze as he stared at the health tea before him with an indescribable expression.","Considering she had specially brewed it, Jing Zeyou still picked up the cup, preparing to take a sip.","Aunt Wang beside him stared intently at the cup, also curious about this health tea.","The tea had barely touched his lips, just a slight taste, when Jing Zeyou immediately moved the cup away.","It really was hard to drink!","Seeing that Jing Zeyou wasn't going to continue drinking, Aunt Wang looked a bit disappointed and prepared to return to the kitchen.","\"Oh right, little Yi is sunbathing in the courtyard. You can go ask her after you finish eating.\"","Aunt Wang left reassured, waiting for Jing Zeyou to uncover the mystery.","Jing Yi, currently sunbathing in the courtyard, was unaware that the two in the dining room were puzzled by her health tea.","At this moment, she was comfortably sleeping on a lounge chair, sunbathing.","When Jing Zeyou came out, he saw a fully armored person sunbathing.","He found Jing Yi's behavior somewhat confusing - not a single patch of skin exposed, how could this be considered sunbathing?","\"Is this... sunbathing?\"","Jing Yi lifted her sunglasses, seeing Jing Zeyou standing beside her. Her almond eyes curved, her smile as warm and bright as the sun.","\"Big brother, have you eaten?\"","\"Mm, I came to ask about that cup of health tea...\"","Jing Yi seemed to think for a moment before remembering what health tea he was talking about.","\"Oh, that. I heard people who stay up late need to replenish themselves, so I found some cassia seeds and such in the kitchen, put them together to brew. There shouldn't be anything inedible in it.\"","Jing Zeyou's mouth twitched slightly. What did she mean by 'shouldn't be'?","She still hadn't said exactly what was in it...","\"Big brother, want to sunbathe together?\"","Seeing that he was still standing beside her and hadn't left, Jing Yi extended an invitation to sunbathe together.","To be honest, it did look very relaxing.","So, another lounge chair appeared on the lawn.","Jing Zeyou didn't know why he was accompanying Jing Yi in doing such a boring thing.","But, his mood wasn't bad.","Jing Zeyou closed his eyes, leisurely lying on the lounge chair, and curiously asked, \"Dressed like that, aren't you hot?\"","Actually, what he wanted to ask more was, what's the point of sunbathing like this?","Level 10 sun protection sunbathing?","Under the brim of her hat, the corners of Jing Yi's mouth turned up slightly. She stretched out a small hand, waved it slightly, then quickly hid it back in her sleeve.","\"Big brother, I'm not hot. This way I won't get tanned!\"","[This set of sun protection clothing is very expensive! It's cool and refreshing, yet warm in the sunlight! This is the best way to sunbathe!]","Jing Zeyou was even more confused. What kind of sunbathing method was this?","But seeing her enjoyment, Jing Zeyou didn't speak again, closing his eyes to quietly sunbathe.","When Jing Zeqian returned home, he saw the two of them sprawled out in the middle of the courtyard, sunbathing.","If it was just Jing Yi, it wouldn't be strange, but he also saw his brother!"]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Brother-Controlled Little Princess","paragraphs":["What's going on now?","Jing Zejun finally finished work early today and could get home sooner to have dinner with her family. However, the atmosphere at the dinner table seemed a bit off.","As Jing Zejun picked at the white rice in her bowl, she secretly glanced at Jing Zeqian, then at Jing Yi. The food in front of her no longer held any appeal.","Did they have a fight? Jing Yi hadn't mentioned anything.","Moreover, Second Brother's resentment seemed directed not just at Jing Yi, but at Big Brother too.","Was Big Brother involved in this somehow?","She had only been away for one day, but it seemed like a lot had happened at home.","At the table, Jing Yi, who was being glared at by Jing Zeqian, paid no attention and focused on eating her dinner. After all, it wasn't the first time Jing Zeqian had shown his dislike for her - she was used to it by now.","[Aunt Wang's braised lion's head meatballs are absolutely amazing today!]","Beside her, Jing Zeyou also seemed unbothered, calmly picking up food with his chopsticks and occasionally chatting with Jing Beicheng, completely ignoring Jing Zeqian's stares.","Mr. and Mrs. Jing Beicheng had naturally noticed the looks exchanged between their children. Though they didn't know what was going on, they chose not to interfere in the children's affairs and went for a stroll in the courtyard after dinner.","In the living room, Jing Zejun sat on the sofa, looking from one person to another. Seeing that Jing Zeqian was still in a foul mood, she couldn't bear to pretend she hadn't noticed.","\"Second Brother, what's wrong?\"","Jing Zeqian felt like he could die from emotion. \"Little sister! You're the only one who's good to your Second Brother! You're the only one in this family who cares about me!\"","Jing Zeqian held onto Jing Zejun's hand as he lamented about what he had seen in the courtyard that afternoon.","On the other side, Jing Yi couldn't help but do something out of character.","She rolled her eyes, while Jing Zeyou also glanced at the complaining man with some exasperation.","\"So, it's just because they were sunbathing together?\" Jing Zejun's tone was uncertain. Was this really her cool and aloof Second Brother?","Jing Zeqian's expression immediately turned serious, emphasizing that it wasn't 'just' that.","She gave a dry laugh, wanting to comfort Jing Zeqian but not knowing what to say.","With Second Brother's attitude, he didn't even need to avoid Jing Yi anymore. It would be hard to make people angry; they'd probably just find it amusing.","\"Enough already? Junjun, go play with Xiao Yi. Don't mind him.\"","Big Brother had spoken. Jing Zejun smiled apologetically, quickly withdrew her hand, and walked over to Jing Yi's side, pulling her back to their room.","Seeing that the spectators had left, Jing Zeqian dropped his act and leaned back in his chair, resuming his usual lazy demeanor.","He was just trying to amuse his little sister anyway. Occasional silliness was harmless and could even strengthen their sibling bond.","\"You two have gotten close enough to sunbathe together?\" Jing Zeyou said calmly. \"She's living in the Jing family now, so she's family one way or another. Don't you think your attitude towards her is a bit too harsh?\"","Jing Zeqian snorted coldly, crossing his long legs. \"I've never seen you sunbathing before.\"","Although Jing Zeqian had some issues with Jing Yi, they weren't that serious anymore. What he really cared about was why his brother was being so nice to a newcomer!","Jing Zeyou was getting a real headache now. He raised his hand to massage his temples but noticed the familiar cup of health tea. Aunt Wang hadn't thrown it away yet! Was it really necessary to keep this cup of unknown herbal concoction?","Jing Zeyou walked over, intending to pick up the cup and dispose of its mysterious contents, but he seemed to think of something and his eyes flickered.","\"I worked late yesterday, so I woke up this afternoon and decided to get some sun, replenish some vitamin D. What's wrong with that?\"","Jing Zeqian raised his left eyebrow but didn't speak. His eyes clearly told Jing Zeyou that he wasn't satisfied with this answer.","His brother had never sunbathed with him... More importantly, was sunbathing really what he was concerned about?!","Always busy like a workaholic, and now he suddenly has time to sunbathe with Jing Yi?","Anyone could guess how sarcastic Jing Zeqian's expression must have been at that moment.","\"Tell me, what will it take for you to let this go?\"","\"Give me back my share!\" Jing Zeqian replied so quickly it was hard not to believe it was premeditated.","Seeing Jing Zeyou's gaze, Jing Zeqian felt a bit guilty, but then remembering he was in the right, he instantly regained his confidence.","\"Fine, I'll transfer it to you later. But don't make a fuss in front of Junjun and Xiao Yi anymore.\"","Was he really giving in so easily?","Jing Zeqian looked at the man in front of him suspiciously. Surely there wasn't some trick up his sleeve?","But Jing Zeyou was already preparing to go to the study, casually handing the health tea on the table to Jing Zeqian.","\"Don't worry, since I've promised you, I don't intend to go back on my word. Here, you must be thirsty after all that howling. It's freshly brewed tea.\"","Jing Zeqian didn't suspect anything, thinking his big brother was just showing concern. He even felt a bit touched and guilty.","As expected of my own brother, even when I've schemed against him, he still worries if I'm thirsty.","Having talked for so long, he was indeed a bit thirsty. Jing Zeqian picked up the cup, ready to down it in one go.","Jing Zeqian was still immersed in his self-pity, not noticing the upward curve of Jing Zeyou's lips as he walked up the stairs.","\"Pffft!\"","Before he could even finish half of it, Jing Zeqian spat out the tea.","Hearing the commotion behind him, the smile in Jing Zeyou's eyes deepened as he quickened his pace up the stairs.","\"What is this?! It tastes horrible!\"","\"Jing Zeyou!\"","Shouts could be heard from downstairs. Jing Zejun curiously looked towards the door, but quickly returned her attention.","Jing Yi was telling her about sunbathing with Big Brother that afternoon.","When she heard that Big Brother had joined in sunbathing, Jing Zejun was also surprised.","She hadn't expected that her usually composed Big Brother would be interested in something like sunbathing. But was Second Brother really upset just because of this?","\"Right? You also think it's unreasonable, don't you?\"","Getting Jing Zejun's agreement, Jing Yi spoke a bit louder, feeling the confidence of having found an ally.","Jing Yi carefully glanced at the door, then lowered her voice to tell Jing Zejun, \"Besides, I think he's just brother-obsessed!\"","[That resentful look all afternoon was enough to make your skin crawl! His brother complex is way too obvious!]","Jing Zejun's lips curled into a smile. \"Do you think he wanted to sunbathe with you two as well?\"","Jing Yi looked disgusted. \"Sunbathing? With him like that? He'd probably want to use a ruler to keep Big Brother and me apart.\"","[As soon as he came back, he started with the sarcasm. He's just like a living, breathing brother-obsessed little princess!]","Jing Zejun burst out laughing. Jing Yi's description was quite vivid.","It's a good thing Second Brother didn't hear that, or they'd start arguing again. After all, the number of times those two had bickered lately was countless.","Everyone had gotten used to it by now."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Shen Xi","paragraphs":["The phone kept ringing incessantly in the early morning, waking Jing Yi from her deep sleep.","She reluctantly and irritably got up, picked up her phone, and answered, \"Hello? Who is it?\"","\"Jing Yi! You came back to the country and didn't even contact me! Are you trying to end our friendship?!\"","The voice on the other end was so loud that Jing Yi instinctively held the phone away from her ear, but the shouting was enough to completely dispel any remaining drowsiness.","Jing Yi finally realized that the person on the other end was her good friend—Shen Xi!","When Jing Yi had first arrived, her original self had already been studying Financial Management at a foreign university for three years.","If it were just ordinary conversation, it would have been fine, as Jing Yi's English was quite good.","But when she returned to school, she was completely lost. She didn't understand anything about financial management and couldn't comprehend the various terms and jargon the teachers used.","Sure enough, in the first semester after returning, Jing Yi failed her courses, and so did Shen Xi.","Moreover, if they didn't pass the make-up exams, neither of them would be able to get their graduation certificates.","During that time, the two of them were like comrades-in-arms, spending every day in the library, helping each other with questions and answers. They managed to pass their make-up exams and became very good friends in the process.","After graduation, Shen Xi had tearfully said goodbye, making Jing Yi promise to come find her when she returned to the country.","Now things had become complicated. Over the past half month, Jing Yi had received so much information that she completely forgot to contact Shen Xi.","\"Xixi...\"","\"Oh, so you still remember me! I thought you, Jing Yi, had become so forgetful!\"","Jing Yi held the phone away from her ear again, realizing her friend was truly furious.","\"Xixi, listen to me. I didn't mean to not contact you. It's just that I've had so many things to deal with recently. I just finished handling everything and was planning to contact you in a few days.\"","Jing Yi spoke sincerely, but her eyes betrayed her guilt.","There was silence on the other end. Thinking Shen Xi was still angry, Jing Yi continued to apologize.","Finally, a voice came through, \"Fine, we'll talk when we meet. You have time today, right?\"","\"Yes, yes, of course! If Xixi wants to meet, how could I not have time?\"","After agreeing on a time and place, Jing Yi hung up the phone.","She breathed a sigh of relief. If Xixi found out that she had been playing around for half a month and didn't even think to contact her, she wouldn't hear the end of it for a year.","But why had Shen Xi been so easy to persuade just now?","Jing Yi had thought that her poor excuse would surely be seen through.","\"Well, we'll talk when we meet!\"","Jing Yi shook her head, deciding not to worry about it anymore, and got up to go to the bathroom.","\"Aunt Wang, I won't be home for dinner tonight. Could you please let uncle and auntie know?\"","Hearing Jing Yi's voice, Aunt Wang came out of the kitchen. \"Are you not eating lunch either?\"","Lunch? Jing Yi's hurried footsteps came to a halt.","Although she was reluctant, Jing Yi painfully declined. If she was late meeting Shen Xi, her friend would surely be even more upset.","Seeing the reluctance on Jing Yi's face, Aunt Wang couldn't help but smile. \"I can make it for you tomorrow. Oh, I've made some desserts. Would you like a little something to tide you over?\"","Jing Yi nodded eagerly and followed Aunt Wang into the kitchen.","How beautiful!","Jing Yi carefully took one and put it in her mouth. Her eyes immediately lit up.","So delicious! This must be what they call sweet but not cloying!","Aunt Wang, watching her expression, smiled so much that the wrinkles at the corners of her eyes bunched up.","It had to be said, cooking for Jing Yi gave her a real sense of accomplishment.","Jing Yi stopped, looking longingly at the little desserts in front of her. If she ate any more, she'd never be able to leave the kitchen.","\"Uncle Li, can I take out the black supercar from the garage today?\" Jing Yi asked, having found Uncle Li in the courtyard.","Jing Yi had been eyeing that car for a long time. A few days ago, she had asked Jing Zeyou about it, and to her surprise, it turned out to be his. She had thought that given her big brother's personality, he would prefer more steady and dignified cars.","Uncle Li smiled warmly, his attitude gentle. \"Of course, Miss Jing. The young master said you could drive any car in the garage. I'll go get you the keys.\"","Jing Zeyou had already arranged everything a few days ago.","Jing Yi followed Uncle Li, excitement evident in her expression.","\"Uncle Li, you can just call me Xiao Yi.\" Being called 'Miss Jing' all the time felt a bit awkward.","She wondered how her big brother felt every time Uncle Li called him 'young master'. Jing Yi was a bit curious.","Uncle Li took the keys and led Jing Yi to the garage, still maintaining his professional and polite demeanor.","\"That wouldn't be appropriate, Miss Jing. Now that you're part of the Jing family, I should naturally demonstrate my utmost professionalism. Miss Jing, the supercar you requested is over there, and here are the keys.\"","Jing Yi resigned herself to the fact that the title wouldn't be changed. It seemed like doing otherwise would be a slight against his professional career.","Jing Yi took the keys, thanked Uncle Li, and walked towards the car she had been admiring for so long.","Is this really the world-renowned 'Black Night'?!","Jing Yi walked up to a black supercar, her slightly heated gaze making it clear how much she liked this car.","The matte black body, the texture of the piano lacquer finish, the streamlined shape, the seamless connection between the windshield and side windows.","This was simply a work of art! Jing Yi almost didn't want to drive it out as she admired it.","But, opportunities like this were rare!","A melodious sound emerged from the supercar's exhaust, echoing in the air as Jing Yi drove the black supercar out of the villa.","In front of the villa was an open road where Jing Yi could enjoy a brief period of acceleration.","The scenery on both sides of the road flew by, and there wasn't a hint of fear on Jing Yi's face. Instead, she became increasingly excited, feeling as if her heartbeat was synchronizing with the supercar's roar.","This truly deserved its ranking as one of the top three supercars in the world!","As she approached the city roads, Jing Yi slowed down, driving steadily.","Although there weren't many cars on the road, she didn't plan to speed up again. After all, there are a thousand rules of the road, but safety comes first!","The smile on Jing Yi's face remained radiant.","Jing Yi parked in front of a traditional courtyard-style restaurant specializing in official cuisine. She looked inside to make sure she hadn't come to the wrong place.","\"Excuse me, where's the parking lot?\"","A waiter at the entrance quickly came forward and pointed Jing Yi in the right direction. After Jing Yi's car drove off, another waiter came out and gently nudged him.","\"Why didn't you offer to park the customer's car? Aren't you afraid the supervisor will find out?\"","The waiter's smile became a bit stiff. His gaze remained fixed on the black supercar, his tone somewhat grudging.","\"Open your eyes and look at what kind of car that is! If there was even a tiny scratch, forget about the measly amount the supervisor would dock from our pay, my entire life savings wouldn't be enough to cover it!\"","Hearing this, the person next to him became even more curious, craning his neck to look, but only catching a glimpse of the black supercar's rear as it disappeared."]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Her Name is Jing Zejun","paragraphs":["After parking the car, Jing Yi followed the waiter into the private room where Shen Xi had already ordered and was waiting.","Shen Xi's round face was tense, her expression very serious.","Seeing this, Jing Yi immediately put on a bright smile, her dimples showing as she approached Shen Xi.","\"Xi Xi! Long time no see, I've missed you so much!\"","Shen Xi glanced at her, her eyes full of doubt.","Missed her?","She'd been back for almost a month and hadn't bothered to contact her. Is that what she called missing her?","Jing Yi noticed Shen Xi's dissatisfaction and laughed awkwardly, moving even closer.","\"Alright, alright, it's my fault. I apologize! I'll make it up to you! Blame it on my nearly non-existent memory!\"","Jing Yi solemnly promised that she would definitely make up for hurting Shen Xi's feelings.","Shen Xi's small face finally softened, the corners of her mouth slowly turning up. She reached out and hugged Jing Yi, her eyes and brows full of joy, her words of complaint tinged with happiness.","\"Jing Yi Yi! You're heartless, coming back for so long without contacting me! Are we still best friends?\"","Jing Yi gently patted her back, smiling, \"Okay, okay, I'm the heartless one. I'll cover your meals for a whole month! We'll go shopping later, and you can get whatever you want!\"","Shen Xi looked up in delight, \"Really?\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow, \"Of course!\" She was now somewhat of a small-time rich girl, and she could certainly afford this much.","\"But, Xi Xi, I'm hungry.\"","Right now, filling her stomach was more important. She had only eaten a few pastries for breakfast.","Shen Xi reluctantly let go of her, laughing and scolding, \"Such a touching moment, and all you care about is food!\"","Jing Yi felt a bit wronged; she really was hungry.","The two finally started eating.","\"By the way, how did you know I was back in the country?\" Jing Yi asked curiously as she picked up some boiled sliced pork in front of her.","Shen Xi opened her mouth, then suddenly stopped, her fingers unconsciously gripping her chopsticks tightly, conflicting emotions flashing in her eyes.","This made Jing Yi even more confused: \"What's wrong? Is it not convenient to tell me?\"","After a moment's hesitation, Shen Xi decided to tell Jing Yi about the incident.","It all went back to three days ago when Shen Xi accompanied her mother to a banquet. At that banquet, she overheard several young ladies discussing the Jing Family.","Although her family didn't rank high in North River, she had heard of the famous Jing Family.","She initially thought it was just gossip about a wealthy family, but then she heard Jing Yi's name.","Could it just be someone with the same name? Shen Xi was confused at the time, as Jing Yi had never mentioned being part of the North River Jing Family when they were abroad.","But as these young ladies revealed more information, Shen Xi became increasingly certain that the 'Jing Yi' they were talking about was indeed the Jing Yi she knew.","So Shen Xi decided to call Jing Yi to test her, and unexpectedly, it turned out to be true.","\"You've never heard that you're the Jing Family's young miss?\"","Shen Xi was still amazed that her best friend was actually from a wealthy family, and not just any wealthy family. How could anyone not be surprised?","Jing Yi didn't take it seriously. When she heard Shen Xi mention being a wealthy young miss, she found it amusing.","\"Young miss? Don't joke around, how could I be considered a young miss?\"","Then, Jing Yi briefly explained the whole situation to Shen Xi.","\"No wonder those people said...\" Shen Xi trailed off, hesitating to continue.","Jing Yi could guess it was probably not very pleasant, but she became curious.","She had just returned to the country and hadn't had the chance to meet other wealthy families yet, so she was genuinely curious about how they would talk about her.","Shen Xi sighed, wondering why this person seemed to enjoy hearing about her own misfortune.","\"They said that the Jing Family had found their real young miss, and you, the fake one, had the nerve to come back with them.\"","\"Is that all?\"","Shen Xi glanced at her, knowing that what those people said was certainly more unpleasant.","Jing Yi smiled indifferently. It was normal for wealthy families to gossip, after all. It wouldn't affect her ability to sleep in or the interest in her bank account!","However, at most she was adopted, so how did this turn into a matter of real and fake young misses?","In the novel, the original Jing Yi had quickly socialized with some socialites after returning to the country and began to intentionally or unintentionally use her status as the Jing Family's young miss, which led to the issue of real and fake young misses.","But since her return, she had spent almost all her time with the Jing Family and didn't know any socialites. Or was it that certain plot points were destined to happen?","Jing Yi's mood became heavier, losing her previous relaxed and carefree demeanor.","Shen Xi thought she was upset because of what those people said, and quickly tried to comfort her, \"Oh, those people are just foul-mouthed. If worst comes to worst, I'll argue back for you next time!\"","Jing Yi looked at Shen Xi, who was clamoring to defend her honor, and smiled, her eyes curving like crescent moons.","The person in front of her was her first friend in this world. Shen Xi was a very sweet, cute, and innocent girl, quite different from herself.","\"I'm just kidding. It's only a few words, they can't eat me alive!\"","Shen Xi felt a bit indignant; those were still very hurtful words.","\"But seriously, don't you feel uncomfortable in the Jing Family?\"","She had only ever heard Jing Yi mention her grandmother. Since she grew up abroad, she probably wasn't very familiar with the current Jing Family members, right?","\"I don't. Don't worry, the Jing Family members are all quite nice.\"","At least so far, they were easy to get along with. There was just an added 'tiger balm', but that could be considered a spice to an otherwise plain and peaceful life.","Seeing that her expression showed no signs of reluctance, Shen Xi finally felt relieved.","\"Then, what about that rumored real young miss?\"","Jing Yi looked up at Shen Xi in surprise, \"Didn't you hear what her name is?\"","Jing Yi had assumed Shen Xi would already know Jing Zejun's name, considering even she had gained 'fame' in the wealthy circles.","Shen Xi's eyes were filled with confusion. What did she mean? Should she know her?","She had heard long ago that the Jing Family had found their biological daughter, but such matters of the top wealthy circles had nothing to do with her.","Jing Yi smiled mysteriously and said, \"Her name is Jing Zejun.\"","Shen Xi frowned slightly upon hearing this, feeling it sounded familiar. When she realized, she suddenly looked up, her expression shocked.","\"Jing Zejun?!\"","She only knew one Jing Zejun, the female general from that TV drama she loved!","Jing Yi calmly nodded, composedly watching Shen Xi's surprise.","Jing Yi had also watched that TV series featuring Jing Zejun with Shen Xi, so she naturally knew how much Shen Xi liked Jing Zejun.","Shen Xi stared at Jing Yi with wide eyes. This was too much information for just one afternoon!","\"So what those gossip accounts said was true!\" She had previously thought those gossip accounts were too far-fetched, criticizing how even in this day and age, there were still such entertainment gossips about lost young misses being found by their wealthy parents.","\"But I'm still on your side!\" Shen Xi suddenly began to express her stance, firmly declaring her position to Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's hand holding the chopsticks paused slightly, looking at her amusedly, a hint of emotion flashing in her eyes.","\"It's not like we're going to fight. Don't worry, Jing Zejun is a very gentle person, easy to get along with.\""]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: The Shen Family","paragraphs":["Before coming, Shen Xi had planned that if Jing Yi felt uncomfortable at the Jing family home, she would invite Jing Yi to stay with her instead. Although Shen Xi's family wasn't among the top-tier wealthy families, they were comfortably well-off and wouldn't make Jing Yi feel out of place. Plus, they could occasionally leverage the \"North River Shen Family\" name for some borrowed prestige.","However, hearing that Jing Yi was getting along well with Jing Zejun, Shen Xi felt half her worries dissipate.","\"What have you been up to since returning to China?\" After addressing all of Shen Xi's concerns, Jing Yi finally had time to inquire about her friend's life back home.","Surely she hadn't actually started taking over the family business?","Jing Yi remembered that Shen Xi wasn't particularly interested in financial management; otherwise, they wouldn't have met on the way to a makeup exam.","Shen Xi shrugged nonchalantly, \"Same old, same old. My brother keeps an eye on things at home, and I just show up at the company occasionally. My parents don't expect me to earn money or make a name for myself, so life's pretty average, I guess.\"","Jing Yi gave her a look. This was considered average? If she hadn't also become a \"freeloader\" in the Jing family, she would have been green with envy at Shen Xi's situation.","\"Though things haven't been so peaceful at home lately, and my parents have even less time to keep tabs on me,\" Shen Xi added. Recently, everyone in her family except her had been incredibly busy.","Even her mother, who usually spent her time at home, was now rushed off her feet, with no time for tea with her old friends or shopping trips with Shen Xi.","Jing Yi placed a bowl of almond tofu next to Shen Xi, curiosity piqued. \"What's going on?\"","Shen Xi sighed, recalling her father's ominous words.","\"Have you heard of the Shen family in North River?\"","North River had three prominent families: the Jing family, the Shen family, and the Wang family.","Each family owned a leading company in North River, all of which were top-tier conglomerates.","Jing Yi thought for a moment. She remembered that in the original novel, the Wang family was constantly at odds with the Jing family.","But the Shen family? Jing Yi didn't know much about them. She frowned slightly, looking up expectantly at Shen Xi for an explanation.","\"The Huarui Group, under the Shen family, has been undergoing a major shake-up recently. The top executives in the group have all been replaced over the past month and a half. My parents have been busy dealing with all of this,\" Shen Xi explained.","Although Shen Xi didn't know exactly what they were busy with – after all, they were only distantly related to the Shen family, barely even considered relatives – why were they so invested in this?","\"Xixi, are you one of those legendary rich heiresses?\" Jing Yi asked. It seemed that Shen Xi must have some connection to this Shen family.","Shen Xi rolled her eyes. \"If I were a rich heiress, would I still be asking my parents for an allowance every month? That would be one down-to-earth heiress! My family just has a slight connection to them. The real Shen family doesn't have any heiresses.\"","Mentioning this, Shen Xi leaned closer to Jing Yi and began sharing some gossip about the Shen family.","\"The Shen family only has one son, named Shen Huaichu. He's the one who came back to take over all of the Shen family's businesses, which is why the group started this major overhaul.\"","Shen Xi wasn't actually very familiar with the name Shen Huaichu and only learned about him from hearing her family members talk about him recently.","When her brother told her about this, he also shared a bit of insider information. \"My brother said his parents apparently died in a car accident. But the key point is, after he grew up, he came back to reclaim everything that belonged to him and became the person in charge of the Shen family!\"","As Shen Xi spoke, her expression grew increasingly excited. Jing Yi found it amusing – who had taught her to introduce people like this?","\"Are you telling a story or sharing gossip?\" Jing Yi teased.","Shen Xi waved her hand dismissively. \"Anyway, it's because Shen Huaichu got his shares and became the big boss of Huarui and the Shen family that my parents have become so busy lately, though I don't really know what they're busy with exactly.\"","Jing Yi, on the other hand, tried to recall the original novel. After all, so much time had passed that she couldn't remember the detailed plot anymore.","Shen Huaichu? She had no impression of him at all.","Oh well! Who cares who he is.","Jing Yi decided to stop taxing her brain and picked up her chopsticks to continue eating with Shen Xi.","After the meal, Shen Xi was ready to drag Jing Yi out shopping, but since the journey was quite far, Jing Yi suggested driving there.","She had specifically brought out her \"Black Night\" today – it would be a shame not to get more practice with it!","\"Alright then! Let's go shopping in your car!\" Shen Xi linked arms with her as they walked out of the courtyard house.","When they reached the parking lot, Shen Xi immediately spotted the \"black car\" Jing Yi had mentioned.","It was impossible to miss. Although surrounded by luxury vehicles, this car still managed to outshine them all.","When they arrived, there were even a few people gathered around discussing the car.","\"Yi Yi, is that black car the one you were talking about?\" Shen Xi asked incredulously, staring at the vehicle.","Using such simple words to describe this car – don't you think it might feel slighted?","Jing Yi nodded, not seeing anything wrong. \"It is black, isn't it? Come on, let me take you for a spin. This car is an absolute joy to drive!\"","Jing Yi pulled Shen Xi along, smiling as she asked the people in front to make way. However, two of them seemed particularly annoyed.","It was a couple, and the woman appeared very displeased with Jing Yi's request to move. She looked Jing Yi and Shen Xi up and down with disdain.","\"Move? Why should we? Even if you want to gawk at luxury cars, you don't have to be so pushy about it! Haven't you seen a nice car in ages?\"","Jing Yi's almond-shaped eyes narrowed slightly as she held back Shen Xi, who was ready to start an argument.","The woman's voice was quite loud, drawing curious glances from those around. Seemingly not satisfied, she turned to the man beside her and whined.","\"Honey, don't you think girls these days are so materialistic? It's really annoying.\"","The man beside her wore a superior expression, his gaze equally scornful.","\"You think she just wants to look at the car? She's probably after the car's owner.\" The man snorted coldly, giving Jing Yi a meaningful look.","She's quite pretty, he thought.","A flash of disgust crossed Jing Yi's eyes.","\"That's right. Even my husband's car is worth five million, let alone this one,\" the woman added.","Seeing that the couple was now using this opportunity to show off their own car, Jing Yi pressed the car key. The scissor doors opened smoothly.","Her dimples appeared as she smiled, but there was no warmth in her eyes. \"Now, can you please move aside?\"","The atmosphere around them suddenly became quiet, and the couple's expressions turned sour.","Shen Xi's face showed equal disdain as she stepped forward, shouldering past the two.","\"You two, just because you can't afford a nice car yourselves, you assume others can't either?\"","\"You...!\" The woman tried to say something more, but the man quickly pulled her back, not daring to make a sound. People who could afford cars like this weren't the type they could afford to offend.","After Shen Xi was seated, Jing Yi, sitting in the driver's seat, leaned against the window and looked at the couple.","\"A five-million-yuan car? I've never seen one of those before.\"","She tilted her head and smiled, her eyes full of mockery. As the window slowly rolled up, the car's engine roared to life.","The people around started pointing and whispering, while the man, his face dark, pulled the woman away."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Mentholatum","paragraphs":["In the sports car, Shen Xi clapped her hands and laughed, \"You were so cool just now! Those two guys' faces turned green!\"","She couldn't help but feel elated every time she thought of the expressions on those two men's faces.","Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel, the corners of his mouth slightly raised as he kept his eyes on the road. \"Just enjoy the feeling for now. This car actually belongs to Jing Zeyou. I'm only borrowing it for a quick drive.\"","Shen Xi didn't care, as long as they had saved face, it didn't matter whose car it was. \"So what? You're still very handsome, okay!\"","She looked at the car's interior. Although she wasn't sure of its price, just by looking at it, she knew it must be very expensive!","Shen Xi sighed, \"Yi Yi, if we're talking about this level of luxury, my family probably couldn't afford to keep you...\"","\"Huh?\"","Jing Yi was a bit confused, but they quickly reached their destination, so she didn't ask further.","......","\"Big brother? You're off work so early today?\"","After parting ways with Shen Xi, Jing Yi returned to the Jing family home. Seeing both Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian there, she was a bit surprised.","Jing Zeqian, also sitting on the sofa, was displeased. He deliberately coughed a few times to attract Jing Yi's attention.","Jing Yi ignored him and started chatting with Jing Zeyou.","It was Jing Zeqian who lost his patience first. \"What's this? Am I so invisible that Miss Jing doesn't even see me sitting here?\"","[Here we go again!]","Usually, Jing Yi would have already started 'arguing' with Jing Zeqian, but today she had just met with an old friend, so she was in a good mood.","[I'm in a good mood today, so I won't bother with you.]","Jing Yi put on an obedient smile, her lips curving upwards, \"Second brother!\"","Jing Zeqian was taken aback. It seemed her mood wasn't just good, it was excellent. She didn't even snap back at him?","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly, \"Work finished early today. Have you eaten?\"","Jing Yi nodded with a smile, the dimple in her cheek becoming more pronounced.","Seeing the two of them chatting again, Jing Zeqian became even more displeased, coldly observing Jing Yi's smiling face.","Jing Yi was completely oblivious to Jing Zeqian's mood. She moved closer to Jing Zeyou and started discussing the black sports car. \"Big brother, that 'Black Night' is absolutely amazing!\"","'Black Night'?! Jing Zeqian's eyes were filled with disbelief.","\"You drove 'Black Night' out?!\"","Jing Yi was startled, glaring at the shocked Jing Zeqian who had stood up. \"Yeah, what about it?\"","[What's wrong with this guy? Why is he shouting so loudly?!]","Jing Zeqian looked at his brother with shock and a hint of hurt. How could he not shout? 'Black Night' was bought by Jing Zeyou at an auction half a year ago. After buying it, he had asked Jing Zeyou to let him drive it.","But his brother had said it was bought for appreciation, not for driving.","\"Didn't you say it was just for display?!\"","Jing Zeyou felt a rare moment of guilt. He wasn't really a fan of sports cars, and initially, he did buy it just for display...","But Jing Yi wanted to try driving it, didn't she?","\"If you want to drive it too...\" Jing Zeyou held out the keys he had just received to Jing Zeqian.","But Jing Zeqian didn't seem grateful. He crossed his arms and said disdainfully, \"I don't want your leftovers!\"","Jing Yi slightly pursed her lips, looking at Jing Zeqian's tsundere behavior.","[Just take the food when it's offered. Don't be picky, this is 'Black Night'!]","Jing Zeqian hesitated for a moment, thinking that what Jing Yi said made sense. So before Jing Zeyou could fully retract his hand, Jing Zeqian snatched the keys from him.","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow, the corner of his mouth curving upwards, having successfully resolved another unnecessary conflict.","Jing Zeqian's lips held a mischievous smile as he watched Jing Yi, who had started digging into the fruit platter brought by Aunt Wang.","\"I didn't know you could drive. How surprising.\"","His tone was still as sarcastic as ever. Jing Yi smiled slightly, ignoring him.","[Such a judgmental dog.]","Jing Zeyou's eyes flickered. Here we go again, he thought, wondering if he should retreat first.","Jing Zeqian paused for a moment, wanting to retort but holding back. However, he couldn't hold it for more than three seconds.","\"Driving a car like 'Black Night' on city streets is simply degrading its status!\" This was the only one of its kind, a limited edition sports car in the world.","Jing Yi glanced at him, put a piece of guava in her mouth, and then calmly raised her chin, her face full of innocence.","\"Is that so? Then, second brother, you shouldn't degrade 'Black Night'. Don't drive it out, just keep it well-preserved for display. Why don't you give the keys back to big brother?\"","Jing Zeyou picked up his teacup, feeling like he could stay a bit longer.","Jing Zeqian was stumped for a moment. \"Hmph, when I drive it out, I'll show you what a real sports car is like!\"","\"Second brother, there are speed limits in the city. Reckless driving leads to tears for your loved ones.\"","Jing Zeyou's hand holding the teacup shook slightly. His thin lips, hidden behind the cup, pressed together, suppressing the urge to smile.","Jing Zeqian glared at Jing Zeyou.","Brother! Don't think I don't know you're laughing just because you're hiding behind that teacup!","\"I know these traffic rules! I'm talking about the racetrack!\" Jing Zeqian's eyes held a hint of pride. \"Do you know about the Shanchi Racing Track in North River? That's where sports cars can truly show their potential.\"","It had to be said, Jing Zeqian's words did make Jing Yi a bit excited.","[A professional racetrack?!]","Jing Zeqian's smile was proud and radiant. Judging from Jing Yi's expression, he knew she must be curious about the racetrack he mentioned. But he didn't receive the eagerness he had imagined.","Jing Yi just said \"Oh\" and went back to eating fruit.","Jing Zeqian put his leg down, his tone carrying a hint of urgency, \"That's it? You're not going to say anything else?\"","Jing Yi looked up, confused. \"Say what?\"","Jing Zeqian felt like he was about to die of anger.","How could anyone be so dense!","Jing Zeyou's hand holding the teacup trembled slightly. He was quite pleased with the way Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian interacted.","Jing Zeqian had grown up in a very privileged environment and was the youngest son in the family. His personality was inevitably somewhat arrogant and conceited.","He had always been worried that his brother might suffer due to his personality, and it was good that Jing Yi could temper his sharp edges.","However, he was also curious about why Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi seemed to be naturally at odds with each other.","Sure enough, in less than two minutes, they were arguing again.","\"I heard from Aunt Wang that you went out with a friend today. I didn't know you had friends.\"","Jing Yi smiled slightly at Jing Zeqian, \"That's why I envy second brother. You're not bothered by friends, and you don't have friends pestering you to go to gatherings. How peaceful it must be to be alone!\"","[You jerk! It would be more surprising if someone like you had friends!]","The corner of Jing Zeyou's eye twitched as he watched impassively as Jing Zeqian angrily stood up and started arguing with Jing Yi.","\"Who are you saying doesn't have friends?!\"","\"Huh? I didn't say it was second brother who doesn't have friends.\"","Jing Zeyou sighed lightly, feeling a bit helpless. They really were like two elementary school kids arguing.","Maybe he should go upstairs after all..."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: On the Eve of the Banquet","paragraphs":["Upstairs, Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zejun were unaware of the commotion below as they discussed the upcoming banquet. Lin Ruiqing held Jing Zejun's hand, her eyes brimming with affection and tenderness.","\"That's about all there is to it. Don't worry, it's just a simple introduction to everyone,\" Lin Ruiqing reassured her.","Jing Zejun nodded, pressing her lips together. She was indeed a bit nervous, as this was different from facing an audience on set.","At the banquet, she would face scrutiny from many more people, though they would all try their best to appear delighted for her sake.","At least, she thought, they wouldn't let their true feelings show on the surface.","\"Mom, could we shorten my... part a bit?\" Jing Zejun asked hesitantly.","Lin Ruiqing looked puzzled, unsure what she meant by \"shortening her part.\"","Jing Zejun paused, realizing she had slipped into actor-speak, describing tomorrow's banquet as if it were a scene in a film.","\"I mean, couldn't we just keep it to a brief appearance and skip the rest of the formalities?\" she clarified.","In truth, she did feel that tomorrow's banquet was more like a performance, with everyone both on and off stage playing a role. It seemed a tedious charade, hardly worth watching.","Noticing Jing Zejun's lack of enthusiasm, Lin Ruiqing probed, \"Is something wrong?\"","Jing Zejun hesitated. \"I just feel this should be a family matter, so...\"","Her voice trailed off, seemingly aware that she might be disappointing Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing's efforts. Seeing her mother's loving gaze only intensified her guilt.","For twenty years, she hadn't been by her mother's side. Now, she couldn't even grant her parents this small wish...","Lin Ruiqing smiled gently, patting Jing Zejun's hand. \"I understand. Our Junjun isn't used to such events. But your father and I, we want to formally introduce our daughter to everyone.\"","At this, Lin Ruiqing's voice caught slightly. She smiled, gently caressing Jing Zejun's face, gazing at her now grown daughter as if trying to reclaim those lost twenty years.","\"Although we know your adoptive parents treated you well, your father and I still want to make up for those twenty years we missed. We want to give you the very best we can...\"","Hearing Lin Ruiqing's tender words, Jing Zejun's eyes reddened, and she instinctively embraced her mother. \"Mom...\"","Lin Ruiqing gently patted her back. \"Don't worry, I'll try to keep it as brief as possible. But, are you perhaps also concerned about Yi?\"","Jing Zejun straightened up, surprise in her eyes. \"You noticed?\" She had indeed been worried that Jing Yi might mind, but she hadn't expected Lin Ruiqing to pick up on it.","Lin Ruiqing smiled contentedly. \"You and Yi seem to be getting along well.\" She had imagined various scenarios of how the two girls might interact, but hadn't expected them to become so close so quickly.","A glimmer of a smile passed through Jing Zejun's eyes. \"Maybe it's because she's really easy to get along with.\"","It was the first time Jing Zejun had met someone so adaptable.","Jing Yi didn't seem to care about how her status might change or what discussions it might provoke. She wasn't concerned with the Jing family's position or her status as the Jing family's daughter. The only thing she seemed to care about was what delicious meal Aunt Wang would prepare that day.","Lin Ruiqing's eyes crinkled with amusement, as if recalling something. \"Don't worry, your father has made separate arrangements.\"","Speak of the devil.","Jing Beicheng knocked on the door from outside. \"Have you two ladies finished your discussion?\" He glanced downstairs. \"It's almost chaos down there.\"","Mother and daughter exchanged a knowing look, both breaking into laughter.","Without saying a word, they knew Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian were at it again.","Downstairs","Jing Zeyou had been about to return to his study when he saw Jing Beicheng and the others coming down. He sat back down.","It seemed the war was about to end.","Sure enough, the bickering ceased abruptly.","Jing Yi continued to bury her head in the fruit, while Jing Zeqian sat back on the sofa, arms crossed, looking annoyed.","Jing Zejun sat down next to Jing Yi, accepting a strawberry she offered.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng took seats on another sofa. Turning to Jing Zeqian, Lin Ruiqing asked, \"What were you arguing with Yi about this time? You're thirty years old, yet still acting like a child.\"","\"Twenty-nine,\" Jing Yi muttered, rolling her eyes discreetly.","[What's the difference between twenty-nine and thirty?]","\"What's the difference between twenty-nine and thirty?\" Jing Beicheng's mouth tightened, his expression stern.","Jing Yi's eyes lit up, thinking she and Jing Beicheng shared a moment of connection.","The others all turned to look at them, their expressions indecipherable.","Dad, you just copied that word for word! Plagiarism!","Jing Beicheng coughed a few times, looking somewhat uncomfortable.","Jing Zeqian wisely chose not to argue further, though his eyes still betrayed his disagreement.","Lin Ruiqing watched the two girls leaning together, eating fruit, her expression soft.","\"Yi, tomorrow's banquet is in the evening. Uncle Li will arrange for people from the dress shop to come in the morning. You and Junjun can try on some dresses and see if you like any.\"","Jing Yi agreed with a sweet smile.","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou discussed the details of tomorrow's banquet.","\"You're done? This guava is quite sweet.\" Jing Yi was still feeding Jing Zejun on the side.","\"I can't eat anymore. My drama is wrapping up in a few days, so I need to keep watching my diet for a while longer.\"","The drama was set in the Republican era, with most scenes featuring cheongsams. So during this period, Jing Zejun had been consciously restricting her diet.","Otherwise, if she returned to the set the next day and her costume didn't fit, she'd get scolded by the director again.","Jing Yi popped the guava from her fork into her mouth, sighing a little.","[Being an actor is really tough. It's better to be a 'rice worm'!]","Jing Yi's cheeks were puffed out adorably as she chewed. Jing Zejun couldn't resist pinching her cheek.","Compared to being a 'rice worm', being an actor was indeed quite challenging.","Jing Zejun had initially entered the entertainment industry for the money, and she had been fortunate enough to land the role of the second female lead in \"Jun Lin\".","That drama had catapulted her to fame.","The show had been a hit, and Jing Zejun had gone from being an unknown to ranking among the third-tier actresses.","More importantly, because she became famous, she had more opportunities to take on roles, and she was gradually able to pay off the money for her adoptive parents' surgeries.","Although her subsequent dramas were mostly mediocre, and her adoptive parents had still passed away, Jing Zejun remained grateful for that drama.","Jing Yi noticed Jing Zejun's distant gaze. Though she didn't know what she was thinking about, Jing Yi keenly sensed her change in mood.","[She seems a bit down. I wonder why?]","The conversation on the other side paused briefly before continuing, but Jing Yi didn't notice the others glancing in their direction.","\"Want some more?\"","Not knowing how else to comfort her, Jing Yi awkwardly offered another piece of fruit to Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun snapped back to reality, her lips curving into a smile, her eyes filled with warmth as she accepted the fruit."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: The Banquet of a True Heiress","paragraphs":["Many notable figures from North River gradually appeared in the banquet hall hosted by the Jing Family.","Guests dressed in elegant attire mingled among the crowd, their faces adorned with reserved yet appropriate smiles.","Waiters in tailcoats weaved through the throng, offering glasses of champagne from trays to passing guests.","Jing Yi was standing with Shen Xi on the other side of the banquet hall.","Though the banquet hadn't officially begun, Jing Yi was already feeling drowsy. She raised her hand to cover her red lips as she stifled a yawn.","She had expected the banquet to be more entertaining, or at least for the food to be more delicious.","Although the food was indeed good, it still fell short compared to Aunt Wang's cooking.","More importantly, only she and Shen Xi were lingering around the dining table, with passersby occasionally glancing their way. How could she eat comfortably under such circumstances?","Shen Xi, on the other hand, was keenly observing the coming and going of guests.","That one was a big shot she often saw on the financial news channel! And that one was the industry benchmark her brother frequently mentioned!","Shen Xi had come specifically to accompany Jing Yi. During their last gathering, Jing Yi had invited her to attend the Jing Family's banquet.","Otherwise, even her father wouldn't have received an invitation from the Jing Family.","Shen Xi was about to say something to Jing Yi when she noticed the drowsiness in her eyes, which surprised her.","\"No way, you're sleepy already?\" The banquet had barely begun, and the main events hadn't even started. How could she be tired already?","Jing Yi sat on the sofa, bored out of her mind. \"Don't you find this boring?\" She was really struggling to stay awake.","Shen Xi rolled her eyes at her friend, helping to adjust her dress. It was a shame that she looked so beautiful today.","She wore a shimmering feather dress, paired with slightly curled hair and a feather hairpin, giving her an ethereal appearance.","Who would have thought that dressed in such a beautiful gown, she'd not only hide in a corner but now sprawl on the sofa!","\"This is the normal flow of a banquet. If you're bored, you can go eat something. Come on, get up. Who attends a banquet like this?!\"","Shen Xi pulled Jing Yi up from the sofa and started fixing her hair.","Why did that sound so familiar?","Oh, right! It sounded just like something her mother would say! And her current actions were very similar to...","Shen Xi felt a bit helpless, feeling as if attending this banquet had aged her considerably.","As Shen Xi was still adjusting Jing Yi's hair, she noticed a handsome man approaching. Her eyes lit up, and she was about to point him out to Jing Yi when she heard them exchange greetings.","\"Little Yi.\"","\"Big Brother.\"","Shen Xi's eyes widened slightly. Was this the older brother, Jing Zeyou, that Jing Yi had mentioned?","He truly exuded maturity and steadiness!","Noticing Jing Zeyou's gaze turn towards her, Shen Xi straightened her back and politely greeted him.","\"Hello, Big Brother! I'm Shen Xi, Jing Yi's friend.\"","\"Hello,\" Jing Zeyou said with a slight smile, nodding gently to Shen Xi.","Shen Xi, a relative of the Shen family and Jing Yi's good friend from university.","As this was Jing Yi's friend, he should show her proper respect.","\"If you're bored, you can take your friend upstairs to play. Later, the hotel will serve Western cuisine, which you might want to try.\"","\"No need, Big Brother. Junjun hasn't made her appearance yet. I'll wait until after her debut to go out for some fresh air.\"","Debut?","A barely noticeable smile flashed in Jing Zeyou's eyes.","\"Alright then. The lighter-colored drinks over there are specially mixed fruit wines. They're not as strong, you might want to try them, but in moderation.\"","Jing Zeyou had noticed that Jing Yi wasn't particularly interested in the food at the banquet.","Sure enough, Jing Yi's expression brightened a bit. \"Really? I'll go try some in a bit!\"","Jing Zeyou smiled, chatted briefly with Shen Xi, and then left.","Watching Jing Zeyou converse effortlessly with the guests, Shen Xi remarked, \"Yi, your big brother is so handsome! He's truly mature and gentlemanly.\"","Jing Yi nodded in agreement, but her gaze had already been drawn to the fruit wines Jing Zeyou had mentioned.","She pulled Shen Xi over, picked up one of the glasses, and said, \"Xi, this is plum wine. Want to try?\"","Jing Yi handed the glass to Shen Xi and picked up another for herself, about to take a sip.","A hand with distinct knuckles stopped her.","Jing Yi frowned slightly and looked up.","[Of course, it's you again!]","Who else could it be but Jing Zeqian, worried that Jing Yi might get drunk and cause a scene?","Shen Xi was also surprised to see the newcomer. Realizing it was someone Jing Yi knew, she didn't approach but watched with curiosity.","Was this the \"Tiger Balm\" second brother Jing Yi had mentioned?","His aura was quite different from the older brother's. Though equally handsome, he exuded a hint of roguish charm.","If he looked like that, she wouldn't mind if he was a \"Tiger Balm\"!","\"Are you planning to get drunk and make a scene at the banquet?\" Jing Zeqian snatched the plum wine from her hand, intending to put it back.","\"It's fruit wine! Big Brother said it's not strong and told me to try it!\"","...Fruit wine?","Jing Zeqian's hand holding the wine glass paused, unsure whether to return it or not.","In the end, he yielded to Jing Yi's accusatory tone and gave the wine back to her.","\"Drink less. If you get drunk, no one will carry you back.\"","Jing Yi glanced at him, then took a sip.","[Delicious!]","Jing Zeqian's lips curved into a slight smile. Seeing that Jing Yi had nearly finished her glass, he couldn't help but say, \"Drink less.\"","\"Young Master Jing! Long time no see!\" A well-dressed man in a suit approached. He appeared to be a few years older than Jing Zeqian.","But this wasn't what caught Jing Yi's attention. Instead, it was the way the man addressed Jing Zeqian that surprised her.","[Young Master Jing?! What kind of angsty young adult novel male lead is this? Hahahahaha!]","Jing Zeqian's smile froze. He hadn't thought there was anything wrong with this form of address before, but now that Jing Yi pointed it out, it suddenly felt off in every way!","His expression betrayed no unusual reaction as he raised his glass to clink with the man opposite him.","\"General Xu, it's been a while.\"","The man opposite looked delighted. He had worked hard to find an opportunity to chat with Jing Zeqian alone, and was pleased that Jing Zeqian seemed to remember him.","\"I've heard that several of Startrack's artists have won major awards recently. Young Master Jing, your business is truly flourishing!\"","\"You're too kind, General Xu. It's just a small venture on my part.\"","\"If this is a small venture, what does that make all our years of hard work? Young Master Jing, there's no need for modesty. I hope there will be an opportunity for our company to collaborate with Startrack in the future!\"","\"It would be Startrack's honor to collaborate with your company, General Xu.\"","Startrack was the entertainment company Jing Zeqian had founded single-handedly, and he couldn't help feeling pleased at the praise.","Jing Zeqian looked at Jing Yi proudly, but she maintained her usual obedient expression.","[No way? How can someone almost thirty take such casual flattery seriously?]","Jing Zeqian paused briefly, continuing his conversation with the man in front of him without showing any change in his demeanor.","Surely Jing Yi didn't really think he was that naive?!"]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Let's Take a Photo","paragraphs":["As night fell, the main event of the banquet began in earnest.","Jing Zejun descended the stairs arm-in-arm with Lin Ruiqing, while Jing Beicheng stepped forward to greet them.","Jing Zejun wore a black butterfly-bow fishtail gown for the evening, her smooth ebony hair cascading over her fair shoulders.","'Is this the long-lost Jing family heiress?'","'She looks quite the part.'","'That girl seems familiar. Haven't we seen her somewhere before?'","The guests' minds raced with thoughts, though their faces maintained polite and cheerful expressions.","Jing Zejun, maintaining her smile, placed her hand in Jing Beicheng's outstretched palm and stood center stage in the banquet hall.","\"Ladies and gentlemen, thank you all for taking time out of your busy schedules to attend this banquet. Today, there is no Hengjing chairman here; my wife and I are simply ordinary parents wanting to share our joy with you all.\"","Jing Beicheng glanced sideways at Jing Zejun, who noticed her father's slightly reddened eyes.","\"Three months ago, the Jing family found our daughter who had been missing for over twenty years...\"","Jing Beicheng, typically known for his dignified and steady demeanor, rarely showed such emotion.","\"Today, we simply want to introduce her to everyone, to let you all know that the Jing family's eldest daughter has returned.\"","Jing Zeqian had been watching Jing Zejun from below, feeling happy for his sister, parents, brother, and himself.","His gaze held a touch of emotion as he stood to the side, applauding with everyone else. His eyes swept across the room, landing on Jing Yi not far away.","Jing Zeqian paused, suddenly realizing Jing Yi's current situation...","While Jing Zeqian was indeed pleased by Jing Beicheng's words—after all, he didn't want anyone to take what belonged to Jing Zejun, even the title of Jing family heiress—he now felt a twinge of concern.","Jing Zeqian's brow furrowed slightly as his gaze pierced through the crowd, finding Jing Yi. She was applauding enthusiastically, even more energetically than the guests around her.","There were too many people for him to hear Jing Yi's thoughts, but judging by her demeanor, she probably hadn't considered the implications as deeply as he had.","Jing Zeqian's lips curled into a smile, his slender eyes flashing with amusement as he turned his head to join the guests in applauding.","Meanwhile, Jing Beicheng had finished introducing Jing Zejun and glanced at Jing Yi standing nearby.","\"Yi Yi, come up here too.\"","Jing Yi, who had been caught up in the excitement, suddenly heard her name called. Her expression was surprised and bewildered.","Was he calling her to come up?","The guests' gazes followed Jing Beicheng's line of sight towards her.","Shen Xi quickly tugged at her, urging her to go on stage. These stares were too intense!","Jing Yi reluctantly walked up, the curve of her smile somewhat stiff.","\"This is our youngest child, who grew up abroad with her grandmother. She's also recently returned to the country...\"","The longer Jing Beicheng spoke, the more uncomfortable Jing Yi became, unsure why this additional segment had been added.","Finally, Jing Beicheng finished speaking, and Jing Yi hurriedly pulled Jing Zejun off the stage, leaving Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing to continue socializing with the guests.","\"How did I end up involved in this?\" Jing Yi brought Jing Zejun over to Shen Xi's side, finally relaxing and looking quite relieved.","Jing Zejun's eyes sparkled with amusement, her gentle aura becoming even more pronounced. \"So you get nervous too? And you were laughing at me yesterday.\"","Jing Yi was momentarily stumped, opening and closing her mouth without finding a retort, her eyes wide and watery as she stared at Jing Zejun.","Seeing her like this, Jing Zejun decided not to tease her further and turned to look at the quiet Shen Xi standing beside them.","\"And who might this be?\"","\"My friend, Shen Xi.\"","Shen Xi looked a bit nervous, stumbling over her words, \"Jiu Sheng, no, I mean—Miss Jing, hello, I'm Shen Xi.\" In her nervousness, she had called Jing Zejun by her character name from the drama.","Jiu Sheng, the name of her character in \"Jun Lin.\"","Realizing it was her analysis, Jing Zejun's smile turned gentle, her voice soft. \"Hello, Miss Shen. I'm Jing Zejun, Jing Yi's sister.\"","Jing Yi felt a bit exasperated; after all, she and Jing Zejun were only a month apart in age.","\"She's your fan. She's a bit nervous meeting you.\"","Knowing how passionate Shen Xi was about that drama, Jing Yi helped express this to Jing Zejun.","\"Thank you. Would you like a signed photo or a personalized autograph?\"","Shen Xi's eyes lit up, her nervousness disappearing as she looked at Jing Zejun with delight. \"Is that okay?\"","Jing Zejun's lips curved upward, her expression gentle. \"Of course. I didn't bring any with me today, but I'll have Yi Yi bring it to you later.\"","\"Great!\"","Before they could chat further, a group of socialites approached, holding wine glasses.","\"Miss Jing!\"","Jing Zejun turned, politely greeting the group, though she didn't recognize any of them.","\"I'm Lulu!\"","\"I'm Lucy!\"","\"I'm Lucinda!\"","Jing Zejun grew increasingly confused as she listened. Were these three from the same family? Or were they related? Was this an English listening comprehension test?","If it weren't so impolite, she would have asked outright if the three were sisters.","As Jing Zejun stood there perplexed, Jing Yi struggled to suppress her laughter, her whole body trembling slightly.","No wonder this scene had seemed familiar—these were the 'plastic sisters' who had followed the original Jing Yi around, throwing their weight about in the novel.","The first time she had read their names in the novel, she had laughed uncontrollably.","\"Hello to you all.\"","\"Miss Jing, congratulations! We're so happy you've found your family!\"","The socialite on the right stepped forward, her face full of sincerity, as if she were truly happy for Jing Zejun.","Was she the one called Lucinda?","This was the only thought in Jing Zejun's mind.","\"Thank you.\"","Then the one called Lulu approached, beaming, \"Miss Jing, I'm Lulu.\"","\"Hello, hello.\"","Afterward, the group continued with more small talk, but from start to finish, they never greeted Jing Yi, even though Jing Beicheng had just introduced her.","Even Shen Xi noticed this, let alone Jing Zejun, whose eyes flashed with displeasure.","Jing Zejun didn't mind people trying to curry favor with her because of her status as the Jing family heiress. She had anticipated such scenes from the moment she entered the Jing family.","However, Jing Zejun strongly disliked their attitude towards Jing Yi. She let out a soft laugh and linked arms with Jing Yi.","\"Thank you for your congratulations. I'm indeed very happy to have found my family and gained a beautiful sister.\"","The three sisters before them seemed a bit awkward. They had deliberately ignored Jing Yi's presence, as rumors about the true and false heiresses were still circulating in their social circles. They had assumed Jing Zejun would dislike Jing Yi, the supposed false heiress.","The three hurriedly greeted Jing Yi.","Jing Yi responded politely, though she didn't actually care about the sisters' attitude. It saved her a lot of energy this way.","But it didn't prevent Jing Yi from realizing that the Jing family was standing up for her."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Quarrel","paragraphs":["After leaving the L Sisters, Jing Yi led Jing Zejun and Shen Xi to the outside of the banquet hall.","She looked around, found a suitable spot to sit, and took a deep breath of the fresh outdoor air.","\"I've finally come back to life!\" she exclaimed.","The other two looked at Jing Yi with amusement. \"Was it really that dramatic?\"","Jing Yi nodded with a serious expression.","[It's not an exaggeration at all! Ordinary people can't handle these banquets. You have to wear a smiling mask the whole time! You must be constantly mindful of your manners! And you can't even eat properly!]","Jing Zejun couldn't help but laugh, listening to Jing Yi's rambling.","Shen Xi sat down on a nearby wooden chair, looking up at the grand and elaborate banquet hall in the distance.","Wait, what kind of normal person attends a banquet only to sit outside?","A gentle breeze blew by, causing Shen Xi to shiver involuntarily, making the scene seem even more desolate.","Jing Yi noticed Shen Xi's movement and said with a hint of guilt in her voice, \"Are you cold? Maybe we should go back inside.\"","Shen Xi smiled and waved her hand dismissively, \"It's just a sudden temperature change, that's all.\" After all, how cold could it be at this time of year?","Besides, going back meant more socializing, which Shen Xi found rather troublesome.","\"Just give me a few minutes, I'll go get some clothes from the car,\" Jing Yi said as she strode towards the parking lot.","Shen Xi watched Jing Yi's determined gait with slightly widened eyes.","Did this person even realize she was wearing an evening gown?","\"Have you and Jing Yi known each other for a long time, Miss Shen?\" Jing Zejun's voice brought Shen Xi back from her thoughts. She turned her head quickly to look at him.","\"I suppose it's been quite a while, four or five years now.\" Although she hadn't really spoken much with Jing Yi for the first two years.","When Shen Xi first met Jing Yi, her initial impression was that this person was aloof and difficult to approach.","It wasn't until later, when they both failed the same course and ended up working together, that Shen Xi realized Jing Yi was actually quite nice.","\"We were college classmates.\"","Jing Zejun nodded, aware that Jing Yi had studied Financial Management abroad. Although it didn't seem like a major Jing Yi would choose, he didn't think much of it.","\"Are you also interested in Financial Management, Miss Shen?\" Jing Zejun asked curiously.","Shen Xi smiled sheepishly, \"Actually, I'm not interested in it at all. I even failed a course because I couldn't understand it. I just didn't have any particular interests at the time, so I followed my brother's choice and went for Financial Management.\"","Listening to Shen Xi's words, Jing Zejun's lips curved into an involuntary smile.","It seemed that Jing Yi's friend was quite an interesting person as well.","Perhaps seeing that Jing Zejun was a very gentle person, Shen Xi became more talkative.","\"The reason I became friends with Jing Yi was because she also failed a course at that time. We ended up spending every day in the library together, keeping each other accountable...\"","At that time, Shen Xi was very surprised to see Jing Yi collecting her grade report in the office.","As Jing Yi's classmate, Shen Xi naturally knew about her grades - she was consistently in the top three of their class, a true academic star.","She never imagined that Jing Yi would fail a course, let alone the same one she had failed.","It's no wonder Shen Xi was surprised. After all, she couldn't have known that some classmates could change so dramatically over the course of their studies.","Even now, Shen Xi still thought it was just her own stereotyping that had led her to misunderstand Jing Yi.","When Jing Yi had first arrived, she knew that her original self's major was Financial Management, and she was utterly desperate.","She was a pure liberal arts student - wasn't this asking for her life?","It wasn't until she had failed several courses and caught the attention of her professors, along with the looming crisis of not being able to graduate, that Jing Yi forced herself to catch up intensively.","Meanwhile, the two were engrossed in their conversation.","On the other side, Jing Yi had already reached the parking lot and retrieved several pieces of clothing from the car.","Just as she was leaving the parking lot, she heard some familiar voices.","\"It's such a pity, we didn't get to chat much with the second young master of the Jing family earlier!\"","\"I know! I had just said hello, and he left. I wanted to talk more!\"","\"Hey, did you see Jing Zejun's expression earlier? He looked so provincial! Hasn't he heard of English names before?\"","\"Oh Lucy, he's only just entered high society. He grew up in a small town, you have to be understanding.\"","\"And that fake heiress too, if I were her, I wouldn't have the face to come back.\"","\"This is the Jing family we're talking about. Of course she'd want to cling on, even if she has to force her way in. You don't know, but I bet even the Jing family's bathroom is bigger than where she used to live!\"","\"Haha, Lucinda, your tongue is so sharp!\"","\"But I thought they seemed to have a pretty good relationship.\"","\"Lucy, don't be so naive. Can't you see such obvious acting? Come on, they're just keeping up appearances.\"","\"Putting on airs, it's all just because of her status as the Jing family's daughter. What's there to be so proud of?\"","\"Do you know that Jing Zejun is an actor? I saw her auditioning last time. I thought after she was brought back, she'd obediently play the role of the Jing family's daughter, but who knew she'd still be acting in films.\"","\"Lulu, are you trying to steal her job?\"","\"Become a celebrity? I'm not that cheap. My dad would scold me if he knew!\"","They were mocking Jing Zejun while walking towards the parking lot when suddenly a figure appeared in front of them.","Jing Yi stood before them, holding the clothes. Her lips curved into a smile, but it didn't reach her eyes.","The three girls' expressions clearly showed panic. They had thought the parking lot would be empty and had spoken freely.","\"Ladies, just come from the restroom?\" Jing Yi's languid voice drifted over.","Upon hearing Jing Yi's words, the three girls' faces darkened.","\"...Miss Jing, we were just...\"","After all, Jing Yi was a member of the Jing family, and the three girls were somewhat wary, not daring to confront her directly.","\"If you didn't come from the restroom, does that mean your little mouths have been smeared with laxatives?\"","The girl who had called Jing Zejun cheap earlier stepped forward, \"Miss Jing, aren't you being too harsh?\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow and let out a laugh. Her beautiful almond-shaped eyes turned to the girl, making her tremble involuntarily.","\"Harsh? Ladies, you should be grateful I'm only saying a few words.\"","\"You!\"","\"What about me? Your speech is so halting, perhaps you should consider going back to the drawing board? Is it fashionable now to wrap up your cerebellum and use your cerebrum as a decoration?\"","\"What are you so proud of? You're nothing but a substitute picked up by the Jing family. To put it nicely, you don't even qualify as an illegitimate child!\" The person standing on the left blurted out, somewhat flustered.","Jing Yi chuckled lightly, her eyes full of innocence, her tone dripping with sarcasm.","\"Well, at least I'm a person with a sense of shame. I wouldn't flatter someone to their face and curse them behind their back.\"","\"If you can't speak properly, next time you attend a banquet, I suggest you don't sit at the same table as others.\"","Lucy's face had turned red. She wanted to say something more, but the two people beside her pulled her away, preparing to leave.","Watching their retreating figures, the smile slowly faded from Jing Yi's lips, her eyes darkening."]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: The World Where Jing Zeqian Is Injured","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, Jing Zejun and Shen Xi had been chatting for a while and were starting to worry since Jing Yi hadn't returned yet.","Just as they were about to get up and check on her, they saw Jing Yi's figure approaching from a distance.","Jing Yi walked over, holding some clothes in her hands, with an unpleasant expression on her face.","[Those three crows turned into spirits, just babbling nonsense!]","Jing Zejun, looking concerned, tentatively asked, \"Why were you gone for so long?\"","\"I ran into those three people from the L Family, which held me up for a bit.\"","L Family? Who were they?","Jing Zejun's expression showed a hint of confusion.","Shen Xi, however, quickly caught on, \"You mean those girls called Lucy or something?\"","\"Exactly those!\"","Jing Zejun furrowed her brow slightly, also remembering the three socialites who had come to greet them earlier. \"Did they give you a hard time?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, \"As if they'd dare.\" She handed the clothes to Jing Zejun and Shen Xi.","[They wouldn't dare trouble me to my face, they only dare to hide in corners and talk behind my back. I don't know what era they think this is, those three still have such small minds, treating actors like they're beneath them! I didn't handle it well this time, but next time I'll definitely give them a piece of my mind!]","Those three probably didn't expect that hiding in the parking lot to gossip would still get them overheard...","After being scolded by Jing Yi, not only were they upset, but they also had to worry about whether Jing Yi would tell Jing Zejun about the incident.","This was the newly found Jing family's youngest daughter, and now they had thoroughly offended her.","Jing Zejun held the clothes, staring blankly at Jing Yi.","Jing Yi noticed and asked curiously, \"What's wrong?\" Jing Zejun pressed her lips into a smile and gently ruffled her hair.","\"Nothing, I just think it's wonderful to have a little sister.\"","Regarding suddenly becoming the youngest in the family, Jing Yi had something to say.","\"...I'm only a month younger than you.\"","Jing Zejun's lips curled into a gentle smile. Even if it was just a month, she was still the older sister.","...","\"Well, Yiyi, I'm off now. Bye-bye!\" Shen Xi sat in the sedan, rolling down the window to wave at Jing Yi.","\"Mm, take care.\"","After seeing Shen Xi off, Jing Yi and the others also prepared to leave by car.","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou were still discussing some matters, while Jing Zejun accompanied Lin Ruiqing to sit in the living room. Jing Zeqian lazily followed them.","Jing Yi yawned, looking exhausted.","Jing Zeqian glanced up and saw Jing Yi's unladylike behavior, his tone filled with disdain, \"You're really wasting that evening gown. You don't look like a princess at all.\"","Jing Yi tiredly lay down on the sofa, \"I'm not a princess to begin with...\"","[I was wrong, I shouldn't have been interested in the banquet...]","Jing Zeqian's tone was somewhat exasperated: \"No ambition!\"","Jing Yi didn't care at all, and she didn't have the energy to bicker with Jing Zeqian anymore.","[Fine, I have no ambition. You can be the princess, okay?]","Jing Zeqian: ...","Jing Zejun lowered her head to stifle a laugh, while Lin Ruiqing's lips also curled up uncontrollably.","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou seemed to have finished their discussion and walked over. Jing Yi reluctantly got up, ready to go upstairs and rest.","\"There's one more thing...\"","Jing Yi looked up at Jing Zeyou, her eyes gradually widening.","[At this hour, there's still something?!]","Jing Zeyou cleared his throat, \"It'll only take a few minutes.\" Jing Yi lazily sat back down on the sofa.","\"I've arranged a physical examination for Yiyi and Junjun the day after tomorrow.\"","Jing Yi was a bit confused.","[Physical examination? Why suddenly a physical?]","Jing Zeyou added, \"Our family has annual check-ups. Since Junjun and Yiyi just came back, I thought it would be good to have a check-up first.\"","Of course, the ultimate purpose of this check-up was for Jing Yi.","He wanted to find out if the recent strange occurrences were due to a problem with Jing Yi's body or some other reason.","Half a month ago, Jing Zeyou had visited a private hospital owned by Hengjing.","\"What do you mean? You're asking if it's possible to hear other people's inner thoughts? Is it ventriloquism?\"","Jing Zeyou's doctor friend found it somewhat amusing and even wondered if his friend had become confused from overworking.","Jing Zeyou didn't know how to describe it. If he was too direct, it might threaten Jing Yi's peaceful life, but he did want to know if there was something wrong with Jing Yi's body that was causing them to hear her thoughts.","\"It's not ventriloquism? Then it's very likely that there's something wrong with your body. Come, let me examine you!\"","Then, Jing Zeyou was dragged off by his friend for an examination.","Jing Zeyou felt a bit helpless. If he was the only one hearing it, it would definitely be his problem, but besides him, everyone in the family could hear it.","However, it did remind Jing Zeyou that he could have Jing Yi undergo a full body examination.","Worried that Jing Yi might overthink it, Jing Zeyou included Jing Zejun in the plan.","But Jing Yi didn't suspect anything. Instead, she thought of something else.","[A physical examination? This is perfect timing!]","The others discreetly glanced at Jing Yi as she sat up, somewhat puzzled.","Due to Jing Zejun being lost since childhood, Lin Ruiqing's health had never been very good. Although the Jing family's wealth allowed them to constantly provide treatment for Lin Ruiqing, sometimes illnesses can come suddenly and unexpectedly.","In the original story, during the time when Jing Zejun was found, Lin Ruiqing fell ill. It was then discovered that her condition had suddenly worsened. Even with the Jing family's access to the world's top medical resources, they were only able to extend Lin Ruiqing's life by a few years.","This was something deeply buried in Jing Yi's heart, and she had been looking for an opportunity to address this hidden danger.","So she didn't even notice how clumsy Jing Zeyou's excuse was, instead thinking it was a perfect opportunity.","\"Uncle, Auntie, let's all go for the check-up together! Big brother should come too!\"","The only one left out, Jing Zeqian: ...","Lin Ruiqing looked surprised, not understanding why Jing Yi would mention her.","\"Yiyi, your uncle and I just had a check-up a few months ago...\"","Lin Ruiqing felt there was no need for her to have another check-up, given that she had just had one a few months prior.","But Jing Yi was particularly insistent, \"Auntie, let's all go together. We're all going to have check-ups anyway, it'll save the hospital some trouble.\"","[The earlier we check, the earlier we can find out! And we can check big brother's health too! We can't let it drag on!]","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow, after all, he knew about her future life.","\"What do you think, big brother?\" Jing Yi's beautiful almond eyes were full of expectation.","Jing Zeyou's lips curled into a slight smile as he nodded.","Lin Ruiqing didn't insist either. After all, it was just a check-up, not some big request.","Jing Yi's expression relaxed considerably, feeling like a major concern in her heart was finally going to be resolved. \"Alright then, can I go rest now?\"","Jing Zeyou looked at the eager Jing Yi with amusement and nodded, \"Mm.\"","Just as Jing Yi was about to get up and return to her room to rest, Jing Zeqian's cold voice came through.","\"Is that so? I think you all seem to have forgotten something, haven't you?\"","Jing Zeqian sat with his arms crossed on the sofa, looking extremely displeased."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: The Illness of Lin Ruiqing","paragraphs":["At a private hospital in North River, the Jing family had gathered for medical check-ups.","The private hospital was situated atop a mountain in North River city.","On the way there, Jing Yi had found the location rather peculiar.","Who would put a hospital on a mountaintop?","Jing Zeyou explained that since it wasn't a public hospital, the location was chosen with patient privacy in mind.","Moreover, this hospital was renowned globally for its top-notch medical technology, facilities, and service.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun stood on the balcony, overlooking the scenery of North River.","Jing Zejun glanced secretly at Jing Yi beside her, noticing she hadn't spoken a word during the journey.","He wondered if Jing Yi was worried about something, or just lost in thought.","\"Yi Yi, you don't need to worry, it's just a simple check-up,\" Jing Zejun said softly, trying to comfort her.","Jing Yi responded with a weak \"mm,\" and resumed her reverie.","Concern flickered in Jing Zejun's eyes; it was rare to see Jing Yi so distracted.","'Knock, knock'","Someone was at the door!","Jing Yi quickly turned to look. It was the doctor friend Jing Zeyou had consulted earlier.","\"Zeyou, everyone's test results are ready,\" Jing Zeyou stepped forward.","He was particularly concerned about Jing Yi's condition. \"Are there any issues with their reports?\"","\"Both young ladies' check-up reports show no major problems. However, it's worth noting that Miss Jing Zejun's report indicates a weakened immune system. If possible, it would be best to avoid prolonged dieting and adjust her eating habits accordingly.\"","Jing Zejun, feeling the weight of everyone's gaze, sheepishly rubbed her nose.","She had indeed been a bit harsh on herself lately, but thankfully, the filming was almost wrapped up.","\"What about little Yi?\" Could it be that nothing was found?","The doctor replied, \"Miss Jing Yi is in excellent health, with no minor issues to report.\"","Even with her lax lifestyle, she's still healthy? Jing Zeyou's eyes betrayed his surprise.","Even Jing Beicheng and the others were somewhat astonished.","Jing Yi, noticing their expressions, felt a bit indignant.","[What's that supposed to mean? Deep sleep is the best way to stay healthy, and I've been eating well and exercising properly, you know!]","Jing Zeyou felt a bit disappointed, but since nothing was found, it meant there wouldn't be any impact on Jing Yi's health.","Before he could fully relax, his friend's next words made Jing Zeyou's heart skip a beat.","\"Everyone else's health is fine, except for Auntie.\"","The room suddenly fell silent, shock and unease filling everyone's eyes.","\"What did you say?\" Jing Zeyou was stunned for a moment before quickly regaining his composure.","The doctor glanced at Jing Zeyou, then shifted his gaze to Lin Ruiqing.","\"Auntie's health condition is not optimistic... Although it's currently in its early stages and the likelihood of deterioration is low, it would be best to admit her for observation immediately.\"","Jing Beicheng stood up and strode to the doctor.","The doctor handed him the report, carefully explaining the issues with Lin Ruiqing's health.","Jing Beicheng furrowed his brow, \"She has annual check-ups. Why wasn't this detected before?\"","\"The human body is like that. Often, problems hidden inside suddenly worsen, but fortunately, we've caught this early.\"","Jing Beicheng didn't seem comforted, his expression remaining grave as his hand holding the report trembled slightly.","Surprisingly, Lin Ruiqing was the calmest person in the family.","\"Beicheng\"","Jing Beicheng looked up, passing the report to Jing Zeqian who had approached, then sat back down beside Lin Ruiqing, tightly holding his wife's hand.","Nearby, Jing Yi actually breathed a sigh of relief, her earlier unease dissipating.","[Thank goodness! It's only mild, there's still time for everything.]","Jing Yi's words reminded the Jing family members who had sunk into a gloomy mood.","Yes, there was still time for everything.","\"Zeyou, we'll need to wait until Auntie is admitted and undergoes further detailed examinations before we can formulate a specific treatment plan.\"","Jing Zeyou nodded and left with the doctor to arrange Lin Ruiqing's hospitalization.","Jing Yi patted Jing Zejun's back, offering silent comfort.","Jing Zejun's eyes were slightly red; it seemed she had been quite scared earlier.","She had only recently found her birth parents, and it was as if heaven had almost played a cruel joke on her.","Jing Zejun hugged Jing Yi, who was surprised but still gently patted her back, quietly comforting her.","Yi Yi, thank you so much!","\"You really don't all need to stay here. Didn't the doctor say it's just inpatient treatment for now? No surgery is needed at this stage,\" Lin Ruiqing said, looking at the row of people standing before her, urging those who needed to work to go to work, those filming to go film, and those resting to rest.","But no one budged.","Lin Ruiqing sighed, \"Even if I need someone, isn't your father here? There's no need for such a crowd around me. If you're not feeling cramped, I certainly am.\"","Jing Yi silently looked up at the spacious private room.","[It seems quite roomy to me.]","This was the most famous private hospital in North River, also owned by Hengjing, so naturally, they wouldn't put Lin Ruiqing in an ordinary ward.","It was Jing Yi's first time seeing a hospital room with a reception area. She inwardly shook her head, thinking, truly befitting of a boss, even when sick they need to receive guests.","Lin Ruiqing was rarely at a loss for words, but Jing Yi's reaction gave her pause. She glared at Jing Beicheng beside her, whose lips were slightly curved upwards.","\"Anyway, I don't need so many people. Go about your business, it's annoying to see you all here!\"","Jing Zeyou and the others looked at Lin Ruiqing, hesitant to speak. They still wanted to stay and take care of her.","After all, Lin Ruiqing had never been this ill before, and all her daughters were very worried.","The atmosphere in the room became tense.","Jing Yi quietly raised her hand, her voice soft, \"Um, how about I stay to take care of Auntie?\"","\"Alright! Then it's decided!\" Jing Zeqian didn't hesitate for even a second, afraid Jing Yi might change her mind.","Jing Yi gave him a silent look.","[Great! I'm the only one without a job, so this important task falls to me! After all, I'm the only unemployed one, you're all busy! It's good to be busy!]","...Big brother, is she taking advantage of us?","Jing Zeyou shot Jing Zeqian a warning glance, then turned to Jing Yi and asked, \"Are you sure it's okay?\"","\"No problem!\" Jing Yi promised earnestly.","[What could be the problem? The hospital has nurses and doctors, and there's Uncle too. At most, I'll just be keeping her company and entertaining her. Maybe I'll be a delivery person if Auntie doesn't like the hospital food. I could bring meals made by Aunt Wang. I wonder if Aunt Wang's health food tastes good...]","A hint of a smile flashed in Jing Zeyou's eyes as he agreed to let Jing Yi stay.","Come to think of it, this was a private hospital in North River with the best medical resources and services. Even if they all stayed, they wouldn't be of much use, and perhaps Jing Yi would be better at keeping their mother entertained.","Jing Zejun hesitated for a moment but didn't insist on staying. Since Jing Yi would be there to keep Lin Ruiqing company, she decided to finish her remaining work first and then come back to accompany her mother.","And so, Jing Yi officially began her life as a caregiver."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Orphan","paragraphs":["Jing Yi's guess was correct; she really did become a delivery person.","At this moment, Jing Yi was eating a health-conscious meal prepared by Aunt Wang, together with Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng.","It wasn't that the hospital hadn't prepared food, but she still felt that Aunt Wang's cooking tasted better!","With Jing Yi's constant mentions, Lin Ruiqing, who had initially thought the hospital food was quite good, also began to miss Aunt Wang's cooking.","Jing Beicheng had no choice but to ask the doctor about dietary restrictions.","Jing Yi finally got her wish and was able to eat Aunt Wang's health-conscious meal!","Although it wasn't quite the same as their usual meals, it had its own unique flavor!","So far, Jing Yi's caregiving duties had been relatively easy. The only problem was that, while she was supposed to keep Lin Ruiqing company and alleviate boredom, she had no idea what to talk about with her.","Fortunately, when she was there, Jing Beicheng was usually present too. So Jing Yi could comfortably play the role of a silent mascot.","Things often don't go as smoothly as imagined. Today, Jing Beicheng suddenly announced that he needed to return to Hengjing to handle some work matters.","For Jing Yi, this was like a bolt from the blue.","[What's going on with big brother? The company has been handed over to you, yet you still need uncle to step in to resolve issues! You're really letting down my trust in you!]","Although Jing Beicheng felt the same way, he was still a director of the company, and there were some matters that required his presence.","No matter how much Jing Yi wailed, Jing Beicheng was determined to go today.","After giving Jing Yi a few instructions, he said goodbye to Lin Ruiqing.","He hadn't even reached the door when he heard Jing Yi's voice again.","[So much for always staying with auntie, men's words are all lies!]","Jing Beicheng's mouth twitched slightly; this girl was becoming more and more unruly. He turned his head to see his wife's smiling eyes, and helplessly opened the door to leave.","The atmosphere in the hospital room quieted down. Jing Yi lowered her head slightly, her hands intertwined, constantly pressing her pink-tinged nails.","[Quick! Quick! Say something, the atmosphere is getting awkward!]","Lin Ruiqing didn't feel awkward at all. She had been listening to Jing Yi's voice and found it quite interesting.","She wore a gentle smile on her face.","Since Jing Yi had come to their home, they hadn't spent time alone like this.","She got along well with Zejun and Zeqian, but when it came to her and Jing Beicheng, Jing Yi still seemed a bit reserved.","Lin Ruiqing's smile faded a little. Seeing that Jing Yi was still feeling awkward, she said, \"Yiyi, if you're bored staying here, you can go out for a walk. There are doctors and nurses here, so don't worry about me.\"","Jing Yi was taken aback and quickly said, \"How could I do that? How could I leave you alone in the hospital room...\"","Jing Yi realized that her earlier behavior might have made Lin Ruiqing think she was bored. She felt a bit frustrated. It wasn't that she was bored; she just didn't know how to interact with elders.","Jing Yi was an orphan, even before she transmigrated into this world.","The grandmother at the orphanage said that she had been left at the orphanage door one winter. She was a newborn, very healthy, without any illnesses.","Sometimes she wondered why her parents couldn't have waited until spring to abandon her.","Didn't they worry that no one would discover the small bundle and that she might freeze to death at the door?","Jing Yi grew up in the orphanage, knowing from a young age that she was an abandoned child.","At first, she wasn't indifferent to it. She would mind when others said she had no parents, or when they said she was dumped at the orphanage.","The grandmother was old, and there were many children in the orphanage besides her, so she had to solve many problems on her own, like having money stolen or being trapped in the bathroom. She resolved everything by herself.","There was no need to complain to anyone or act coy with anyone; she could solve everything.","So when she was able to earn money, the first thing Jing Yi did was learn Sanda (Chinese kickboxing).","Because some people really don't understand words!","Later, she managed to finish high school while working part-time and successfully received a university admission letter.","She thought her life was about to start a new chapter.","But then she discovered human traffickers and was stabbed in a vital spot while trying to save a child.","In the moment before she closed her eyes, Jing Yi's only thought was that it was good she had called the police before following them.","When she opened her eyes again, it was in another world.","After transmigrating, Grandma Jing's affection initially made her feel a bit at a loss. Later, she discovered that Grandma Jing gave her a feeling similar to the grandmother at the orphanage.","They got along very well for those two years.","Jing Yi never knew how to interact with elders; the only elders she had contact with were the grandmother at the orphanage and Grandma Jing.","She knew even less about how to interact with parents. Although Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing weren't her actual parents, treating them according to that hierarchy should be correct.","Jing Yi felt a bit deflated, her whole body drooping, looking somewhat pitiful.","Lin Ruiqing was about to speak to tell her not to overthink, but Jing Yi spoke first.","\"I'm sorry, Auntie. It's not that I don't want to keep you company and am deliberately putting on a long face. I just don't know how to interact with you...\"","[Elders probably all like more obedient girls, but I don't know what type of girl Auntie likes. Could it be the elegant and dignified type? If I didn't have to talk, maybe I could pretend, but I'm here to chat and relieve boredom! How can I not talk at all? But the problem is, if I talk too much, I might break character!]","As Jing Yi's thoughts wandered further, Lin Ruiqing's gentle voice came through, \"Yiyi, come sit here.\"","Lin Ruiqing patted the soft stool next to the hospital bed, gesturing for Jing Yi to sit beside her.","Jing Yi gently bit her lip and walked to the bedside to sit down, her whole being exuding an air of unease and discomfort.","Lin Ruiqing gently stroked Jing Yi's head, speaking in a soft and gentle voice, \"Actually, I'm the one who doesn't know how to interact with you.\"","Lin Ruiqing looked at Jing Yi in front of her, recalling how they looked when they first met.","\"You might not remember, but when you first came, I had a very bad attitude towards you. I thought you were brought by my mother to humiliate me. My Junjun was gone, but how could they bring back a child of about the same age, preparing to replace her...\"","Jing Yi didn't know what to say, so she lowered her head and listened as Lin Ruiqing continued.","\"I was very angry and told you to get out. You were very scared at the time, tightly holding onto your grandmother's sleeve, your body trembling slightly. Later, she took you away.\"","The encounter in Grandma Jing's hospital room was the first time Lin Ruiqing had seen Jing Yi since she had grown up. Lin Ruiqing's emotions were complex at the time, and in her complexity, she overlooked the panic in her heart.","She didn't know how to talk to Jing Yi, so she simply didn't speak.","\"Then you came to the Jing family. I've actually wanted to say thank you to you for a long time.\"","[Thank you?]","Jing Yi looked up, somewhat confused.","Lin Ruiqing smiled, her gaze still gentle as she looked at Jing Yi.","\"Thank you for being willing to return to the Jing family together.\"","Thank you for helping me find Junjun, thank you for being willing to integrate into the Jing family, and thank you for insisting on bringing me for this check-up..."]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Improving Relations","paragraphs":["Lin Ruiqing reached out to hold Jing Yi's hand, her face showing a hint of solemnity.","\"I've also owed you an apology for a long time. I'm sorry.\"","Jing Yi was slightly taken aback, revealing a surprised and confused expression.","\"Auntie, why are you apologizing?\"","Lin Ruiqing's lips quivered slightly, as if she had many things she wanted to say.","\"For the resentment I directed at you back then. Because of my misplaced anger, you ended up growing up abroad for over twenty years.\"","Jing Yi hurriedly waved her hands, looking somewhat flustered. \"Auntie, you really don't need to apologize. If it weren't for the Jing family, how could I have possibly grown up in such a privileged environment?\"","[If it weren't for Grandma Jing, Jing Yi might have grown up in an orphanage the whole time. Compared to children who spent over a decade in orphanages, Jing Yi was already very fortunate.]","Jing Yi's gaze was clear and pure. \"...As for the resentment you mentioned, I may not be able to accept it on behalf of three-year-old Jing Yi, but you don't owe anything to the grown-up Jing Yi.\"","Lin Ruiqing's eyes reddened slightly, the tender smile in them growing more pronounced.","\"Then let's consider this matter settled. I'm just starting to learn how to be a mother to two daughters, and you're experiencing living with elders for the first time. Let's call it even.\"","Jing Yi's pupils dilated slightly, and she froze on the spot.","[Did she just say two daughters?]","Lin Ruiqing's face bore a smile as she gently patted Jing Yi's head. It might be too early to talk about these things now; she should give her some time to think it over.","\"There's a milk tea shop downstairs. The nurse just said it's quite good.\"","Jing Yi immediately sat up straight, her small face full of seriousness. \"Auntie, you can't have anything too sweet.\"","[I remember clearly what the doctor said about dietary restrictions!]","Lin Ruiqing chuckled lightly, the smile at the corners of her mouth deepening.","\"It's not for me, it's for you. You've been eating bland food with me all this time. You should have what you like.\"","Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents, and the dimple at the corner of her mouth appeared faintly. \"Hehe, actually, Aunt Wang's health food is quite delicious too.\"","Lin Ruiqing couldn't help but smile as well. \"If there's anything you want to eat, let Zeqian bring it for you. He should be here soon.\"","Jing Yi's eyes brightened noticeably, and she quickly pulled out her phone.","\"Hello, Second Brother?\"","\"How did you know I was going to ask you for a favor?\"","\"Auntie said you could bring me some food!\"","\"The milk tea from the shop downstairs, the one with the green sign. I want their signature drink with 30% sweetness. Then there's a duck neck shop next to the milk tea place, get me some duck necks and tofu knots. And across from that, there's a cake shop. I want two donuts and... You're the pig!\"","Lin Ruiqing laughed quietly. It turned out that Jing Yi had already familiarized herself with all the food shops in the area, and even remembered that the nurse said the signature drink with 30% sweetness was the best.","When Jing Zeqian arrived, Jing Yi was chatting with Lin Ruiqing. Who knows what they were talking about, but they were both laughing so much their eyes had curved into crescents.","\"Second Brother!\"","This wasn't a call for her second brother; it was clearly a call for the snacks in his hands. She was like a hungry wolf.","Jing Yi took the snacks from Jing Zeqian's hands and immediately turned away.","Jing Zeqian didn't have time to bother with her. He walked to Lin Ruiqing's side, who was smiling as she watched Jing Yi.","\"Mom, how are you feeling today?\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded with a smile, \"Pretty good. The doctor says I'm recovering well.\"","Jing Zeqian's worry eased a bit. Lin Ruiqing's illness had really scared him.","During this time, Jing Zeqian had been constantly checking on Lin Ruiqing's condition with Jing Zeyou and the doctor. Now he could finally relax a little.","\"Mom, I'll come to keep you company starting tomorrow.\"","Although he had readily arranged for Jing Yi to come and keep her company before, he couldn't possibly let Jing Yi replace them in accompanying Lin Ruiqing.","\"Junjun also said she's coming tomorrow. You two should coordinate.\"","Wasn't Junjun still busy with her film crew? Jing Zeqian remembered that Jing Zejun's scenes were wrapping up recently, and she should still have quite a lot to do.","\"She said she's almost finished.\"","Jing Zeqian nodded. Since his sister was coming, he would take a step back.","After chatting idly for a while, Jing Zeqian noticed Jing Yi eating happily.","He moved closer to Jing Yi and reached out to take a donut, earning a glance from her.","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow. \"What? I bought these from so far away, and you're not even willing to let me eat one?\" Only then did Jing Yi let this donut go.","Jing Zeqian didn't particularly like sweets, but seeing Jing Yi eating so heartily made him feel hungry too.","He took a bite of the donut he was holding and immediately frowned, looking suspiciously at the remaining half.","What's so good about this? The texture isn't great, and it's so sweet!","He put the remaining donut on the table, then put on gloves and tried a bite of the duck neck.","This is just average too...","Then Jing Yi saw the person next to her taking one bite after another. Her almond-shaped eyes gradually widened. \"You're going to eat it all!\"","\"Don't be stingy, I've only eaten a few!\" As he spoke, he put a few more snacks into his mouth.","\"Leave some for me!\" If she didn't protect her food, everything she ordered would end up in Jing Zeqian's stomach!","\"What's so good about this stuff anyway?\"","\"If it's not good, why are you eating so much?!\"","\"What's wrong with tasting a bit?\"","\"You call this tasting a bit?!\"","Lin Ruiqing shook her head helplessly. It's a good thing the isolation in the ward was effective, otherwise they might have attracted the doctors and nurses.","Before the two could finish arguing, Jing Beicheng pushed open the door and entered. The quarreling in the ward came to an abrupt halt.","......","\"Jing Zeqian, tell me, what did you do wrong?\"","Thinking that his wife was still in the hospital, Jing Beicheng had rushed back to the hospital as soon as he finished dealing with some cooperation matters.","As a result, as soon as he opened the door, he heard the two of them arguing in the ward. They were both in their twenties or thirties, yet still so inconsiderate.","Lin Ruiqing watched the two people standing obediently in front of her husband. She really should have taken a picture to show Xiao You and Junjun.","Jing Zeqian, who was almost thirty and the CEO of a listed company, was now standing as punishment while reciting his mistakes.","[Who would have thought that the formidable Young Master Jing, who commands respect in the business world, would still be punished by standing when he makes mistakes at home? Hahaha]","Jing Yi lowered her head and chuckled quietly. Seeing Jing Beicheng's gaze turn towards her, she quickly suppressed the smile on her face and stood obediently to the side.","\"What about you?\" Jing Beicheng asked Jing Yi.","This was the first time Jing Yi had been punished by standing. Although she had laughed at Jing Zeqian, thinking about it now, she felt quite embarrassed herself.","Moreover, when Jing Beicheng became serious, he was truly imposing.","Jing Yi spoke softly and hesitantly: \"I shouldn't have spoken loudly in the hospital, I shouldn't have been stingy and not let Second Brother eat together, and I shouldn't have left Auntie alone when I was the one who said I would keep her company.\"","Jing Beicheng nodded, seemingly satisfied with this answer.","Jing Zeqian's eyes widened, his face full of shock as he looked at Jing Yi.","Jing Yi had only been interacting with his parents for such a short time, and she already knew his father's weak spot?!","\"It seems Little Yi already knows her mistakes. Go keep your aunt company.\"","Jing Yi's almond eyes curved into crescents, and her dimple appeared faintly. \"Thank you, Uncle! I'll definitely correct my behavior!\" As she left, she cast a glance at Jing Zeqian beside her.","Jing Zeqian: He swore that must have been a show of triumph!"]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Express Delivery Girl","paragraphs":["\"Big brother, are you working overtime again until now?\" Jing Yi had just come downstairs when she saw Jing Zeyou about to go up.","She widened her eyes, thinking Jing Zeyou had been working all night again and was only now returning home.","Jing Zeyou shook his head, \"No, I just came back from Mom's place. I'm going to grab a document before heading to the office.\"","Jing Zeyou had gone to the hospital early this morning to visit Lin Ruiqing and discuss her recovery progress with the doctor.","The doctor said Lin Ruiqing was recovering well, gradually improving, and should be able to leave the hospital soon.","Seeing that Jing Zejun and Jing Beicheng were in the hospital room keeping her company, Jing Zeyou didn't stay long. He returned to the Jing family home, intending to gather some things before going back to the office.","Jing Yi breathed a sigh of relief.","[Thank goodness, I thought big brother had become such a workaholic that he didn't even care about his life anymore.]","Jing Zeyou's lips twitched slightly. He only had one life, and he did care about it.","Jing Yi strolled leisurely to the dining room to eat.","Sunlight from the courtyard still streamed through the windows. It was a long-awaited time to relax!","She stretched comfortably.","For the past few days, to accommodate Lin Ruiqing's schedule, Jing Yi had also started going to bed and waking up early, finally developing a healthy routine.","Today was the first day she could sleep in and leisurely get up for breakfast.","Aunt Wang had even prepared a new dish for Jing Yi - baked buns! The golden-brown crust topped with white sesame seeds looked mouth-watering.","Jing Yi eagerly picked one up with her chopsticks and savored it.","In an instant, Jing Yi's almond-shaped eyes lit up. The crust was crispy, the lamb wasn't gamey at all, the texture was tender, and there was a subtle aroma of cumin. It had been so long since she'd tasted something this good!","\"Aunt Wang! These baked buns are delicious!\" Aunt Wang's eyes crinkled with joy.","The sound of Jing Zeyou's footsteps coming downstairs could be heard.","\"Big brother, do you want to join us for a bite? These baked buns are amazing!\"","Jing Yi poked her head out, looking towards Jing Zeyou who had already reached the living room, inviting him to eat together.","Jing Zeyou thought for a moment, realizing he didn't have any important meetings, so he decided to join them. \"What are your plans for the afternoon?\" he asked.","Jing Yi picked up a slice of ham and put it in her bowl. \"I plan to lie down and watch TV.\"","Jing Zeyou paused for a moment, the corners of his mouth turning up slightly.","Although he knew that given Jing Yi's personality, she probably wouldn't have any serious plans, Jing Zeyou was always surprised by her answers.","\"How about visiting Zeqian's company?\"","Jing Yi's almond eyes looked at Jing Zeyou in front of her, curiosity shining through.","[Jing Zeqian's company? You mean Startrack Entertainment?]","\"Big brother, are you going to second brother's company this afternoon?\"","Jing Zeyou didn't actually have time for that. It was just that Jing Zeqian had left a document at home and asked him to drop it off.","Jing Zeyou had already arranged for Uncle Li to have someone deliver it, but thinking Jing Yi might be interested in Jing Zeqian's entertainment company, he asked if she wanted to go.","\"I'll go! No need to trouble Uncle Li, I can deliver the document myself.\"","[An entertainment company, huh? There should be lots of handsome stars there!]","Jing Zeyou looked up at Jing Yi, the corners of his mouth unconsciously turning upward.","After all, as one of the top entertainment companies in the industry, Startrack Entertainment had no shortage of not just handsome men, but also award-winning actors, actresses, and popular celebrities.","He picked up one of the baked buns she had highly recommended. It was indeed quite good.","\"Big brother, can I take 'Black Night' out?\"","Jing Yi's eyes sparkled with anticipation, her tone becoming cheerful.","Ever since she had driven it last time, Jing Yi had been constantly thinking about it, but never had the chance.","[If I could drive it to Jing Zeqian's company, he'd be so jealous!]","Those two really did take every opportunity to bicker.","Lunch was almost over. Jing Zeyou put down his chopsticks and wiped his hands with a nearby wet wipe.","\"Whenever you want to take it out, just ask Uncle Li for the keys. Or better yet, I'll leave the keys with you, so you don't need to ask me anymore.\"","Now Jing Yi was truly surprised, staring at the person in front of her with wide eyes full of joy.","\"Thank you, big brother!\"","[Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, this is 'Black Night' we're talking about!]","Seeming to want something in return, Jing Zeyou added, \"Just one condition: be careful.\"","He didn't know why Jing Yi liked sports cars so much, but he knew she was a responsible driver and wouldn't recklessly speed.","Otherwise, he wouldn't feel comfortable letting her drive out alone.","\"I know, I know! Safety first, it's the number one rule of driving!\"","The corners of Jing Zeyou's mouth turned up, a faint smile playing on his lips.","It was time for him to return to the office. \"The document is with Uncle Li. Just ask him for it when you leave.\"","\"Okay! Goodbye, big brother!\"","As Jing Zeyou left for the office, Jing Yi quickly finished her meal, eager to get ready.","Clearly, the allure of 'Black Night' was greater than that of food.","Jing Yi pushed open the door to her room's walk-in closet, faced with a sea of clothes.","When she first arrived, this room didn't have nearly as many clothes and accessories. Two days after Jing Yi moved in, Lin Ruiqing had arranged for several personal shoppers and luxury stores to fill the room with clothes.","Looking up suddenly, she was dazzled by the variety of styles, finding it hard to choose what to wear.","This will do!","Jing Yi changed into a short white T-shirt and light brown cargo pants, grabbing an orange-toned cardigan. After a quick touch-up, she was ready to go.","\"Uncle Li, is this the document second brother needs?\"","Jing Yi walked to the courtyard where Uncle Li was already standing respectfully by the main gate, holding a folder.","Seeing Jing Yi come out, Uncle Li handed her the document.","Jing Zeyou had briefed him before leaving.","\"Yes, Miss Yi. This is the document the young master asked me to give you, and here are the keys. Let me show you to the garage.\"","Jing Yi took the items and smiled, \"No need, Uncle Li. I can find it myself. Please, carry on with your work.\"","She knew where the garage was, so she declined Uncle Li's offer to guide her.","Uncle Li hesitated for a moment but didn't insist.","\"'Black Night'! Here I come!\"","The piano black sports car was waiting in the center of the garage. Jing Yi spotted it immediately.","The door opened, and Jing Yi slid into the driver's seat, gripping the steering wheel.","No matter how many cars she had driven, she was always impressed by the feel of 'Black Night'. It truly lived up to its reputation as a top-tier luxury car!","The familiar engine roared to life. Uncle Li, busy with his tasks in the courtyard, looked up to see the black sports car speeding away from the villa.","Since Miss Yi had arrived, the Jing family seemed to have undergone some changes. It felt livelier somehow.","Several times, he had heard commotion from the living room while standing outside. At first, he worried that the second young master and Miss Yi were arguing.","But after a while, it became the norm.","More importantly, it was fortunate to have Miss Yi around. Otherwise, the madam might have suffered greatly this time.","Uncle Li smiled to himself and returned to his tasks."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Star Trails Entertainment","paragraphs":["A black sports car pulled up in front of Startrack Company.","The stylish car caught the attention of people around, and those in the office building curiously looked out, thinking it might be one of the company's artists.","Until the owner stepped out of the car, it seemed to be someone they didn't recognize...","It was a very beautiful girl, with a high ponytail, her slightly curled hair shimmering in the sunlight.","Her skin was fair and smooth, her eyes bright and lively, her figure slender and graceful, her whole being radiating youthful charm.","Paired with the cool exterior of the sports car, the contrast was even more striking.","Jing Yi stepped out of the black sports car and looked up at the unique building before her.","Unlike traditional office buildings, the company's exterior was made up of dazzling glass windows, even forming a curved design. Through these windows, one could see the spacious and bright office space inside, leaving a deep impression at first glance.","Jing Yi stood still for a few more moments to take it in, then strode through the main entrance.","In front of her was a huge LED screen, constantly displaying the company's logo along with various photos and posters of their artists, showcasing the talent of the company's many famous celebrities.","Jing Yi didn't linger long, as she was still holding the documents for Jing Zeqian.","\"Excuse me, which office is Jing Zeqian in?\"","\"Jing Ze... Do you mean President Jing?\" The polite smile on the receptionist's face stiffened slightly.","She had almost followed Jing Yi's way of addressing Jing Zeqian, but the professionally dressed receptionist quickly corrected herself.","This was the first time someone had come to Startrack and directly called out Jing Zeqian's full name.","Jing Yi nodded, telling the receptionist she was here to deliver documents.","\"Do you have an appointment?\"","Appointment? Hadn't her brother told him someone was coming to deliver documents?","It really was troublesome to see the boss, Jing Yi thought. She smiled at the receptionist, asking her to wait a moment.","She definitely hadn't made an appointment in advance, so she'd have to make one on the spot.","The receptionist watched as she took out her phone and waited a few seconds.","Jing Yi's clear and pleasant voice rang out, \"Jing Zeqian, do you still want your documents?\"","The person on the other end seemed to say something, and Jing Yi immediately changed her tone, saying, \"Second Brother, your documents have been delivered!\"","The receptionist was surprised to see her gritting her teeth.","Was this the recently found sister of President Jing, Jing Zejun, that people in the company had been talking about? But she remembered Jing Zejun didn't look like this, she had even seen Jing Zejun in a drama!","Jing Yi hung up the phone and smiled at the receptionist, her eyes showing a hint of embarrassment.","\"Sorry for delaying your work, he'll be down to get them in a moment.\"","The girl before her was beautiful, with a youthful and vibrant kind of beauty. Her slender waist was visible under her jacket, and her voice was polite and friendly.","But this didn't prevent the receptionist from taking a sharp breath when she heard her words.","No! She had meant to offer to take the documents up if there was an appointment! Not to have the boss come down personally to get them!","\"Miss Jing, why don't I take them up for you?\" The receptionist quickly came out, fearing she might lose her job if she delayed.","Seeing the receptionist's panic, Jing Yi reassured her, \"It's fine, they're his documents after all, he can come get them himself. By the way, how did you know my surname is Jing?\"","The receptionist was stunned. She had only guessed, and in her urgency had called out the name. She didn't expect her to really have the surname 'Jing'. Who was this Miss Jing?","While the receptionist was still puzzled, Jing Zeqian had already walked out of the elevator.","\"Jing Yiyi! If I hear you call my full name again, you're done for!\"","Jing Yi quickly put on a sweet smile, waving the documents in her hand with an obedient look. \"Second Brother, I've come to deliver your documents.\"","Seeing this, Jing Zeqian didn't pursue the matter further. He glanced at her, reached out to take the documents, his tone somewhat nonchalant.","\"Not lounging at home today?\"","\"Because I had to deliver documents to Second Brother!\" Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents.","If it weren't for Big Brother saying Startrack had handsome guys, I wouldn't have come!","Jing Zeqian flipped through the documents, his slender eyes glancing at Jing Yi before looking away again.","Don't think he didn't hear her thoughts just because she didn't say it out loud. Did she think he didn't know she was complaining about him? As if this girl would ever have such good intentions.","As Jing Yi saw Jing Zeqian looking at the documents, she looked around out of boredom and noticed Wen Qingyan's photo and recent schedule displayed on the big screen.","\"Second Brother, Wen Qingyan is with your company?!\"","Jing Yi's face was full of shock as she tugged on Jing Zeqian's sleeve, staring intently at the person on the big screen.","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, looking somewhat displeased, \"Don't tell me you've never looked into Startrack?\"","He had told her about it several times, and now she didn't even know about his company's top star!","Jing Yi laughed awkwardly. She indeed hadn't paid much attention to what Jing Zeqian had said. She had thought he was just boasting before, but it turned out he really did have some skills.","However, Jing Yi's surprise wasn't because Startrack had an award-winning actor, but because Wen Qingyan was the male lead in the original novel.","She had almost forgotten about the crisis Startrack would face later!","The original novel didn't describe this part in much detail. Jing Yi only remembered that two of Jing Zeqian's company's top artists - one who, backed by the Wang family, framed Jing Zeqian and caused a crisis for Startrack, and another who refused to leave Startrack and suffered damage to his reputation as a result.","Jing Yi just now remembered that Wen Qingyan was the artist who refused to leave Startrack.","In the original novel, because Wen Qingyan refused to leave when Startrack was under various attacks, it led to a period of career stagnation for him.","What was the name of the other person? It seemed he also had a good relationship with Jing Zeqian.","Seeing Jing Yi frowning and lost in thought, Jing Zeqian tapped her on the head, interrupting her train of thought.","\"What are you thinking about? Wen Qingyan is currently filming so he won't be at the company. If you want to see handsome guys, I'll have someone take you to see some of the new artists later.\"","Am I that obvious?","If Jing Zeqian had heard that, he would definitely nod vigorously.","At that moment, another person walked out of the elevator - a man wearing glasses.","He stood next to Jing Zeqian and said, \"President Jing, Vice President Xu and Director Li are already in the conference room.\"","Jing Zeqian raised his hand to check the time on his watch.","\"I have a meeting to attend in a moment. You can look around the company on your own, but don't cause any trouble. Secretary Li, have Little Wang accompany her.\"","What's this about? What trouble could I possibly cause?! Having someone follow me just to look around the company, who does he think he's looking down on!","The dissatisfied expression on Jing Yi's face was too obvious. Jing Zeqian glanced at her, and she immediately resumed her obedient expression.","Jing Zeqian turned and left with his secretary, leaving Jing Yi standing there with her arms crossed, her face full of defiance once again.","The receptionist nearby was still immersed in surprise. Jing Yiyi? Another sister of President Jing? She must also be a close family member.","\"Excuse me?\"","\"Yes, Miss Jing?\" The receptionist stepped forward, her attitude respectful.","\"Besides Wen Qingyan, does your company have any other famous stars?\"","So President Jing's sister really didn't know much about his company. \"Besides the award-winning actor Wen, Startrack also has an award-winning actress, as well as three rising starlets. Recently, we also have several idols who became famous through talent shows...\""]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Jiang Miaomiao","paragraphs":["It wasn't just the receptionist praising her own company - in recent years, the development of Startrack Artists had indeed been quite impressive. At least so far, she hadn't heard of any entertainment company that could match Startrack.","Jing Yi listened to a long list of names. After the receptionist finally finished recounting the company's glorious history, she asked, \"What's the name of that award-winning actress?\"","\"Oh, her name is Jiang Miaomiao. Sister Miaomiao became famous overnight for her film role. That movie was...\"","Jiang Miaomiao? The name sounded oddly familiar. Could it be her?","Jing Yi was still trying to recall the plot of the original book, feeling a bit frustrated.","While Jing Yi was still troubled, the person arranged by Jing Zeqian had already come down.","It was a girl about Jing Yi's age, looking as if she had rushed over, still slightly out of breath.","\"Miss Jing, I'm Little Wang, arranged by Mr. Jing to give you a tour. I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.\"","A smile bloomed on Jing Yi's lips. \"You haven't kept me waiting, you came very quickly.\"","Little Wang's face still bore a flush from running, and she smiled sheepishly at Jing Yi. \"Then, Miss Jing, please follow me.\"","Jing Yi thanked the receptionist and followed Little Wang into the elevator.","After Jing Yi left, people passing by gathered around the reception desk.","\"Little Lu, was that Mr. Jing's sister?\"","Upon hearing the news that Mr. Jing's sister had come, the administrative department downstairs was in an uproar, rushing down to see the excitement. They had heard that Mr. Jing had recently found his sister, who was apparently an actress!","The receptionist carefully glanced around before quietly gossiping with her colleagues, \"It seems it's not Jing Zejun, but another sister?\"","The people around were surprised. \"Another one?\"","\"I thought she didn't look like the Jing Zejun I know!\"","The company had its own internal sources of information. Although news about Jing Zejun wasn't widely known, most people at Startrack were aware that Jing Zejun was Jing Zeqian's sister.","They were part of the same circle, so naturally, they had to remember people to avoid accidentally offending the Jing family in the future.","\"I just heard Mr. Jing call her Jing Yi Yi,\" the receptionist said with a mysterious look.","\"I know, I know! I heard she's an adopted daughter!\"","\"Adopted daughter?!\"","Everyone's eyes widened as they turned to look at the speaker.","The person continued with a mysterious expression, \"My relative attended a banquet at the Jing family. Mr. Jing's father acknowledged her as an adopted daughter, saying she grew up abroad.\"","The others seemed to have gotten some juicy gossip, their eyes lighting up.","But wait! How did this person have so much information they didn't know?","Attending Mr. Jing's banquet?! How did a socialite who could attend the Jing family banquet end up among them?!","Meanwhile, in the elevator, Jing Yi noticed Little Wang seemed a bit nervous and said with a smile, \"We should be about the same age. You can just call me Little Jing or Little Yi.\"","Little Wang was stunned for a moment, and by the time she reacted, the elevator had already stopped. She quickly held the elevator door open for Jing Yi.","Little Jing?","She wouldn't dare, and it felt like she was calling Mr. Jing...","\"Anyway, I'm not your boss, and I don't have any position, so just call me Little Yi.\"","Jing Yi really wasn't used to being called \"Miss Jing\" respectfully wherever she went. It just felt strange to hear.","Little Wang could only agree, though later Jing Yi indeed never heard her say \"Miss Jing\" again, but she also never called her \"Little Yi.\"","\"This is the company's Artist Management Department, mainly responsible for discovering and nurturing new talents, signing contracts with artists, and arranging their schedules and activities. Usually...\"","Startrack Entertainment was mainly divided into the Artist Management Department, Production Department, Publicity Department, Marketing Department, and so on.","In addition to these main departments, the company also had many auxiliary departments, such as Legal Affairs, Human Resources, Administration...","After hearing all this, Jing Yi was thoroughly confused. She felt like she wasn't here to visit artists, but rather to take over the company.","She was just a bystander, did she need to know all these details?","If Jing Zeqian had heard this, he would definitely say it was necessary!","The reason Little Wang explained in such detail was entirely because of Jing Zeqian's instructions.","\"Mr. Jing's intention is to explain all the information about Startrack to Miss Jing in sufficient detail, including the company's internal structure and artist composition, etc.!\"","Little Wang firmly remembered Secretary Li's reminder, fearing she might miss some part.","\"Um...\" Little Wang stopped, looking a bit worried.","Was there something she hadn't explained well?","Jing Yi really didn't want to interrupt Little Wang's introduction, but if she continued like this, it would be dark before she got to hear the part she wanted to know about.","\"Where's the pantry?\"","\"Startrack has rest areas and pantries on every floor. The pantry is over there.\" Little Wang led Jing Yi to a nearby pantry.","Jing Yi was a bit surprised. It was so people-friendly. She had thought that with Jing Zeqian's personality, he would surely be a capitalist who skimped on his employees.","\"What would you like to drink?\"","\"I don't want anything. You should get yourself a glass of water first.\"","Little Wang was a bit stunned, but Jing Yi had already moved to the snack area.","She bit her lip before pouring herself a glass of water.","\"Want some?\"","Little Wang quickly shook her head. Jing Yi's lips curved upward, looking beautiful and obedient.","\"Are all the artists in the Management Department we just saw?\"","Jing Yi pulled her to sit on the couch in the rest area and started chatting casually.","\"Some might be there. Artists only come to the company when they have business. Some might be in the Publicity Department discussing promotion strategies, or in the Production Department participating in creative work.\"","No wonder she hadn't seen many artists on her way up.","\"Then for someone like Jiang Miaomiao, at her level, does she come to the company often?\"","\"As for Sister Miaomiao, she comes to the company even less often. If there's anything, her manager will come directly to coordinate and arrange. When Sister Miaomiao does come, it's mostly to see Mr. Jing.\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow, nodding understandingly as she threw the now empty snack bag into the trash.","It seemed to be a matter of fame after all. For an artist at Jiang Miaomiao's level, who was already an award-winning actress, there probably wasn't much that required her personal presence besides on-camera work.","So how could she confirm whether that Jiang Miaomiao was the one who framed Jing Zeqian?","Little Wang saw that Jing Yi wasn't speaking, seeming to be in a daze.","\"Are you a fan of Sister Miaomiao?\"","Jing Yi snapped back to reality and said with a smile, \"Yes, I quite like her dramas.\"","She couldn't even remember the person, how could she have watched Jiang Miaomiao's dramas?","\"Then you can just tell Mr. Jing directly. Sister Miaomiao and Mr. Jing have a very good relationship. You could say Mr. Jing single-handedly made her famous...\"","\"What did you say?\" Jing Yi seemed to have caught some key words, reacting rather strongly.","Little Wang hesitated a bit before repeating, \"I said, you could say Sister Miaomiao was single-handedly made famous by Mr. Jing.\"","'I never expected that the person I, Jing Zeqian, single-handedly made famous would end up stabbing me in the back for a man...'","'Jiang Miaomiao, you've really outdone yourself!'"]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: The Battle for Parking Spaces","paragraphs":["Jing Yi stared blankly at Little Wang, noticing she seemed to have cheered up a bit.","Was her mood swinging too drastically?","Having heard the information she wanted to know and remembering something important, Jing Yi felt much more relaxed.","Little Wang tentatively asked, \"Do you need me to get you Miaomiao's autographed photo or something?\" The company had quite a few such items from artists, like autographed photos and merchandise.","Jing Yi smiled and shook her head, \"No need. Let's go see the new artists my second brother Jingze mentioned.\"","She wasn't really Jiang Miaomiao's fan, so why would she need her autograph?","\"Alright, they should be training on the sixth floor now. I'll take you there.\"","Jing Yi was quite excited, after all, the receptionist had introduced them so impressively earlier - award-winning actors and popular celebrities. It felt like all the good-looking people in Jiangbei had come to Startrack.","\"It's right in here.\" Little Wang knocked on the door and led Jing Yi inside.","The people inside were practicing dance moves. They didn't lose focus when they heard the door open, concentrating on their reflections in the mirror as they danced.","The dance instructor looked over, recognizing Little Wang. \"Assistant Wang, what brings you here? And who is this?\"","He stood up, discreetly eyeing Jing Yi with apparent interest.","Is she a new artist signed by the company? She's quite good-looking with a nice figure.","\"This is CEO Jing's sister. She's here to see the artists.\"","The dance instructor immediately dropped his appraising gaze and politely greeted Jing Yi, \"Oh, so it's Miss Jing. Hello! Hello! I'm Startrack's dance instructor. My name is...\"","The boy group that had been practicing also stopped. They had overheard - this was CEO Jing's sister!","\"Hello, Miss Jing!\"","\"Miss Jing!\"","\"Miss Jing!\"","The boys swarmed over enthusiastically to greet Jing Yi.","Jing Yi gave a forced laugh, startled by the boys' enthusiasm and taking half a step back.","She had thought they would just look from the doorway, not actually enter the practice room.","Seeing that the boys wanted to say more, Jing Yi hurriedly said she was sorry for interrupting their practice and quickly pulled Little Wang out of the room.","\"There are a few more artists over there. Would you like to see them?\" Little Wang carefully asked, noticing Jing Yi's apprehensive expression.","Jing Yi quickly waved her hands in refusal: \"No need! It's better not to disturb their training.\"","Most importantly, these people weren't nearly as good-looking as she had imagined!","Come to think of it, with two handsome, high-quality CEOs and one handsome older man around her every day, Jing Yi's standards had unconsciously been raised.","\"Is there anywhere else you'd like to visit? I can take you there.\"","After walking around so much, Jing Yi was feeling a bit tired and didn't want to trouble Little Wang further.","\"No need, thank you for today. Do you know if my second brother is done with his meeting?\"","Jing Yi planned to let Jing Zeqian know she was leaving and then go home. This trip wasn't as relaxing as staying at home.","\"Please wait a moment, I'll go up and check for you.\"","\"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Jing Yi walked to the first floor lounge area, where a crowd had gathered. It looked quite lively.","\"Really! I heard it from my relative!\"","\"You're lying! There's actually a rich capitalist among us!\"","\"No, I think we've gone off-topic...\"","The receptionist suddenly spotted Jing Yi and deliberately coughed a few times, smiling as she greeted her, \"Miss Jing!\"","Jing Yi smiled sweetly, her eyes crinkling, \"Hello everyone.\"","The crowd became even more chaotic, returning her greeting before dispersing like egg drop soup.","Jing Yi felt a bit disappointed; she had been ready to listen in on everyone's gossip.","Outside the company, a large SUV stopped behind the 'Black Night'.","\"Sister Miaomiao, there's a car parked in front, we can only stop here.\"","The woman in the car was resting with her eyes closed. \"Zeqian's car?\"","The assistant hesitated, \"It doesn't look like CEO Jing's car.\" At least, she had never seen Jing Zeqian drive that car before.","The woman's expression showed some impatience, \"Tell the front desk to have it moved.\"","The assistant realized the car in question was obviously the 'Black Night', and it was parked in the designated parking area, which was also the closest spot to Startrack's entrance - just a few steps from the company's main door.","The woman seemed unwilling to compromise and park further back, leaving the assistant in a difficult position.","Hearing no movement, Jiang Miaomiao finally opened her eyes, frowning slightly, \"Why are we just sitting here?\"","\"Sister Miaomiao, look at that car.\"","Jiang Miaomiao raised her head to look at the sports car in front, hesitating.","Having been in the entertainment industry for nearly ten years, she naturally understood that a car represented its owner's status, and the car in front of them was clearly not one that could be casually moved.","\"Forget it! Just park here. Open the door!\" Jiang Miaomiao's tone revealed her displeasure.","The driver quickly opened the door, and the assistant got out first to help Jiang Miaomiao, afraid that any negligence might anger her further.","Holding onto her assistant's hand, Jiang Miaomiao changed into her prepared high heels and walked step by step towards Startrack's entrance.","Seeing Jiang Miaomiao enter, the receptionist hurried out to greet her, \"Good afternoon, Sister Miaomiao!\"","Jiang Miaomiao glanced at her and gave a disinterested \"Mm.\"","\"Whose car is that at the entrance?\"","The receptionist's heart skipped a beat, and she instinctively looked towards Jing Yi, who was resting on the sofa.","Jiang Miaomiao noticed the direction of her gaze and followed it.","She lifted her chin slightly, looking sideways at Jing Yi, and asked nonchalantly, \"Hers?\"","The receptionist hurried to answer, \"Yes, she's...\"","Before the receptionist could finish explaining Jing Yi's identity, Jiang Miaomiao had already walked over with her assistant's support. The receptionist quickly followed.","Jiang Miaomiao was Startrack's top female artist, personally groomed by Jing Zeqian, so her status in the company was quite special.","But Jing Yi was the CEO's sister, and the receptionist was truly afraid of a conflict between the two - Jiang Miaomiao was not easy to deal with!","Jing Yi was resting on the sofa when she suddenly heard the sound of high heels. Opening her eyes, she saw a group of people standing in front of her.","The person in the center seemed somewhat hostile.","\"Is that your car at the entrance?\" Jiang Miaomiao asked again.","Jing Yi was a bit confused, turning her head to look at 'Black Night' obediently waiting in the parking area.","\"Yes, it is.\"","Jiang Miaomiao looked her up and down; her clothes were all from this year's latest C brand collection.","She had initially thought Jing Zeqian had gotten a new car, but since it wasn't his, it didn't matter whose it was.","Jiang Miaomiao glanced at her assistant, and the girl stepped forward, \"Please move your car.\"","Jing Yi became even more confused, looking at Jiang Miaomiao, \"May I ask if I'm blocking a fire exit or obstructing traffic?\"","Jiang Miaomiao didn't speak, her gaze becoming more unfriendly.","The assistant continued, \"That's Sister Miaomiao's parking spot.\"","In fact, it wasn't really anyone's designated spot; it was just usually occupied by either Jing Zeqian or Jiang Miaomiao.","As for Wen Qingyan, he didn't care about such things at all.","Strictly speaking, the only one who cared about this spot was Jiang Miaomiao.","The receptionist felt awkward, wanting to step in and mediate, but no one seemed interested in hearing what she had to say.","Jing Yi chuckled lightly, \"If it's a private parking spot, I believe there should be a sign indicating so. Otherwise, I might assume it's a public parking space.\"","\"Everyone at Startrack knows that spot is for Sister Miaomiao's car!\"","So this is Jiang Miaomiao?"]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: This is My Sister","paragraphs":["Jing Zeqian had just come down when he saw a group of people gathered together, with Jing Yi standing in the middle.","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, \"What are you all crowding around for? Don't you have work to do?\"","Jiang Miaomiao turned and saw Jing Zeqian. She immediately changed her demeanor, no longer leaning on her assistant, and walked up to Jing Zeqian's side with a smile.","\"Zeqian, long time no see.\"","Jing Zeqian glanced at her, nodded, but didn't say anything.","Jing Yi stood to the side, arms crossed, calmly watching the 'old friends reuniting' scene unfolding before her.","\"What's going on?\" Jing Zeqian asked.","The receptionist opened her mouth, wanting to say something, but Jiang Miaomiao looked at the assistant, and the girl from earlier stepped forward.","\"Mr. Jing, we wanted to ask this young lady to move her car, but she doesn't seem willing to.\"","Jing Yi's expression remained unchanged, showing no intention of refuting. The receptionist felt anxious on her behalf.","Is this how she wants to play the villain? The skill level is too low, Jing Yi thought.","Jiang Miaomiao also stepped forward, speaking softly: \"It's like this, Zeqian. I'm used to parking my car there, as you know. I just wanted to discuss it with this young lady...\"","She seemed to think of something and put on a troubled expression, even tugging at her assistant's sleeve, with a 'I'm a bit upset but I don't want to say it and make things difficult for you' look on her face.","Jing Yi lowered her head and chuckled softly, confusing everyone around her.","This skill level is even lower, and the tactics are so outdated! Tsk tsk tsk, some people try desperately to hide their age, but the words that come out of their mouth immediately give them away, Jing Yi thought to herself.","Jing Zeqian naturally knew what Jing Yi was thinking, and could guess that the girl was definitely mocking Jiang Miaomiao's way of addressing him!","Jing Yi saw Jing Zeqian looking at her and put on a stern face, \"What? Do you want me to apologize?!\"","Jing Zeqian was taken aback by her accusatory tone. He looked at her helplessly, \"Who said I wanted you to apologize? It's just a parking spot. If it's parked, it's parked. It's not like there aren't other spots.\"","Didn't Startrack arrange a parking garage? Isn't a whole floor enough for parking?","Jiang Miaomiao was stunned for a moment. She had thought that for such a small matter, Jing Zeqian would naturally side with her, as he always had in the past. He usually didn't care about trivial things.","Jing Zeqian smiled and introduced Jing Yi to Jiang Miaomiao: \"Miaomiao, this is my sister, Jing Yi. It's a good opportunity for you two to meet.\"","So she really is Jing Zeqian's sister, Jiang Miaomiao thought. \"Oh, so you're his sister. What a coincidence. Since it's sister's car, let's just leave it there then.\" Jiang Miaomiao smiled and greeted Jing Yi.","She had originally thought that even if this was Jing Zeqian's long-lost sister, she shouldn't have to pay too much attention to her. After all, she had known Jing Zeqian for years, while Jing Zejun had only known him for a few months.","Besides, Jing Yi was adopted.","But Jing Zeqian's attitude seemed different from what she had expected. Jiang Miaomiao suppressed her inner displeasure and maintained a gentle expression.","Jing Yi glanced at Jing Zeqian beside her, somewhat surprised that he would take her side.","\"So you're the famous Sister Miaomiao. You really are beautiful. Can't your tour bus fit? Maybe have the driver be more careful, the 'Black Night' is very expensive.\"","Jing Yi smiled sweetly, her eyes curving into crescents.","Behind her, the receptionist pressed her lips tightly together, afraid of laughing out loud and being seen by Jiang Miaomiao.","Jiang Miaomiao's smile became a bit stiff, but she quickly composed herself.","\"Is that so? Did Zeqian give it to you? You're so good to your sister.\"","Jing Yi naturally understood Jiang Miaomiao's implication. Her smile widened, her round almond eyes meeting Jiang Miaomiao's gaze.","\"He doesn't have that kind of money. The car is from big brother.\"","Jing Zeqian tapped her forehead, their relationship appearing very close. \"How can you say I don't have money? I can certainly afford a 'Black Night'!\"","\"You're bluffing! You have to borrow it from big brother to drive!\"","\"That's because there's only one in the whole world, and big brother bought it.\"","The assistant's hand trembled slightly.","Thank goodness they didn't move it impulsively, or ten tour buses wouldn't be enough to compensate.","Jiang Miaomiao's smile was becoming hard to maintain. The Jing Yi in front of her seemed more difficult to deal with than she had imagined.","\"Why did you come to the company today?\" Jing Zeqian didn't want to make Jiang Miaomiao's situation too awkward.","Jiang Miaomiao smiled at Jing Zeqian, \"There are some work-related matters I wanted to discuss with you.\"","Jing Zeqian nodded, then looked at Jing Yi, \"Wait for me for a bit, I'll go back with you.\"","\"No way, Aunt Wang made afternoon tea. If we don't go back soon, it'll get cold.\"","Jing Yi flatly refused. The 'old friends reuniting' act was getting a bit nauseating.","\"How could it possibly get cold! Wait for me and we'll go back together!\"","Jing Yi was equally stubborn, \"If I go back with you, I won't get to eat much! I'm going back first!\"","Clearly, Jing Yi still remembered the scene from last time when Jing Zeqian ate all her snacks.","Jing Zeqian opened his mouth to argue again, but he was worried that if this continued, his image at the company would plummet.","This girl had already let slip so much!","Jing Zeqian could only let her go, \"Alright then, drive carefully.\"","Jing Yi nodded obediently and prepared to leave. Before leaving, she stopped in front of Jiang Miaomiao.","Jing Zeqian felt a sense of foreboding.","Sure enough, he saw Jing Yi smile sweetly and say to Jiang Miaomiao: \"Sister Miaomiao, now you can move your tour bus over to park.\"","Then she left gracefully, leaving Jing Zeqian glaring at her back.","She really had to cause trouble for him even as she was leaving!","Seeing Jiang Miaomiao's somewhat unnatural expression, Jing Zeqian said, \"Let's go to my office to talk.\"","Jiang Miaomiao smiled and followed Jing Zeqian, \"You seem to quite like this sister of yours?\"","Jiang Miaomiao joked, probing Jing Yi's position in Jing Zeqian's heart.","If it were Jing Zejun, she could understand. After all, she was a long-lost sister, naturally deserving of some spoiling.","But wasn't Jing Yi adopted?","And she had always lived abroad, where did they find the time to cultivate such a relationship?","Jing Zeqian complained, \"Where did you see that I like her? She only knows how to argue with me every day, contradicting me with every extra word I say. She doesn't act like a sister at all.\"","Jiang Miaomiao smiled and didn't say anything, but her eyes held an indecipherable look.","Jing Zeqian opened the office door and asked Secretary Li to make her a cup of coffee.","\"Just water is fine. I'm about to start filming, so I'd better not have coffee.\"","Jing Zeqian looked at her strangely. Wasn't she always inseparable from her coffee?","\"By the way, what did you want to see me about?\" Jing Zeqian didn't think too much about it and sat down opposite Jiang Miaomiao.","\"Oh, I had Sister Li help me accept Director Xu's film, and some variety shows. I wanted to discuss the publicity with the PR department.\"","\"Variety shows? Didn't you always dislike participating in variety shows?\"","Didn't she say that actors should maintain an air of mystery?","Jing Zeqian asked puzzled, \"And won't the workload be too much? Weren't you not feeling well recently?\"","A flash of unease crossed Jiang Miaomiao's eyes, but she smiled at Jing Zeqian, \"I got bored after resting for a while, you know? I thought it would be good to interact more with the public. Besides, these are just some casual variety shows.\"","Seeing that she had already made up her mind, Jing Zeqian didn't say anything more. He just asked his secretary to call in the PR department for a meeting."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Hobbies of Jingyi","paragraphs":["\"Really? So my mom can be discharged from the hospital next week?\"","In a private hospital in North River, the doctor was in the ward discussing Lin Ruiqing's treatment situation with Jing Beicheng and Jing Zejun.","The doctor was recording the treatment progress in his notebook. Hearing Jing Zejun's question, he looked up with a smile and said, \"Yes, Mrs. Jing's treatment is going very well. She should be fully recovered by next week.\"","Jing Zejun's smile deepened. This was the best news she had heard in a while.","Jing Beicheng, who had been by Lin Ruiqing's side, also managed a rare smile.","He had been the most worried person during this time. Having finally found his daughter and reunited the family, he thought his wife's health would gradually improve.","But then suddenly receiving news of his wife's deteriorating condition was like a bolt from the blue for him.","Thankfully, everything was fine now.","Lin Ruiqing held his hand, a gentle smile on her lips.","\"Thank you, Doctor!\"","Jing Zejun saw the doctor out and happily returned to her parents' side.","Lin Ruiqing lovingly stroked her head.","The joy in Jing Zejun's eyes was almost overflowing. \"That's wonderful, Mom! You'll be able to come home next week!\"","Lin Ruiqing also breathed a sigh of relief, finally able to go home. Although Jing Yi and the others had been taking turns coming to care for her and keep her company during this time,","it was still very different from being at home.","\"So Mom was bored too? But I heard that the ward was quite lively a few days ago?\"","Jing Zejun sat nearby, her smile bright and gentle.","Jing Beicheng looked at Lin Ruiqing, realizing that she had 'sold out' the incident of Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi being made to stand as punishment to Jing Zejun.","Lin Ruiqing looked at Jing Zejun, deliberately avoiding eye contact with Jing Beicheng.","Jing Beicheng smiled faintly. Well, it wasn't him who was embarrassed anyway. \"Those two can start arguing anywhere,\" he said, completely selling out Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi.","The smile in Jing Zejun's eyes deepened. She had heard from Lin Ruiqing that the two were made to stand as punishment for fighting over food.","She thought it was such a pity that they didn't take a photo to commemorate the moment. Lin Ruiqing had agreed, but they decided to let the two save face.","'Knock knock'","The door to the ward opened, and Jing Yi poked her head in from outside, looking all innocent. \"Is this the customer with order number 1234? Your meal has arrived.\"","The people in the ward couldn't help but smile at her strange behavior.","Jing Yi had sent a text message to Jing Zejun early in the morning, asking what they wanted to eat today. She had Aunt Wang prepare it and brought it over.","Jing Zejun was curious why Jing Yi was up so early today.","Then she heard an absurd explanation that was very in line with Jing Yi's character: she was hungry.","So, today's lunch was delivered by the little Jing delivery girl.","\"It's my order. Thank you, delivery girl,\" Jing Zejun walked up and took the fully packed lunch from her hands.","Jing Zejun was a bit surprised and looked at the food Jing Yi was still carrying. \"Why did you bring so much?\"","How did she manage to bring so much food by herself?","Lin Ruiqing asked, \"Why didn't you ask a few more people to help deliver?\"","\"It's not too bad. Everything looked so delicious, so I just packed it all up and brought it over,\" Jing Yi replied.","It was only when they laid out all the food in front of them that Jing Yi began to think that maybe she had brought a bit too much.","Jing Beicheng picked up a piece of fish for Lin Ruiqing, even removing the bones for her.","[Oh my god! The domineering CEO male lead is right beside me! Removing fish bones is such a male lead thing to do!]","Jing Beicheng's hand holding the chopsticks paused briefly, but he quickly resumed eating as if nothing had happened. Lin Ruiqing, however, felt a bit uncomfortable.","Jing Zejun looked up, her eyes filled with amusement.","Since she started interacting with Jing Beicheng and his wife, she had also discovered that Jing Beicheng was indeed a gentle and affectionate person when it came to Lin Ruiqing.","Yi Yi really understood her perspective!","\"Yi Yi, do you want some fish?\" Lin Ruiqing, wanting to interrupt Jing Yi's wandering thoughts, pointed at the cod in front of her, intending to pick up a piece for her.","\"Auntie, you eat yours. Don't worry about me.\"","\"I heard from your older brother that you've been out driving sports cars recently?\" Jing Beicheng's original intention was to chat about daily life with his child, but since he hadn't interacted much with his daughter before, his tone was the same as when he spoke to Jing Zeyou and the others.","Jing Yi felt a bit nervous, thinking that Jing Beicheng might not approve of her engaging in such dangerous activities.","The grandmother at the orphanage had been very worried about her doing these things, so she always did what ordinary girls would do.","After all, there were so many children at the orphanage, and she didn't want to make the grandmother worry by letting her know about such dangerous hobbies.","Later, Jing Yi got used to this and acted the same way around Grandma Jing.","In fact, during her two years abroad, she had made some friends with similar interests, but she didn't dare tell Grandma Jing.","Just like now, she was afraid to tell Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing about her hobbies.","Jing Zejun noticed that something was off about Jing Yi's mood and was about to interrupt.","Jing Yi smiled and said, \"It's not a big deal. I just thought the car looked nice, all shiny and beautifully designed, so I took it out for a spin. Don't worry, I drove very slowly.\"","Jing Zejun was slightly taken aback. Jing Yi actually really liked that car.","Every time she talked about that sports car called 'Night', her eyes would light up.","Even Lin Ruiqing noticed that something was off with Jing Yi and glared at Jing Beicheng for his inability to communicate properly.","He opened his mouth, wanting to explain, but didn't know what to say.","\"I actually think girls who drive sports cars are very cool. There's no rule saying girls can't drive sports cars.\"","Jing Yi looked up, her expression a bit confused, not understanding why Lin Ruiqing suddenly said this.","\"Auntie, I...\"","\"Whether it's because it looks good or because you like it, they're all cool hobbies. Try this Xue Yan, Aunt Wang made it very tasty. Don't mind your uncle, he's old-fashioned and doesn't know how to express himself properly.\"","The world-renowned chairman of Hengjing Group, described as inarticulate and unable to express himself, Jing Beicheng didn't refute his wife's words and just nodded silently.","Jing Yi's eyes became watery, and she smiled sweetly.","[So, Auntie thinks driving sports cars is cool...]","Jing Beicheng cleared his throat a few times, wanting to say something more.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zejun's gazes turned to him simultaneously, and he swallowed his words again.","He hadn't meant to say anything else...","Then, Jing Beicheng's slightly cautious voice was heard at the dining table, \"If you like it, you can buy a few more to keep at home. We have plenty of space anyway.\"","Jing Yi nodded, the smile in her eyes very gentle.","Lin Ruiqing glanced at him, \"Is that all you're going to say to win her over?\"","Jing Yi's eyes lit up, looking expectantly at Jing Beicheng.","He smiled helplessly. Was he, the chairman of Hengjing, really such a miser?","\"I'll add money to your bank cards. Both Yi Yi and Junjun, buy whatever you like.\"","[As expected of a sugar daddy, he's not stingy with money at all!]","Jing Zejun and Jing Yi huddled together, laughing softly.","\"Thank you, Dad!\" \"Thank you, Uncle!\"","The corners of Jing Beicheng's mouth turned up slightly. Having another daughter call him Dad wasn't bad at all."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Lin Ruiqing Discharged from Hospital","paragraphs":["The day of discharge from the hospital arrived. Jing Beicheng was helping Lin Ruiqing rest in the hospital room.","Jing Zeyou was discussing follow-up precautions with the doctor when he remembered what Jing Zeyou had mentioned last time.","\"Your aunt's condition is fine now, but Zeyou, are you sure you don't want to take a psychological assessment or something?\" The doctor was still concerned. Although Jing Zeyou's physical examination report showed no issues, it didn't rule out potential psychological problems.","Jing Zeyou smiled helplessly. How could he explain that both his body and mind were perfectly fine? \"Don't worry, I know what I'm doing. If there really was a problem, I'd definitely contact you. As for last time, just consider it mere curiosity on my part.\"","The doctor gave him a skeptical look but didn't push further. \"Alright then, but if you notice anything unusual, make sure to contact me!\" Jing Zeyou had finally managed to politely decline his doctor friend's suggestion.","In the hospital room, Jing Zeqian was directing Jing Yi, \"Jing Yi, come put this away.\"","Jing Zeqian handed some clothes to Jing Yi, who was packing luggage. Jing Zejun was packing on the other side of the hospital bed, occasionally looking up at the two bickering, shaking her head with a slight smile.","Jing Yi glared at Jing Zeqian but still took the clothes. She had been temporarily 'hired' as an assistant by Jing Zeqian due to having nothing else to do, which essentially meant being at his beck and call.","[The suitcase is right there! Are his arms too short or what?!]","\"And this too.\"","Jing Yi took the jacket, glaring once more.","Jing Zeqian's smile only grew wider. So this was how it felt to have someone dislike you but be unable to do anything about it - it felt pretty good!","\"Junjun, have you wrapped up your filming?\" Jing Zeqian asked.","Jing Zejun nodded, continuing with her task, \"Yes, it's pretty much done. All that's left is the subsequent promotion.\"","\"Have you considered joining my company?\" This wasn't the first time Jing Zeqian had brought this up with Jing Zejun.","His reasoning was simple. He ran an entertainment company, and since Jing Zejun wanted to be an actress, why couldn't she join his company? This way, he could protect her and provide her with better resources. After all, he had nurtured an actress to become a Best Actress award winner.","Jing Zejun's smile faded slightly, her movements pausing as she seemed at a loss.","Jing Yi noticed Jing Zejun's discomfort and immediately spoke up to divert attention, \"What's the big deal? So what if it's Startrack? Your company's current top actress is Jiang Miaomiao. What resources do you have for Junjun?\"","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, immediately retorting, \"Startrack is a major company. How could we not have good resources?\"","\"Well, if Jiang Miaomiao and Junjun both want the same script, who gets it?\"","Jing Zeqian hesitated briefly before responding, \"A script doesn't have just one role!\" He refused to believe they would both want the exact same role!","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow, \"Second brother, you're not answering my question directly.\"","[He values that Jiang Miaomiao more than I thought!]","Jing Zeqian's lips tightened. He would certainly favor his own sister, but Jiang Miaomiao was someone he had personally nurtured. He couldn't leave her with nothing.","He looked at Jing Yi with a serious expression, \"This question isn't realistic. Even for artists from different companies, any issues regarding script roles can be negotiated. And even if such a situation did arise, I would definitely favor my own sister.\"","Jing Yi gazed at Jing Zeqian with a meaningful look, \"Second brother, do you think Junjun doesn't have the ability to get that script on her own?\"","He knew that even when artists from different companies compete, negotiations are necessary. How do they negotiate? Either by comparing star power or acting skills. But when it came to Jing Zejun, Jing Zeqian seemed to subconsciously ignore this option.","Jing Zeqian paused, \"...You're deliberately making things difficult.\"","Apart from this, he seemed unable to find a rebuttal.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng felt that every word Jing Yi said pointed to the core of the issue.","Jing Zejun had her own choices. Perhaps her company wasn't as good as Startrack, but she must have her own considerations.","Jing Zeqian just couldn't understand this point. After finding Jing Zejun, he wanted to lay everything out in front of her, afraid she might take a step and hurt herself.","Jing Zejun's hand tightened slightly as she looked at the two, her expression somewhat worried.","\"Why are you arguing again?\" Jing Zeyou pushed open the door, seeing the two bickering as usual.","\"Big brother, be the judge. Jing Yi is always opposing me!\"","\"You're the unreasonable one. I want to tell big brother first!\"","\"Stop!\" Jing Zeyou held up both hands to stop the two rushing towards him.","He didn't want to hear from either of them. It was all trivial matters anyway, what was there to argue about? \"If you want to argue, can't you do it at home? Even though the hospital rooms are soundproof, you should still be considerate.\"","Jing Zeqian finally gave up, and Jing Yi returned to Jing Zejun's side, patting her hand with a sweet smile.","Jing Zejun, whose mood had been a bit low, couldn't help but smile as well.","\"By the way, what's the name of the drama you just finished filming?\"","Seeing that the previous topic had been diverted, Jing Yi wanted to chat about something Jing Zejun was interested in to improve her mood.","\"All you do is eat and sleep all day. You can't remember anything,\" Jing Zeqian said coldly from the side, earning reproachful looks from several people.","[Jerk!]","\"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms,\" Jing Zejun quickly said the name of the drama, afraid that the two would start arguing because of her again.","Jing Yi's movements slowed as she was putting away clothes, her eyes filled with deep confusion.","[Sea Crabapple Still Blooms? Why does this name sound so familiar?]","At times like these, Jing Yi couldn't help but hate her limited memory. It took so much effort to recall anything.","The others didn't pay much attention, assuming Jing Yi had heard the name of the drama in some entertainment news.","\"Now that filming is over, can you eat properly?\" Jing Zeyou still remembered Jing Zejun's low immunity from her last physical examination.","\"If little Zeyou hadn't mentioned it, I would have forgotten. Junjun, filming is one thing, but you still need to take care of your health. When we get back, let Aunt Wang help you nourish your body. You can't diet like that again. If necessary, we can hire a personal trainer.\"","\"Okay, mom,\" Jing Zejun smiled shyly.","Actually, it was just that the director of this drama was a bit strict. To present a better effect, the cheongsams were made slightly small, and to fit into them, Jing Zejun had to deliberately eat less.","Jing Yi leaned close to Jing Zejun's ear and whispered, \"Can you ask Aunt Wang to prepare an extra portion for me?\" Jing Zejun smiled tenderly, affectionately pinching Jing Yi's cheek.","\"Of course! You can have whatever you want to eat.\""]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: CEO of the New Appointment","paragraphs":["Jing Yi had arranged to meet Shen Xi in the afternoon, and she had already arrived at the café.","Shen Xi pushed open the door, spotted Jing Yi, and quickly walked over. \"Yi Yi!\"","She hung her coat on the back of the chair and ordered a coffee from the menu. \"Why did you come so early today?\"","\"I hitched a ride with Jing Zeqian.\" It happened that he needed to go out today too, although they inevitably had a bit of a clash in the car.","\"Has Mrs. Jing been discharged from the hospital?\"","Shen Xi hadn't seen Jing Yi for a while and knew she had been accompanying Lin Ruiqing recently.","Jing Yi nodded, \"Yes, she was discharged a few days ago.\"","\"That's good.\"","Shen Xi took the coffee from the waiter, said thank you, and looked up to see that something seemed off with Jing Yi.","She was absentmindedly stirring her coffee spoon, appearing somewhat distracted.","\"What's wrong? Something on your mind?\"","\"I feel like I've forgotten something very important.\"","Shen Xi hesitantly asked, \"Forgotten? Can it really be that important if you forgot it?\"","Jing Yi glanced at her, her tone tinged with a hint of grievance, \"You know how bad my memory is.\" Otherwise, she wouldn't have failed so many courses back then.","Shen Xi recalled the scene of her frantically studying in the library and nodded in agreement.","\"Well, what do you think it might be about? Why don't you talk it through with me? Maybe you'll remember.\"","Jing Yi thought for a moment and felt Shen Xi had a point. \"Do you know about the TV drama Zejun filmed recently?\"","Shen Xi immediately nodded, \"Of course, 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms'!\"","Jing Yi felt it was related to this drama, so she wanted to start there. \"What kind of show is it?\"","At this, Shen Xi perked up, fully embodying the image of a fan recommending it to a stranger.","\"It's a drama about passionate youth in the Republican era, telling the story of a wealthy young lady who...\"","Jing Yi was dumbfounded. She had only wanted a general idea, not the entire plot synopsis. But Shen Xi beside her had already become unstoppable.","Finally, Shen Xi finished recounting everything she knew about the drama.","She took a big sip of her coffee, having become quite thirsty after talking so much. \"Did you remember the important thing?\"","Jing Yi looked up blankly and shook her head. The plot synopsis hadn't helped at all.","Shen Xi didn't know how else to help her. \"Is Miss Jing on a diet for this drama?\"","Jing Yi looked up, surprised. \"How did you know?\"","\"From set photos. Compared to when she attended the banquet last time, she seems to have lost a lot of weight.\" The camera tends to widen people horizontally to some extent, so she's probably even thinner in person.","Jing Yi nodded in agreement, \"Yes, the director is very strict. To look good on camera, the cheongsams were made quite slim, so she's been deliberately restricting her diet.\"","Shen Xi shook her head with emotion. Although she was a fan of Jing Zejun, she didn't really understand.","She had already become the daughter of a wealthy family, and a famous one at that - the Jing family. Her second brother was even the boss of an entertainment company.","Why did Jing Zejun need to work so hard?","Hearing this, Jing Yi chuckled lightly, \"That's why she's Jing Zejun.\"","Hm? What did that mean? Shen Xi was puzzled by this ambiguous statement.","Jing Yi didn't explain further and changed the subject, \"How have things been with your family lately?\"","Jing Yi remembered Shen Xi mentioning the group's reorganization last time.","After all, they were also a well-known wealthy family in North river. Jing Yi felt she should learn more about it, to better handle future situations.","Otherwise, she'd end up like now, unable to remember anything important or even know where to start thinking about it.","\"It seems they've resolved some of the uncooperative voices. After all, it was a major overhaul. There were some old members causing trouble and arguments before, but it looks like things have been settled now.\"","\"That's impressive. Sounds like quite the tough character.\"","Jing Yi was genuinely curious about the current president of Huarui Group.","Shen Xi strongly agreed. It wasn't an exaggeration - after all, to completely take over Huarui Group, one of the top three in North river, in just a month? How could that be an ordinary person?","Whenever Shen Xi's family mentioned that Shen Huaichu, they always seemed both admiring and wary, which made her quite curious as well.","\"Your brother and the others weren't affected, were they?\"","Jing Yi assumed Shen Xi's relatives were so busy because they were inside the group, fearing that the new boss's housecleaning might eventually reach them.","Shen Xi was confused and asked, \"Why would they be affected?\"","Now it was Jing Yi's turn to be puzzled. \"Huh? Don't they work for the group?\" Shen Xi then realized Jing Yi had misunderstood.","Her family were just distant relatives who had some connection. And because her father didn't want to face the caustic attitudes of the high-level executives in the group, he had started his own company.","\"Then why is your family so busy?\"","Bringing this up, Shen Xi felt a bit exasperated. \"Because my dad is preparing to make a big profit.\"","Shen Xi's father truly admired Shen Huaichu's abilities. He felt that Shen Huaichu was the type to prioritize benefits over relationships, so he was trying to establish connections with Huarui, hoping to make a significant profit.","Jing Yi didn't really understand the intricacies of business cooperation, but that didn't stop her from being interested in wealthy family drama!","\"Only looking at benefits? How did he figure that out?\"","Talking about this, Shen Xi became more animated. She put down her coffee cup.","\"Wasn't Huarui Group's original president his uncle? Although it's unclear whether he had a hand in his parents' car accident, the moment the current president got the shares, he dismissed his uncle from his position, along with all his confidants.\"","Her father had been discussing this with the family when he came back. It was a big deal, after all, many people had devoted their youth to Huarui.","That day, there were many anguished voices both inside and outside Huarui Group.","But Shen Huaichu didn't spare anyone. Anyone with even a slight connection to his uncle had to pack up and leave.","\"More importantly, a few days later, he had his uncle sent to prison on charges of 'illegal fundraising'.\"","\"Were the charges real?\"","\"Of course. This wasn't some trumped-up evidence. There was solid proof.\" When her father mentioned the amount involved, Shen Xi was shocked for quite a while.","So her family really wasn't that wealthy. Otherwise, she wouldn't have been surprised by that amount.","Jing Yi, however, felt that this person's battle had been fought beautifully, swift and decisive.","\"My dad thinks so too! That's why he's starting to try to make contact with Huarui.\"","Jing Yi felt somewhat emotional. It seemed that even in wealthy families, life wasn't easy. Perhaps being a laid-back person like her was better.","Speaking of which, the balance in her savings account had grown a bit recently. Every time she saw all those zeros at the end, it put her in a good mood."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Remembering","paragraphs":["The sun was slowly setting, casting a golden-green glow over the Jing family's courtyard.","Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing walked arm in arm through the garden outside their villa. \"It's getting cold. Shall we go back inside?\" he asked.","As the sunset faded, Jing Beicheng tightened the coat draped over Lin Ruiqing's shoulders, worried she might catch a chill.","Lin Ruiqing wanted to walk a bit longer. After her hospital stay, she felt like she had nearly grown into the bed.","Jing Beicheng reluctantly agreed, accompanying her on a slow stroll through the courtyard.","The surroundings were so quiet that only the sound of wind rustling the leaves could be heard. Lin Ruiqing remarked wistfully, \"The house is usually so lively. It feels strange to have it suddenly so quiet.\"","Jing Beicheng looked at Lin Ruiqing. \"If you're bored, I can call everyone back.\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled at Jing Beicheng's words, giving him a helpless look. \"The children all have their own things to do. Why would you call them back?\"","Jing Zeyou had called earlier to say he had to work overtime today. As for Jing Zeqian, he was unusually busy as well, saying he had meetings with artists that wouldn't end anytime soon.","Jing Zejun also had plans with a director today and wouldn't be home for dinner. Jing Yi was out gathering with friends.","The house was suddenly left with just the two of them.","Jing Beicheng didn't care about all that - he simply disliked seeing even a trace of melancholy on his wife's face.","Lin Ruiqing continued, \"Before Yi came, I suppose the house was often like this too.\"","Back then, before they had found Jing Zejun, Lin Ruiqing had nearly convinced herself that wherever he was, Jing Zejun must be living well.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian were frequently busy at the company, leaving just her and Jing Beicheng at home.","After finding Jing Zejun, they weren't very close at first, and the atmosphere at home wasn't very natural. Later, when Jing Yi came to the Jing family, there was hardly a day without noise and commotion in the house, unless several people were away.","Now she found herself unaccustomed to the quiet.","Lin Ruiqing sighed, \"I'm starting to feel a bit old now.\"","Jing Beicheng frowned, not wanting his wife to talk that way. \"How are you old?\"","Lin Ruiqing glared at him. \"Not just me - you're old too!\" Jing Beicheng opened his mouth, then stopped himself. Well, alright then - they could grow old together.","Seeing he didn't argue, Lin Ruiqing couldn't help but laugh. \"But it's okay. Even if I'm old, I still have you by my side...\"","Jing Beicheng squeezed Lin Ruiqing's hand tightly, about to say something.","\"Auntie! Uncle!\"","Just as they were getting sentimental, an energetic voice interrupted their wistful mood.","They both turned their heads towards the main gate. Jing Yi had returned.","After finishing dinner with Shen Xi, Jing Yi had headed straight home. Shen Xi had driven her back.","She had wanted to invite Shen Xi in to sit for a while, but as soon as Shen Xi heard Jing Beicheng was home, she immediately refused.","This was a big shot even her father couldn't approach - she didn't dare act carelessly in front of Jing Beicheng.","Jing Yi found it amusing. She was just inviting her in to sit, not asking her to misbehave.","Shen Xi said very seriously, \"If I go in, I'll get nervous as soon as I see your uncle. When I'm nervous, I'll say the wrong things. Saying the wrong things would be misbehaving.\"","Jing Yi had no choice but to give up, waving goodbye.","As she walked through the gate, she saw the warm and beautiful scene - a couple strolling hand in hand in the sunset.","Jing Yi couldn't help but call out loudly to greet them.","It was only when she got closer that she realized she might have disturbed them.","[Oh no! Did I interrupt Uncle and Auntie?]","Lin Ruiqing was actually very happy Jing Yi had returned. She let go of Jing Beicheng's hand and took a few steps towards Jing Yi.","\"Why didn't you stay out longer with your friends? Have you eaten?\"","Jing Yi supported her, smiling sweetly. \"I ate! Have you and Uncle had dinner?\"","\"We've eaten too, but Aunt Wang should still have some tonic soup simmering. Would you like some?\"","\"Yes, yes!\"","The two of them walked back into the house arm in arm, leaving Jing Beicheng standing alone in the courtyard as the sun set.","How realistic - once the child comes home, they don't need him anymore. Jing Beicheng could only sigh and make his own way back into the house.","Jing Yi and Lin Ruiqing were already seated in the dining room. Two steaming bowls were placed in front of them, containing the three-delicacy bird's nest soup Aunt Wang had specially prepared for Lin Ruiqing.","Jing Yi picked up a spoon and took a sip, her eyes lighting up. \"Auntie, this is delicious!\"","Lin Ruiqing's lips curved up, telling her to drink more.","Jing Beicheng walked in and quietly sat down next to Lin Ruiqing. Aunt Wang brought out another bowl and placed it in front of him.","\"Didn't you drive out today?\"","Lin Ruiqing was worried that because of what Jing Beicheng had said last time, Jing Yi was forcing herself to comply.","Jing Yi looked up, her face beaming with an obedient smile. \"As it happened, Second Brother was going out too, so I just caught a ride with him.\"","\"Then how did you get back?\"","Jing Yi spooned another sip, then replied, \"Xi drove me back.\"","After the banquet last time, Lin Ruiqing had learned that Jing Yi had a very good friend in Jiangbei named Shen Xi.","She had some impression of that round-faced girl. \"Why didn't you invite your friend in to sit for a while?\"","Jing Yi remembered Shen Xi's on-guard expression and laughed. \"She was a bit nervous, so she didn't come in.\"","[Actually, she was afraid of seeing Uncle.]","Jing Beicheng, who had been quietly sipping his tonic, paused. He realized he had never interacted with any of Jing Yi's friends and felt a bit wronged.","Lin Ruiqing smiled knowingly, well aware of her husband's image in others' eyes.","\"Next time, tell her not to be nervous. Just think of us as ordinary parents.\"","Jing Yi nodded. \"That's what I told her too.\"","[Maybe Uncle's reputation has spread too far.]","Lin Ruiqing agreed with this. Compared to being someone's father, Jing Beicheng's identity as the Chairman of Hengjing Group was more deeply ingrained in people's minds, generally causing some trepidation.","\"Jun and the others aren't back yet?\" Jing Yi looked around, not seeing the other three, and asked curiously.","Lin Ruiqing explained, \"Zeyou is working overtime today.\"","[Big Brother is still working overtime, as expected.]","\"Zeqian also has meetings today. He said he's discussing future promotions with some artists.\"","[What artist requires Young Master Jing to arrange things personally? Could it be that Jiang Miaomiao?]","\"Zejun is out having dinner with a director and some investors.\"","Dinner with investors?! Something seemed to flash through Jing Yi's mind. Her eyes suddenly widened, her expression completely losing its previous relaxed state.","\"Dinner?! Auntie, which investor is Jun having dinner with?\"","Lin Ruiqing didn't understand why Jing Yi was so nervous all of a sudden. She hesitantly said, \"It's for that drama she filmed before, 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms'.\"","\"Auntie, which restaurant are they eating at?\"","Lin Ruiqing hesitated a bit. \"I think it's at Yuelai.\"","Jing Yi's mind exploded. She seemed to have realized something and abruptly stood up, rushing towards the door.","\"Auntie, Uncle, I need to go out for a bit. I'll be right back!\""]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: The Incident Involving Jingze Jun","paragraphs":["After rushing out of the villa, Jing Yi quickly drove 'Black Night' out of the garage.","Fortunately, the keys she was supposed to return to Uncle Li last time had been forgotten, so the car keys were still with her.","The roar of 'Black Night' sounded again, but it was different from usual. This was also the first time Uncle Li had seen Jing Yi drive this sports car at such speed, and he was a bit worried.","Uncle Li hesitated for a moment, but still walked into the villa.","Inside the villa, Jing Beicheng was comforting Lin Ruiqing, \"Nothing's wrong, Xiao Yi probably just remembered something she hadn't finished and rushed out to do it.\"","The worry on Lin Ruiqing's face didn't fade.","\"But Yi Yi looked very flustered, and it's so late at night. What could be so urgent? Couldn't it wait until tomorrow?\"","\"She's in her twenties now, she can take care of herself. If there really was something wrong, she would ask Zeyou and the others for help.\"","Lin Ruiqing sighed, trying to comfort herself. She no longer had the appetite for the tonic and was about to ask Aunt Wang to take it away when Uncle Li walked in quickly.","\"Sir, Madam, Miss Yi has driven out.\"","Jing Beicheng gave Lin Ruiqing a look, signaling her not to worry too much, before turning to answer Uncle Li, \"She had an urgent matter to attend to, it's fine.\"","Jing Beicheng thought Jing Yi had just driven out to handle something, but Uncle Li's expression told him it wasn't that simple.","He asked again, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Miss was driving very fast, I'm worried...\"","This wasn't the first time Uncle Li had seen Jing Yi drive out, and if it was her usual driving style, he wouldn't have come to report to Jing Beicheng.","But that acceleration was impossible to ignore, especially since it was 'Black Night'.","Lin Ruiqing looked even more worried. She had seen the urgency in Jing Yi's eyes earlier.","How could she not be concerned about her driving out so fast this late at night?","Lin Ruiqing looked at Jing Beicheng, placing her hand on his forearm, her face full of worry, \"Why don't we contact Xiao You and ask him to check on Yi Yi? He might be able to help her if something's wrong.\"","Jing Beicheng thought for a moment, then nodded, gently patting Lin Ruiqing's hand to reassure her.","In the CEO's office of Hengjing Group, Jing Zeyou was handling the work on his desk, mostly documents that had piled up recently.","During the period when Lin Ruiqing was ill, Jing Zeyou had visited the hospital almost every day to check on her condition and discuss her daily treatment with the doctors.","Some work had gradually accumulated as a result.","Just as he was about to finish the work at hand, Jing Zeyou raised his head to ease the discomfort in his neck.","He really was a 'workaholic' as Jing Yi often worried. Thinking of Jing Yi's concern, Jing Zeyou couldn't help but smile.","The phone on his desk rang.","Jing Zeyou glanced at the caller ID. His father was calling?","Jing Zeyou was surprised. At this time, Jing Beicheng should be taking a walk with Lin Ruiqing.","He answered the call, \"Dad?\"","On the other end, Jing Beicheng told Jing Zeyou what had happened after Jing Yi came back.","She drove out in 'Black Night'?","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly, \"Dad, it's okay. Yi Yi knows how to drive.\"","Then the voice on the other end said something else, and worry appeared in Jing Zeyou's eyes.","\"Alright, I understand. I'll contact her right away.\"","Jing Zeyou hung up the phone, his brows slightly furrowed.","Even when Jing Yi drove out, she was always very careful about safety. What could have made her so flustered?","As night fell, the city of North river was illuminated by dazzling lights, making it seem dreamlike.","A sharp beam of headlights cut through the night sky, illuminating the road ahead. The eye-catching black sports car sped through the city streets at a breathtaking speed.","Many pedestrians by the roadside noticed this black sports car flying down the road.","'It's the one she filmed in Sea Crabapple Still Blooms.'","'I think it's at Yuelai.'","Lin Ruiqing's voice kept echoing in Jing Yi's mind as she raced towards Yuelai Hotel.","Since leaving the Jing family home, Jing Yi had kept her foot on the accelerator. Her expression was unusually anxious, and her mood was very tense.","The phone rang.","\"Hello, Big Brother!\" It was Jing Zeyou calling.","\"Yi Yi, what's wrong? Dad and Mom said you rushed out in 'Black Night'.\"","The voice on the other end of the phone was filled with concern.","Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel tightly, her gaze fixed firmly on the road ahead, her foot still not easing off the accelerator even slightly.","Because she had finally remembered what that very important thing was.","'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms! Sea Crabapple Still Blooms!' The name of this drama had been mentioned so often, how could she have forgotten such an important matter!","Jing Yi's eyes reflected her self-reproach. She should have remembered this much earlier!","Because of this drama, what Jing Zejun received was not praise from the audience, but harassment from investors and attacks from public opinion!","In the original book, Jing Zejun had participated in the TV series Sea Crabapple Still Blooms. This was a script that Jing Zejun really liked, and she had been very dedicated to filming this drama.","She thought she was lucky - the director was conscientious, and the investor was generous, never giving them trouble about the budget.","But what Jing Zejun didn't know was that from the very beginning, the investor of this drama wasn't interested in the show itself. His ultimate goal was Jing Zejun, the beautiful rising star.","So, at a party after the filming wrapped up, he slipped something into Jing Zejun's drink.","The director of the drama naturally knew about this, but for the sake of the sponsorship, he hadn't warned Jing Zejun.","He even found an excuse to take the manager out, leaving Jing Zejun alone to face the investor, becoming his accomplice.","Although the investor didn't succeed in the end - he was about to do something when Wen Qingyan, who happened to be in the hotel, discovered the situation and rescued Jing Zejun.","But for a long time afterward, Jing Zejun faced considerable criticism and attacks on the internet. It was Jing Zeyou who eventually suppressed the whole incident.","\"Big Brother! Go to Yuelai Hotel right now!\" Jing Yi's voice was very different from usual, extremely urgent.","Jing Yi made a turn and continued, \"Jun Jun is having dinner with the investor today, but I've been unable to reach her on the phone. I suspect she's in danger. I'm on my way there now!\"","Jun Jun? Jing Zeyou was a bit confused, but Jing Yi's tone was so anxious that she hung up without waiting for him to ask more questions.","Jing Zeyou got up, grabbed his coat, and tried to contact Jing Zejun.","No answer...","If the call could have gone through, Jing Yi wouldn't be rushing there like a madwoman now.","Jing Zeyou realized that something might really be wrong. He strode out of his office, \"Little Chen, find out immediately if Jing Zejun is at Yuelai Hotel, and which private room she's in!\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Intrusion","paragraphs":["Jing Zejun was scheduled to have dinner with investors today, as previously arranged by the director. She brought her agent along to the dinner.","\"Director Li, we had an agreement. I didn't skimp on the budget, so you can't deceive me about Jing Zejun's matter,\" said a man in his forties at the Yuelai Hotel. Sitting across from him was the director of \"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms.\"","The director's expression held a hint of flattery. Seeing the investor raise his glass, he quickly lifted his own and clinked it with the other's.","\"Rest assured, rest assured. However, shouldn't we discuss this with Zejun first? Perhaps she might also be...\"","The man across from him chuckled, and the director immediately fell silent.","\"Were you about to suggest she might be willing? Director Li, you've been in the entertainment industry for so long, can't you read people yet?\"","If he hadn't been so useless, unable to even arrange for someone to enter the hotel, would he have to start taking action at this point?","The investor was bold, but the director didn't have such courage. His eyes darted to the wine beside him – it had been spiked!","Seeing the director's cowardice, the investor took a sip of wine, contempt in his eyes. No wonder he hadn't won a single award in so many years.","If the lead actress of this film wasn't Jing Zejun, he wouldn't have wasted so much money on it. \"Just remember, all you need to do is lure the agent away. The rest doesn't concern you.\"","He swirled the wine in his glass, his cloudy eyes reflecting a determined intent.","\"Yes! Yes!\" The director wiped away cold sweat. The filming was complete, but every aspect of the subsequent promotion and distribution required money.","He felt sorry for Jing Zejun, but he had placed all his bets on this film. He was almost fifty and still hadn't achieved anything in this industry!","No matter what, \"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms\" couldn't be ruined by anyone!","\"General Xu, Director Li, sorry we're late,\" Jing Zejun said as she entered the private room with her agent.","\"You're finally here. Zejun, come sit here.\" The director quickly moved a chair, gesturing for Jing Zejun to sit next to the investor.","Jing Zejun nodded slightly, smiling as she sat down, looking confused to see only the two of them there.","\"Aren't Yi-ge and the others coming?\" Wasn't this supposed to be the wrap party for the crew?","The director laughed awkwardly, \"Oh, they all had other work, so they couldn't make it. It's just the four of us today.\"","Jing Zejun set aside her doubts and, seeing the investor raise his glass, quickly picked up her own.","\"It's fine. Even with just four of us, let's toast to the soaring success of our 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms'!\"","\"Thank you, General Xu.\"","Seeing Jing Zejun drink from her glass, a glint appeared in the investor's eyes, while the director grew increasingly uneasy.","At the dinner table, the investor chatted casually with Jing Zejun for a while, during which he gave the director a meaningful look.","The director suddenly clutched his stomach, as if in discomfort.","Jing Zejun looked at him with concern, \"Director, are you feeling unwell?\"","Still holding his stomach, he complained that he might have drunk too much too quickly.","Jing Zejun was worried, \"Should I take you back to rest?\"","But the director immediately refused, \"No need, no need. I'll just have Little Li accompany me to the restroom. You stay here and keep General Xu company for me.\"","The agent beside Jing Zejun hesitated. Leaving Jing Zejun alone in this room didn't seem right, especially with another man present.","But Director Li really did look unwell. \"Little Li, it's just the restroom next door.\"","Jing Zejun sighed inwardly and nodded to her agent.","As the two left the room, Jing Zejun felt awkward. She rummaged through her bag under the table, only to realize she had left her phone in the car.","She was about to say something when she suddenly felt dizzy and weak.","Realizing something was wrong, Jing Zejun tried to leave, but the investor was standing at the door, smiling at her.","Meanwhile, tires screeched against the road as Jing Yi arrived at the Yuelai Hotel.","She still couldn't reach Jing Zejun on the phone!","Jing Yi immediately got out of the car and ran towards the private room location Jing Zeyou had sent her.","'Third floor! Third floor!'","\"Miss? Miss!\" The receptionist watched helplessly as Jing Yi rushed past her into the hotel, frantically calling for security to chase after her.","But Jing Yi was fast. By the time security entered, she was already on the third floor, facing a long corridor.","Which room was the Purple Bamboo Court?!","The hotel was large, and Jing Yi looked extremely anxious, but she still checked each room from the stairway.","She saw two figures leaving a room and instinctively knew that was the place.","\"Little Li, why don't you accompany me to buy some pain medication? My stomach is really killing me!\" The man being supported looked hesitant.","\"Director Li, Zejun is still inside. She's a young woman, it's not appropriate for her to be alone with General Xu...\"","\"Ah! Little Li, General Xu isn't that kind of person!\"","He knew exactly what would happen if Jing Zejun was left inside, but this was the ultimate goal of this dinner. If he couldn't get the agent far away, he might burst into the room and interrupt General Xu's plans.","\"I know General Xu isn't that type, but if someone takes a photo, it could still cause misunderstandings.\"","The agent glanced back at the room. He had thought escorting the director to the restroom would be enough, but now it seemed the director wanted to leave the hotel...","Once they left the hotel, he would lose control over the situation.","\"This is a five-star hotel, very discreet. Besides, we're just going downstairs to buy medicine. It won't take long,\" the director said, growing frustrated as the agent refused to take the bait.","If the agent sensed something was wrong, or if any sound came from inside, how could he possibly control the situation?","As the director was still trying to convince Jing Zejun's agent, preparing to press his advantage, a girl appeared in front of him.","He looked annoyed. General Xu was pressuring him to cooperate, Jing Zejun's agent was being difficult, and now some random person had shown up.","He was about to question her when she spoke first, \"Are you the director of 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms'?\"","The director thought she might be paparazzi and looked flustered, trying to maintain composure as he scolded, \"So what if I am? Which media outlet are you from? This is a high-class hotel, outsiders aren't allowed. You should quickly...\"","Before he could finish, a heavy punch landed on his face. The director's body swayed, and he fell to the ground.","Dizzy, he touched his nose and panicked at the sight of blood on his hand.","The agent, unsure of what was happening, stepped forward to shield the director. \"Who are you?! How dare you hit someone like that!\"","Seeing Jing Yi's stance, he felt a bit intimidated.","As he hesitated, the sound of a breaking wine glass came from the room. Jing Yi's head snapped up, and she immediately kicked the door open and rushed in."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: The Rampaging Jingyi","paragraphs":["\"Miss Jing, I've finally managed to get some alone time with you.\"","The investor slowly approached Jing Zejun, who fearfully tried to back away.","But her body had no strength! Her head was spinning, and she felt like she would faint at any moment.","\"Brother Li! Brother Li!\" she tried to call out, but her voice was faint, filled with weakness and terror.","I can't faint! I can't pass out!","Jing Zejun bit her lip hard, trying to keep herself alert. Her lips turned pale, leaving deep marks inside her mouth. She could even taste blood.","The investor advanced step by step, a greedy, lecherous smile on his face. \"No use calling out. Your agent is probably outside the hotel with Director Li by now.\"","Jing Zejun could only watch helplessly, powerless to act.","His hand moved from her face down her neck. Jing Zejun shuddered, feeling ice-cold all over as an overwhelming sense of humiliation washed over her.","She spotted a wine glass nearby and used her last bit of strength to sweep it onto the floor, creating a sharp shattering sound.","This was her final hope...","Just as the investor was about to force himself on her, the room door was kicked open.","A glimmer of hope flickered in Jing Zejun's despairing eyes as she saw Jing Yi.","\"Get the fuck out of here!\"","The interrupted investor was furious, but seeing Jing Zejun lying on the couch, Jing Yi was even angrier.","Her eyes, usually filled with mirth, were now sharp and cold as ice.","\"You bastard!\" she snarled through gritted teeth, immediately charging at the investor.","Jing Yi's fist flew out, aimed at his face. Her powerful punch landed squarely on the investor's jaw.","Caught off guard, the investor was knocked to the ground. The sound of breaking glass and scraping echoed harshly through the room.","Jing Yi took off her coat and draped it over Jing Zejun.","The woman on the couch, her eyes red, finally let her tears fall freely now that a familiar face had arrived.","\"Yi Yi!\"","Jing Yi felt rage boiling inside her, but looking at Jing Zejun, she still managed to force a smile. \"Wait here for me.\"","The investor, knocked to the floor, wiped blood from the corner of his mouth. His face was dark, his gaze menacing.","He clearly had no idea who this woman was or where she'd come from.","\"Miss, I advise you not to meddle in affairs that don't concern you! Go back to wherever you came from!\"","\"Oh really? Well, this miss just loves to meddle!\"","Jing Yi flexed her wrists and charged again. The investor's face twisted with malice as he grabbed a wine bottle from the table, ready to smash it.","\"Yi Yi!\"","Jing Yi dodged to the side. The bottle smashed on the table as she delivered a high kick to her oncoming attacker.","Caught off guard, the investor was sent sprawling to the floor in an undignified heap.","Jing Yi gave him no chance to recover, instantly pouncing on him and pinning him down.","\"You'd better let me go! Do you have any idea who I am?\" the investor snarled through clenched teeth, still trying to threaten Jing Yi despite the pain.","Jing Yi's face remained expressionless as she clenched her fist again. Each punch landed with precision and force on the investor's face and body.","\"Li Yu! Are you fucking blind? Do you not want your funding anymore?!\"","The commotion in the room caught the agent's attention. He had originally planned to wake up the director, but hearing the noise, he rushed in.","The room had descended into chaos, though it was more of a one-sided beating. When he saw Jing Zejun, he finally understood what had happened!","No wonder the director had been acting so strangely, insisting on dragging him outside!","The agent wanted to check on Jing Zejun, but seeing Jing Yi in that state, he could only stand there dumbfounded.","The director was in a similar state. Even if he could fight, Jing Zejun's agent's 'dare to rush in and I'll beat you up' expression was enough to intimidate him.","Jing Zejun, worried that Jing Yi might seriously hurt the man, called out to her. \"Yi Yi...\"","Her voice finally made Jing Yi stop. Jing Yi was also getting tired from the beating. She looked at the investor, who was now in too much pain to speak.","Jing Yi grabbed him by the collar and threw him into the corner. A smile finally returned to her face.","But to the investor, it looked even more terrifying. No matter how beautiful Jing Yi was, it didn't change the fact that her fists were hard as steel!","\"You were asking if I knew who you were, right?\"","The investor fearfully shook his head, his eyes filled with terror.","Jing Yi's lips curled into a smirk as she pointed at Jing Zejun. \"I think you should look into who she is. Otherwise, you might not even know how you ended up dead.\"","The investor looked confused. He had investigated Jing Zejun and found that she was just a girl from an ordinary family. Her parents had passed away a few years ago, and she had been struggling alone in the entertainment industry.","Seeing his expression, Jing Yi knew he had no idea that Jing Zejun was the daughter of the Jing family.","Come to think of it, if he had known, he probably wouldn't have dared to make a move on her.","The more Jing Yi thought about it, the angrier she became. This investor was bad enough, but that director was no better!","\"What? You thought because she was from an ordinary family, you could do whatever you wanted with her?\"","The investor shook his head frantically, his eyes filled with fear. \"Miss, ma'am! It's my fault! I didn't recognize her importance. I've offended Miss Jing! I'll make amends! Whatever compensation is needed, I can arrange it!\"","Jing Yi laughed bitterly, about to say something more.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian had already arrived at the door, followed by a string of hotel staff.","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow. \"Compensation, huh? Those two will tell you what kind of compensation Jing Zejun needs.\"","\"Come in and close the door!\"","She was trying to maintain some consideration for Jing Zejun's celebrity status. Bringing so many people, were they afraid her name wouldn't make the headlines tomorrow?","Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou rushed in to see this scene. Before he could roll up his sleeves, Jing Yi's voice reminded the two that a crowd of people was still behind them.","Jing Zeqian quickly closed the door, shutting out everyone outside the private room, including the director and the agent.","Jing Yi walked to Jing Zejun's side, tightening the coat around her. \"Did he do anything to you?\"","Jing Zejun's eyes were red as she forced a small smile, her voice barely a whisper. \"No, he didn't have the chance to do anything. You arrived just in time.\"","Jing Yi's face was filled with sympathy as she gently embraced Jing Zejun, patting her back softly.","From behind came the sound of Jing Zejun's quiet sobs. \"Yi Yi, I was so scared.\"","Jing Zejun had truly felt desperate earlier. She thought her life was over. She didn't know why the director had disappeared, why her agent hadn't returned, leaving her alone here...","In her moment of despair, Jing Yi had arrived, suddenly giving Jing Zejun hope.","But seeing Jing Yi alone, she had worried that Jing Yi might not be able to overpower the investor. It wasn't until she saw Jing Yi's fighting skills that she felt safe enough to wait on the couch.","\"It's okay, it's okay. I'm here now.\"","Jing Yi softly comforted Jing Zejun, allowing her to release all the fear and emotion she had been holding back."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: Her surname is Jing, the scenery of the Jing family","paragraphs":["Outside the room, the hotel manager paced back and forth with a worried expression.","An employee watched him, eyes darting nervously. \"Manager, what should we do? The Jing family's daughter got into trouble at our hotel, this is...\"","The manager stopped and glared fiercely at the speaker. \"If I knew what to do, would I be anxiously pacing here?!\"","A few minutes earlier, Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian had entered the hotel from outside. The receptionist didn't recognize them, but the manager had been informed in advance about Jing Zeyou's arrival.","He had only heard from the owner to quickly escort them to the Purple Bamboo Court, saying the Jing family's daughter was in trouble in that private room.","Before he could rush to handle the situation, the two men had already arrived. He could only jog after them.","Nearby, a director with a panicked expression overheard their conversation and suddenly widened his eyes, grabbing the manager's arm tightly.","\"What did you say?! Who's the Jing family's daughter?!\"","The manager's face showed clear irritation. At this point, he couldn't be bothered with any guests.","\"Who else could it be?! Jing Zejun!\"","The director's face turned pale, still gripping the manager's arm. \"Which Jing family?! Which Jing family?!\"","The manager was thoroughly exasperated now. He forcefully pulled his arm free. \"How many Jing families are there in North River!\" With that, he ignored the director and frantically tried to figure out how to handle the aftermath.","The director stood frozen in place, his expression dazed. Beside him, his agent's eyes were wide with shock, clearly just learning this news as well.","While he was still processing Jing Zejun's identity, the director suddenly grabbed his agent's collar. \"Why didn't you tell me she was the Jing family's daughter?!\"","If he had known earlier, he wouldn't have given in to the investor's coercion, and he wouldn't have offended the Jing family. Now that the Jing family members were here, how could he explain? Should he admit to being an accomplice in this plan?!","The agent pushed him away, frowning slightly. \"Director Li, have you lost your mind? Are you saying it would be okay to treat someone like this if they weren't from the Jing family?\" Moreover, he had only just learned this information himself.","The agent glanced around at the people nearby and said no more. In this situation, the less said, the better. It wouldn't be good if someone with ill intentions spread this online.","Inside the private room, Jing Zeqian was furiously beating the investor. Jing Zeyou watched silently for a while before stopping his brother.","\"If you keep hitting him, it'll be manslaughter.\"","\"This bastard deserves to die right here, and it still wouldn't be enough!\"","It wasn't until Jing Yi's voice came through that they stopped. \"Let's wrap this up quickly. We need to take Junjun to the hospital. That bastard might have drugged her.\"","Jing Yi had noticed earlier that Jing Zejun's condition didn't seem right. Her voice was very soft, and she had no strength.","In the corner, the investor was barely breathing. Jing Zeqian gave him one last fierce punch before stopping.","He walked over to Jing Yi, looking worriedly at Jing Zejun's tear-stained face, his eyes full of concern.","Jing Zeyou crouched down, his gaze piercing with coldness.","The man in the corner could still breathe. \"Xu Qingyun, 45 years old, from North River, general manager of Xie Fan Capital, married with one son, investor in 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms', assets include... Am I correct?\"","The investor now found even breathing painful. \"Who... who are you people?\"","\"Perhaps you know that Jing Zejun's surname is Jing?\" When the investor didn't react, still consumed by pain, Jing Zeyou added a few more words, \"The Jing of the Jing family.\"","The investor froze as if under a spell, a chill running through him.","The Jing of the Jing family?! Which Jing family?!","Jing Zeyou stood up, his face still cold and detached. \"I'll call an ambulance for you, but you'll also be receiving a summons.\" It was astounding that such a small company, corrupted to this extent by his greed, could still operate.","Ignoring the investor's reaction, Jing Zeyou opened the door.","\"Mr. Jing!\" The anxiously waiting manager immediately rushed over.","\"Get everyone out. I don't want to see a single piece of news about this incident tomorrow.\"","The manager immediately tensed up. \"Rest assured, I will warn all hotel staff.\" He left with his team.","Outside the door, only the director and the agent remained.","The agent still needed to check on Jing Zejun before making any decisions.","Although Jing Zeyou was very dissatisfied, he didn't know how this entertainment company was managed. In his view, the agent was extremely incompetent.","He hadn't investigated the attendees, location, and environment before the artist attended the dinner, nor had he identified potential threats around the artist. He didn't even know that his artist had come into contact with something she shouldn't have.","Jing Zeyou's gaze turned cold as he looked at the director leaning against the wall, his face tense. \"You're the director of 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms'?\"","This was the second time today he had heard this title. The first time he heard it, he had been punched.","The director was now somewhat triggered by this title.","\"Mr. Jing, I didn't know Zejun was the Jing family's daughter. It was all Mr. Xu's doing! He said if I didn't do as he said, he'd withdraw the funding. 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms' is also Zejun's passion project, she certainly wouldn't want the film to fall through...\"","The director had walked up to Mr. Jing, looking extremely flustered and almost incoherent.","He might not have known the Jing family's status, but he certainly knew the position of the Jing family's second young master's Startrack Entertainment in the entertainment industry. It was said that his older brother's status was even higher.","He never would have imagined that Jing Zejun, with such a background, wouldn't use it and instead chose to follow a path of hard work!","The director silently blamed Jing Zejun in his heart but didn't dare to voice it.","\"Junjun indeed put a lot of heart and soul into this film. I'm afraid Mr. Xu's money won't be needed anymore.\"","Jing Zeyou recalled what the doctor had said and how happily Jing Zejun had talked about this film. His gaze towards the director grew colder.","But the director didn't notice Jing Zeyou's thoughts. He thought the situation might have taken a turn for the better. Before a smile could form on his face, Jing Zeyou's next words completely shattered his hope.","\"So Startrack will take over the entire film. You don't need to worry about it anymore. What I mean is, you don't need to worry about anything in the future.\"","The director stood there, stunned, his eyes filled with despair.","\"Are we going?\"","Jing Zeqian had already put Jing Zejun on his back and was standing at the door. Jing Yi was beside them, adjusting the clothes to cover Jing Zejun better.","Jing Zeyou nodded and led the group downstairs.","The agent looked at the director who had collapsed on the ground, muttering to himself, and sighed. He should probably start thinking about how to explain this to the boss.","\"You take Junjun to the hospital. I'll drive and follow you.\"","Jing Yi suddenly remembered that 'Black Night' was still parked at the hotel entrance. She thought about driving it over together to save coming back for it later.","Jing Yi covered Jing Zejun with her clothes and was about to get out of the car when Jing Zejun grabbed her.","Jing Zejun, with reddened eyes, just looked at her like that.","[...Alright, let's leave 'Black Night' aside for now!]","Jing Yi sat back down next to Jing Zejun, letting her lean against herself."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: The Warm Inkstone","paragraphs":["Yuelai Hotel, next to Purple Bamboo Court.","Wen Qingyan sat on the sofa as his assistant reported the recent events to him.","\"Brother Wen, we've figured it out. It seems Sister Zejun was tricked here by the director and investor of 'Sea Crabapple Still Blooms', but they didn't succeed. Thankfully, Sister Zejun's family arrived in time.\"","The assistant had been working with Wen Qingyan for a few years now and was quite familiar with Jing Zejun from their interactions during the \"Sovereign\" project.","Wen Qingyan had coincidentally booked a private room at the hotel for a gathering with friends. Just after seeing them off, he heard a commotion next door, with voices growing louder.","Wen Qingyan sent his assistant to check on the situation, never expecting it to involve Jing Zejun...","Upon hearing that Jing Zejun was next door, Wen Qingyan immediately stood up, ready to rush over. His assistant stopped him, assuring him that the situation had been resolved.","It was due to Wen Qingyan's concern that the assistant went to gather more details.","Tricked into having dinner? Worry flashed in Wen Qingyan's eyes, wondering what Jing Zejun had gone through.","He remembered that the director of \"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms\" was called Li Yu. Wen Qingyan furrowed his brow and looked up at his assistant, asking, \"Was it Li Yu?\"","The assistant nodded quickly, mentioning that he had seen the man earlier, who was probably still sprawled on the ground, seemingly having suffered a great shock.","Wen Qingyan pressed his lips together, deep in thought, recalling the director of that drama with a cold look in his eyes.","\"Brother Wen, is Sister Zejun Mr. Jing's sister?\" The assistant's voice interrupted his thoughts.","Wen Qingyan snapped back to reality, a hint of surprise in his eyes. He had assumed this news would have spread throughout Startrack by now, yet his assistant was unaware.","Of course, the assistant didn't know. Wen Qingyan had been busy with film-related matters recently, and as his assistant, he hadn't had the chance to return to Startrack, let alone hear about this news.","When he had seen Jing Zeqian carrying someone on his back earlier, he was so shocked he froze on the spot, thinking he must have seen wrong.","\"If Miss Jing is Mr. Jing's sister, why did she still...\"","Why did she still go to auditions herself? Why didn't she speak up when her script was stolen? Why didn't she reveal her identity at all?","These weren't the first time Wen Qingyan had heard such questions. He thought, if she had done those things, she wouldn't be Jing Zejun.","A slight smile tugged at Wen Qingyan's lips. Regardless of whose daughter she was, to him, she would always just be Jing Zejun.","\"But Brother Wen, I saw another girl inside. She seems to be Sister Zejun's sister. I heard she was the one who beat up the investor, and quite severely too. I couldn't believe it; that girl looks so cute.\"","A girl? Was it the one called Jing Yi? The Jing Yi who had confronted Jiang Miaomiao and emerged unscathed?","Wen Qingyan had heard of Jing Yi's name, of course from the mouths of Startrack staff.","Jing Yi's story had been circulating in the company for almost a month now, given that she was not only Jing Zejun's acknowledged sister but had also managed to leave unharmed after provoking Jiang Miaomiao.","However, these weren't the issues Wen Qingyan was concerned about. \"Go and find out about Zejun's condition, see if she's alright.\"","\"Yes, Brother Wen!\"","On the other side of the city, Jing Zejun and the others had arrived at a private hospital.","The doctor, holding the report, said to Jing Zeyou and the others, \"There are still some traces of drugs in Miss Jing's system, but they're not harmful to her body. She might feel weak, but there's nothing serious to worry about.\"","Jing Beicheng looked at the sleeping Jing Zejun on the hospital bed with a serious expression. \"Then why hasn't she woken up yet?\"","\"The drug components haven't been fully eliminated, but don't worry, she should wake up soon.\"","Not to mention it, but the Jing family's hospital visits had been quite frequent lately. Mrs. Jing had just been discharged not long ago, and now Jing Zeyou's sister was admitted.","Jing Zeyou was also helpless but wasn't in the mood to chat idly with his friend.","On the hospital bed, Jing Zejun slept peacefully. She had fallen asleep on the way to the hospital, unable to stay awake.","Lin Ruiqing stood by the bedside, watching Jing Zejun intently with worry in her eyes.","Jing Beicheng also stood nearby, silently keeping them company.","Last night, when Jing Beicheng saw that none of the four children had returned home, he sensed something might be wrong. He called everyone but no one answered, and he was about to go to the company to investigate.","But soon after, he received a call from Jing Zeyou saying they were all at the hospital.","Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing rushed over overnight, and seeing Jing Zejun lying on the hospital bed nearly caused Lin Ruiqing to faint.","By now, the sky was starting to turn a hazy gray with the approaching dawn.","Jing Yi, unable to stay awake any longer, had fallen asleep on the sofa with a suit jacket draped over her.","Jing Zeqian, still sporting a black eye, sat beside Jing Yi, carefully applying medicine to her hand.","He had noticed last night that the back of her hand was red and swollen, not knowing how much force she had used. No wonder when he stepped in, that person had no strength left to struggle.","He hadn't expected this little girl to have an ace up her sleeve, not knowing she knew some scattered fighting techniques.","Seemingly uncomfortable in her sleep, Jing Yi moved slightly. Jing Zeqian quickly put away the medicine and pretended to be asleep.","Sensing no more movement beside him, he slowly opened his eyes.","Oh, she had just turned over. What a scare!","Jing Zeqian sighed in relief and leaned in again to gently apply medicine to her hand.","At this moment, the person on the hospital bed's eyelashes fluttered slightly, seeming to be on the verge of waking up.","Jing Zejun's eyes opened slightly, seeing Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng's worried expressions, her eyes reddening.","\"Mom, Dad.\"","\"Junjun, you're awake! How do you feel? Are you still uncomfortable?\"","Jing Zejun shook her head lightly, forcing a smile. \"I'm not uncomfortable anymore.\"","She looked around, and Jing Zeyou approached, with Jing Zeqian also standing up.","Not seeing Jing Yi, she looked confused. \"Where's Yiyi?\"","Lin Ruiqing gestured towards the sofa, speaking softly, \"She's asleep. She stayed up all night watching over you, only falling asleep at dawn.\"","Jing Zejun turned her head to look at Jing Yi lying on the sofa, the corners of her mouth turning up slightly.","\"Big brother, I'm sorry for causing you all trouble.\"","Jing Zeyou frowned, disliking his sister's formality. \"What are you saying? You're my sister, of course it's my responsibility to protect you. We're family.\"","Jing Zejun gave a weak smile.","\"I've handed your drama to Startrack. That director won't be appearing in the entertainment industry anymore.\"","Jing Zejun nodded slightly, a hint of sadness in her eyes. \"Was it for the investment?\"","Jing Zeyou hesitated for a moment before nodding.","As expected, the director really cared about this drama, cared enough to betray her without hesitation.","\"Junjun, don't think about these things now. Just rest more.\"","Lin Ruiqing interrupted the conversation, not wanting Jing Zejun to dwell on it further."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Some Simple Self-Defense Moves","paragraphs":["Jing Yi cupped her chin in her hands, staring blankly at the agitated Jing Zeqian who was alone.","The other people in the hospital room were all calm.","The cause of the situation could be traced back to the morning. After spending a day in the hospital, Jing Zejun had mostly recovered, and the doctor said she could be discharged.","Seeing that Jing Zejun had more or less recovered, Jing Zeyou brought up the matter of her agent.","Jing Zeyou's opinion was to change to a new agent, but Jing Zeqian didn't quite agree. He thought they should switch to a completely different company.","When they first found Jing Zejun, Jing Zeqian had already prepared a contract, intending to sign her to his own company.","Jing Zeqian's slightly furrowed brow revealed a hint of irritation. \"Jun Jun, I still don't understand. I'm in the entertainment industry myself. What's the difference between you being in my company and someone else's?\"","Every time this topic came up, Jing Zejun would change the subject, and this time was no exception.","But this time, it angered Jing Zeqian. If it was just a matter of competing for scripts, it would be fine, but this time such a serious incident had occurred. It was enough to show that both the agent and the company were incompetent.","Was his Startrack not better than those lousy companies?","Jing Yi yawned, which was particularly noticeable in the quiet hospital room.","Seeing that everyone's attention was now focused on her, Jing Yi laughed dryly, trying to minimize her presence.","[Was my yawn really that loud?]","Jing Zeqian glared at Jing Yi before continuing to question Jing Zejun, \"Jun Jun, are you worried that Startrack doesn't have resources? Or that it can't provide you with a better platform?\"","Seeing that Jing Zeqian had misunderstood to this extent, Jing Zejun became a bit flustered and tried to explain, \"Second brother, that's not what I meant...\"","\"Then tell your second brother, what exactly are you thinking?\"","[Probably that once she enters Startrack Entertainment, she'll be known as Jing Zeqian's sister, the CEO of Startrack, and not as Jing Zejun anymore.]","Jing Zeqian was stunned, at a loss for words for a moment.","Beside him, Jing Zeyou's expression was complex. He hadn't expressed any opinion on this matter, but in his heart, he had also hoped to bring Jing Zejun into Startrack.","However, it now seemed that he might not understand Jing Zejun as well as Jing Yi did...","Lin Ruiqing sighed, sitting to the side without speaking.","The two brothers were both trying to give things to Jing Zejun, but they had never considered what she actually wanted.","Hearing Jing Yi's words, Jing Zejun bit her lip lightly, trying to suppress the bitter emotions in her heart.","Jing Yi hadn't noticed that the room had fallen silent again. Looking at the somewhat helpless Jing Zejun, she sighed inwardly.","[The achievements she's worked so hard for would immediately become 'Oh, it's because she's Jing Zeqian's sister.' How could she be content with that?]","Jing Zejun sniffled and forced a smile, looking towards Jing Zeqian.","\"Second brother, I'm not worried that Startrack doesn't have resources or a platform. It can't be worse than when I first entered the entertainment industry, especially since Startrack is such a big platform.\"","Jing Zeqian lowered his head in silence, looking somewhat dejected.","\"At first, it was to earn money for my adoptive parents' surgery. I didn't come from a professional background, nor did I have any big companies backing me. I entered the entertainment industry based solely on my looks.\"","Lin Ruiqing remembered Jing Zejun's life back then and felt a pang of sympathy. Jing Beicheng hugged her, silently comforting her.","\"But later, they passed away. I no longer needed to earn money for their surgery, but I still stayed in the entertainment industry.\"","Extras, supporting roles, nobodies - Jing Zejun had played them all. It wasn't until she got a role as the second female lead that she felt it had all been worth it.","To become a good actress, she had done a lot, but there was also a lot she hadn't done.","Just as Jing Yi had said, once she entered Startrack, she would no longer have the name Jing Zejun.","\"Startrack can give me a lot - good scripts, good resources, and good production teams.\"","Jing Zejun knew that with Jing Zeqian's care and love for her, these things would be placed before her immediately. She wouldn't have to go through the hardship of auditioning or competing for roles and scripts.","Some people who knew her identity would even question why, with such a background, she wouldn't use it, and instead put on an act of working hard.","Jing Zeqian opened his mouth, but hesitated to speak.","Jing Zejun smiled, \"But second brother, after so many years, it seems like all I know how to do is act. I still want to try and see how far I can go...\"","Jing Zejun's words almost made Jing Yi want to applaud, but seeing Jing Zeqian's expression, she lowered her raised hand.","It was probably better not to provoke him.","Jing Yi wanted to stay out of it, but Jing Zeqian didn't give her the chance. He deliberately sat down next to her, his face taut, and asked, \"What's your opinion?\"","\"Huh?\" Jing Yi pointed at herself in confusion. \"My opinion?\"","[Wait, even the aunts and uncles haven't said anything, what opinion can I give?]","Seeing that everyone in the hospital room was looking at her, Jing Yi knew she couldn't escape.","\"Well, I think it's not conflicting. Second brother, you can protect her, and even if Jun Jun is in another company, it doesn't prevent you from protecting her. As for her career, Jun Jun will handle it herself.\"","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms, looking at Jing Zejun whose eyes were full of expectation. He sighed, \"Alright! I won't force you to come to Startrack anymore.\"","The people in the hospital room had smiles in their eyes, and the atmosphere finally became less tense.","\"But you must change your agent! That agent is both stupid and has poor timing. How could I possibly feel at ease leaving Jing Zejun with him again?\"","Jing Zejun hesitated. Actually, Brother Li had been quite good to her. Although he was a bit weak-willed, he still took good care of her.","However, since Jing Zeqian had compromised, she should also take a step back. Moreover, the higher-ups in the company probably knew her identity by now.","The matter finally had a conclusion, and Jing Yi's expression brightened a bit.","Seeing her smile, Jing Zejun's lips also curved upwards involuntarily. \"By the way, Yi Yi, how's your hand?\"","Jing Yi was taken aback for a moment. She had almost forgotten about it, mainly because it didn't seem to hurt anymore.","Lin Ruiqing looked at her hand. \"Xiao Qian applied medicine to it last night. It looks a bit better. Apply it a few more times over the next few days.\"","Jing Zeqian sat to the side with a straight face, wearing an expression of 'it's none of my business'.","[He would be that kind? He probably poisoned the medicine, right?]","Jing Zeqian smiled through gritted teeth, looking like a villain from a historical drama. \"You think I was kind enough to apply medicine for you? I poisoned it!\"","Jing Yi's eyes widened. \"I knew you poisoned it!\"","\"Stop teasing her,\" Lin Ruiqing said with a smile, patting Jing Zeqian's arm. \"He applied the medicine for you last night, afraid of waking you up.\"","Jing Yi glanced at the proud-looking man beside her, a hint of a smile flashing in her eyes.","\"By the way, Yi Yi, you know Sanda?\" Lin Ruiqing asked curiously.","Jing Yi's smile became a bit stiff. \"I just learned a few simple moves for self-defense.\"","Jing Zejun remembered the scene from earlier. Jing Yi's movements didn't seem like she had just learned a few simple moves.","The brothers Jing Zeyou also didn't quite believe it, but tacitly agreed not to expose Jing Yi.","Lin Ruiqing smiled gently. \"I think it's quite good. Girls should learn these things too. It would be best if Jun Jun learned some as well. It's good for self-defense and fitness.\"","Jing Yi relaxed a little, looking up at Lin Ruiqing with a bright smile."]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Prank","paragraphs":["\"I'll sleep with Yi Yi tonight. Just send it to her room.\"","In the dining room, the Jing family was gathered for dinner.","Lin Ruiqing had asked Aunt Wang to prepare some health tonics, saying she'd send them to her room in the evening. That's when she heard Jing Zejun make this surprising statement.","Since Jing Zejun had been discharged from the hospital today, Aunt Wang had prepared many delicious dishes. Jing Yi was engrossed in savoring each dish when she heard Jing Zejun's bombshell announcement.","The spare rib on her chopsticks fell back into her bowl as Jing Yi's eyes filled with confusion.","[Huh? When did this happen? How come I don't know about it?]","A smile rippled across Jing Zejun's eyes as he picked up a piece of braised beef and placed it in her bowl. He had just decided this, suddenly feeling that being with Jing Yi gave him a sense of security.","Jing Yi looked at the beef in her bowl, hesitated for a moment, then picked it up and ate it in one bite.","[This must be a bribe... and it's delicious! So tender and flavorful!]","\"I have a question,\" Jing Yi raised her hand. Everyone looked at her, somewhat puzzled. Jing Zejun asked, \"What is it?\"","\"Will there be a portion of the health tonic for me tonight?\"","\"Eat, eat, eat. All you think about is food! You'll get fat!\" Jing Zeqian teased.","Jing Yi glared at Jing Zeqian, attempting to deflect this 'malicious' curse back at him.","Lin Ruiqing's lips curved into a smile. \"Of course, how could we not have a portion for you?\"","\"Then there's no problem. Good thing my bed is big enough.\"","After dinner, Jing Yi felt a bit stuffed. She was now pacing back and forth in the living room with Jing Zejun, taking a walk to aid digestion.","[If only I'd known, I wouldn't have eaten so much... I'm so full...]","Jing Zeyou had returned to his study, while Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing had also retired to their room to rest. Only Jing Zeqian remained in the living room, along with Jing Yi and Jing Zejun who were still walking around.","Sitting on the sofa, Jing Zeqian spoke up, \"Do you want to watch a movie?\"","Jing Zejun was puzzled. Why suddenly suggest watching a movie? Besides, there was a room downstairs that served as a private cinema. \"Why not go watch in the cinema downstairs?\"","\"Too lazy to go down. I'll just watch a bit before heading to bed.\"","Jing Zeqian quickly selected a movie, his fingers moving so fast that Jing Yi couldn't even catch the title.","She felt something was odd, but since there was nothing else to do, she sat down on the sofa, cuddling up with Jing Zejun to watch the movie.","[Oh, it's a foreign art film? I didn't expect this to be the kind of movie Young Master Jing likes.]","Jing Zeyou seemed to pay them no attention, but he was actually keeping an eye on their reactions from the corner of his eye.","As the movie started, seeing that the two weren't paying attention to him, he quietly moved to the edge of the sofa.","Jing Yi didn't notice. She was immersed in the movie, as was Jing Zejun beside her.","On the screen, a woman was walking along a small path.","The opening narration introduced the story's background. This was a newlywed bride returning from her maiden home, heading towards a rural town where she had married into.","\"Jun Jun, have you seen this movie before?\" Jing Yi asked.","Jing Zejun shook his head, noticing that the movie's filter seemed a bit dark.","In the movie, the woman had been walking on a small path for a long time. Jing Yi became curious, \"Is her husband's home that far away? Or is this just building up to something?\"","\"I don't know. Maybe art films just have longer shots like this,\" Jing Zejun replied, not very confidently.","By this time, Jing Zeqian was standing against the wall, his eyes full of mischief, as if planning something.","In the movie, the woman finally stopped, seemingly having reached her destination.","Jing Yi watched intently, wanting to see what the actor playing the husband looked like.","But the husband didn't appear. Instead, the woman from the beginning quickly turned around.","It was a face with blank features!","Jing Yi's mouth gaped open, not even having time to feel scared.","Suddenly, the living room lights went out, plunging the entire room into darkness!","That featureless face became even clearer!","\"Ahhhhh!!!\"","The scream from the living room was so loud that Jing Zeyou heard it in his study and hurried downstairs.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng also heard the noise and rushed out to see what was happening. \"What's going on?\"","As the three came downstairs, they saw Jing Yi chasing after Jing Zeqian in the living room, shouting threats, while Jing Zeqian ran ahead, laughing hysterically.","\"Hahaha, you really got scared! Jing Yi Yi, I can't believe I got you this time!\"","Jing Yi was furious. \"Jing Zeqian! I'm going to 'kill' you today!\"","It was clear that Jing Zeqian had done something to anger Jing Yi again.","The two ran several laps around the living room.","Jing Zejun finally managed to calm Jing Yi down. Although he had been startled too, his reaction wasn't as strong as Jing Yi's.","Jing Zeqian leaned against the living room wall, still clutching his stomach and laughing uncontrollably.","\"Hahahahaha!\"","The three newcomers learned what had happened from Jing Zejun.","Jing Zeyou's lips twitched slightly. His brother really kept pushing the boundaries of immaturity. Finding it too ridiculous, he returned to his study.","Lin Ruiqing walked over to Jing Zeqian and gave him a few hard slaps on the back, her tone full of disdain. \"Still laughing! How old are you? Playing such childish pranks, aren't you too immature?\"","Jing Zeqian wiped away his tears of laughter, noticing Jing Yi glaring at him angrily, but he still couldn't help smiling.","He had been planning this since he got home, and couldn't believe he actually got the chance. He hadn't expected her to be so unguarded and unfamiliar with the movie, completely immersed in the scene.","Indeed, it was a simple, crude horror movie. Jing Zeqian had even worried that the scenes might be too bloody, so he had specifically chosen one that wasn't too terrifying.","Thinking about it, Jing Zeqian couldn't help but laugh again. To think that Jing Yi, who usually feared nothing, could be scared by a horror movie.","Lin Ruiqing was at a loss with him. Let him laugh, she thought. He'll learn his lesson when he really gets beaten up one day.","After comforting Jing Yi for a while and seeing that she was alright, Lin Ruiqing went upstairs with Jing Beicheng.","Jing Yi glared at Jing Zeqian one more time. He was still savoring the taste of his victory.","\"Jun Jun, let's go. We're not talking to this immature fool!\" She pulled Jing Zejun and turned to go upstairs, heading back to their room.","Immature? The prank might not be mature, but it was effective.","However, he dared not say this in front of Jing Yi now. If she really got angry and hit him, he might not be able to take it.","Jing Zeqian was still enjoying the 'fruits of his victory', the smile on his face growing deeper.","\"Come on, don't be angry anymore.\"","After Jing Zejun finished washing up, Jing Yi was still sitting on the sofa, furiously punching a pillow, seemingly imagining it was Jing Zeqian.","\"I'm so mad! That immature brat! Peppermint oil! Tsundere brother-complex little princess!\"","Jing Yi used every insult she could think of, but it still didn't seem enough to vent her anger.","Jing Zejun moved closer to her side. \"Then next time, why don't you play a prank on him?\"","Jing Yi had the same thought, but she knew he would be on guard for a while now. She'd have to wait for another opportunity.","\"Well, I'm going to take a shower now.\" At least she had someone to sleep with tonight..."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Grandma Jing","paragraphs":["The night sky hung like a clear mirror, with the moon suspended amidst twinkling stars. The northern part of the city had shed its hustle and bustle, and the Jing household had fallen into slumber. Only one room still emitted a faint light, with soft voices emanating from within.","Two girls were nestled on the bed, with a dim lamp glowing nearby. Jing Zejun, trying to find a topic of conversation to ease Jing Yi's fear, asked, \"Yi Yi, what kind of person was Grandma?\"","Jing Zejun hadn't seen Grandma Jing since she was three years old, and her earlier memories had long faded. The only time she had seen her was in the hospital room when Grandma Jing was on her deathbed. She had held Jing Zejun's hand, her expression both excited and remorseful. Tears streaming down her face, she kept saying, \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry...\"","\"Grandma...\" Jing Yi's lips curved into a slight smile. \"She was a very elegant old lady.\"","Though aged, with graying hair at her temples and many wrinkles etched by time, she always wore a gentle smile, looking every bit the kind grandmother.","\"She loved to sunbathe in the courtyard every afternoon, but she was always very careful about sun protection. I found it strange - how could someone sunbathe while wearing sun protective clothing and a hat?\"","'Yi Yi, quick, put on your sun protection clothes! Did you apply sunscreen?'","'Grandma, why would I need sunscreen if I'm sunbathing?'","'You're just too young! You're reckless now while your skin is still soft. Go on, hurry!'","Through the dim light, Jing Zejun could see the warm smile on Jing Yi's face.","\"But Grandma always said she needed calcium, yet she didn't want more dark spots or wrinkles on her face. So she would wrap herself up to sunbathe.\"","Jing Yi snuggled into the blanket, the room filled with a cozy atmosphere. \"Even though her posture was a bit stooped, she still walked quite sprightly, always mindful of her appearance. She didn't look like an 80-year-old lady at all.\"","The dim bedroom light cast shadows on Jing Yi's face. Jing Zejun thought to herself that Jing Yi must have loved her grandmother dearly, after all, she was the only family she had growing up.","\"She loved to have gatherings with her old friends, drinking afternoon tea.\"","'Yi Yi, Grandma is going shopping with Grandmother Wang. You'll have to eat dinner by yourself tonight, okay?'","'Yi Yi, want to go for afternoon tea? Of course, it's just tea, no cakes. You should eat less sweets.'","Jing Zejun gradually calmed down, picturing a vibrant old lady in her mind.","\"She was also quite stubborn. You might think she was living a rich, fulfilling life, but sometimes she'd sit in the courtyard, her eyes filled with sadness.\"","After Jing Zejun went missing, Grandma Jing took Jing Yi abroad. They rarely even made phone calls back home, let alone return to the country.","It wasn't that Jing Beicheng hadn't brought up the matter. Jing Yi had also tried to persuade Grandma Jing, after all, the old lady was getting on in years, and it must be lonely living abroad with just her granddaughter.","Jing Yi didn't mind, but she didn't want Grandma Jing to feel that way.","\"But she was stubborn, insisting that life abroad was so comfortable, with her old friends and granddaughter. She refused to go back.\"","[But I knew that she always felt guilty deep down, feeling she had no right to return to that place.]","\"Actually, all these years, Grandma had been looking for you. Even though she was abroad, she never lost contact with those missing persons agencies.\"","Jing Yi wasn't trying to explain anything on Grandma Jing's behalf. She had no right to forgive on Jing Zejun's behalf, she just didn't want the Jing family to continue misunderstanding Grandma Jing.","Jing Zejun's emotions were complex as she quietly listened to Jing Yi describe her grandmother.","\"She was also a very stubborn person. Once she decided on something, no one could change her mind.\"","Jing Yi's gaze became distant as she continually recalled her daily life with Grandma Jing, a smile playing on her lips.","\"I never met Uncle while we were abroad because Grandma would always 'chase' me out. She was always telling me to go do my own things, not to stay at home.\"","Jing Zejun was a bit confused. According to what Jing Yi said, Grandma Jing shouldn't have treated her like that.","Jing Yi smiled and continued, \"She was just afraid that if I stayed there, Uncle would give me cold looks.\"","This was something Jing Yi didn't understand at first, and her former self never figured it out. Her former self always thought it was because of her status that Grandma Jing intentionally kept her from meeting the Jing family members.","But Grandma Jing always loved Jing Yi dearly. She just felt guilty about her own mistakes and didn't want Jing Yi to be caught up in that guilt.","Later, Jing Beicheng and the others came for another visit. That day, Jing Yi happened to be at home, and Grandma Jing had forgotten the time of their arrival.","It wasn't until she heard the sound of cars that Grandma Jing realized.","\"And then what happened?\" Jing Zejun was drawn into the story Jing Yi was telling with such relish.","\"Then I thought, well, there's no way to avoid it now, we'll have to meet them. But to my surprise, Grandma grabbed me and rushed upstairs, repeatedly telling me not to come down.\"","It was on that day that Jing Yi overheard their conversation.","From upstairs, Jing Yi heard a middle-aged man's voice, sounding very authoritative, \"Mom, are you planning to never let Jing Yi meet us in your lifetime?\"","\"You can see her after I'm dead.\"","\"Mom!\"","\"Grandma, Dad didn't mean it like that.\" Jing Yi heard a younger voice.","\"I know what you mean, but I'm the one who made the mistake. Yi Yi doesn't owe any of you anything. She doesn't need to face your cold looks.\"","The middle-aged man's voice sounded weary, \"Mom, when will you come back with me?\"","\"Beicheng, if I go back, Rui Qing who has finally recovered...\"","\"So you plan to stay here with Jing Yi for the rest of your life?\"","\"I'll probably have to stay here for the rest of my life. I've said before, after I die, you can meet Yi Yi. When that time comes, I hope you'll take care of her, considering she'll be an orphan.\"","Jing Yi's gaze was distant. \"The old lady was so stubborn. So our first meeting was also my first time meeting all the members of the Jing family.\"","There was a hint of sadness in Jing Yi's eyes. Jing Zejun noticed this and moved closer to Jing Yi, saying softly, \"Then let me tell you about my adoptive parents.\"","\"Alright.\"","Jing Zejun's adoptive parents were an ordinary couple who, due to health issues, couldn't have children of their own, so they adopted her from an orphanage.","\"Mom told me that she spotted me at first glance in the orphanage. She thought this little girl was really pretty, and decided to bring me home right then.\"","Jing Yi's lips curved upwards involuntarily, seeming to picture little Jing Zejun in her mind.","\"They were just an ordinary working-class family, but they never skimped on me financially. When they found out I had been kidnapped, they even kept track of missing person reports for me.\"","\"Until I was eighteen, when they fell seriously ill...\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: The Gift","paragraphs":["At the Hengjing Group, Jing Zeyou had just finished a meeting and was the first to leave the conference room.","A man in his thirties followed closely behind Jing Zeyou, carrying a laptop. \"...Baoqing Group has sent an invitation. They're holding a jewelry auction next Tuesday.\"","Jing Zeyou strode into the elevator with his long legs and looked at his secretary. \"I recall Baoqing's people mentioning two special gemstone necklaces at the auction?\"","\"Yes, sir.\" The assistant pulled out a thin magazine from his files and handed it to Jing Zeyou.","He flipped through it, pointing at two items. \"Bid by phone for these two, and also for a jade bracelet.\"","Jing Zeyou indicated two sapphire necklaces. One was a pearl and gemstone necklace with a pendant made of sapphires and diamonds forming a flower shape, the chain composed of plump pearls.","The other was a diamond necklace with a pendant of a pure but uniquely shaped sapphire, the chain made of diamonds.","\"Certainly, General Jing,\" Assistant Chen took back the magazine and returned it to its original place.","These were likely meant for General Jing's two sisters, but it wasn't his business who they were for. He only needed to obtain the items after next week's bidding and hand them over to General Jing.","\"At eleven o'clock this morning, General Shen from Huarui Group will arrive to discuss the details of our companies' collaboration,\" the assistant continued to report Jing Zeyou's upcoming work schedule. \"The meeting room has been arranged, and the specific contract documents have been placed on your desk.\"","Jing Zeyou nodded slightly, glanced at his watch, and pushed open the door to enter his office.","Assistant Chen stopped at the doorway. After Jing Zeyou returned to his office, he turned and walked towards his own desk.","For the next while, Jing Zeyou would likely be reviewing documents and handling work. During this time, he rarely called for his assistant, but that didn't mean Chen could be idle.","Assistant Chen got up, taking the product magazine from earlier, and walked into the president's office, approaching an employee.","\"Little Lu, for next Tuesday's Baoqing Group auction, you're responsible for contacting the auction staff and bidding by phone for these three items.\"","\"Understood, Assistant Chen.\"","Before Assistant Chen came in, the office had been quiet. The young employees were busy with their own tasks, brows slightly furrowed and expressions serious, the air filled with the tapping of keyboards.","Occasionally, a few employees in professional attire would hurry between the office and their workstations.","The previously quiet office became animated at the mention of the jewelry auction.","Their president, who had been perpetually single, was suddenly interested in a jewelry auction, and bidding on three pieces at once!","\"Assistant Chen, does our president have something going on?\" Several people gathered around, their faces full of curiosity.","In front of the president, they wouldn't dare to be so presumptuous, but although Assistant Chen usually maintained a serious face, he was quite approachable. He would often cover for them when there were occasional work slip-ups.","Most importantly, Assistant Chen was also quite fond of gossip.","Assistant Chen glanced at them, \"Gossiping about the president's private affairs? Don't you want your jobs?\"","Despite his serious expression, the employees surrounding him weren't scared. Their eyes still gleamed with curiosity.","Assistant Chen cleared his throat a few times and glanced towards Jing Zeyou's office. \"General Jing recently found two sisters.\"","The employees suddenly realized, remembering the recent rumors circulating in the company about the president finding his biological sister, but ending up with two sisters.","\"So it's true that one is Jing Zejun, right?\" The girl who spoke up was excited.","She was a fan of Jing Zejun and couldn't believe that her idol turned out to be the legendary heiress of a wealthy family.","Assistant Chen nodded slightly, and the surrounding discussion grew louder. \"I'm telling you, keep your gossip down!\" As the voices grew louder, Assistant Chen had to remind everyone.","They might not care about their jobs, but he still needed this job to make a living, even though he wasn't married yet.","\"Then, who's the other sister?\"","\"Why ask so much? All you need to know is that the president treats both sisters equally.\"","At least on the surface.","Assistant Chen waved the magazine in his hand, reminding the employees with various thoughts.","They nodded in understanding.","Assistant Chen didn't say more. \"Little Lu, keep this matter in mind. After the auction ends, the items need to be in General Jing's hands.\"","The young employee quickly agreed.","After Assistant Chen left, the office, quiet for a moment, gathered together again.","\"Hey, do you think the other sister is the one brought back from abroad?\"","A nearby colleague leaned in, also speaking softly: \"Of course. It's said she was raised by General Jing's grandmother and only recently returned to the Jing Family.\"","\"Wow, how could those two heiresses possibly get along? One is the real heiress who finally returned to the wealthy family, the other is the fake heiress who's enjoyed the luxurious life since childhood.\"","Just thinking about it made them feel that the two would surely dislike each other.","At least, that's what most people in the office thought. After hearing this, several people nodded in agreement.","\"But how can she be called a fake heiress? It's not like she was switched at birth or lived with the Jing Family since childhood. It feels more like she's a relative.\"","Another colleague disagreed with this statement and immediately refuted: \"How is she not? Even if she lived abroad, she was still raised by the Jing Family's old madam. Let's not even talk about living conditions, just this point alone makes her like an adopted daughter, doesn't it?\"","\"What does that matter? They've hardly ever met, how could they be at each other's throats?\"","The fan of Jing Zejun from earlier was a bit dissatisfied. These colleagues were talking as if they had seen it themselves, and she didn't think Jing Zejun would necessarily clash with that girl, after all, Zejun was so gentle.","Those colleagues thought she was too naive, really believing that everyone in the world got along perfectly.","Come on, this was the Jing Family! The globally top-ranked Hengjing Group, who wouldn't be tempted? Just the title of Miss Jing could become a dazzling calling card.","As the discussion grew more heated, Little Lu, who had been assigned the task, flipped through the auction magazine, looking at the starting prices of the two necklaces. He spoke casually.","\"I think all your talk is pointless. One of these necklaces could buy a house in North River, and you're here discussing whether the two heiresses are fighting.\"","And this was just the starting price...","Hearing his words, several people crowded around again, their pupils dilating slightly as they saw the several zeros in the price.","Even after working at Hengjing for so many years, their perception of money was still constantly being refreshed.","One of the colleagues asked curiously, \"Little Lu, didn't Assistant Chen mention a specific budget earlier? So you...?\"","Little Lu smiled slightly, \"Not mentioning a budget means that no matter how high the bidding goes, these items must be in General Jing's office after next Tuesday.\"","In other words, there was no budget."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Shen Huai Chu","paragraphs":["Assistant Chen knocked on the door. \"Mr. Jing, General Shen from Huarui Group has arrived.\"","Jing Zeyou looked up and glanced at his watch. \"Take him to the conference room. I'll be there shortly.\"","\"Understood.\"","Jing Zeyou stood up, adjusted his attire, and picked up the documents on his desk before leaving the office.","\"General Shen.\"","A man was sitting in the conference room waiting. He wore a crisp dark suit, with an equally well-dressed assistant standing behind him.","Seeing Jing Zeyou enter, he stood up to shake hands.","\"Mr. Jing.\"","The man had handsome features with sharp contours, defined eyebrows, and deep, cold eyes that exuded indifference.","Even in a meeting with a business partner, his face remained expressionless, giving off an unapproachable aura.","This wasn't the first time Jing Zeyou and Shen Huaichu had met, but it was the first official meeting between Hengjing and Huarui Group.","Since Shen Huaichu's return, he had stirred up quite a storm in North river. Jing Zeyou was naturally aware of everything that had happened with the Shen family and Huarui Group recently.","Even now, Jing Zeyou admired Shen Huaichu, who was a few years younger than him.","The Shen family's Huarui Group was a financial conglomerate with businesses spanning banking, investment, insurance, and wealth management services.","As one of the top-ranking families in North river, the Shen family had been losing some of its luster in recent years. Their influence had even waned compared to the up-and-coming Wang Family, including their flagship Huarui Group.","But a few months ago, Huarui Group changed hands.","With Huarui's reboot, Jing Zeyou became interested in the company and in Shen Huaichu himself. He had even discussed Shen Huaichu with Jing Beicheng and shared his ideas about cooperating with Huarui.","Jing Beicheng strongly supported Jing Zeyou's ideas.","\"Please, have a seat. I apologize for keeping you waiting.\"","Jing Zeyou sat across from Shen Huaichu and placed the documents on the table.","With only the four of them in the office, Jing Zeyou and Shen Huaichu began their formal strategic cooperation talks.","Meanwhile, at the Jing family residence","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun had chatted until midnight yesterday, so they didn't wake up until nearly noon.","Jing Beicheng was already in the living room watching the midday news.","Lin Ruiqing looked at the two sleepy-eyed girls and chuckled, \"Good morning? It's almost noon now.\" If they had slept any longer, she would have gone to wake them for lunch.","Jing Zejun smiled sheepishly. They had indeed slept in quite late. Yesterday, they lost track of time while talking, and this morning they just couldn't get up.","\"Since you're up, let's have lunch. Aunt Wang has already prepared the meal.\"","At the dining table, Jing Beicheng first ladled some soup for Lin Ruiqing. Noticing Jing Yi's gaze, he paused briefly before serving soup to Jing Zejun and Jing Yi as well.","\"Thank you, Uncle!\"","\"Thank you, Dad.\"","Lin Ruiqing looked at the two beautiful girls before her and smiled contentedly.","\"Zejun, take some time to rest these days. Go out and have fun with Yi. Don't rush into work.\"","Jing Zejun nodded. Even if this incident hadn't occurred, she had planned to take a break anyway.","She had just finished filming a drama, and with her current status and popularity in the entertainment industry, she couldn't seamlessly move from one project to another. Especially after filming \"Monarch,\" she hadn't received many good scripts. She had really liked the script for \"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms,\" but now with everything that had happened, she wasn't sure what would come next.","Lin Ruiqing seemed to think of something and said with a smile, \"Or, you two could come on vacation with us.\"","Jing Zejun and Jing Yi both looked up, exchanging surprised glances.","Jing Zejun asked, \"Mom, are you and Dad going on a trip?\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded.","This was something Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng had discussed a few days ago. During her recent hospital stay, Lin Ruiqing had thought about many things: how little time she had spent with her daughter, how neither of her sons had started families yet, and how she hadn't had much chance to get to know Jing Yi.","But what Lin Ruiqing thought about most was that even after all these years with Jing Beicheng, she felt she had spent the least time with him.","So they came up with the idea of going on a trip together.","Jing Beicheng remained composed as he picked up some bamboo shoots with his chopsticks and placed them in Lin Ruiqing's bowl. \"Do you two want to come as well? I had originally planned to take just your mother sightseeing. If you want to join, I might need to rework the itinerary. After all, the places we like might not suit you...\"","Jing Zejun listened to Jing Beicheng, unsure how to respond.","Jing Yi sneaked glances at Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing.","[This doesn't sound like he's too keen on us joining...]","Lin Ruiqing looked a bit uncomfortable and pinched the person next to her. Jing Beicheng paused briefly but quickly regained his composure.","Jing Beicheng indeed didn't want their planned couple's getaway to be 'interrupted' by family members, even if they were the two girls he adored.","For him, there was a big difference between a couple's trip and a family vacation of four. They could always plan a family trip another time.","While Jing Yi continued to observe quietly, Jing Zejun pressed her lips together, suppressing a smile.","Lin Ruiqing glared at Jing Beicheng, \"Your father has also retired from Hengjing. We don't have much to do these days, so we thought we'd travel and see the world while we still can.\"","Jing Yi nodded in agreement as she ate her spareribs.","[Retirement is the perfect time when you have both leisure and money. Of course, you should make the most of it and go see the world. Later, when you're surrounded by grandchildren, you might not want to leave even if you could.]","Lin Ruiqing strongly agreed. She wouldn't pressure her children to get married, but if grandchildren did come along, she probably wouldn't feel comfortable traveling so freely.","\"Where are you and Aunt planning to go, Uncle?\"","Although Jing Yi had no plans to join Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng on their trip, she was still curious about their destination.","Lin Ruiqing looked at Jing Beicheng. She actually didn't know where they were going. Jing Beicheng knew her preferences and had arranged everything.","Jing Beicheng mentioned a few locations, and Jing Yi's expression went beyond simple envy.","\"Wow! Uncle, you even took care of all the planning?!\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled, \"So, do you two want to come along?\"","Jing Beicheng glanced over inconspicuously, and the girls quickly shook their heads. \"Mom, I'll pass. I have some work to do after my break. What about you, Yi?\"","Jing Yi hastily replied, \"I'm not going either. I... I don't like traveling. I prefer staying at home!\"","Jing Zejun lowered her head, trying to stifle a laugh.","A hint of amusement flashed in Jing Beicheng's eyes. \"It's fine if you don't come. I'll give you each some money. You can use it whether you go out or stay at home.\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun thought to themselves: You really didn't want us to come along, did you..."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Qian Jingze and Jiang Miaomiao","paragraphs":["\"Traveling? Why did you suddenly think of going on a trip?\" Jing Zeqian heard the news that the Jing Beicheng couple wanted to go traveling when he returned home.","He was a bit surprised, as in Jing Zeqian's memory, he had never seen his parents go on a trip alone.","Jing Beicheng looked up, glanced at him, and said calmly, \"We want to go out and have some peace and quiet for a few days.\" Jing Zeqian was taken aback, while Jing Yi's lips curved up slightly.","\"...So when do you plan to leave?\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled and said, \"We don't know yet, we've just made a rough plan with your father.\" Jing Zeqian nodded, not asking any further.","It's good to go out for a while. Lin Ruiqing has barely had any time to truly relax these past few years, always worrying about how Jing Zejun was doing away from home. Now that the family is reunited, it's time to relax a bit.","\"Are you two going as well?\"","Jing Zeqian asked Jing Yi and Jing Zejun, thinking his parents had arranged the trip to take Jing Zejun out to relax.","The two beside him shook their heads in unison.","\"I have work coming up in a while.\"","\"I'm staying at home!\"","Jing Zeqian looked at the two strangely. If they're not going, that's fine, but why did they say it so decisively?","\"...Alright then, I'll take you out another day.\"","Since Jing Zejun and Jing Yi came to the house, he hadn't had the chance to show them around North River properly. It just so happened that Jing Zejun was resting for this period, and Jing Yi had been staying at home, so he might as well take them both out to relax.","[It wouldn't be going to his company to see those mediocre male celebrities again, right? I'll have to politely decline.]","Jing Yi, don't think that just because you're pretending to watch TV, I don't know what you're thinking!","Jing Zeqian looked at Jing Yi with a forced smile, \"Jing Yi, what do you think of those celebrities in our company?\" He just had to ask like this!","Jing Yi's eyes widened slightly, and she let out a dry laugh, \"They're quite good, a leading company in the entertainment industry, with top star Wen Qingyan, top actress Jiang Miaomiao, and countless popular celebrities under them...\"","She began to list out Startrack's awards and honors one by one.","Jing Zeqian nodded with satisfaction. It seems that Little Wang had done a good job in tutoring Jing Yi about Startrack's related information.","Jing Yi glanced at Jing Zeqian, whose mood seemed alright, \"But brother, I don't need to go to Startrack again. What if there's no parking space next time...\"","Jing Zeqian glared at her. She really knew how to bring up the wrong topic. Besides, given her behavior last time, did she look like someone who couldn't get a parking space?","Lin Ruiqing was a bit confused, \"What parking space?\"","Jing Yi only then realized she might have let something slip, \"It's nothing major, just a small misunderstanding with one of brother's company artists last time I went to his company.\"","Seeing Jing Yi's attempt to cover up, Lin Ruiqing could tell she was hiding something. She looked towards Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian had no choice but to explain to Lin Ruiqing about Jing Yi's conflict with Jiang Miaomiao last time.","Jing Zejun actually knew about this incident. She also knew Jiang Miaomiao, a well-known actress in the entertainment industry.","Jing Zejun had filmed with Jiang Miaomiao before. The entertainment industry is full of drama, and it's common for people to show different faces in public and private.","She just didn't expect Jing Yi to encounter Jiang Miaomiao, and she was a bit worried. After all, Jiang Miaomiao wasn't an easy person to get along with. After the last incident, Jing Yi had probably been marked by Jiang Miaomiao.","Lin Ruiqing frowned slightly and asked, \"It's just a parking space, why fight over it?\"","Putting aside the issue of Jing Yi's identity, just based on who came first, that Jiang Miaomiao wasn't in the right.","Jing Beicheng thought a bit deeper. He didn't understand much about the entertainment industry, but this parking space incident was enough to prove Jiang Miaomiao's status at Startrack.","Jing Beicheng hadn't interfered with his younger son's decision to start a business in the entertainment industry. He had never been interested in Hengjing's business since he was young, so carving out his own path was a good thing.","Jing Beicheng had been keeping an eye on Startrack's trends, which were indeed not bad. But the entertainment industry was inevitably a mixed bag, and he wasn't sure if his younger son's management style was good or bad.","But after all, it was his son's company, so he couldn't say much. Jing Zeqian was the CEO of a company now.","Jing Zeqian felt a bit awkward, after all, it was indeed his company's artist.","Jing Yi saw Jing Zeqian's expression and couldn't bear to see him being lectured.","She quickly explained, \"Auntie, it was just a misunderstanding. Besides, I'm not part of brother's company, so accidentally taking up a parking space did cause them some trouble.\"","\"You went there to bring him documents, not to cause trouble. How is that causing them trouble?\"","But seeing that Jing Yi was speaking up for him, and that Jing Zeqian had stood on Jing Yi's side at the time, Lin Ruiqing didn't push him further.","However, Lin Ruiqing was still curious about this Jiang Miaomiao, \"Junjun, do you know this Jiang Miaomiao?\"","Jing Zejun turned to look at Lin Ruiqing, \"I'm not sure if it counts as knowing her, but I know of this person.\"","Although they had filmed the same movie, they barely had any interaction.","Lin Ruiqing nodded in understanding. Not really knowing her meant that this Jiang Miaomiao hadn't bothered Junjun.","\"Brother, what kind of person do you think Jiang Miaomiao is in your company?\" Jing Zejun suddenly spoke up, surprising even Jing Yi who looked over.","Jing Zeqian thought Jing Zejun might have a bias against Jiang Miaomiao because of the parking space incident.","Jing Zeqian said seriously, \"Junjun, although Miaomiao can be a bit arrogant, there's no problem with her abilities.\"","Otherwise, she wouldn't have become Startrack's top actress. She had the works to back it up. Plus, he was planning to have Jiang Miaomiao look after Jing Zejun a bit, which would also be good for her development.","Jing Zejun nodded, lowering her eyes to hide the complex emotions within.","[Oh ho, Jing Zeqian is no longer simply valuing Jiang Miaomiao.]","Jing Zeqian didn't know where Jing Yi's hostility towards Jiang Miaomiao came from. It couldn't be because of the parking space incident, could it?","But he couldn't ask directly, because Jing Yi hadn't shown any outward dissatisfaction towards Jiang Miaomiao.","\"Junjun, I won't comment on her character, since you can never truly know a person. But Miaomiao is also an actress, and as you know, she has several major awards. You two could find some time to exchange ideas about acting techniques and such.\"","[Better not!]","\"That's not necessary, brother.\" Two voices rang out simultaneously.","Lin Ruiqing opened her mouth, then swallowed her objection. Seeing that her daughter knew what she was doing, she decided not to interfere.","Seeing Jing Zeqian looking a bit deflated, Jing Yi nudged his shoulder. \"Come on, Junjun is so amazing, what acting techniques does she need to exchange? She's a leading actress herself!\"","\"Brother, I'm not that familiar with Sister Miaomiao. Asking someone to look after me out of the blue like this would not only put you in their debt, but also make it awkward for Sister Miaomiao. So it's better if I just learn as I film.\"","Jing Zeqian sighed, tugging at the corner of his mouth, and said helplessly, \"Fine! You two have it your way! You little troublemakers.\""]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: The White-eyed Wolf","paragraphs":["Jing Yi looked puzzled, \"What were we just talking about?\"","Weren't they discussing travel plans earlier? How had the topic strayed so far?","Jing Zeqian glanced at the person beside him, \"I said I'd take you all for a tour of North river, not that we'd go to 'Startrack'.\"","Jing Yi laughed dryly, realizing she had misunderstood and led the conversation astray.","Since they weren't going to 'Startrack', Jing Yi was quite curious, \"Then where are we going?\"","\"The Shanchi Racing Track in North river. Want to go?\"","Jing Zeqian knew very well that Jing Yi was interested in racing tracks. She had only been here a few days and had already set her sights on her eldest brother's only sports car. Last time racing tracks were mentioned, her eyes had lit up.","Besides, he happened to be an investor in the Shanchi Racing Track, so taking them there for fun wouldn't be a problem.","Jing Zeqian mentioned the racing track casually, and sure enough, he saw the reaction he had anticipated.","The person beside him instantly brightened up.","[Racing track!!!!!]","\"Racing track?\" Lin Ruiqing's voice chimed in simultaneously.","Jing Yi suppressed her smile, trying hard to appear uninterested.","Lin Ruiqing was a bit confused, not knowing why Jing Zeqian had thought of taking Jing Yi and the others to a racing track, but she had heard Jing Yi's excited voice and seen her attempt to hide her enthusiasm.","She didn't say anything more, just smiled at Jing Yi and said, \"It's nice to go out and about.\"","Jing Zejun smiled at Jing Yi and asked on her behalf, \"Sounds good, Second Brother. When are we going?\"","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zejun with delight, thinking he was also interested in racing.","Jing Zeqian considered his recent work schedule, \"Tomorrow?\"","\"Great!\" Jing Yi agreed immediately.","Even Jing Beicheng couldn't help but smile.","...","At the entrance of the Huarui Group CEO's office, a woman was angrily trying to force her way in.","\"Mrs. Shen, you can't go in!\" The assistant blocked her path.","\"Get out of my way!\"","\"Mrs. Shen, you don't have an appointment, and the CEO is in a meeting!\"","The middle-aged woman shoved the assistant aside and barged into the office.","Inside, Shen Huaichu was discussing something with two current executives of the company. Seeing the intruder, his eyes showed no ripple of emotion, remaining cold.","\"Please leave for now.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","The executives had heard the commotion outside earlier. Seeing Shen Huaichu's order, they walked towards the door, catching a glimpse of the newcomer - someone they recognized.","\"Mr. Shen...\" The assistant, unable to stop the middle-aged woman, was now extremely nervous.","Shen Huaichu said calmly, \"You go out too.\"","\"Yes...\"","The assistant turned and left, closing the office door.","He stopped at his workstation, his expression very tense, his uneasy eyes betraying his inner anxiety and unease.","The woman who had just entered was the wife of the former CEO. He recognized her but also knew that Shen Huaichu wouldn't want to see this person. Yet he still failed to stop Mrs. Shen.","The assistant had only recently been assigned to this position by the CEO; the previous assistant had long since packed up and left. For him, this was a rare opportunity.","And he was one of the few who had witnessed the company's major leadership change and remained, naturally knowing how swift and decisive Shen Huaichu's methods were.","In the office, Mrs. Shen, who had barged in, glared fiercely at Shen Huaichu.","\"Shen Huaichu, you ungrateful wretch! Have you no conscience?! Your living expenses and school fees all these years were paid by your uncle! And this is how you repay him, sending him to jail while you sit comfortably here, taking over his position! Even a dog wouldn't bite the hand that fed it!\"","Shen Huaichu gave her a cold glance, his eyes utterly indifferent, seemingly unbothered by her words.","\"Conscience? Money? Aunt, are you referring to the money you inherited from my parents' estate, or the conscience you showed when you usurped our home after my parents passed away?\"","\"What do you mean your parents' estate?! Wasn't your uncle your father's brother? Why shouldn't he have a share of the Shen family's money?!\"","\"So you tampered with the car back then?\"","Mrs. Shen's face instantly turned pale, her eyes flashing with panic, \"What nonsense are you talking about! What happened back then was an accident! You have no evidence to slander your own uncle and aunt like this! Are you even human?!\"","The woman's voice was hoarse and trembling. She tried to appear calm, but the quiver in her voice betrayed her current state of mind.","Shen Huaichu smiled, but his voice carried a chill that made one's heart tremble.","\"Human? Aunt, I stopped being human twenty years ago. In that car accident twenty years ago, my parents, your elder brother and sister-in-law, were crushed beyond recognition by that large truck. They couldn't crawl out, but I did.\"","Twenty years ago, Shen Huaichu's parents were taking their not-yet-ten-year-old son out for a trip, but their car never reached its destination.","While speeding on the highway, the car suddenly lost control. Shen Huaichu's father frantically turned the steering wheel, trying to force the car to stop, but they collided with a speeding truck behind them.","Shen Huaichu's mother held him tightly, shielding him underneath her. Before the ambulance could arrive, both parents had already stopped breathing.","Shen Huaichu was the only survivor of that car accident.","Mrs. Shen, frightened by his gaze, unconsciously took half a step back, swallowing nervously.","The person in front of her seemed like an evil spirit, ready to drag her away at any moment.","Shen Huaichu's cold eyes fixed on her, \"You say I'm comfortable? How can I not be? You all have comfortably enjoyed the glory and wealth of the Shen family for twenty years. I've only been in this position for a few days.\"","Mrs. Shen's legs went weak, her lips trembling slightly, realizing that Shen Huaichu wouldn't easily let them off.","\"Huaichu, please, I'm begging you! Please spare your uncle, spare your brother! Spare our family! I'm begging you!\"","Spare them? Why didn't they spare his family back then?!","As for Shen Chen, that useless fool, did he even need to lift a finger? Just a wine bag and rice sack. And his uncle had sat in this position for many years.","From Huarui's peak period, he had sat here until the company declined day by day. Equally useless.","Shen Huaichu sneered, lowering his head to continue dealing with work, his voice growing colder.","\"Aunt, I have spared him. Otherwise, what you'd be seeing might not be a living uncle. At least now you can spend the rest of your life, ten or so years, or maybe just a few years, visiting him in there occasionally.\"","Mrs. Shen's eyes gradually filled with hatred, her bloodshot eyes full of venom, \"You're a devil! Why couldn't you have died in that crash too!\"","Shen Huaichu's lips curled slightly. He had thought the same thing back then. \"If you all didn't die, how could I?\"","He pressed the intercom on his desk, his voice icy, \"Call security.\"","The assistant immediately entered with several security guards, ready to drag the woman away. Her distorted mouth was still cursing Shen Huaichu, \"Shen Huaichu! You'll come to no good end!\"","No good end? He had heard too many such words lately. It would be best if these people lived long enough to see him die...","Shen Huaichu lowered his eyelids, continuing to flip through the documents in his hand, saying expressionlessly, \"If this happens again, you needn't come back.\"","The assistant felt relieved, \"Don't worry, Mr. Shen! I definitely won't make the same mistake again!\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Shan Chi Raceway","paragraphs":["Shanchi Racing Track, a renowned domestic racetrack, is also one of the most famous attractions in North River.","The racing track is situated on a vast grassland, surrounded by tall fences about three meters high. These fences are made of sturdy metal and covered with thick safety nets.","Inside the fencing, the racetrack is oval-shaped, approximately half a kilometer long and fifty meters wide. In the middle is a complex and impressive racing circuit.","As the major investor, Jing Zeqian not only enjoys the right to use the track daily but also receives a portion of the profits from annual professional races.","At this moment, Jing Yi is standing on a tall viewing platform, taking in the intricate racetrack below. Her expression is full of amazement.","\"Second brother, how much money did you invest in this racing track?\" Jing Yi asks, her voice sounding distant as she continues to stare at the track in awe.","Jing Zeqian leans against the railing, looking relaxed and casual. \"I don't quite remember the exact investment, but the earnings from races these past few years have been enough to break even.\"","Jing Yi's pupils dilate.","[My estimate of the Jing family's wealth was far too conservative...]","Jing Zeqian raises an eyebrow slightly, wondering just how much she had estimated.","\"Young Master Jing!\"","A group of men wearing racing suits approaches from a distance. They're friends Jing Zeqian invited to race, waving at him from afar.","Since he's just one person and can't possibly race with both his sisters simultaneously, he decided to invite a few friends.","As they draw near, Jing Zeqian introduces Jing Yi and Jing Zejun, \"These are my two sisters from home, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun. These are my friends.\"","\"Hello, sisters! Hello!\"","\"Nice to meet you! I'm a huge fan of Sister Zejun's acting, a true die-hard fan!\"","As people who often hang around Jing Zeqian, how could they not know about the two girls who recently joined the Jing family?","Whether they're true fans or not, it's always good to build a rapport.","\"Hello, everyone,\" Jing Zejun greets them with a smile.","\"You must be Yi Yi, right? I'm Li Chengsheng, but you can call me Brother Sheng. I heard from your brother that you're quite interested in racing. How about I take you for a spin later?\" A red-haired man approaches, his lips curling into a smile as he looks at Jing Yi.","The girl's large, bright black eyes are clear and lively. Her delicate and beautiful features, coupled with her glossy, slightly curled black hair reaching her chest, give her an appearance of vivacity and docility.","This is clearly the type of girl he likes!","Jing Zeqian glares at the red-haired man warningly, signaling him to restrain himself.","This guy is known for his skill in charming girls, and Jing Zeqian certainly doesn't want him using those tactics on his sister.","\"Nice to meet you, Brother Sheng,\" Jing Yi smiles, revealing a small dimple at the corner of her mouth.","[As expected of Jing Zeqian's friends, each with their own unique characteristics...]","Jing Zeqian feels this might not be entirely a compliment.","Seeing the red-haired man chatting up Jing Yi, another man steps forward, smiling at Jing Zejun, \"Then how about I take Sister Zejun for a lap? We can enjoy the scenery of the racetrack at the same time.\"","Jing Zeqian is starting to regret inviting these people. If he had known, he wouldn't have called them. They're all harboring ulterior motives, pouncing like hyenas at the sight of meat.","\"That's enough, you lot! I called you here to accompany us, not to hit on my sisters!\"","The red-haired man raises an eyebrow, stepping back to stand with his friends. After all, since Young Master Jing brought two sisters, they'd have a chance to talk to at least one of them no matter what.","\"Shall I give you two a tour first?\" Jing Zeqian offers.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun nod, following Jing Zeqian down from the viewing platform towards the racetrack.","Jing Zejun notices Jing Yi's eyes growing brighter, filled with excitement. She really does have an extraordinary interest in racing.","\"Over there is the track, which includes various different layout configurations...\"","\"Yes! The inclination angle of that big turn...\"","Jing Yi listens attentively. Seeing an opening, the red-haired man behind them quickly jumps in, continuing to explain to the two girls.","Although he tries his best to present a confident and cool image, Jing Zejun's interest in racing isn't deep, and Jing Yi's attention is entirely focused on the track layout. His performance clearly falls flat.","Seeing that neither of his sisters is paying attention to the red-haired man, Jing Zeqian doesn't mind his peacocking behavior and allows him to take over the role of tour guide.","\"Over there is the high-tech equipment for the racetrack, including high-speed cameras, radar monitoring, and wireless communication devices...\"","As a racetrack capable of hosting international professional events, Shanchi Racing Track is equipped with many facilities to ensure the smooth running of races and, more importantly, the safety of the racers.","Jing Yi nods in understanding as she looks at the large screen before her. She listens very attentively, seeming to have truly accepted the red-haired man as the tour guide.","Li Chengsheng notices that Jing Yi's attention isn't on him at all, and a hint of unwillingness flashes in his eyes.","Beside them, Jing Zeqian crosses his arms, amusement flickering in his deep, narrow eyes.","Did they really think the Jing family's daughters were the kind of girls who could be won over with a few casual tricks?","\"This area is for the modified cars of track members, usually maintained and cared for by the staff here. That one is Young Master Jing's GH race car.\"","Jing Zeqian's GH race car, built by a professional racing team, is a race-modified version of a Martin professional sports car. The deep red paintwork makes it look like a fiery steed, its outstanding appearance immediately catching Jing Yi's attention.","\"Over there is my race car...\" Li Chengsheng points to a very eye-catching race car not far away.","The body shape is equally streamlined, but the multicolored paintwork...","Jing Yi can only say that everyone has different preferences, and she understands and respects that.","\"Jun Jun, do you want to try? I'll take you!\" Jing Yi's words surprise Jing Zeqian's friends.","\"Yi Yi, perhaps it's better if we take you for a ride,\" one of them suggests. After all, these are professional race cars, and they were asked by Young Master Jing to accompany the girls. If anything were to happen, they wouldn't be able to bear the responsibility.","Jing Zeqian scoffs disdainfully. It's one thing for him to tease Jing Yi occasionally, but do these guys really dare to underestimate his sister?","\"Yi Yi, I think I'll pass. I'd rather watch from the viewing platform,\" Jing Zejun says. She's not particularly interested in racing herself, and would prefer to watch the race from outside rather than sit in the car.","Jing Yi considers for a moment and doesn't insist. She turns to Jing Zeqian, her eyes full of anticipation. \"Second brother, can I drive that car?\" Jing Yi points to his race car.","Jing Zeqian isn't surprised. Judging from her earlier reaction, he knew she had her eye on that race car. What else could he do? Since they came, he naturally wants Jing Yi to enjoy herself fully. How could he begrudge her a single car?","Moreover, he hasn't seen Jing Yi's true skill level yet.","\"Yes, you can drive it.\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Get Out of the Way, I'm About to Start...","paragraphs":["The group was somewhat surprised, not expecting Jing Zeqian to be so trusting of Jing Yi driving a race car alone. They all silently decided to go easy on Jing Yi, worried that too much speed might frighten the younger sister.","\"But!\" Before Jing Yi could get excited, Jing Zeqian immediately added, \"You must pay attention to safe driving. This is a racetrack, not a regular speed-limited street.\"","Although Jing Zeqian had previously mocked Jing Yi for driving 'Night' in the city as a waste of talent, now that he actually saw her getting into a race car, he worried she might use too much force and have an accident.","Jing Yi nodded with bright, sparkling eyes, appearing obedient and well-behaved.","But Jing Zeqian was still uneasy, unsure if Jing Yi had actually taken his words to heart.","\"Jing Young Master, why don't I take Yiyi for a lap first?\" Li Chengsheng was unwilling to give up any opportunity.","Jing Zeqian glanced at him, but before he could speak, Jing Yi had already refused.","\"No need, I'll just familiarize myself with a couple of laps on my own!\" She excitedly followed the staff to change into the proper gear, leaving Li Chengsheng looking disappointed that his plan had fallen through.","The corner of Jing Zeqian's mouth turned up slightly, and he didn't forget to remind the others, \"Keep an eye on her safety, don't let her go too fast.\"","The group nodded in understanding, naturally aware and having no intention of showing off their skills in front of a novice.","Jing Yi changed into professional racing gear, put on her helmet, and sat in Jing Zeqian's Ferrari race car. She stroked the steering wheel appreciatively before gripping it firmly.","Jing Zeqian brought Jing Zejun to the previous viewing stand. Meanwhile, staff had prepared tech equipment nearby so Jing Zeqian could more clearly see their race situation.","Jing Zejun watched as the eye-catching red race car appeared on the track.","\"Second Brother, I didn't expect you to have a sports car hidden here too.\"","Jing Zejun thought the number of vehicles in the family garage was already surprising enough, not realizing he had other cars elsewhere.","Jing Zeqian gazed at the red sports car familiarizing itself with the track below. \"It's just for occasional fun, this car is only usable on the racetrack.\"","This car was also decided to be purchased at the time of investment, and Jing Zeqian had used it fairly infrequently.","The red race car was going around the track lap by lap, getting used to it.","The current speed was still reassuring to Jing Zeqian. He even hoped Jing Yi would keep using this speed to play on the racetrack. After all, there were no other spectators, so there was no need to excessively accelerate to show off. Safety was more important.","Unlike Jing Zeqian's vague worry, Jing Zejun was more expectant, looking forward to what kind of surprise Jing Yi would show on the racetrack.","\"Little Sister Yiyi, are you sure you want to race against us?\" Li Chengsheng poked his head out of the car window, looking at the sweetly smiling Jing Yi with a hesitant expression.","Actually, he thought just taking a few laps around the track would be fine...","Jing Yi's lips curved up in a smile, her dimples showing slightly, looking even sweeter and more obedient. \"It's fine, Brother Cheng! I'll know my limits. We're already at the racetrack, it'd be such a waste not to have a race!\"","Li Chengsheng looked at the expressions of the other guys and had to concede. After all, he would slow down to take care of Jing Yi.","Seeing that everyone agreed, Jing Yi returned to her car, put on her helmet, gripped the steering wheel tightly, and quietly waited for the starting signal.","The people in the stands were also a bit nervous.","Three, two, one...","Go!","The red race car shot out like an arrow leaving a bow, the sound of tires friction against the ground resounding throughout the track like war drums!","Jing Zeqian's eyes widened as he stared at the direction the race car had left, unable to come back to his senses for a long time.","What was Jing Yi doing?! He had clearly warned her about safe driving, safe driving!","Not only was Jing Zeqian shocked, but the other racers who had intended to go easy were also very surprised. Out of a competitive spirit, they unconsciously accelerated to chase after her.","One of the race cars, affected by the surrounding vehicles, lost control at a turn and slid off the track, but quickly returned and continued to join the intense competition.","But all of this had nothing to do with Jing Yi. She was weaving through the front of the track, her steering wheel operations changing flexibly with the road.","Jing Yi focused intently on the road ahead, her body tense. Her eyes now showed none of the docility from before, as if she were a warrior born for the racetrack.","The colorful race car was driving right behind her.","Li Chengsheng's initial intention to take care of Jing Yi was completely gone. At this moment, the only thought in his mind was that he absolutely couldn't lose the race in front of a beautiful girl!","Especially since she was supposed to be a novice!","Li Chengsheng used every trick he knew. The colorful race car was getting closer and closer to Jing Yi's car, trying to overtake.","A curve appeared on the track ahead.","Jing Yi took a deep breath, her body tense to the extreme. She turned the steering wheel to the designated angle, and the race car charged towards the curve like a cheetah.","The tires made a sharp friction sound in the turn, the car body tilted in the curve, bringing out thick smoke and making a piercing noise.","The red race car was demonstrating what smooth drifting looked like on the track, putting some more distance between it and the cars behind.","The racers in the cars behind watched this scene in amazement. Was Young Master Jing sure his sister was a novice?","This kind of skill would be equally impressive even in a professional race!","Jing Zejun didn't know what the standard for a good racer was, but that red car was clearly faster than the other vehicles in terms of speed.","She knew Jing Yi was in first place at the moment.","\"Second Brother! Yiyi is so amazing, she's in the lead!\" Jing Zejun's voice was full of happiness and excitement, not noticing at all the somewhat ugly expression on Jing Zeqian's face beside her.","However, looking at the thick smoke brought out by the car's drift, Jing Zejun was a bit puzzled. \"Second Brother, is that thick smoke from Yiyi's car normal?\"","Jing Zejun hesitated, somewhat worried it might be caused by the car's excessive speed.","Beside her, Jing Zeqian's brows were tightly knitted. Normal my ass! Watching Jing Yi's operations, Jing Zeqian even wanted to curse. He told her to drive safely, and now she's drifting through turns?!","After passing through the turn, the serious little face inside Jing Yi's helmet finally broke into a smile.","She knew she had already won this race.","The Ferrari charged towards the finish line, crossing it. Several seconds later, the other vehicles successively crossed the finish line.","After stopping the car, Jing Yi let out a relieved sigh, patted the steering wheel in a good mood, and got out of the car.","She took off her helmet and waved sweetly at Li Chengsheng and the others who had stopped beside her.","Jing Zeqian's friends also managed to smile, though their expressions were somewhat complex, especially the red-haired Li Chengsheng.","He never imagined Jing Yi's racing skills would be so superior. He had wanted to show off in front of her.","\"Little Sister Yiyi, you... you've raced before?\" The person beside her couldn't help but ask curiously. Jing Yi's performance was nothing like a novice's.","Jing Yi smiled, her dimples showing slightly. \"I played a few times abroad before.\"","Played a few times?","Everyone deeply doubted this number. Did this look like someone who had only played a few times? They didn't know whether to say Jing Yi was being modest or if she was just a natural genius. Their expressions became even more indescribable.","Jing Yi looked beyond them. Jing Zejun and Jing Zeqian were walking this way.","She happily waved at the two, not noticing the hint of anger in Jing Zeqian's eyes."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: The Retreat of Jingyi","paragraphs":["\"Jing Yiyi! Is this how you pay attention to safety when I tell you to be careful?!\"","Before Jing Yi could share her excitement with Jing Zejun, Jing Zeqian's words hit her like a thunderbolt.","Seeing Jing Zeqian's dark face, Jing Yi felt a bit guilty but tried to maintain her composure, saying, \"I was paying attention to safety!\"","It's not like she was accelerating the whole time...","Jing Yi moved closer to Jing Zejun, linking arms with her to avoid Jing Zeqian's gaze.","\"Mr. Jing, Miss Yiyi might be a novice, so she couldn't control the speed well for a moment...\" Li Chengsheng tried to say something nice about Jing Yi, but he felt increasingly uneasy as he spoke.","If Jing Yi wasn't Jing Zeqian's sister, he would have wanted to sponsor her to participate in professional races. Of course, his money was nothing compared to the Jing family's wealth.","\"Have someone take the race car back,\" Jing Zeqian turned to instruct the staff behind him to drive the car away.","After just over ten minutes of driving, his heart was racing like this. If they continued, he might need to see a cardiologist!","Jing Zeqian glared at her, \"When I'm not around, don't even think about touching a race car again!\"","Jing Zeqian was worried that Jing Yi would secretly come to Shanchi to play when he wasn't around, so he gave her an advance warning.","When Jing Yi started driving, she was like a runaway horse that couldn't be stopped. Racing itself was a dangerous game, and he had no idea of Jing Yi's true abilities, so naturally, he couldn't ensure she would come out unscathed every time she played like this.","Jing Yi pouted, feeling a bit defiant, but seeing Jing Zeqian's dark face, she didn't dare to voice her objections.","Fine, Jing Zeqian was just concerned about her...","\"But Mr. Jing, hasn't Miss Yiyi raced cars abroad before...?\" Li Chengsheng's voice trailed off as he noticed Jing Yi's gaze turn towards him, frantically blinking.","Li Chengsheng had originally wanted to ask Jing Zeqian about Jing Yi's racing experience abroad, as he was truly curious about her racing skills, but Jing Yi seemed to not want him to bring up this matter.","His voice grew quieter and quieter, while Jing Yi was furious on the side.","What was wrong with this Li Chengsheng?! Couldn't he read the room? Was this the time to bring that up?","Jing Zeqian and Jing Zejun were surprised, clearly unaware of this information, or rather, no one in the Jing family knew about this.","Jing Yi hid behind Jing Zejun, desperately wishing she could be invisible at this moment, but Jing Zeqian clearly wasn't going to let her off the hook.","\"Jing Yiyi? This wasn't your first time racing?\"","Jing Yi sighed helplessly. How could it be her first time? Did they really think she was that naturally gifted? \"Well, actually, I just played around casually with some friends.\"","The \"friends\" Jing Yi referred to were actually professional race car drivers from abroad.","Before Jing Yi had transmigrated, she had only been slightly interested in racing. But racing was an extremely expensive hobby. Not to mention that professional racers all had their own modified cars, dedicated racing teams, and special driving licenses.","Each of these aspects alone required a significant amount of money. Even for casual enthusiasts, the price of these racing games was enough to deter most hobbyists.","After Jing Yi transmigrated, by chance, she met some friends involved in professional racing.","One day at a night market, while she was waiting for her snack order, a conflict broke out at a nearby table.","She watched as a group of drunk men pulled a girl to the ground. The girl was alone, and one of the men raised a chair, about to smash it down on her.","Jing Yi rushed over and kicked the man to the ground.","The rest of the men at the table looked ready to charge at her. Two fists were no match for four hands, especially when Jing Yi also had to protect the fallen girl.","At that moment, another group of people rushed in, joining Jing Yi in fending off the attackers.","Later, Jing Yi learned that this group was composed of race car drivers, even professionals who had participated in international races. They gradually became friends.","Seeing Jing Yi's keen interest in racing, they took her to the race track a few times.","When they discovered that Jing Yi's interest in racing wasn't just superficial, they became more dedicated in teaching her. They even tried to persuade Jing Yi to pursue a career as a professional race car driver with them.","Jing Yi declined. Her friends were puzzled, and while they didn't fully understand, they respected her decision.","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms, skeptical of Jing Yi's explanation. How could she master seamless drifting around corners just by \"playing around casually\"?","However, he couldn't force her to explain everything in detail. But after today's incident, Jing Zeqian mentally flagged Jing Yi's attitude towards racing.","Jing Zeqian didn't dwell on Jing Yi's situation any longer, as the person in charge of the race track had been waiting nearby for quite some time.","Jing Zeqian didn't visit the race track often, so the manager was clearly there to report on operations. Jing Zeqian, along with Li Chengsheng and a few others, moved to the side to discuss some matters concerning the race track with the manager.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun walked back to the viewing stand from earlier, watching her entire racing process on the small screen that recorded the events.","There was no trace of pride on her face. When she noticed several obvious flaws, her expression became even more serious.","It seemed she had gotten a bit rusty after not racing for so long.","Seeing Jing Yi's serious demeanor, Jing Zejun tentatively asked, \"Yiyi, you really like racing, don't you?\"","Liking sports cars, enjoying racing, and even being skilled in kickboxing - these all seemed to be sides of Jing Yi that she was reluctant to show her family.","Jing Zejun had actually been puzzled for a long time about why Jing Yi was so unwilling to let her family know about these hobbies.","Jing Yi was slightly taken aback but still nodded.","\"Then why haven't you ever mentioned it to the family?\"","Jing Yi continued looking at the screen and responded nonchalantly to Jing Zejun's question, \"I only play occasionally anyway, so there's no need to bring it up.\"","Jing Zejun frowned slightly, clearly not agreeing with Jing Yi's words.","She felt that Jing Yi's reluctance to mention it wasn't because she only played occasionally, but because she feared certain reactions from her family if she did, so she restrained herself from showing her fondness for these hobbies.","She had noticed before that when their father mentioned 'Black Night', Jing Yi had visibly tensed up, as if she was afraid of worrying or upsetting him, and had quickly glossed over it.","Jing Zejun hesitated for a moment before speaking seriously, \"Yiyi, hobbies aren't something that will disappear just because you suppress them.\"","Jing Zejun didn't want Jing Yi to put her hobbies aside due to excessive consideration for others' feelings, even if it was family.","Jing Yi stopped looking at the screen and smiled a little at Jing Zejun's words.","\"Junj un, you saw how Second Brother reacted just now. Even he was worried. If Uncle and Auntie found out, wouldn't they be even more concerned? It doesn't matter, it's just a hobby after all.\"","The more casually Jing Yi brushed it off, the more Jing Zejun's heart ached for her.","From Jing Yi's behavior, it was clear that these weren't just simple hobbies. They seemed to be an integral part of who Jing Yi was. She was now hiding this part of herself, just to avoid worrying her family..."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Unbridled Wild Horse","paragraphs":["After returning from the racetrack, Jing Zejun appeared preoccupied, maintaining this demeanor even after arriving at the Jing family home.","Jing Zeqian, somewhat concerned, asked, \"Junjun, what's wrong?\" Jing Yi's worried gaze also turned towards her.","Jing Zejun quickly forced a smile, saying unnaturally, \"It's nothing, just thinking about work matters.\"","Jing Zeqian, recalling that Jing Zejun's company was in the process of assembling a new team for her, assumed she was worried about the issue of her manager.","\"Is there anything I can help with?\"","Although he had promised Jing Zejun not to insist on her joining 'Startrack' anymore, Jing Zeqian was still keeping an eye on Jing Zejun's affairs privately.","After all, being in the same entertainment industry, he couldn't simply ignore everything, especially when it concerned his sister.","Jing Zeqian might not be involved in Jing Zejun's career, but at least in these small matters, he hoped his sister wouldn't have to worry.","Jing Zejun's expression softened, \"It's just some minor things, Second Brother doesn't need to worry...\"","The sound of a car echoed in the courtyard. \"Looks like Big Brother is back,\" Jing Zejun quickly changed the subject, fearing Jing Zeqian would probe further.","Jing Yi also looked over, a hint of surprise in her eyes.","Jing Zeyou had been collaborating with a company recently, presumably an important partnership, causing him to return home later than usual these days.","On several nights, when Jing Yi was preparing to go to bed, she still saw Jing Zeyou pouring coffee, burning the midnight oil in his study.","[Big Brother actually finished work on time today, that's rare!]","The \"rare\" Jing Zeyou walked into the living room, seeing his three siblings gathered there, and asked, \"Where are Mom and Dad?\"","Jing Zejun walked towards the kitchen, telling Jing Zeyou, \"They went to attend a friend's gathering.\"","When they returned, they hadn't seen their parents, and Aunt Wang said the couple had left early to attend a gathering.","Instead of going to his room to change first, Jing Zeyou waited for Jing Zejun to come out of the kitchen before handing two gift boxes to Jing Yi and Jing Zejun respectively.","These were two items his assistant had acquired for him at a jewelry auction earlier.","As for the jade bracelet, since Lin Ruiqing wasn't present, Jing Zeyou decided to keep it in his study first, planning to give it to her when they returned from the gathering.","Jing Yi looked down at the gift box in her hands, asking curiously, \"Big Brother, what's this?\"","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly upward, \"The partner company happened to have a jewelry auction, so I had someone bid on a necklace each for you and Junjun.\" He spoke as if it were a casual purchase from a street vendor.","Beside him, Jing Zejun curiously opened the box in her hands, revealing a pearl and gemstone necklace with a dazzling blue sapphire.","Jing Yi opened her box to find a diamond necklace inside.","Her pupils dilated as she gazed at the shimmering diamond necklace, though what truly caught the eye was the blue sapphire pendant.","Jing Yi looked up at Jing Zeyou in disbelief, \"Big Brother, is this a real gemstone?\" The jewel was emitting a soft blue glow.","She was asking somewhat rhetorically, knowing that anything Jing Zeyou gifted couldn't possibly be a plastic ornament.","Jing Zeyou nodded, \"This is one of the more special blue sapphires from Baoqing's auction items this year. I thought it looked decent.\"","[This is just 'decent'?!]","Jing Yi's expression was complex, feeling that perhaps she was simply inexperienced in such matters.","Seeing that both his sisters seemed to like their gifts, Jing Zeyou felt somewhat satisfied, glad that he had his assistant bid on them.","As Jing Zeyou went upstairs, Jing Zeqian, sitting nearby, watched his two sisters excitedly comparing their gifts and felt a twinge of jealousy.","Not only did he not have a gift to give, but now he seemed to have lost his standing as well.","He had spent the entire day accompanying them, yet he hadn't seen them smile like this...","When Jing Zeyou came back downstairs, he noticed Jing Zeqian's somewhat sour expression, not understanding what was wrong this time.","\"Where did you all go today?\" Jing Zeyou asked, sitting on the sofa with his long legs crossed.","Jing Zeqian replied listlessly, \"We went to Shanchi.\"","Jing Zeyou knew his brother had invested in a professional racing track, which was quite profitable.","But what was with his expression?","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly, \"Wasn't it fun?\"","[It was super fun! Extremely fun!]","Before Jing Zeqian could say anything, Jing Yi couldn't hide her thoughts anymore.","Jing Zeyou's lips curved upward, at least one person seemed to have enjoyed today's outing.","Hearing Jing Yi's excited voice, Jing Zeqian immediately poured cold water on the situation, \"I don't know if Junjun found it fun, but Jing Yi certainly did! She was like a wild horse let loose on the racetrack!\"","[Always tattling! Tattletale extraordinaire!]","Jing Zeqian's mouth twitched, but he went on to completely sell out Jing Yi, including how she had beaten his friend to win first place on the track, and all those dazzling drift techniques.","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly. Although he could somewhat guess Jing Yi's skill level given her fondness for 'Black Night', hearing Jing Zeqian's account still surprised him. This didn't sound like the level of an ordinary racing enthusiast.","By ordinary enthusiast, he meant someone like Jing Zeqian, who occasionally went racing but whom Jing Zeyou would rather call a typical example of a 'stationery collector' - his racing skills hadn't improved much, but he kept several professional race cars.","Moreover, this guy cared more about the profits from the racetrack, with the hobby itself being secondary.","Hearing her second brother's complaints, Jing Zejun intercepted, \"Second Brother, Yi Yi is very skilled, and she knows her limits.\"","Jing Zejun worried that the more Jing Zeqian said, the more likely Jing Yi would be to hide her other side.","Jing Zeyou, sitting nearby, also spoke up, \"If you were watching and still let little Yi get into trouble, then clearly it wasn't her fault.\"","Jing Zeqian choked a bit, having thought his eldest brother would take his side, but unexpectedly hearing such a response.","Seeing Jing Yi already sweetly chatting with Jing Zeyou, he shot Jing Zeyou a look that said, 'You got me this time!'","Jing Zeyou said gently, \"If you want to go to the racetrack again in the future, go ahead. But you must be careful. If you get hurt, forget about your second brother being worried, I might not even agree to let you go anymore.\"","Jing Yi was surprised and delighted that Jing Zeyou would support her racing hobby.","\"Mmhm! Don't worry, Big Brother! I'll always put safety first!\"","Beside them, Jing Zeqian side-eyed the three siblings with their great rapport, leaning back on the sofa, silently fuming.","Jing Zeyou hadn't seen Jing Yi drive, if he had, he wouldn't be so nonchalant about it.","Jing Zeyou raised his hand to check the time, then looked towards the kitchen with a puzzled expression, \"Is Aunt Wang not home today?\"","Usually by this time, dinner at home would have started, but even at this hour, there was no sign of it.","Jing Zejun smiled, \"Big Brother, we're eating out today.\" She had just gone to the kitchen to tell Aunt Wang not to prepare dinner."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Youth Gathering","paragraphs":["\"Shall we go out to eat?\"","Upon hearing this, Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly and looked at Jing Zeqian. Seeing the surprise in his eyes, he knew that Zeqian had just found out about this as well.","Jing Zeyou asked, \"Where shall we eat?\" It would be nice to gather for a meal out occasionally.","Jing Yi raised her hand with a suggestion, \"How about hot pot?\" Although Aunt Wang's cooking was delicious, she sometimes wanted a change of taste.","Hot pot?","This was quite novel for Jing Zeyou. Even when he went out for business dinners, his assistant would usually book a five-star restaurant for him. He had never specifically gone out for hot pot before.","\"I have no objections.\"","Jing Yi quickly looked towards Jing Zeqian. He was lazily leaning back on the sofa, deliberately dragging out his words, \"Hot pot, huh? I'll have to think about that...\"","Jing Zeyou's lips curled into a slight smile as he placed his water glass on the coffee table. His tone was casual as he said, \"If Zeqian doesn't like it, the three of us can go...\"","\"Who said I don't like it!\" Jing Zeqian hastily retorted.","Jing Yi stood up happily, \"Then Junjun and I will go change clothes, and we'll head out in a bit!\"","[Tonight is young people's gathering time!]","Once again outmaneuvered by his brother...","Feeling a bit disgruntled, Jing Zeqian saw Jing Yi and Jing Zejun go upstairs. He teasingly said to his brother, \"Big bro, it's young people's gathering time, you know.\"","Jing Zeyou replied calmly, \"Aren't you almost thirty too?\" Jing Zeqian was only three years younger than him, so he could hardly be counted among the young people either.","But Jing Zeqian didn't see it that way. As long as he hadn't reached thirty, he was still in his twenties and therefore a young person.","Moreover, he still had the recreational life of a young person, unlike his brother who seemed to live solely for Hengjing Group and felt uncomfortable if he didn't work for a single day.","While waiting for Jing Yi and Jing Zejun, the two brothers chatted casually. \"What are you planning to do about Junjun's drama?\" Jing Zeyou asked.","Jing Zeqian's tone turned serious, \"I've taken over the entire project. I've already contacted the film and TV production company a few days ago. Startrack will bear the subsequent investment costs...\"","\"Sea Crabapple Still Blooms\" had already completed filming before Li Yu was sidelined, but the post-production work hadn't been finished.","Although Startrack was an entertainment company with its own production department, it still fell slightly short compared to professional film and TV production companies.","Jing Zeqian wasn't arrogant enough to believe that Startrack's production department could handle the entire post-production of this Republican-era drama.","\"Do you need my help?\" Jing Zeyou offered.","Jing Zeqian declined. It was just one drama, and this level of investment wasn't a big deal for Startrack. Even if the show didn't become a big hit, he was confident they could recover their costs.","\"Big bro, second bro, let's go!\" Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were ready quickly, and the two brothers discussing business on the sofa also stood up.","Jing Zeqian walked to the courtyard, intending to go to the garage and bring out the car. He had been truly frightened by Jing Yi's driving earlier today and decided it would be safer if he drove.","But after a moment's thought, he looked at Jing Yi and asked, \"Shall I drive? Or do you want to?\"","\"It's fine, second bro. You can drive.\"","[What's with that expression? It's not like I'm uncomfortable if I'm not driving. Why fight over it when someone else offers to drive?]","Jing Zeqian: ... He was just worried she might feel upset.","About fifteen minutes later, the four of them arrived at the location Jing Yi had mentioned.","Jing Zeyou stood outside the hot pot restaurant, a hint of bewilderment in his deep eyes.","So this was how young people gathered?","The exterior of the hot pot restaurant was bustling with activity, the air filled with a cacophony of voices. A long queue snaked its way from the entrance, full of customers waiting for their turn to dine. Dozens of chairs were placed outside the door to allow queuing customers to wait patiently.","Jing Zeyou carefully avoided the waiter who was handing out queue numbers, but the waiter still hurriedly passed a number to Jing Zeyou, assuming that Jing Yi's group had also come to dine at the hot pot restaurant.","After briefly explaining how many customers were ahead, the waiter turned and hurried away.","Jing Zeyou looked at the [Number 87] in his hand with surprise. Were there really 86 groups of people waiting to eat before them?","Jing Zeqian also seemed a bit put off, avoiding the passing crowd as he questioned, \"Jing Yi, we're not going to wait for all these people to finish eating before we can have our dinner, are we?\"","How could that be possible?","Jing Yi called over the waiter who had been handing out queue numbers and showed him the membership on her phone.","She had borrowed this from Shen Xi earlier. Shen Xi was a serious hot pot enthusiast, especially fond of this restaurant. She not only came here often but never hesitated to top up her membership.","The waiter paused, looked at Jing Yi's membership level, and his attitude became more enthusiastic. He led the four of them into the restaurant.","Inside the hot pot restaurant, diners sat around tables, savoring the delicious hot pot while chatting with friends or family. Some were engaged in lively conversation, others speaking in low tones.","Several waiters were constantly moving between these customers, efficiently serving dishes and enthusiastically inquiring about customers' needs.","The waiter opened the door to a private room, \"Will this room be suitable for you?\"","Jing Zeyou scanned the room. Although it was a bit small, it was clean and bright.","Jing Yi looked at the other three, and seeing no objections, said, \"It's fine.\"","After they sat down, the waiter took out a tablet.","Jing Yi's eyes lit up. It had been a long time since she had eaten hot pot at this restaurant. \"What would you like to eat?\" she asked.","Jing Zeyou shook his head, \"You order. Anything is fine with me.\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun sat together, enthusiastically selecting dishes.","\"How about the four-grid pot?\"","\"Sounds good. I heard they've recently introduced several new soup bases.\"","\"Then let's get two classic ones and two new ones...\"","A few minutes later, the table in front of them was filled with various types of meat, seafood, vegetables, and other hot pot ingredients. The hot pot was steaming, with four different soup bases bubbling in the pot.","\"Big bro, go ahead and start. The tripe is going to overcook.\"","Jing Yi used the public chopsticks to put fresh tripe into her own bowl and Jing Zejun's bowl. Seeing Jing Zeyou's hesitation, she warmly invited him to join in.","Beside them, Jing Zeqian had already quickly adapted to the environment and was busily putting his favorite ingredients into the pot.","The scene before him was too lively. Jing Zeyou's lips curled into a smile as he also joined in the hot pot feast.","\"Isn't this soup base too spicy?\"","Jing Zeqian lifted his water glass and took a big gulp. He saw that Jing Yi and Jing Zejun really liked the spicy pot, so he couldn't resist trying a few slices of fatty beef from it.","The numbing spiciness exploded in his mouth instantly, as if a ball of fire was burning. This level of spiciness was clearly beyond his tolerance!","At this moment, Jing Yi's lips were also slightly red, but seeing Jing Zeqian's reaction to the spiciness, she burst into laughter.","\"Hahaha, how can hot pot not be spicy?! If you're afraid of spice, go for the tomato base!\"","\"Who's afraid?\" Jing Zeqian defiantly picked up a few more pieces with his chopsticks and put them into the spicy pot..."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Caught on Camera","paragraphs":["After the four of them had eaten and drunk their fill, they walked out of the hot pot restaurant. Outside, the scene was still crowded with people.","When Jing Zeyou and the others said they were ready to head home, Jing Zeqian was clearly unwilling. \"Are you serious? Is this what you call a gathering of young people? Going home right after dinner?\"","Jing Yi was a bit confused. Had she previously said this was a gathering for young people?","Jing Zeqian noticed Jing Yi's expression and his heart skipped a beat. He had accidentally let something slip!","Jing Zeyou narrowed his eyes and glared at him.","Jing Zejun's breath caught, her eyes betraying panic.","Fortunately, Jing Yi didn't think too much about it. She had eaten too much and her brain wasn't working properly, so she assumed she had mentioned it herself without realizing.","\"Even young people need to sleep, and big brother has to get up early for work tomorrow,\" Jing Yi said.","Jing Yi was just talking off the top of her head. If she were asked to go out all night partying, she'd probably give up within half an hour.","Seeing that she hadn't pursued the matter, the others all breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Well then, Jing, where do you suggest we go?\" Jing Zeqian asked.","Jing Zeqian pretended to be thinking, but he was actually trying to calm his nerves from earlier. The other three were getting impatient waiting, but he couldn't come up with anything.","He did indeed have places he frequented, but most of them were entertainment venues. It wouldn't be appropriate to take his two sisters there, especially since Jing Zejun was a celebrity. If his brother found out, he would certainly object.","In the end, the four of them returned to the car, ready to head home.","None of them noticed that in a corner of the parking lot, a man wearing a hat was capturing the scene with a camera. After Jing Zeqian's car drove away, he emerged from the shadows and quickly got into a van.","\"Follow them!\" he said.","Sitting in the van, the man looked at the photos he had taken with satisfaction. He took out his phone and made a call.","\"Hey, Editor-in-chief! Guess who I caught on camera? Jing Zejun. I got shots of her having dinner with three people - two men and one woman.\"","\"Cut out the woman?\" the man immediately understood the editor's intention. A scene of a popular starlet dining with unknown men would attract more attention. If it was just a group of people, everyone would assume it was just a gathering, and that wouldn't be interesting.","The man chuckled, \"Alright, Editor-in-chief! I'll edit it and send it to you.\"","The next morning at the Jing family home,","Jing Zejun received a call from her agent early in the morning.","The new agent was a professional woman in her forties, considered one of the top agents in her company.","\"Hello, Sister Qing? Trending on Weibo? I haven't had a chance to check my phone yet.\"","Jing Zejun opened the app and saw her name at the top of the trending list. The content claimed she had a late-night dinner with a man and returned to the same residence.","The topic quickly exploded, as the photo showed more than one man, sparking speculation from all directions.","Jing Zejun frowned slightly. It seemed they had been photographed while out for dinner yesterday. \"Sister Qing, the men in the photo are my brothers.\"","The agent naturally knew this. The moment she saw the silhouettes, she recognized the two young masters of the Jing family.","The reason their company hadn't immediately come out with a clarification was twofold. On one hand, they were worried about revealing the identity of the Jing family members, as Hengjing wasn't a company their small agency could afford to offend.","On the other hand, they wanted to gauge the Jing family's attitude before deciding on their next PR move.","Jing Zejun thought for a moment. \"Alright, I'll discuss it with my family first.\"","She hung up the phone and looked at the trending headline highlighted in red.","\"Popular starlet Jing Zejun has late-night dinner with two men, spends the night with both, returns to same residence!\"","It contained photos of her with Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian, apparently taken as they left the hot pot restaurant and entered the parking lot.","As for \"returning to the same residence,\" there was only a distant shot of the back of a car, without even a photo of the Jing family's mansion gates.","The previous night, the van had followed Jing Zeqian's car from a distance, but they were stopped at a checkpoint further down the road. They couldn't get any information from the people at the entrance either.","In the end, they could only return with that blurry photo and the earlier shots from the hot pot restaurant.","Jing Zejun scrolled through the comments. No wonder her agent sounded so nervous - the comments were overwhelmingly negative.","[Ah! My General Jiusheng! Tell me this isn't true.]","[My goodness, two men? That must have been quite a hot night!]","[Could there be some misunderstanding? Maybe they're family?]","[Family my foot. Jing Zejun said before that her parents passed away and she's the only one in her family. You can look up her past interviews. She's been caught red-handed!]","[Didn't they say they returned to the same residence? But we can't see any house in this photo.]","[Maybe they couldn't follow the car in. But it looks like the three of them went to the same place.]","[There's no evidence. It's all just slander!]","[Three people? This is the first time I've seen a celebrity gossip story with three main characters. They're really living it up.]","[Me too! Me too! It's really eye-opening. The entertainment industry never fails to surprise me.]","[She's ruined my Junlin!]","[She's benefited enough from the popularity. It's time for her to distance herself from Junlin!]","[What do you mean 'benefited'? Jing Zejun became popular because of her good acting!]","[Are the fans getting upset? Jing Zejun became famous because of Junlin. Now the drama fans want her to keep her distance, what's wrong with that?]","The comments section was a mess. It seemed that a simple statement wouldn't be enough to resolve this.","Jing Zejun took her phone and went downstairs.","Downstairs, before Jing Zeyou could leave for work, he received a message from security.","Security reported that a van had followed them last night, and they had recorded the license plate.","Jing Zeyou glanced at the information they had found. Entertainment World? Were they after Jing Zeqian or Jing Zejun?","He handed the phone to Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian frowned. \"Entertainment World? What kind of third-rate gossip magazine is this?\"","Indeed, it was a minor publication. Otherwise, they wouldn't have chased gossip all the way to the Jing family home.","\"They might be after Junjun,\" Jing Zeyou said.","Just as Jing Zeyou was about to ask Jing Zejun, he saw her coming down the stairs. \"Big brother, second brother, we were photographed yesterday.\"","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian exchanged a glance. It was just as they had thought.","Jing Zeqian, being most familiar with these entertainment reporters, frowned slightly and asked, \"Is it trending on Weibo?\"","Jing Zejun nodded and handed her phone to the two of them. Jing Zeyou's expression darkened as he read the comments on the trending topic.","\"The agent wants to ask you before deciding on the next PR move.\"","\"They haven't decided on a PR strategy yet? The topic is already exploding!\" Jing Zeqian's tone conveyed strong dissatisfaction. If this were a Startrack employee, they'd already be packing their bags.","However, with Jing Zejun present, Jing Zeqian refrained from being too harsh.","Jing Zejun hesitated. She thought that perhaps it was because of the Jing family's status that the company was being so cautious with every step.","\"This matter will need to be handled by Hengjing,\" Jing Zeyou stated, offering the solution."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Water Army","paragraphs":["The Jing Family was holding a family meeting to discuss the recent trending topic.","Jing Yi enlarged the photo from the trending topic and examined it carefully, still unable to see herself in it. \"Why am I not in the photo?\"","Jing Zeqian replied irritably, \"If you were in the photo, it wouldn't be 'Meeting Two Men in One Night,' it would be a family gathering.\"","This was a common tactic in the entertainment industry, and Jing Zeqian didn't find it unusual.","Jing Yi suddenly realized that she had been deliberately cropped out.","Jing Zeyou calmly said, \"I think we should have Hengjing issue a statement and send a lawyer's letter. There's no point in keeping this under wraps anymore.\"","Jing Beicheng agreed with his eldest son's suggestion. Actually, Hengjing should have sent out a notice when they found Jing Zejun, but it had been delayed until now due to her career.","Jing Yi also agreed that this was the simplest and most direct solution.","Lin Ruiqing looked at the still somewhat troubled Jing Zejun and asked, \"Jun Jun, what do you think?\" She agreed as well, but Jing Zejun's attitude should be the main consideration.","Seeing that everyone in the family had expressed their opinions, Jing Zejun had no reason to refuse. After hesitating for a moment, she agreed.","\"Then I'll have the company's publicity department issue the statement.\"","After the decision was made, the group quickly took action.","While issuing the statement, Entertainment World, which had reported on Jing Zejun dining late at night with a man, also published an apology.","The apology stated that an internal entertainment reporter had made a false report by taking things out of context, causing serious harm to Jing Zejun's reputation. They attached the complete photo and the results of the disciplinary actions taken against the reporter and relevant editors.","By the time more netizens realized what was happening, the trending topic had changed to [Hengjing Group's Young Miss Jing Zejun], causing the backend to crash at one point.","A series of popular headlines below were almost all related to Jing Zejun.","The top trending topic displayed Hengjing's official statement, which essentially explained that a few months ago, the CEO of Hengjing Group had found his long-lost sister Jing Zejun, and clarified that Jing Zejun was having dinner with her family last night. Regarding Entertainment World's malicious slander, Hengjing would pursue the matter to the end.","They also released the official photo from yesterday and a lawyer's letter.","[I knew those two people looked incredibly handsome just from their backs!]","[My God! Cinderella turned into a rich heiress! This is too much like a fantasy novel!]","[Not just a rich heiress, Hengjing is a top global conglomerate!]","[Apologize, apologize! Do you know who you slandered last night!]","[Help, I called the two young masters of the Jing family gigolos yesterday!]","[Good luck to the person above...]","[Who understands! I work for Hengjing, and when I saw everyone criticizing yesterday, I didn't dare make a sound!]","[The person above, you knew the truth and didn't say anything? I hope you never have seasoning packets when you eat instant noodles!]","[How could I dare to speak up? The CEO hadn't said anything, how could a lowly employee like me dare to expose his information?]","[Has no one noticed the other young lady in the photo? She's quite pretty.]","[Is that a friend?]","[Didn't they just find the young miss? Where did this one come from?]","Gradually, people in the comments started to speculate about the relationship between the two girls.","[According to insider information, the Jing family originally only had one biological daughter who was kidnapped at the age of three. Then, for some reason, the Jing family's matriarch brought back a girl of similar age, the girl in the photo. But Jing Zejun's mother strongly disagreed, so she's been staying abroad and only recently returned.]","[Coming back at this particular time? Isn't that strange?]","[Ah? This doesn't really count as a fake heiress, it seems more like an adopted daughter.]","[As long as she doesn't threaten Zejun's position, it's fine!]","[How could she not be a threat? Coming back at this time, isn't she here to steal the Jing family heiress position?]","[Rich families are so messy!]","[That old matriarch must have something wrong with her head, how could she think of using an imposter to replace the real heiress?!]","[She might not even qualify as a replacement.]","As the direction of the trending topic changed, an assistant approached a woman resting on a lounge chair with a phone in hand.","\"Sister Miaomiao, we've arranged for the internet army to go out. The public discussion has shifted to focus on that Jing Yi.\"","Indeed, the woman on the lounge chair was Jiang Miaomiao, whom Jing Yi had confronted earlier.","She kept her eyes closed and gave a faint \"Mm\" in response. \"Tell those internet troops not to hold back, and keep their mouths shut about other matters.\"","\"Understood, Sister Miaomiao.\"","Meanwhile, Jing Zeqian, who was closely monitoring the direction of public opinion, immediately felt that something was off.","After the identities of Jing Zejun and Jing Yi were revealed, many netizens began commenting on Jing Yi, with their words full of malice.","If he couldn't see that someone was deliberately manipulating public opinion at this point, he might as well consider his years in the entertainment industry wasted.","Jing Zeqian made a phone call, \"Little Wang, help me investigate whose internet army is behind these trending topics, and have the company's PR department resolve this as soon as possible.\"","After hanging up the phone, Jing Zeqian's face showed no relief as he continued to closely monitor public opinion.","Also at the Jing residence, Jing Zejun learned about this from her manager.","She hadn't expected things to develop so quickly. In just a few hours, the public's focus had shifted from her to Jing Yi.","\"It must be someone who deployed an internet army.\"","Internet army?","Jing Zejun paced back and forth in her room. She really couldn't understand. Jing Yi wasn't even in the entertainment industry and had only been back in the country for a few months. Why would someone deliberately deploy an internet army to attack her?","\"Sister Qing, can you find out who's behind this?\"","There was hesitation on the other end of the phone. \"There's no information, but Startrack has made some moves. Your second brother might know something.\"","\"Alright, then please help me keep an eye on the public opinion situation here, Sister Qing.\"","Jing Zejun went to Jing Zeqian's room. He was in the study. \"Second brother, have you seen the news?\"","Jing Zeqian knew what she was referring to. \"Yes, I've already had Startrack's PR team get involved.\"","Despite saying this, his brows were still furrowed.","\"I couldn't trace the internet army. I checked the IP addresses, they're from several internet cafes in North River.\"","This was Jing Zeqian's biggest confusion. Jing Yi had been staying at home quietly for the past few months and hadn't been in contact with other people. How could someone be so bold as to deploy an internet army?","Jing Zejun's brows furrowed even more. \"Second brother, could it be because of me that they're directing public opinion towards Yi Yi?\"","Jing Zejun had considered that the only connection Jing Yi had to the entertainment industry was through her and her second brother. Was it possible that her rivals were deliberately trying to muddy the waters by targeting Jing Yi?","\"Probably not.\"","He had never seen any celebrity hire an internet army to specifically target a family member of their rival, especially to attack someone as unknown as Jing Yi.","Concern showed in Jing Zeqian's eyes. \"Has she seen the comments?\"","Jing Zejun shook her head. \"Probably not.\" When she went downstairs, Jing Yi was eating dessert in the dining room, so she probably hadn't seen them yet."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Variety Show Invitation","paragraphs":["\"Yi Yi?\"","\"Mm!\"","Jing Yi quickly turned off her phone and smiled at the person on the stairs, looking as if nothing was amiss.","But Jing Zeqian still keenly noticed her action, a flash of concern crossing his eyes.","Jing Zejun moved closer to Jing Yi's side.","Jing Yi smiled and said, \"How's it going? Did you resolve everything?\"","\"Since you already know, why pretend nothing happened?\"","Jing Zeqian's voice suddenly rang out, surprising Jing Zejun.","Jing Yi paused slightly, lowering her gaze, making it impossible to see the emotions in her eyes.","Jing Zejun hurriedly asked, \"Yi Yi, did you see the comments?\"","\"I saw some.\"","Her voice sounded devoid of any sadness, more like she was discussing someone else's affairs.","\"Don't be upset, those people...\"","Being in the entertainment industry, Jing Zejun knew better than anyone the level of harm words could inflict.","Jing Yi's lips curled up slightly, a hint of resignation flashing in her eyes.","\"I'm not upset about those nasty things they said.\"","[Who cares what they say, it's not like it'll decrease my bank balance anyway.]","Jing Zeqian sat opposite Jing Yi, raising an eyebrow, \"So what did you see in the comments?\"","He didn't doubt the truthfulness of Jing Yi's words, after all, it was very much like her style.","Jing Yi let out a soft sigh, \"I saw them mentioning Grandma.\" Her voice was very soft, as if afraid of disturbing the deceased Grandma Jing.","A flash of anger surged in Jing Zeqian's eyes, but he still tried to keep his tone calm, \"Give me your phone.\"","Jing Yi glanced at him and unlocked her phone. On the screen were comments discussing Grandma Jing, most of the words far from friendly.","These comments completely ignited Jing Zeqian's anger.","Whether Grandma Jing was right or wrong, even Jing Beicheng had no right to say, who were these busybodies to meddle!","He immediately called Jing Zeyou, walking to the courtyard, speaking seriously about something.","Jing Yi sat on the sofa, staring blankly at the coffee table in front of her.","It was just a morning's incident, how did it drag out so many issues? She couldn't understand why people who had already passed away were still being dragged out for commentary.","Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi, her eyes full of worry. She knew better than anyone what Grandma Jing meant to Jing Yi.","\"Don't worry, Second Brother and the others will handle it.\"","Jing Yi took a deep breath and nodded, \"Mm.\" That's all that could be done now.","Seeing that Jing Zeqian had gone to resolve the issue, Jing Yi didn't dwell on it anymore. It was best to leave things to those capable of handling them, while she stayed put.","\"Want some pudding?\"","\"Huh?\"","Jing Zejun wore a surprised and confused expression. One second she was thinking about how to console Jing Yi, the next this person wanted to eat pudding?","Seeing Jing Zejun pondering something, Jing Yi added, \"Aunt Wang just made it, it'll get cold if we don't eat it.\"","Since when did Aunt Wang make warm pudding?","However, seeing that Jing Yi seemed completely fine now, Jing Zejun felt much more at ease.","\"Yes!\"","And so Jing Yi led the way to the dining room to enjoy the freshly made pudding.","After hanging up the phone, Jing Zeqian found the living room empty. Looking towards the dining room, he saw the two already seated and starting on dessert.","He curled his lips into a smile and strode over, \"What are you eating? Get me some too.\"","At the same time, Hengjing and Startrack simultaneously issued several legal notices, warning against malicious comments about Grandma Jing and Jing Yi, which finally calmed down the excited netizens a bit.","This was Hengjing and Startrack after all, if those legal notices were delivered, it wouldn't be just some minor celebrity squabble anymore.","\"Sister Miaomiao, Mr. Wang's side has withdrawn the water army. They said if they didn't, the Jing family would soon trace it back to you.\"","The assistant leaned close to Jiang Miaomiao, quietly relaying the message.","Her expression showed some impatience as she opened her eyes to look at the assistant. The ferocity in her gaze made the assistant involuntarily shrink back.","The assistant lowered her head, avoiding Jiang Miaomiao's gaze, afraid to make eye contact.","\"I see,\" Jiang Miaomiao's voice carried strong displeasure.","Ever since learning that the Jing family would announce Jing Zejun's identity, Jiang Miaomiao had instructed her assistant to arrange for their water army to be ready. She knew the waters would be muddy, and if not, she would come to stir them up herself.","But before they could fully direct the public opinion towards Jing Yi, Jing Zeqian had quickly discovered it, and even Jing Zeyou was close to tracing it back to her.","What else could she do but withdraw? If Jing Zeqian noticed her unusual behavior now, all the chess moves she had made recently would be for naught.","Jing Yi, you got lucky this time!","\"Miaomiao! Everyone's finished rehearsing, do you want to take a look at the activity route for later?\"","Hearing the newcomer's voice, she immediately put on a kind smile and agreed amiably.","After the person left, Jiang Miaomiao's voice lowered, \"Tell them I'm not feeling well and can't record for too long. Keep a close eye on the editing after it's over.\"","\"Understood, Sister Miaomiao!\"","She supported Jiang Miaomiao as they walked towards the center of the stage.","......","\"Variety show? Sister Qing, I remember telling you on the first day that I don't really want to appear too much on variety shows. I'd rather focus more on scripts and improving my acting skills.\"","Jing Zejun was on the balcony, taking a call from her manager.","The other end said something, and Jing Zejun's brow relaxed a bit.","\"A family variety show?\"","How long had it been since this incident occurred, and variety shows were already knocking on their door?","The Jing family's popularity had been soaring these past two days, and variety show directors immediately contacted Jing Zejun's manager, speaking earnestly and even willing to meet all of Jing Zejun's requirements if possible.","The manager considered that there had been too much public opinion surrounding the Jing family recently. While Hengjing and the Jing family might be able to intimidate some, both she and Jing Zejun were in the entertainment industry and preferred to achieve a win-win situation through industry methods.","Moreover, the other party was a renowned director from Fruit TV, responsible for many hit variety shows in recent years. The manager felt that participating in this show was a sure win.","Jing Zejun could use this variety show to openly showcase her family members, which would be a good way to address public opinion. Of course, the manager hoped even more that Jing Zejun could increase her popularity through this show.","Jing Zejun hesitated for a moment, listening to her manager's persuasion. She couldn't deny feeling somewhat tempted. If they could change the current online attacks against Jing Yi through the variety show, that would be ideal.","However, Jing Zejun always felt that variety shows were a double-edged sword. If not handled well, they could easily backfire.","Initially, she wasn't solely focused on acting either and had participated in a few variety shows, but the results weren't very good. Plus, her personality really wasn't suited for variety shows...","Jing Zejun felt a bit troubled, \"How about this, Sister Qing, let me discuss it with my family and get back to you.\"","After all, it was a family variety show, so it was best to ask for her older brother's and the others' opinions."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Family Variety Show","paragraphs":["The Jing family, including Jing Zeyou and others, were gathered in the living room, holding a family meeting.","Jing Yi secretly glanced at one person, then another.","[The frequency of family meetings has been so high lately...]","The main topic of the family meeting was the variety show invitation received by Jing Zejun's agent.","This show focused on family relationships, planning to invite five different celebrity families to participate in filming to showcase the daily interactions of different familial relationships.","Jing Zejun was one of the guests the director planned to invite.","As soon as he saw the news about Jing Zejun, the director immediately contacted Jing Zejun's team.","He knew this was an excellent opportunity. Not to mention Jing Zejun's recent popularity, just the identity of being the Jing family's daughter was a win for the show. Of course, if they could get Hengjing's CEO on camera as well...","Jing Zejun was the first to express his thoughts, \"This is what I'm thinking: participating in the variety show can indeed help alleviate the recent public opinion. I plan to go with Yi.\"","Jing Yi, sitting next to Jing Zejun, wasn't surprised by his words, but she wasn't particularly happy either. Her mind was full of thoughts about not being able to sleep in.","Jing Zeyou looked at her helplessly. When he came back, he was worried that Jing Yi might be affected, but Jing Zeqian said she was fine. He didn't quite believe it at first.","Now it seemed that Jing Yi really didn't care about those people's comments.","However, while Jing Yi didn't care, the other family members wanted to resolve this issue as quickly as possible.","Lin Ruiqing, not very familiar with these variety shows, looked at Jing Zejun and asked, \"For a family variety show, is it okay if only you and Yi go?\"","Jing Zejun shook his head, \"It's fine. The director won't actually invite all members of five families.\"","Although it's called a family variety show, the director wouldn't really require guests to bring all their family members. Naturally, different familial relationships would be arranged as the main subjects of observation.","Jing Zeyou leisurely poured a cup of tea for Jing Beicheng, seemingly pondering something.","Jing Zeqian, who was nearby, said, \"I'll go too.\"","Jing Yi glanced at Jing Zeqian, who had joined the conversation, finding it peculiar.","[Isn't he in this industry? How come he's interested in filming a variety show?]","Of course, Jing Zeqian wasn't interested in filming a variety show. He just wanted to accompany Jing Yi and the others. If any problems arose, having him there would make things more stable.","Moreover, he was somewhat familiar with this variety show. During the last artist work report, Wen Qingyan from his company had also received an invitation.","Wen Qingyan's agent originally wanted to accept it for him, but Wen Qingyan wasn't too interested in variety shows, so he seemed to have declined the invitation.","It appeared that this director was really ambitious, wanting both heat for the show and guests who brought their own traffic.","Jing Beicheng nodded. Jing Zeqian knew better than anyone else in the family how to present themselves on a variety show, so having him there was reassuring.","Jing Zeyou looked up and said casually, \"Then I'll join too.\"","Jing Zeyou's words surprised everyone else.","Jing Zejun was stunned for a few seconds, \"Big brother, what did you say?\"","Jing Yi was shocked, her eyes wide open. Had she misheard?","\"Big brother, that's filming a variety show. If you go, you won't be able to go to the office and work on time...\"","Seeing the same expression on the faces of other family members, Jing Zeyou felt a bit helpless. Did they really think he was such a workaholic that he'd feel uncomfortable if he didn't work for a day?","Clearly, that's exactly what Jing Yi thought.","[Since when did 'workaholic' big brother become interested in other things? Could it be that Hengjing is planning to enter the entertainment industry and he's here to investigate?]","Jing Beicheng raised an eyebrow slightly. How come he didn't know Hengjing was developing new business?","Jing Zeyou replied, \"Work matters can be handled remotely.\" The biggest issue at the moment was how to resolve the public opinion attacks on Jing Yi.","If only Jing Zejun and Jing Yi went on the show, the internet would likely be in an even bigger uproar, making the direction of public opinion even harder to control.","Moreover, since Jing Zejun's return, he hadn't had a chance to deeply understand Jing Zejun's profession. This was the perfect opportunity.","[Hengjing's CEO, Startrack's CEO... This director really hit the jackpot!]","Jing Zejun had the same feeling. She didn't rush to contact her agent, but instead looked at her two brothers again, \"Big brother, second brother, why don't you think about it some more?\"","Although it was called a family variety show, she hadn't planned on dragging both of her brothers into it.","Jing Zeqian leaned back in his chair, returning to his usual lazy demeanor, \"What's there to think about? It's just a variety show.\" It just so happened that he had never filmed one before, so he could experience the work of his artists.","Jing Zeyou also nodded.","Seeing that the matter was settled, Jing Beicheng instructed, \"I'll have Uncle Li pay attention to some details. You can film at home since your mother and I won't be there.\"","Jing Yi was stunned for a moment before realizing that Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing had mentioned their plans to travel last time.","Lin Ruiqing smiled and said, \"It's perfect that you'll be filming at home. We don't really like having cameras pointed at us all the time, so we're planning to leave tomorrow.\"","This was what Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng had just discussed. After hearing that they were all going to film the variety show, she decided to set off tomorrow.","Anyway, Jing Beicheng had already arranged all the specific details, and with their two sons watching over things, they had nothing to worry about.","Jing Yi, on the side, was incredibly envious.","[I wonder if I told uncle now that I want to travel with them...]","Jing Beicheng's heart skipped a beat. He lifted the teacup in front of him and took a sip, while mentally preparing various excuses.","Jing Zeqian was also frantically thinking of ways to interrupt. They absolutely couldn't let Jing Yi get her way. The show was originally accepted for her sake, and now she was trying to pull a last-minute escape!","[Forget it, uncle will definitely refuse! The variety show was accepted for my sake in the first place, and if I ran away, Jing Zeqian would definitely catch me.]","At least you have some self-awareness, Jing Zeqian thought as he secretly glanced at Jing Yi.","The corners of Jing Zeyou's mouth turned up slightly. He wasn't worried at all that Jing Yi would actually go traveling with Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing.","No matter how carefree or easygoing Jing Yi's personality was, she wouldn't be unaware of the purpose behind their participation in this variety show.","\"Junjun, do I need to play a certain character?\" She had watched many variety shows.","Even for reality shows, most of them still had scripts. It was impossible to show everything.","Jing Zejun looked at her enthusiastic expression and said with amusement, \"This is already enough.\"","Jing Zeqian poured cold water on her excitement, \"What kind of role do you still want to play? With your acting skills, you'd be exposed in a minute.\"","Being exposed would be even more troublesome. It was better to just act normally during filming, the same as usual.","Jing Zeyou also agreed. As the daughter of the Jing family, there was no need to compromise herself to cater to others' preferences.","Jing Yi thought about it and agreed, deciding not to create trouble for herself."]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Offended People","paragraphs":["\"You're going to be on a reality show?!\"","Shen Xi was shocked, nearly spilling her coffee.","She had just learned about what happened to the Jing family and, seeing that Jing Yi was affected too, called her out to ask about it. She didn't expect Jing Yi to bring such big news.","Shen Xi looked at Jing Yi in surprise, \"How did you decide to go on a reality show? Are you planning to enter the entertainment industry?\"","Jing Yi sighed softly. It wasn't about entering the entertainment industry, but rather because Jing Zeyou and the others said this was the fastest way to dispel the rumors.","Shen Xi nodded in understanding.","However, before she could calm down for more than a few seconds, Jing Yi's next words shocked her again.","Shen Xi's eyes widened once more, her face full of disbelief, \"Jing, your brothers are also going to participate in this family reality show?!\"","Those were the two young masters of the Jing family, one being the renowned Hengjing's CEO, and the other the famous Startrack's CEO in the entertainment industry.","This reality show was going to be star-studded...","Shen Xi was curious about what kind of director could persuade both Jing family CEOs to participate.","Jing Yi thought for a moment, recalling some of the director's works that Jing Zejun had mentioned to her, \"The parent-child reality show on Fruit TV, and also...\"","Jing Yi listed several well-known reality shows for Shen Xi, all of which were popular shows in various time slots.","\"I've actually watched all of those,\" Shen Xi remarked. \"When does it start?\"","\"Probably next week.\" The director would be coming to their house in a few days to discuss the filming details, though of course, she would just be there to make up the numbers.","Anyway, setting aside the reality show matter, Shen Xi was more concerned about the recent trending topic issue.","She shared the same doubts as Jing Zeqian and the others, finding it strange that someone would use internet trolls to target Jing Yi.","Jing Yi wasn't even in the entertainment industry and had just returned to the country, barely meeting anyone.","While Jing Zejun and the others couldn't think of who might be behind it, Jing Yi had someone in mind.","Jing Yi held her coffee cup but didn't lift it, her calm gaze seeming to ponder something.","Shen Xi looked up at her, \"Have you thought of something?\"","Jing Yi pursed her lips and asked, \"Do you know Jiang Miaomiao?\"","Jiang Miaomiao? Shen Xi was puzzled and thought for a moment.","\"Do you mean the celebrity Jiang Miaomiao?\"","Jing Yi nodded slightly.","Recalling the conversation between Jing Zejun and Jing Zeqian earlier, they all believed that even if the person behind the internet trolls wasn't a celebrity, they would be someone related to the entertainment industry.","At the time, she thought it might have been a random attack by a celebrity that happened to affect her.","But later, Jing Yi thought of one person. If it had to be someone connected to the entertainment industry, it must be Jiang Miaomiao.","All because of the parking space incident last time.","Shen Xi frowned slightly, \"Are you saying she arranged for the internet trolls because she was unhappy about you taking her parking space last time?\"","\"It's just a guess.\"","But besides Jiang Miaomiao, Jing Yi didn't know any other celebrities.","Shen Xi rested her chin on her hands, looking somewhat troubled.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up, and she looked at Jing Yi excitedly.","\"Anyway, since that Jiang Miaomiao is an employee of your second brother's company, why not just leave it to him?\"","After all, Jing Zeqian would surely protect his sister, right?","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow slightly, thinking Shen Xi's idea was too simplistic.","First of all, this was just Jing Yi's guess.","If Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou couldn't find out who was behind it, it meant the other party was well-prepared. Even if she insisted it was Jiang Miaomiao, and even if Jing Zeqian believed her, it wouldn't make much difference.","Moreover, she was more worried that this would alert the people behind Jiang Miaomiao, making it harder to control the situation later.","Shen Xi still didn't understand, \"But you're her boss's sister, why would she think of targeting you?\"","Even if there were some conflicts before, now that she knows Jing Yi is Jing Zeqian's sister, why would she still make a move?","\"First of all, I'm still a fake sister. And I think even if it were Jing Zejun, she wouldn't care.\"","This wasn't just a random guess from Jing Yi; she had seen Jiang Miaomiao's attitude towards her last time.","As one of Startrack's top stars and having a good relationship with Jing Zeqian, she wouldn't take seriously a sister who had only been around for a few months.","As for how Jiang Miaomiao viewed Jing Zejun, the original novel had mentioned it.","Jiang Miaomiao was Jing Zejun's idol at first. They didn't have much interaction until Jing Zeqian stepped in and asked Jiang Miaomiao to look after his sister.","Jiang Miaomiao started to notice Jing Zejun, this not-so-famous small celebrity.","Although she agreed to Jing Zeqian's request on the surface, Jiang Miaomiao didn't take Jing Zejun seriously in private.","It wasn't until she saw Jing Zeqian subtly favoring Jing Zejun that her dissatisfaction became more apparent.","In the original novel, Jiang Miaomiao deliberately took on the same drama that Jing Zejun had accepted.","On the surface, she acted like a good sister guiding Jing Zejun's acting, but in reality, she treated Jing Zejun harshly over and over again, even hinting to fans that she was being treated unfairly in both the drama production and the company.","Afterwards, not only Jing Zejun's social media accounts but even Startrack's account received numerous private messages filled with insults.","Jiang Miaomiao's behavior of guiding fans was not just to cause trouble for Jing Zejun, but more of a signal to start distancing herself from Startrack, ensuring she could exit unscathed.","Later, this indeed became a significant boost to Jiang Miaomiao's plans.","Shen Xi looked surprised, not expecting that Jiang Miaomiao wouldn't even take Jing Zejun seriously, \"Is she that powerful?\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow. What else?","She was someone who could shake Jing Zeqian's resolve.","Of course, Jiang Miaomiao's boldness wasn't just because of her good relationship with Jing Zeqian, but more importantly, because of her backing.","Every step Jiang Miaomiao took was premeditated. If Jing Yi hadn't known the plot in advance, she probably wouldn't have been able to guard against it, let alone Jing Zeqian, who trusted Jiang Miaomiao deeply.","Thinking about this, Jing Yi felt a bit of a headache.","She could understand that Jiang Miaomiao had brought certain achievements to Jing Zeqian's career, after all, they were partners who had come up together since their youth.","Jing Zeqian created Startrack, and Jiang Miaomiao's fame had established Startrack's position from the beginning, making it stand out among other entertainment companies.","But if it weren't for Jing Zeqian, how would Jiang Miaomiao have achieved her current success?","\"So what do you plan to do?\"","Even if you know who's behind it, it's still troublesome without evidence, right?","\"Prepare to film the reality show,\" Jing Yi shrugged.","What else could she do? She could only take it step by step. It was too early to say anything now. Jiang Miaomiao and her backer hadn't finished playing their hand, so Jing Yi could only wait and see.","\"Then I'll have to watch the TV closely! That's Hengjing's CEO! And your second brother too! Two handsome guys! This show is going to be a hit!\"","On the other side, the director who invited Jing Zejun thought the same."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Male Lead Wen Qingyan","paragraphs":["\"Director Xu! Jing Zejun's agent said they've accepted the invitation, and Jing Zejun's two CEO brothers will be joining too!\"","The director in front of him was equally ecstatic. Heaven knows how excited he was when he received the response!","He quickly pulled out his phone, his hand trembling slightly with excitement as he dialed the number.","Director Xu tried to keep his voice as calm as possible, though his eyes were brimming with excitement, \"Hello? Mr. Li, this is Xu Yi. Could you please inform Best Actor Wen that Miss Jing has confirmed her participation in this variety show recording? What's Best Actor Wen's stance on this?\"","A few minutes later, the director hung up the phone, basking in this tremendous surprise. The other side said they would respond as soon as possible after consulting with Wen Qingyan!","The director had previously contacted Wen Qingyan, and although he knew this actor usually doesn't accept variety shows, he still wanted to give it a try.","What if?","Sure enough, they immediately refused, but since he had anticipated this, he wasn't too disappointed.","However, not long after, Wen Qingyan's agent contacted him again, asking about the guest invitation situation, and said that Wen Qingyan would respond to his previous invitation after the final guest list was confirmed.","If it were anyone else, this would indeed be arrogant, especially considering he was a renowned director in the variety show circle.","But this was Wen Qingyan, who had been winning major awards since his teens. Even a glimmer of hope was exciting for the director!","Now it seems the chances are even greater!","No variety show could possibly invite Hengjing's CEO, Startrack's CEO, and Best Actor Wen simultaneously, but he might be able to pull it off!","This variety show will definitely be a hit!","On the other side, the person called 'Mr. Li' turned and knocked on the door.","The room door opened, and Wen Qingyan stood at the doorway, still holding a script in his hand.","\"Great Actor Wen, the director of that family variety show called earlier. Jing Zejun has confirmed her participation in the show.\"","\"Then reply to the director that I'll participate,\" Wen Qingyan said without hesitation, leaving his agent beside him quite speechless.","He even felt that Wen Qingyan didn't know what kind of variety show this was, only hearing that Jing Zejun would be participating.","From Wen Qingyan's youth, he had been by this person's side, from his first hit drama, being signed by 'Startrack', to becoming the Best Actor. He had always been Wen Qingyan's agent.","So he understood all too well why Wen Qingyan would have such an attitude.","The agent crossed his arms and leaned against the door frame.","\"I say, Best Actor Wen, are you sure you understand the theme of this variety show? This is a family variety show, so when Miss Jing participates, she won't be alone. She'll be bringing her family along. Aren't you afraid your feelings will be discovered?\"","Wen Qingyan's lips curved slightly upward, carrying a faint smile, as gentle as a spring breeze.","If he cared about Jing Zejun's family or netizens finding out, he wouldn't participate in this variety show, \"If I don't get close to her, will she even remember who I am?\"","In the entertainment industry, even if people live and eat together for several months, once work is over, relationships often cool down quickly.","Moreover, after \"Jun Lin\", it had been difficult for Wen Qingyan to find opportunities to collaborate with Jing Zejun.","They hadn't seen each other for a long time.","The agent rolled his eyes, not wanting to see his worthless expression.","\"So, are you planning to bring your uncle and aunt to participate in the show?\"","Wen Qingyan was an only child, and apart from his uncle and aunt, he really didn't know who else this person planned to bring to this family variety show.","Wen Qingyan shook his head, putting down the script in his hand, \"No, I'm bringing my cousin.\" His parents weren't comfortable in front of cameras, and besides, if they met Jing Zejun, his parents would be the first to notice his feelings.","The cousin Wen Qingyan mentioned was his uncle's child, who had basically grown up following him around. He felt more at ease bringing this kid along.","Regarding Wen Qingyan's feelings, the agent had known for quite some time and had even prepared a PR plan for when the relationship went public.","Wen Qingyan's career path was different from others in the entertainment industry. He had become the Best Actor at a young age and had maintained that status for many years.","Although in terms of age, Wen Qingyan was still considered relatively young in the entertainment circle, most of those at his level were twenty or thirty years older than him.","No scandals, no gossip, purely focused on acting... Wen Qingyan had become a very different kind of star in the entertainment industry.","The agent's PR plan didn't require much effort. Wen Qingyan had always focused on his acting career, unlike idol stars, and didn't need many restrictions on his love life.","As for the fans, it could only be said that because Wen Qingyan had dragged it out for so long, now his big fans vaguely knew that their idol might have someone in his heart.","However, until now, this plan had never been activated...","After \"Jun Lin\" ended, Wen Qingyan said the timing wasn't right, as it would make Jing Zejun think he was too deeply immersed in his role.","When the CP fans exploded, he again said the timing wasn't right, as the fans' attention was too high, which also wasn't a good time.","He thought Wen Qingyan would always be like this, silently guarding as a knight behind the scenes.","Now that she had become a wealthy heiress, the threshold for potential suitors had risen significantly. Did he now think the timing was right?","Wen Qingyan had always worried about causing trouble for Jing Zejun. The agent was right; he had always been overly cautious, but now he didn't need to worry. She had the Jing family behind her, with enough capital to protect her...","The agent asked curiously, \"Aren't you afraid her parents won't approve of you?\"","That's the Jing family we're talking about, ranking high even on the global rich list. Not to mention Hengjing Group's reputation, even 'Startrack' under Jing Zeqian's leadership firmly held a top position in the entertainment industry.","Now Wen Qingyan was coveting their precious daughter. How could it be that easy?","Wen Qingyan's brows revealed composure, not worried about the situation the agent described.","Let's not mention that Jing Zejun's second brother was his boss. He understood Jing Zeqian's character well, otherwise he wouldn't have stayed with 'Startrack' for so many years.","From Jing Zeqian's character, it was likely that the Jing family wouldn't be the type to judge people based on wealth or status.","What he needed to consider most was Jing Zejun's attitude. No matter whose daughter she was, or which family's heiress, to Wen Qingyan, she was just Jing Zejun, the person he knew, nothing more.","The agent pursed his lips. This guy was putting on that face again, always making him cringe, \"Everyone else is going for a family variety show, only you, old man, are going for a dating show.\"","Now that variety show director is really going to be over the moon...","Old man?","Wen Qingyan casually lifted his eyelids, glancing at the agent, \"Just a reminder, I was recently nominated for a youth achievement award.\"","The agent scoffed dismissively. He hadn't seen him care about age before, but when it came to Jing Zejun, he wished he could make himself a few years younger."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Guests of Variety Shows","paragraphs":["The talent managers from Startrack Entertainment Company were reporting their work to Jing Zeqian.","\"You're saying Wen Qingyan is planning to accept that variety show again?\" Hadn't he refused before?","Jing Zeqian looked up at Wen Qingyan's manager, his gaze inquisitive.","The manager seemed a bit nervous and quickly smiled, trying to cover for Wen Qingyan, \"Yes, but I thought since he's been filming movies for the past few years without much rest, I persuaded him to give it a try. Especially knowing that you'll be there too, so he finally agreed.\"","Jing Zeqian glanced at him, then continued listening to the next person's report.","The manager couldn't tell if Jing Zeqian believed his explanation, but he had done his best to cover for Wen Qingyan.","Jing Zeqian, however, found it strange that the company's artists were behaving unusually lately.","First, there was Jiang Miaomiao, who usually prioritized scripts and production teams, but had started accepting jobs with high popularity but low quality.","Recently, she had been arranging work through her manager, and while Jing Zeqian knew she was busy with work, he wasn't clear on the specifics.","Then there was Wen Qingyan, who had never accepted a variety show before, but was now taking part in a family-oriented one.","Wait, he remembered that Wen Qingyan was an only child, wasn't he?","Jing Zeqian looked up at the manager again and asked, \"Who is Wen Qingyan planning to bring to the show?\"","The manager tensed up internally but smiled and said, \"He's bringing his cousin.\"","Bringing a cousin for a variety show?","Jing Zeqian frowned and clicked his tongue. What were these people thinking lately? But he didn't ask further, as Wen Qingyan and Jiang Miaomiao were quite different cases.","Jiang Miaomiao was someone he had mentored, and in the beginning, he used to review and approve her scripts and work.","So even now, Jing Zeqian instinctively cared about Jiang Miaomiao's work.","Wen Qingyan, on the other hand, was already an established A-list actor before joining the company.","Over the years, Wen Qingyan had been very clear about his career path, so Jing Zeqian hadn't paid much attention to the work he accepted.","The manager glanced discreetly at Jing Zeqian, who was now listening to others' reports.","The manager finally breathed a sigh of relief, thinking he had probably passed this hurdle.","...","That night, the programmers at Weibo were working overtime because the platform had \"crashed\" again.","At 8 PM, a family variety show's official account posted a video, officially announcing the show's guests.","Jing Zeyou, Jing Zeqian, Wen Qingyan... The variety show quickly became a trending topic.","[Am I blind? I never thought I'd see Wen Qingyan on a variety show in my lifetime?!]","[It's really Wen Qingyan?! I thought the show was just teasing us!]","[Jing You's brother is coming out too? The Hengjing CEO?!]","[That's Wen Qingyan we're talking about! I'll definitely be glued to my screen!]","[So the Film Emperor Wen is really doing a variety show?!]","[Sister? Is Jing You referring to that fake heiress?]","[They seem to have a pretty good relationship from the looks of it.]","[It's just for show, probably because the public opinion has affected Hengjing, so they're doing this variety show to improve their image.]","[Affected Hengjing? Are you drunk or still sleeping? Do you think Hengjing is some small workshop you've seen before?]","[I won't comment on the rest, but just the fact that Hengjing's CEO is participating means this show is already a big win!]","With the variety show set to start live broadcasting in a few days, the Jing family had no time to read netizens' comments.","Jing Zeyou was arranging company matters for when he'd be away, trying to resolve as much work as possible for the next few days.","Jing Zeqian was coordinating with the variety show team. Not only would his family members participate, but artists from his company would also be there, so some details needed to be clarified.","Meanwhile, Jing Zejun and Jing Yi were busy helping Lin Ruiqing and her husband pack their things, as they were ready to set off on their trip.","Just after seeing them off, the director and his team arrived the next day.","\"Miss Jing, hello!\" Director Xu seemed a bit nervous.","He had started feeling uneasy the moment he stepped into the Jing family's estate. Even though he had filmed in many celebrities' homes before, he was still shocked upon entering the Jing residence.","What amazed him wasn't the size of the villa, but the vastness of the courtyard. He and his team had walked for a full ten minutes! Especially considering this was in the prime area of North river!","As they entered, they went through various security checks. Not just him, but the team behind him was also treading carefully.","\"Director Xu.\"","Jing Zejun stepped forward to greet the director.","Director Xu then noticed Jing Yi behind her. If Jing Zejun could be described as gentle, Jing Yi leaned more towards the sweet type.","With her crescent-moon shaped eyes, she smiled at him as she greeted, \"Director Xu.\"","\"Hello, hello! Nice to meet you, Miss Jing Yi!\" It was the Jing Yi who had been at the center of recent discussions.","After some small talk, the camera crew behind them started setting up the filming equipment.","Jing Zejun looked at Uncle Li standing behind her, and he stepped forward with a polite smile.","\"May I accompany them?\"","\"Of course! Of course!\"","Director Xu nodded quickly. He knew that families like the Jings would be more conscious about such matters.","Seeing Uncle Li following the crew, Director Xu then looked at Aunt Wang, who was bringing in tea and snacks.","He hesitated a bit, \"It's like this, Miss Jing. Since this is a family variety show, although we didn't specify that families can't have housekeepers who cook, it would be better if you could cook by yourselves...\"","\"Director Xu, please just call me Zejun. As for Aunt Wang...\" Jing Zejun turned to look at Jing Yi.","Jing Zejun understood the director's point. If Aunt Wang helped with cooking, they would miss out on a lot of filming material. But Jing Yi loved Aunt Wang's cooking the most...","She looked at Jing Yi, wanting to ask for her opinion.","Although Jing Yi was a bit reluctant, she didn't want to make things difficult for the production team. She nodded slightly, and only then did Jing Zejun indicate that they wouldn't rely on Aunt Wang during the recording period.","Director Xu noticed the eye contact between the two and was a bit surprised. It seemed the outside world's speculations were somewhat off the mark.","\"Is there anything else you'd like to instruct, Miss... Zejun?\"","After all, this was the Jing family's home. Even if he wasn't familiar with Hengjing, he knew about Startrack. If there were any taboos, this variety show might not just fail to become popular, it might not even see the light of day.","\"There is one thing.\"","Director Xu sat up straight, his nerves on edge.","\"My eldest brother might still have some matters to attend to at the company, so his screen time might not be very long these few days.\"","Director Xu quickly said, \"That's no problem! Of course, Mr. Jing's schedule takes priority!\"","Let alone short screen time, even if Jing Zeyou only appeared once briefly, he would be overwhelmed with gratitude. How could he dare to have any other thoughts?","Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"Then I'll trouble Director Xu with this.\"","\"...Is that the only point?\"","Director Xu was slightly stunned. He had prepared to take notes on several pages of instructions, but there was only this one point?!","He knew that when he went to film other celebrities, there were always more than just one point.","The Jing family was indeed more easy-going than he had imagined."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Lost","paragraphs":["\"Shen Xixi, where exactly is this place you mentioned? I've been driving around this street for half an hour and still haven't seen it,\" Jing Yi said as she slowly drove down the street, looking around for the place Shen Xi had described.","Not only had she not found the place, but she hadn't seen Shen Xi either.","\"Yi-yi! I'm so sorry, my car was hit! I haven't arrived yet, I'm waiting for someone to come tow the car,\" Shen Xi replied.","Jing Yi immediately asked with concern, \"Are you alright?!\"","There was some noise in the background, making it difficult for Jing Yi to hear Shen Xi clearly. \"I'm... I'm fine. The car was just parked on the side of the road when it got hit. I wasn't hurt.\"","It was hard to say whether this was lucky or unlucky.","Shen Xi had already left in her car and was passing by a familiar dessert shop. She had planned to buy some treats to bring along, but just as she came out with her purchases, she heard a loud crash.","She looked up to see her car had been badly dented.","She couldn't imagine how fast the other car must have been going to damage her parked car like that!","Hearing that Shen Xi was unharmed, Jing Yi felt somewhat relieved. Looking at the street signs, she asked, \"Should I come pick you up?\"","\"No need, you're already far from here, and I've already contacted my family's driver to come get me,\" Shen Xi replied. She then added, \"Oh, by the way! If you're already in the area, you could check out that amusement park. It's quite lively over there.\"","Even though she couldn't go herself, she didn't want Jing Yi to have come all this way for nothing.","Jing Yi sighed and pulled over to the side of the road.","\"Don't worry about me. Besides, what's the point of going alone? Since you have something come up, I'll just head home. We can meet up another time.\"","Jing Yi peered out of the car window. This place hardly looked lively; there were only a few people on the street.","\"Alright then, let's go out another time!\" Shen Xi agreed.","\"Okay, take care,\" Jing Yi said as she hung up the phone. She looked around again, her almond-shaped eyes filled with confusion.","She had followed Shen Xi's directions exactly, but she couldn't see the giant Ferris wheel or the shopping mall with the huge display screen that Shen Xi had mentioned.","Where she was standing now was just a large empty lot. Forget about a mall, this looked more like a demolition site...","Had she gotten lost?","Jing Yi felt a headache coming on. She was about to start filming for a variety show soon and had just wanted to go out with Shen Xi for a bit. Now it seemed she had been too optimistic.","She might as well use the GPS!","Without further ado, Jing Yi tapped a few times on the car's display screen to navigate her way home.","As the navigation voice started, Jing Yi started the car and set off again.","Watching the trees along the road whiz by, Jing Yi drove through the wide highway and entered a quieter area.","'Please continue on the current road. In 500 meters, turn left onto a small road.'","Jing Yi looked at the road signs with some doubt. Not only was this completely different from the way she had come, but she didn't recognize any of the buildings either.","However, she hadn't been in North River for long, so she wasn't about to challenge the authority of the GPS just yet.","Following the navigation instructions, Jing Yi spotted the small road it mentioned. She skillfully turned the steering wheel, guiding the vehicle smoothly around the corner.","Meanwhile, on the small road the GPS had directed Jing Yi towards, an ambush was taking place.","\"Boss, that car has stopped. Should we get out?\"","The man in the back seat smacked him hard on the head, his tone vicious: \"Are you in a hurry to reincarnate?!\"","The speaker shrank his neck, quietly waiting for the man to speak.","\"The client hired us to teach him a lesson. Even though they said to be rough, if we actually kill someone, we'll be the ones going to jail!\"","The man narrowed his eyes, staring intently at the black sedan in front.","The underling who had spoken earlier quietly added, \"But it doesn't look like there are any security cameras around here.\" The man looked around suspiciously, and indeed, the area seemed somewhat abandoned, not the type of place likely to have surveillance.","But he couldn't afford to be careless. He knew that the person sitting in that sedan was Shen Huaichu, who had been the talk of the town recently.","Just judging by the director's methods lately, it was clear that this was no ordinary person.","Even if there were only two people in that car, it wouldn't be easy.","\"Boss, is that really Shen Huaichu from Huarui Group?\" one of the underlings asked.","The man glared at him fiercely. \"Are you blind?! Didn't you see him get in the car earlier?!\"","The underling rubbed his nose. He had seen it, but he hadn't expected the boss to actually take on that woman's job.","\"Tell the boys to grab their gear and get out of the car!\"","\"Yes, boss!\"","No matter how extraordinary the target might be, they had to get out and deal with it. They were paid to do a job, after all!","Shen Huaichu watched the two cars surrounding them, his cold eyes filled with impatience.","He hated this kind of car chase. The moment the sedan had accelerated, he had already become irritated.","Shen Huaichu told the driver to stop the car, and the two vans behind them pulled up as well.","At this point, there was no movement from the vans. They were probably discussing how to deal with him.","Shen Huaichu closed his eyes, leaning his neck against the back of the seat.","The driver in the front seat tentatively asked, \"Mr. Shen, should I go out and deal with them first?\" Indeed, Shen Huaichu's driver was also his bodyguard.","Shen Huaichu parted his thin lips slightly, \"Let's see what they want to do first.\"","\"Understood.\"","The bodyguard turned around, keeping a close eye on the surrounding vehicles.","The doors of both vans opened, and several burly men carrying clubs got out and gathered in front of Shen Huaichu's car door.","The bodyguard tensed up. Until Shen Huaichu gave the order, he couldn't take action, but faced with this aggressive group, his body had already instinctively reacted.","The middle-aged man called \"Boss\" stood in the middle of the group. There were six men in total, all carrying wooden clubs.","\"Mr. Shen, please step out of the car.\"","Shen Huaichu slowly opened his eyes. Even in this tense situation, his gaze remained completely indifferent.","\"Get out,\" he said.","The bodyguard was the first to open the driver's side door. The thugs waiting outside instinctively took a step back, earning a fierce glare from their boss.","Then the six men watched as the bodyguard went to open the back door, and Shen Huaichu leisurely emerged from inside.","The middle-aged man seemed somewhat annoyed, gritting his teeth as he said, \"Mr. Shen really is calm under pressure, isn't he?\" Even in this situation, he remained so unruffled.","What an act! Soon enough, they'd have him crawling on the ground like a dog!","But Shen Huaichu truly didn't take these few men seriously at all, nor did he intend to say another word to them.","He had only gotten out of the car to get some air because the earlier speed had given him a slight headache.","\"It seems Mr. Shen already knows why we're here. Aren't you curious about who hired us?\"","Shen Huaichu gave him a bland look, his pupils devoid of any warmth.","Who hired them? The identity of whoever hired these men made no difference to him; the outcome would be the same.","His gaze shifted to his bodyguard, who immediately understood Shen Huaichu's meaning. He nodded, turned to face the group, and rolled up his sleeves.","The group also tightened their grip on their wooden clubs, eyeing the bodyguard warily. The big showdown was about to begin."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: First Meeting","paragraphs":["Jing Yi followed the navigation into a small road.","Looking at the unfamiliar path ahead, she felt increasingly lost, and her driving speed gradually slowed down.","Is this really the way home? Maybe I should turn back, at least that way was a main road. This path is getting more and more remote.","But before she could turn around, several cars entered her field of vision.","Jing Yi looked at the group of people holding wooden sticks and had a bad feeling.","Oh no! Did I accidentally enter gang territory? I need to leave quickly!","At the same time, Shen Huaichu and his group also noticed the black sports car that had intruded. Before she could turn around, the boss on the other side sent two underlings to intercept her.","\"Boss, it's a woman.\"","\"Make her get out of the car.\"","Shen Huaichu expressionlessly looked at the car that had intruded. He wanted to see what other tricks those people had up their sleeves.","The underlings who came over had already blocked the front of the car and the car door with their wooden sticks. Jing Yi sighed, feeling like there was no way to escape.","The way these people were positioned, it seemed like if she dared to drive away, the wooden sticks would immediately smash down on her car.","If the car got dented, Jing Zeqian would probably forbid her from going out again.","She could only play it by ear.","Jing Yi opened the car door, forced a smile, and looked at the menacing thugs, \"Gentlemen, I'm just passing through. I accidentally entered here and had no intention of getting involved in your business.\"","The two underlings blocked her with their sticks, gesturing for her to walk towards Shen Huaichu's direction.","\"Stop talking nonsense! Get over there!\"","A flash of irritation crossed Jing Yi's eyes, but she still stepped towards the group of people gathered there.","After walking over, Jing Yi saw Shen Huaichu surrounded by them.","So these people were trying to ambush this rich young master? He's quite handsome, actually, just lacking in expression.","\"Who are you?\" The gang leader spoke up.","Jing Yi turned to look at him and said obediently, \"Sir, I'm just passing through and accidentally entered here. I had absolutely no intention of disturbing you. Don't worry, I didn't see anything and I didn't hear anything.\"","Jing Yi wanted to resolve this situation quickly and go home to rest. She had to record a variety show tomorrow, and staying here to watch them fight would be a waste of time.","\"Passing through?\" In this remote area, who would just happen to be passing by?!","The leader's voice was full of doubt.","Jing Yi was also getting impatient. Was this her fault? That stupid navigation system led her here, she was helpless too!","She'd uninstall that useless navigation app when she got back!","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu, standing in front of his car, had a hint of curiosity flash through his cold eyes.","Passing through?","He was more inclined to believe that this was another person sent to act in front of him, playing the hero to save the beauty?","Shen Huaichu narrowed his eyes slightly, discreetly observing the girl in front of him.","Her long black curly hair cascaded over her shoulders, and her bright black eyes were still smiling, with a pair of dimples, one deep and one shallow, at the corners of her mouth.","If Shen Huaichu hadn't noticed the impatience in her eyes, he might have believed that the person in front of him was a pure, innocent girl.","Jing Yi noticed Shen Huaichu's scrutiny. Great, now she had become a suspect to both parties.","If she had known this would happen, she would have consulted the fortune-telling before leaving home. Then neither she nor Shen Xi would have been so unlucky?!","One had her car hit while parked on the roadside, and the other got ambushed because of the navigation system. It really was a terrible day to go out!","\"Yes, just passing through.\"","\"Who are you trying to fool?! You ignore the main road and choose to 'pass through' these small paths?!\" One of the underlings rushed out, yelling at Jing Yi.","Jing Yi glanced at him, the corners of her mouth slightly raised, but her tone had lost its previous gentleness.","\"Gentlemen, I said I was passing through, so I was passing through.\"","Otherwise, was she sick in the head to come alone and get involved in their dispute?","\"Mr. Shen, this isn't your backup, is it?\" The leader's tone was sarcastic, and the underlings behind him laughed mockingly, \"Boss, would anyone use a woman as backup? Hahahahaha\"","Shen Huaichu still remained coldly silent. The leader on the opposite side seemed to feel he was being mocked.","He waved his hand at three people, \"Go get them!\" The bodyguards beside Shen Huaichu moved to stand in front of him.","Someone really did charge at Jing Yi right from the start. She immediately tensed her body and turned to dodge.","Only Shen Huaichu remained calmly leaning against the car door, watching the chaos unfold before him.","Or rather, watching Jing Yi.","The underling who charged at Jing Yi had bulging muscles, like a small mountain.","His eyes were full of provocation as he swung his stick at Jing Yi.","Watching this scene, Shen Huaichu didn't take any action, as if whether that underling or Jing Yi lived or died had nothing to do with him.","Jing Yi moved quickly, nimbly avoiding the underling's attack.","Her movements were swift and powerful, like a cheetah chasing its prey. The underling, in contrast, seemed clumsy. His attacks were repeatedly dodged skillfully by Jing Yi, and he gradually became enraged, swinging his stick with more force.","Suddenly, Jing Yi launched an attack, her heavy punch striking the underling's face directly.","The underling staggered back a few steps, his eyes full of surprise, as if he hadn't expected this seemingly delicate girl to have such strength.","Jing Yi didn't stop there. She continued to attack another underling who had rushed over, hitting him again and again.","The person being hit began to look weak, gritting his teeth as he charged again, a flash of fear passing through his eyes.","As Jing Yi was dealing with the person in front of her, she didn't notice another person swinging a stick at her from behind. She instinctively raised her arm to block it.","\"Tss!\" She delivered a flying kick, knocking the underling to the ground.","Jing Yi clutched her arm, her eyes showing a hint of coldness. Should she be thankful that they were using sticks?","If it had been a sharper weapon, her arm would probably be soaked in blood by now.","The bodyguards quickly dealt with the remaining people. The opposing leader collapsed on the ground, panting heavily, his face already bruised black and blue, his whole body aching.","He couldn't believe that they couldn't even beat two people on the other side, let alone the fact that Shen Huaichu had leisurely watched them get beaten the whole time!","And that woman who was \"just passing through\"!","The leader looked at the two underlings lying on the ground beside her. Passing through and still beating his men so viciously?!","Seeing that the fight was over, the bodyguard returned to stand quietly behind Shen Huaichu, as if the person who had just fought so fiercely wasn't him.","\"Mr. Shen, don't you want to know who sent us to teach you a lesson?!\" The leader still seemed unwilling to give up. Compared to losing the fight, Shen Huaichu's indifference seemed even more insulting to him!","Shen Huaichu stopped his steps back to the car, slowly walked towards him, looking down at him with eyes still devoid of any emotion.","\"No need. Call the police.\"","The leader stared in disbelief. They had been beaten like this, and now he was calling the police?!"]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Arrogant and Rude Guy","paragraphs":["Jing Yi stood to the side, scrutinizing Shen Huaichu from a distance.","From earlier until now, Jing Yi had only heard him say four words.","'Don't want to, call the police.'","So this guy could actually speak, he wasn't mute after all?","If he wasn't mute, then Jing Yi felt somewhat annoyed. This person had been acting like a big shot the whole time, leisurely watching them fight as if it were some kind of performance.","But what could she do when the other side had bodyguards? He didn't need to lift a finger, and even got to enjoy a good show.","Jing Yi shook her hand and was about to return to her car when the bodyguard from before blocked her path.","She clenched her fist, her gaze turning sharp, as if waiting for the opponent to make a move so she could counterattack.","She had noticed the bodyguard's skill earlier. If it really came to blows, there was a good chance she wouldn't be able to escape unscathed.","The bodyguard remained motionless, so Jing Yi shifted her gaze to Shen Huaichu. His face was still as cold as ice - what a waste of a handsome face!","\"If you have something to say, spit it out! This young lady is very busy!\"","At this point, Jing Yi had completely run out of patience. The stinging pain on her arm was still reminding her of today's unwarranted disaster.","Shen Huaichu stepped forward, examining the person in front of him. \"Who are you?\"","Jing Yi looked up, meeting his indifferent gaze. Her pink lips slowly uttered a few words.","\"None of your damn business!\"","The bodyguard discreetly glanced at Shen Huaichu, only looking away when he saw no reaction.","Shen Huaichu didn't seem angered by Jing Yi's attitude. Instead, the curiosity in his eyes deepened.","Judging from the car and Jing Yi's attire, she certainly didn't look like a girl from an ordinary family.","He continued to ask, \"Who sent you?\"","Who sent her? What did he mean? This guy must have watched too many spy movies!","Jing Yi's delicate brows furrowed slightly, a hint of irritation creeping across her face. She looked up at Shen Huaichu.","\"I thought you were just mute before, but now I see you might be deaf. I said I was passing by. Don't you understand what 'passing by' means?\"","Did he really think she was putting on some heroic damsel-in-distress act for him?","Shen Huaichu didn't say whether he believed her or not. His deep, indifferent eyes remained fixed on Jing Yi, as if trying to discern truth from falsehood through his gaze alone.","Jing Yi didn't back down either, facing his scrutiny head-on. Her clear, round black eyes glared back at him.","An indescribable emotion flickered in Shen Huaichu's eyes. \"Let her go.\" He had only had the bodyguard stop Jing Yi to confirm that she truly had nothing to do with this incident.","Jing Yi glared at Shen Huaichu one last time, her body relaxing a bit. She had really been afraid of getting into a physical confrontation with that bodyguard.","She returned to her car and, after turning around, glanced at Shen Huaichu once more. She sighed, thinking what an impolite and self-important person he was. She had gone out of her way to help, more or less, and he couldn't even say thank you.","Jing Yi huffed, turned the steering wheel, and drove off.","Shen Huaichu watched her car disappear into the distance and said in a low voice, \"Look into her identity.\" Letting Jing Yi go didn't mean Shen Huaichu truly believed her words. In all matters, one still needed to see the evidence.","The bodyguard followed behind him, respectfully nodding his head. \"Yes, sir!\"","After giving his orders, Shen Huaichu turned to get back into the car. As he walked, he passed by the men lying on the ground without sparing them a single glance.","Shen Huaichu's vehicle also left the secluded neighborhood. Within minutes, police cars arrived. The men on the ground tried to get up and flee, but they had been beaten too badly to move.","...","At the Jing family home, Uncle Li was reporting to Jing Zeyou about matters related to the reality show filming.","This included how many pieces of equipment the camera crew had installed and their specific locations. Of course, no equipment had been installed in places like bedrooms and studies - that was the reason Uncle Li was accompanying them.","Jing Zeyou nodded, indicating he understood.","Jing Zeyou looked up at all the equipment around the house. Some of it looked familiar to him, and the Hengjing logo was quite noticeable.","\"Did Little Yi go out today?\"","Jing Zeyou hadn't seen her all day. In the morning, he had thought she was still asleep, but by lunchtime, he still hadn't caught sight of her.","\"Yes, Miss Yi left early this morning.\"","Jing Zeyou nodded, somewhat surprised that she actually had a day where she got up and went out early.","After Uncle Li finished his report and walked out of the hall, he saw Jing Yi approaching. He gave a slight nod in greeting.","\"Miss Yi, you're back?\"","\"Uncle Li.\" Jing Yi quickly put on a smile.","Walking into the living room, she saw Jing Zeyou sitting on the sofa. A flash of panic crossed her eyes.","Jing Zeyou, who happened to be looking her way, caught it.","\"Big brother, you didn't go to work today?\"","Jing Zeyou nodded slightly, looking at Jing Yi. \"Mm, we're recording the reality show tomorrow, so I'm preparing a bit at home. You went out early this morning?\"","\"Yeah, I went out with Xixi for a bit.\"","[If I had known going out early would lead to such an unlucky encounter, I definitely wouldn't have set foot outside the living room! I need to hurry upstairs before Big Brother notices something's wrong!]","Unlucky encounter? Jing Zeyou didn't know what exactly Jing Yi was trying to hide from him.","\"Big brother, I'm going upstairs first.\"","Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents as she pretended nothing had happened, lifting her foot to head upstairs.","But Jing Zeyou called out to stop her.","\"Little Yi.\"","Jing Yi's heart skipped a beat as she frantically tried to figure out why Jing Zeyou had called her back.","Beside her, Jing Zeyou didn't expose her secret, but he was concerned about whether she had encountered some trouble while out.","He probed, \"Where did you two go to play today?\"","Jing Yi hesitated for a moment. \"Oh? Just, just a nearby amusement park.\"","[It should be an amusement park, right? Though I never actually found the place Xixi mentioned...]","\"Is that so? Was it fun?\"","Jing Yi let out a few awkward laughs. \"Yeah, it was pretty fun, haha...\"","[So fun that my hand still hurts. Damn! That whole area must be bruised by now!]","Jing Zeyou shifted his gaze to her arm. When she had come back, Jing Yi seemed to have deliberately hidden that hand behind her back, which was somewhat suspicious.","\"What happened to your hand?\" Jing Zeyou asked directly, catching Jing Yi off guard.","She was about to brush it off when Jing Zeyou spoke again, \"Come here, let me see.\" His voice carried an undeniable firmness.","Jing Yi stood at the foot of the stairs, her eyes betraying her panic, looking every bit like a child caught doing something wrong.","She slowly walked to Jing Zeyou's side and gradually extended one hand.","Jing Zeyou glanced at her. \"The other one.\"","[Ah, I've been found out...]","She finally brought out the hand from behind her back, lightly biting her lip, her eyes filled with nervousness.","Jing Zeyou rolled up her sleeve, revealing a deep purple-blue bruise. It was clearly the result of being hit.","Seeing Jing Yi's injury, Jing Zeyou's brows furrowed tightly.","\"Is this what you call 'nothing happened'?\"","The bruise was dark and severe, its blue-purple hue standing out starkly against her originally fair skin."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Be Yourself, Be a Little More Wild","paragraphs":["Jing Yi insisted it was just a minor injury, not worth going to the hospital for. Only then did Jing Zeyou bring out the first aid kit and ice pack from home to apply cold compression.","\"What happened?\" Jing Zeyou asked while tending to her wound with the ice pack. His furrowed brow showed no sign of relaxing. Perceiving Jing Yi's thoughts, he glanced up at her.","\"Tell me honestly.\"","Jing Yi pursed her lips and stammered, \"I just accidentally ran into a group of people fighting. I wasn't careful and got hurt a bit.\"","\"Where did you encounter them?\"","Bringing this up made Jing Yi quite exasperated. \"It was all because of that stupid navigation system. I don't know where it led me, which is how I ran into those people. Big brother, you should really remove that car's navigation system as soon as possible!\"","Jing Zeyou found it amusing to see her little face looking so fierce. Even with such a severe hand injury, she still had the energy to worry about other things.","Jing Zeyou's hands were very gentle as he applied the ice. Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents as she watched him seriously treating her wound.","[Big brother is just too gentle.]","Jing Zeyou's movements paused briefly before he continued asking: \"Who were those people?\"","Jing Yi recalled the man standing in front of the car. Her eyes narrowed slightly as a feeling of dislike rose in her heart, evident even in her tone of voice.","\"Someone without manners!\"","From Jing Yi's account, Jing Zeyou learned of a somewhat handsome man who appeared to be a wealthy young master with status, but was cold and impolite, being surrounded by thugs.","The men surrounding him were all brawn and no brains, only daring to wield wooden sticks.","Jing Zeyou glanced up at her. Did she expect them to be carrying knives instead?","But Jing Yi was too caught up in her story to notice Jing Zeyou's look.","\"Big brother, you don't know how sour his face was! Even though I just stumbled in by accident, I still helped him take down two guys. Not only did he not thank me, he even questioned who sent me! Can you believe how ridiculous that is?!\"","Jing Zeyou quietly applied medicine to her wound as he listened. Her words brought to mind images of various young masters from wealthy families.","The surrounded man must have some status in North river, otherwise he wouldn't have questioned Jing Yi's identity. But the fact that he didn't immediately recognize her meant he was either not important enough to know the Jing family, or he had only recently returned.","Recently returned... For some reason, a particular person suddenly flashed through Jing Zeyou's mind.","\"Even though his bodyguards could have handled those men without me, I won't try to take credit for saving him. But he actually suspected I was sent by his enemies! With his attitude, even though he was kind of handsome, he really lets his imagination run wild!\"","The more Jing Yi spoke, the more agitated she became. This was the first time since coming to the Jing family that Jing Zeyou had heard her talk so much. It seemed she really did dislike that person.","What started as asking her to explain the whole situation had now turned into her one-sided venting. Jing Zeyou could only listen silently to her complaints.","And just how handsome was this guy? She didn't forget to mention it even while complaining.","\"Didn't you hear what those men called him?\"","Jing Yi thought back to the scene. The leader was lying on the ground, weakly saying something like, \"Mr. So-and-so, don't you want to know who sent me to teach you a lesson?\"","\"I couldn't hear clearly what he said, but it sounded like some kind of boss title.\"","The leader had already been beaten black and blue, so his voice was very faint. Jing Yi hadn't caught it clearly.","Jing Zeyou could only let it go, but he made a mental note to have someone look into it later. Although Jing Yi said it wasn't directed at her, it was better to be safe than sorry.","Looking at the wounds on Jing Yi's hand, he still felt concerned. \"Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital to have it checked?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, looking unconcerned.","\"It's fine, just a small injury. It'll heal in two or three days. Besides, didn't you already treat it for me, big brother?\"","[When I first started learning Sanda, I got even worse injuries than this, and it was fine.]","Seeing how nonchalant Jing Yi was, a flash of heartache passed through Jing Zeyou's eyes.","If it were any other girl who had suffered such a severe injury, they probably wouldn't have been able to bear it. But she always tried to shoulder everything herself, afraid of worrying others.","Jing Zeyou suddenly felt a bit guilty.","Before Jing Yi came to the Jing family, Jing Zeyou had never thought he owed her anything. The family had provided money, and Grandma Jing had raised her.","But now he felt that perhaps because she grew up with just grandmother, without other close relatives, she had always been afraid of troubling others, unwilling to let anyone worry about her.","She even hid her dangerous hobbies, simply because she didn't want them to worry.","When she was living with Grandma Jing, he had never met Jing Yi. He only knew she was a girl grandmother was very fond of. Grandmother didn't often speak of Jing Yi, but Jing Zeyou could see her affection for the girl.","Jing Yi never owed the Jing family anything. On the contrary, it was because of the Jing family that she was drawn into this mess.","She could have been enjoying a carefree life abroad, not having to worry about anyone's opinion of her Sanda or racing. Now that she had come to the Jing family, she was caught up in all sorts of speculation and comments from netizens.","Jing Yi often said it was the Jing family who raised her, but it was only Grandma Jing who raised her. The money was Grandma Jing's money, which had nothing to do with the Jing family. Instead, it was Jing Yi who had always treated every member of the Jing family with a grateful heart.","It was she who suggested the family health check-up, which discovered the hidden danger in Jing's mother's body. It was also she who first sensed Jing Zejun was in danger and single-handedly went to rescue him.","What had the Jing family really given her?","Jing Zeyou felt they hadn't given her anything. If anything, they had only brought her burdens...","Jing Yi pulled down her sleeve and noticed Jing Zeyou seemed to be lost in thought. She asked curiously, \"Big brother, what's wrong?\"","Jing Zeyou snapped back to reality, resuming his usual demeanor. \"It's nothing. I was just wondering if your hand is really alright.\"","Jing Yi smiled brightly, her dimples showing clearly. \"Don't worry, it's fine. But big brother, whatever you do, don't tell second brother about this!\"","[If Jing Zeqian finds out, he'll be hard to deal with.]","For some reason, ever since the incident with Jing Zejun at the hotel, Jing Zeqian had developed a somewhat 'motherly' attitude that even Jing Yi found difficult to handle.","She glanced cautiously upstairs, worried that Jing Zeqian might suddenly come down.","The corners of Jing Zeyou's mouth turned up. \"Zeqian hasn't come back yet.\"","Hearing this, Jing Yi breathed a sigh of relief, patting her chest. \"That's good! That's good!\"","Seeing Jing Yi's alert posture as if facing a formidable enemy, Jing Zeyou was about to say a few good words on behalf of his brother, but after some thought, he swallowed his words.","Better not. Say too much and he might turn into a mother hen himself.","\"Well then, big brother, I'll go upstairs to rest?\"","Jing Zeyou nodded, watching Jing Yi's retreating figure. He couldn't help but call out to her.","\"Yi Yi.\"","Jing Yi turned back, puzzled. Jing Zeyou's deep eyes held a rare touch of tenderness.","His tone was gentle. \"No matter what kind of Jing Yi you are, the family will love you. When it comes to being yourself, you can be a bit more unrestrained.\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: Dear Family","paragraphs":["The reality show \"Dear Family\" goes live.","At 7 AM, the number of viewers flooding into the livestream was already threatening to crash the broadcasting equipment.","Director Xu watched the rapidly increasing viewer count with a mix of excitement and worry, silently praying that the equipment would hold up.","This reality show used a combination of live broadcasting and recorded footage. The recorded segments would be edited and released after the live broadcast ended. The livestream was divided into five channels, each corresponding to one of the five celebrity guests.","Director Xu would be following the Jing Zejun family.","[They're here! I'm here to see the wealthy elite!]","[7 AM? Is live streaming this competitive now?]","[Hurry! Let me see what the Hengjing CEO looks like!]","[Zejun! Zejun! I'm here!]","[So many people!]","[I'm here to see the real vs. fake heiress!]","Even though it was only 7 AM, the live chat was already scrolling frantically.","While the netizens were still chatting, the screen came to life. The recording team got out of their vehicles and entered the gates of the Jing family estate.","[Was that just the gate?!]","[Am I seeing things, or did we walk for ages without seeing a house? This place is huge!]","[My imagination was too conservative!]","[We're here! We've reached the courtyard!]","Soon enough, the viewers caught sight of the courtyard ahead. Following a central path through the courtyard, they could see a three-story villa in the distance.","The path was lined with numerous exquisite sculptures, welcoming guests all the way to the villa, which sat at the very center of the courtyard, creating a stark contrast with the surrounding greenery.","At this point, the live chat quieted down a bit, stunned by the expansive courtyard.","[This yard... it would take me half an hour just to walk across it.]","[I think half an hour might be an underestimate...]","[Look, I can accept that rich people live in spacious homes, but this courtyard is too much!]","[It's quite English in style.]","The sound of knocking echoed, and viewers waited in anticipation, wondering who would be the first person to appear on screen.","A middle-aged man appeared – it was Uncle Li.","\"Good morning, everyone.\"","He welcomed the director and crew inside. Director Xu quickly arranged for all the equipment to be connected, and the Jing family's reality show officially began!","Viewers started admiring the villa's decor, and since they hadn't seen any of the Jing family members yet, the live chat began discussing Uncle Li's identity.","[Who was that just now?]","[Judging by his clothes and demeanor, he must be the butler, right?]","[Huh? I thought he was Jing Zejun's father?]","[Don't be ridiculous! He's clearly a professional butler.]","While the chat was still discussing, Jing Zeyou had already come down the stairs.","Uncle Li walked to his side and bowed slightly, \"Young Master.\"","\"Are we starting already?\" Jing Zeyou glanced at his watch; it was a bit earlier than he had expected.","Director Xu felt a bit awkward. They had indeed arrived half an hour early, but the live chat had been so intense that he feared the equipment wouldn't hold up if they didn't start showing some footage soon.","This was usually the time when Jing Zeyou had breakfast, but he suddenly remembered that Aunt Wang had gone home to rest.","Jing Zeyou's hand paused as he was buttoning his jacket. It looked like he'd have to have breakfast at the office.","By now, the live chat had become chaotic, with Jing Zeyou's name and occupation displayed on the screen.","[So this is the CEO of Hengjing? He's so handsome!]","[I thought domineering CEOs only existed in fiction!]","[Wow! He looks so dashing in a suit!]","[What? Is he leaving already?! No way, I've only been watching for a few minutes!]","[Huh? He's going to work? I guess even world-famous CEOs have to clock in on time.]","Although Jing Zeyou hadn't said a word, Director Xu looked at the lively chat and then back at Jing Zeyou, who was already preparing to leave, his eyes full of admiration. Some people were captivating just by standing there.","While the netizens were still immersed in Jing Zeyou's aura, Jing Zejun had finished preparing and was surprised to see the director and crew already in the living room. Wasn't it supposed to be 7:30?","However, due to her professional demeanor, Jing Zejun quickly adjusted and greeted everyone with a smile.","\"Good morning, everyone.\"","[Ah! Good morning, Zejun!]","[Zejun!]","[General Nine Songs!]","[So this is the recently found heiress of the wealthy family?]","[She's so lucky to be the long-lost heiress of a rich family!]","[...I don't think it's lucky for Jing Zejun or her family.]","Soon after, Jing Zeqian also came downstairs, causing the live chat to go wild once again.","'Jing Zeqian, CEO of Startrack Entertainment'","[I know! I know! He's the boss of the famous actor Wen!]","[Wow! The boss and the actor on the same reality show, the director is so clever!]","[He's so handsome! Feels like a completely different type from his older brother.]","Compared to Jing Zeyou's steadiness, Jing Zeqian's roguish charm seemed to be more popular with the netizens.","He was clearly aware of his appeal, flashing a smile at the camera as he greeted everyone.","Seeing the frenzied live chat, Jing Zejun's first thought was: Yiyi would definitely mock this if she saw it, and probably watch it repeatedly until her second brother felt embarrassed...","\"What are we having for breakfast?\" Jing Zeqian looked at the empty dining room and suddenly remembered that Aunt Wang had gone home to rest.","It seemed that no one in the house knew how to cook.","Jing Zejun had checked the refrigerator earlier and found that Aunt Wang had prepared some ready-to-eat meals for them. They just needed to be heated up, and maybe they could fry some eggs?","About ten minutes later, Jing Zeqian looked at the food on the table and thought it looked quite presentable.","\"Not bad, Junjun!\"","[Isn't there supposed to be another girl?]","[Isn't it obvious? They just don't care about her.]","[So the fake heiress isn't very popular, huh?]","[This exclusion couldn't be more obvious.]","[Well, she's the one who forced her way in!]","Director Xu frowned as he read the live chat, surprised that after all this time, everyone's attention was still focused on Jing Yi.","Speak of the devil.","The sound of footsteps from upstairs made Jing Zeqian and Jing Zejun turn their heads.","Jing Zeqian was surprised. He hadn't heard wrong, had he? Jing Yiyi was up before 8 AM?","The screen promptly displayed her identity, which made the live chat even more lively.","[Jing Yi? This doesn't look like they're family at all!]","[Haha, I didn't expect her name to be the first defeat.]","[She's completely an outsider!]","[I can already imagine how awkward this is going to be!]","After seeing Jing Yi come downstairs, Jing Zejun brought out the toast and eggs she had fried for her, placing them at Jing Yi's usual seat.","\"What a rare sight! Our Jing Yiyi actually got up early. Junjun, quick, send a telegram to Mom and Dad, this needs to be recorded as a major family event!\" Jing Zeqian picked up a piece of toast, teasing.","Jing Zejun's lips curved into a smile, her eyes filled with gentle affection.","Jing Yi secretly glared at him, not daring to be too brazen in front of the cameras.","Jing Yi smiled sweetly at Jing Zejun, \"Thank you, Junjun. Did you make this?\"","\"I just fried a couple of eggs and toasted some bread. Aunt Wang prepared everything else earlier.\"","\"That's still impressive, unlike some people.\"","Jing Yi took a big bite of the toast, finding it crispy and delicious. Her attention was immediately drawn to the bread.","Jing Zeqian glared back at her, as if certain people weren't just eating what was prepared for them."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: Live Broadcast","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, the livestream rooms of the other four people were also very lively.","The variety show \"Dear Family\" invited a total of five guests, besides the actors Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan.","The third guest was a singer, the fourth was a dance-pop idol, and these two also brought their own fan bases, so their livestream rooms were not low in numbers. The one with relatively lower popularity was the fifth guest, swimmer Chen Yu.","However, the comments in his livestream room were also cleaner compared to the others.","At this time, in Wen Qingyan's livestream room:","His cousin Wen Yin was preparing breakfast, while Wen Qingyan had gone for a morning run after getting up early.","The camera followed him as he ran a lap around the neighborhood. Wen Qingyan didn't say a single word the entire time, but the viewership of the livestream didn't drop at all.","Wen Yin was making sandwiches, and the cameraman following him moved closer. The lens swept around the kitchen as he asked, \"Does Mr. Wen usually cook at home too?\"","\"My brother actually rarely cooks for himself. He's either filming or on his way to film. When he does rest occasionally, he'll make something simple.\"","Wen Yin placed another piece of toast on top, cut it in half, and proudly showed it to the camera.","\"Because he has to manage his figure, he can eat very little. I made shrimp for him.\"","[Wen Qingyan is famous in the industry for his self-discipline]","[No wonder he's been popular for over a decade!]","[The little brother seems quite domestic!]","[Feels like a different type from Mr. Wen]","After Wen Yin finished making breakfast and saw that Wen Qingyan hadn't returned yet, he voluntarily said, \"How about I give you a tour of the apartment?\"","The cameraman nodded eagerly and followed him.","\"This is my brother's study, and that's his gym.\"","The camera panned to the bookshelf, which had various types of books, though scripts were the most common.","There were also a few shelves that seemed to be gifts from fans, including letters, figurines, and posters.","[Ah! That's the figurine I sent!]","[The city! The city from \"Jun Lin\"!]","[It really is the original model of the city from \"Jun Lin\".]","A staff member asked, \"That's the limited edition model from 'Jun Lin', right?\" That drama was a huge hit back then, and even some of the merchandise became popular. On the bookshelf was indeed one of the city models released that year.","Wen Yin also noticed the model she was talking about and nodded, \"Yes, my brother treasures it quite a bit.\"","[Oh my god, I don't even want to ship anymore, but Wen Qingyan is collecting the city!]","[You're too obsessed with shipping, what's wrong with the city model?!]","[Come to think of it, on the other side of this city model is General Jiusheng played by Jing Zejun!]","Meanwhile, the cameraman following Wen Qingyan had returned, panting heavily. Despite being so exhausted, he still pointed the camera at Wen Qingyan.","He looked like he wasn't tired at all!","[Ah! So handsome!]","[I watched him run for so long, and he's still so steady!]","Wen Yin waved to Wen Qingyan, who had freshened up, \"Brother, come eat breakfast.\"","As Wen Qingyan sat down, a staff member seemed to find an opportunity and approached to ask, \"Mr. Wen, why did you decide to participate in the 'Dear Family' variety show?\"","Wen Qingyan smiled and said, \"I've been filming for the past few years, and I thought this would be a good chance to take a proper break.\"","Wen Yin glanced teasingly at the person opposite him, then quickly lowered his head to eat his sandwich.","On the other side, the three Jing siblings, who had finished their meal, were also giving the camera a tour of their home.","\"The third floor is where Yi Yi and I have our rooms,\" Jing Zejun introduced the layout to the staff.","The camera panned to the walk-in closet, which was filled with an array of designer clothes, bags, and jewelry.","[I feel like I'm here to broaden my horizons...]","[Those bags that are hard to even pre-order, they have them all here!]","[As expected of a wealthy family, they're really attentive to this newly found biological daughter.]","[What are you saying? She's their biological daughter...]","[I think this Jing Yi has really hit the jackpot.]","[After all, it's the Jing family, they have to keep up appearances.]","The cameraman asked, \"Is this floor just for you and Jing Yi?\"","Jing Zejun nodded, \"Yes, the floor below is for my parents and two older brothers. We won't be showing you that.\"","\"As for the basement, Yi Yi knows it better. Why don't we let her show you around?\"","The staff quickly nodded. After finishing breakfast, Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian had been watching a movie in the living room without any dialogue.","\"Yi Yi, can you take the camera crew for a tour of the basement?\"","\"Okay.\"","Jing Yi looked up at Jing Zejun coming down the stairs, nodded, and stood up. The cameraman following her also stood up, finally able to move.","[Actually, the little sister is quite pretty too.]","[I'd say Jing Zejun is just being polite.]","[Well, he is an actor after all.]","[You guys are worrying too much, I think their relationship looks very harmonious.]","[What else? You expect them to fight on the show?]","[Stop arguing, I'm just curious about what's in the basement!]","Jing Yi led the camera crew downstairs and opened the room on this floor. The lighting inside was a bit dim.","\"This is the cinema.\"","The camera tilted up to reveal a starry sky - a real starry sky cinema.","The entire cinema was predominantly black, including black leather sofas. The cameraman was reluctant to leave, let alone the viewers who were already in awe.","Jing Yi led the camera down another floor, \"This is the game room.\" The camera panned to the relatively brighter game room, filled with computers, VR equipment, and even various arcade machines.","However, what was that claw machine doing there?","A staff member asked, \"What's with that claw machine?\"","\"Oh, that was bought for Jun Jun. She's not interested in these other devices, but she can spend an entire afternoon in front of this claw machine.\"","This piqued the interest of the viewers.","[Is the contrast that big? My gentle Jun Jun also likes such cute games?]","[Spending an entire afternoon... does that mean her skills are poor?]","[Haha, an entire afternoon!]","The staff asked, \"Does Young Master Jing often come to the game room to play?\"","Jing Yi smiled and said, \"Yes, he and I are the ones who love coming to the game room. But he's really bad at it. Forget about games, he can't even win many prizes from the claw machine.\"","The camera focused on the claw machine again.","After Jing Yi finished showing the camera crew around the basement and returned to the living room, she saw Jing Zeqian with a somewhat displeased expression.","If Jing Yi could see the comments, she would have noticed that everyone was warning her to run away quickly.","\"Jing Yi Yi, who are you calling bad at games?!\"","Oops, forgot it was a livestream...","But Jing Yi wasn't scared at all. \"I'm talking about you.\" Losing every time you play, isn't that being bad?","\"If I don't show you my skills today, you won't know how I got my title as the King of the Game Room!\"","\"I'm curious about that too.\"","Then Jing Zeqian dragged Jing Yi to the basement to play games, with the cameraman hurriedly following them.","Jing Zejun smiled helplessly, \"They're not happy unless they bicker every day. You'll get used to it after watching for a while.\"","Later, after the two finished their game, the camera clearly captured Jing Zeqian's side, showing the word \"Defeat\" on the display screen."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Family Members","paragraphs":["After the three Jing siblings had settled down, Director Xu formally began to interview them according to the procedure.","\"Why did you decide to participate in this reality show?\"","This was a standard question asked of every guest.","Jing Zejun had anticipated this question, \"Because netizens seem to be curious about my family, rather than letting everyone speculate, it's better to show it directly like this.\"","Director Xu continued to ask, \"Among the five guests participating in the show, your family has the most members and is also from a wealthy background. Is it more challenging to get along compared to other families?\"","Director Xu's question was quite direct, and the sharpness of the questions was gradually increasing, without avoiding topics due to the Jing family's status.","Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"Actually, before recording the show, this is how we usually interact at home, so it's no different. As for it being challenging? I finally found my family, which I cherish more than anything, so how could I find it difficult?\"","[That's true, Jing Zejun's adoptive parents passed away a few years ago.]","[I feel so sorry for Junjun!]","[It's actually not that bad, this is the Jing family, a well-known wealthy family.]","\"How does it feel to have a sister who is one month younger than you?\"","Jing Zejun's expression remained unchanged, not feeling offended by the pointed question.","\"There are many feelings. Although I call her my younger sister, she actually takes care of me more.\"","After chatting briefly, Director Xu called Jing Yi over to continue the interview.","\"There's a lot of online discussion about your relationship with Jing Zejun. How do you view this?\"","Netizens didn't expect the topic to be addressed so directly, and they eagerly awaited Jing Yi's answer.","Jing Yi didn't seem to mind, \"I know about the true and false heiress situation.\"","[Is she being this direct?!]","[How could she not know, with all the online discussions?]","[Knowing doesn't prevent others from occupying the title of the Jing family heiress.]","Jing Yi continued, \"I actually don't care about what they say, and those words won't affect my normal life.\"","Director Xu pressed on, \"What kind of person do you think Jing Zejun is?\"","Jing Yi smiled, her dimples deepening, \"Junjun is a very gentle person. He appears quiet and calm, but he's very persistent about things he's determined about, especially when it comes to his acting career.\"","\"What about the Jing patriarch and the young master?\"","Jing Yi laughed, \"Big brother is a workaholic, he can work 360 days out of 365 days a year. Second brother is more casual, loves to make sarcastic comments, and usually looks like he's asking for a beating, but he has a heart of gold despite his sharp tongue.\"","Her sweet demeanor made many viewers soften.","[Just putting on a show]","[Actually, they seem to get along very well.]","[Haha, I almost thought the CEO of Startrack only got a 'asking for a beating' evaluation.]","[But as a fan of Junjun, I have to admit that Jing Yi really understands him.]","[It's just saying a few nice words, you guys don't actually believe it, do you?]","[If someone could give me that much money, I'd be willing to say nice things about them every day too.]","Meanwhile, the other guests were also being interviewed in the same manner.","Singer Cheng Cheng was recording the show with his parents, who are both doctors. Due to his career, he doesn't often see his parents, which is why he accepted this reality show.","On the first day of recording, his parents were still absent due to a sudden matter at the hospital.","Cheng Cheng smiled wryly, \"See? They're even busier than I am. I don't know if they'll be able to appear on screen later.\"","The comments were filled with sympathetic voices.","Athlete Chen Yu had relatively less popularity. He was the only guest who brought his wife to participate in the show.","Early in the morning, he had prepared breakfast for his wife, and now the two were enjoying their breakfast time together.","The singing and dancing idol Li Shaocheng was participating with her older sister.","Li Shaocheng smiled sweetly, \"Because I grew up with my sister, but after starting work, we rarely live together. Of course, I want to cherish such an opportunity!\"","She cutely winked at the camera, instantly captivating the netizens.","[Hahaha! Orange is so cute, much more natural than some people who pretend!]","[This is what you call cute, don't think having dimples makes you cute.]","[Why suddenly bring up people from other groups?]","[This is Orange's livestream, we don't allow discussion of others!]","[But wasn't it your fans who started it?]","When two similar types of girls appear in the same place, comparisons are inevitable.","Li Shaocheng is an idol with her own fanbase. When her fans learned she was participating in this show, they started to research the other guests.","Seeing that Jing Yi had inadvertently attracted some fans for her looks, Li Shaocheng's fans were unhappy.","Add to that the fact that Li Shaocheng was appearing with her sister, and it was like stirring up a hornet's nest.","Li Shaocheng could see the potential for success.","Although she and Jing Zejun were in different fields, comparisons in this show were inevitable, so naturally, she hoped to come out on top.","The camera moved to Li Shaocheng's Sister in the kitchen, and a staff member asked, \"Is big sister preparing breakfast?\"","Before her sister could answer, Li Shaocheng chimed in with a laugh, \"How could she? She's probably just rummaging around in the fridge. She's usually quite busy with work, so she rarely has time to cook for herself.\"","[That's right! Big sister and Orange graduated from the same university, and it's a top university!]","[Both sisters are elites. How many people in the entertainment industry nowadays have completed university? Let alone a prestigious one.]","[I feel like you're implying something about the other group.]","[This is a real sister relationship, none of that scheming from wealthy families.]","Li Shaocheng had already walked to the kitchen, smiling as she asked her sister to make room for her, taking the bread from her sister's hands.","\"Do you take care of your sister more often?\"","Li Shaocheng casually sliced the bread, \"Yes, although I'm usually quite busy too, my sister only focuses on work. When she gets busy, she doesn't pay attention to her health, so whenever I have time, I'll go home and cook for her.\"","Her sister seemed uncomfortable with the camera, looking a bit awkward.","Li Shaocheng glanced at the camera and reassured her, \"It's okay, I've got this. Sis, you can go wait in the living room.\"","Her sister hesitated but eventually left the kitchen.","After cutting the bread, Li Shaocheng noticed the sandwich ingredients nearby. She felt a bit embarrassed but quickly hid her emotions.","\"This Tangerine, she took out so many ingredients, probably thinking we could eat all of it.\"","[Huh? I thought big sister was going to make sandwiches, why did she cut the bread?]","[Big sister is called Tangerine, how cute!]","[Orange is such a gentle sister, she's so good to her big sister!]"]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Face-to-Face CP","paragraphs":["At the Jing family home, three people were sitting in a row watching television.","On the large screen, the TV drama \"Monarch\" was playing, currently showing a scene with Jing Zejun.","She was portraying General Jiusheng, standing on the city walls surrounded by corpses, with only a few of her soldiers remaining.","Jing Zejun wore battle armor, her robe stained red with blood, holding a sharp spear, her eyes filled with determination and resolve.","Facing the approaching enemy, she showed no sign of weakness.","The camera zoomed in for a close-up, capturing Jing Zejun's indescribable tenacity as she wielded her spear against the enemy leader, only to fall to his blade.","As she fell, gazing at the azure sky, she murmured, \"Chu Yuanchen, I've stood by your side for nineteen years. This is the last time I'll stand before you.\"","In the distance, Wen Qingyan, playing Chu Yuanchen, arrived, looking at the scene in disbelief, his face as pale as paper, lips tightly pressed, stumbling off his horse and running over.","Seeing that Jing Zejun's character had breathed her last, his eyes filled with pain and despair, as if his very soul had been torn apart.","Jing Yi was deeply moved by this scene, her eyes brimming with tears.","Beside her, Jing Zeqian looked somewhat annoyed but still handed her a tissue, while Jing Zejun appeared a bit embarrassed.","[So touching! Junjun and Wen are truly a perfect match! My JunQing Couple!]","Jing Zejun's eyes flickered slightly, not having heard before that Jing Yi was a fan of her pairing with Wen Qingyan.","Noticing Jing Zeqian's darkening expression beside her, she quickly turned her head, pretending to focus on the TV.","Jing Yi, still immersed in the show, didn't notice the change in the other two's expressions.","The on-screen comments were also intently focused on the drama.","[My General Jiusheng! Your Yuanchen married that woman just three months after your death!]","[Although I'm not a fan of Jing Zejun, I'm really angry that \"Monarch\" ended like that!]","[I'll always believe Chu Yuanchen only loved Jiang Jiusheng!]","[By the way, these three have been sitting in front of the TV for an hour now, aren't they going to do something else?]","Evidently, Director Xu also felt this couldn't continue, and asked, \"It's almost lunchtime, are you three planning to cook?\"","Jing Yi snapped out of the storyline, looking left and right to find both of them staring at her, giving her a slight sense of foreboding.","[No way, can't we just order takeout? I never said I could cook, did I?]","Jing Zeqian's eyes lit up; he had only wanted to pass this task to Jing Yi, not expecting an unexpected bonus.","Jing Zejun had also instinctively wanted to ask Jing Yi's opinion.","\"Cooking is no big deal for Jing Yi Yi!\"","Before Jing Yi could say anything, Jing Zeqian had already settled the matter.","Jing Yi glared at Jing Zeqian.","[Easy for you to say when you're not the one doing it.]","She sighed inwardly, accepting this cruel reality. It wasn't that she couldn't stubbornly insist on Jing Zeqian cooking, but she was worried about being 'poisoned'...","\"Let me be clear, I only know how to make some simple home-style dishes.\"","The two sitting on the sofa nodded in unison, obediently not objecting.","[I didn't expect Jing Yi to be the only one among the three who can cook!]","[Haha, Junjun and Little Jing CEO are so docile!]","\"Then let's change clothes and go out to buy groceries.\"","Jing Zeqian looked puzzled, \"Aren't there various ingredients in the kitchen?\"","Jing Yi glanced at him, \"I only need some fresh, simple ingredients.\" Wouldn't it be a waste to use the food in the fridge that only Auntie Wang could make the best use of?","[Is she really able to cook?]","[Could it be she's planning to buy ready-made food outside?]","[What kind of ingredients are they that it's such a big deal?]","After changing into casual clothes, they prepared to visit a nearby supermarket. The camera crew followed them to the garage.","\"Aren't we going to a nearby supermarket?\"","Jing Zejun smiled, \"It's still quite far, and we'll have to carry the groceries back.\" After all, even reaching the main gate was quite a distance.","The camera panned across the garage, steadying to capture each car.","[...Sorry, did I accidentally enter a car show livestream?]","[The Jing family really keeps redefining my understanding of 'luxury' every time!]","[Is that the 'Night'?]","[Could that car be the 'Night' bought by the mysterious tycoon?!]","[If we were to exchange one car for one house...]","\"Which one do you want to drive?\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow, surprised that Jing Zeqian wasn't worried about her driving today.","Ignoring her, Jing Zeqian casually chose a red SUV that Jing Yi often drove and got in.","After Jing Yi took the driver's seat, a staff member asked Jing Zeqian in the back, \"Is there someone in the family who particularly likes cars?\"","Leaning back in his seat, Jing Zeqian replied, \"Actually, we're all okay with them, but the one who likes cars the most is right there in front.\" He nodded towards Jing Yi, who was driving.","\"We usually have drivers when we go out, so we rarely drive ourselves. Jing Yi Yi really enjoys driving herself, and that 'Night' is her favorite car.\"","Jing Zejun glanced at Jing Zeqian, amusement flashing in her eyes. He was certainly more talkative now than before.","The staff member continued, \"Is it the black sports car in the middle?\"","Jing Zeqian nodded, \"That car was originally bought by my brother as an art piece for viewing, but now it's almost become Jing Yi Yi's exclusive ride.\"","After learning about the value of the 'Night' from the on-screen comments, the netizens became even more excited.","[A limited edition sports car, and she just drives it like that?!]","[That's the 'Night'! Why drive it? I feel like even touching it would be damaging!]","[But isn't it a waste to just let it sit there? Besides, it's someone else's car, right? It's their freedom to let whoever they want drive it.]","[The 'Night' isn't just expensive to buy, it's expensive to maintain. The cost of maintaining it definitely won't be cheaper than buying it!]","About ten minutes later, they arrived at a nearby supermarket.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun strolled leisurely in front, while Jing Zeqian pushed the shopping cart behind them, looking bored.","The cart was full of various snacks, with no trace of ingredients for lunch.","\"Junjun, what do you want for lunch?\"","\"If I tell you, can you make it?\"","Jing Yi chose to selectively ignore Jing Zeqian's sarcastic comment.","Jing Zejun looked towards the fresh food section, \"I'm fine with anything, just make what you're good at.\"","\"Does no one care what I want to eat?\" Jing Zeqian complained while pushing the cart behind them.","[Little Jing CEO is so cute, I thought he'd be the cool CEO type, but he's actually the tsundere type.]","[Hahaha, following behind and muttering complaints, how adorable!]","[I even feel like Junjun and the others might have almost forgotten there's still someone behind them.]","[I must say, this tycoon family is quite down-to-earth.]","[Come on, it's just a 'reality' show, what's so special about it?]"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Siblings Cooking","paragraphs":["After returning from the supermarket, Jing Zeqian was assigned the task of washing the ingredients.","Though he was just washing vegetables, there were water stains all around him and on the floor.","Jing Zeqian noticed the look of disdain on Jing Yi's face. \"What? You think I'm not doing a good job?\"","Jing Yi was still internally complaining when Jing Zeqian caught her off guard. She quickly sweetened her tone, \"Not at all, you're doing great! Keep it up!\"","Jing Zeqian's mouth twitched slightly. What a perfunctory way of praising...","Jing Zejun was only assigned the task of juicing, using the fruits that Jing Zeqian had already washed.","He vigorously cleaned the ingredients, determined to let his brother deal with the company matters quickly. These tedious tasks shouldn't fall on him alone!","[I feel like Little Jing is about to wash the cauliflower to pieces...]","[Haha, it's like he's taking out his frustrations on the vegetables as if they were Jing Yi.]","[Who would have thought that the Startrack CEO, who commands such respect outside, would be obediently helping his sister at home?]","After he finished everything, he changed his clothes and collapsed on the sofa. His previous outfit was completely soaked through.","Don't be fooled by how little work it seemed - it wasn't any easier than going to the office!","By this time, Jing Yi had already started stir-frying. She held the ladle skillfully, tossing the ingredients in the wok.","The camera quickly focused on the steaming shrimp in the wok. A rich aroma of tomato sauce immediately filled the air, making viewers' mouths water.","The audience couldn't smell it at the moment, but that didn't stop them from seeing the stark contrast between the tender white shrimp and the bright red tomato sauce.","Jing Zejun brought out the plated tomato shrimp dish. Jing Zeqian, seeing it from afar, quickly approached.","To be honest, just this one dish showed that Jing Yi really had some skills.","Jing Yi had been taking care of herself since she was young, so cooking simple home-style dishes wasn't difficult for her.","When she used to live alone, she would cook for herself and often help the cooks at the welfare center.","It's just that after she transmigrated, she didn't need to cook herself, so they never knew Jing Yi could cook.","In the kitchen, Jing Yi had already started on another dish. The fish was sizzling in the pan, and she only flipped it when one side was golden brown.","Jing Yi took some pre-prepared black pepper and sprinkled it over the fish.","Seeing that the fish was almost done, she began plating, adding some fresh vegetables and a small bowl of lemon juice on the side.","At this time, the black chicken soup that had been simmering was also ready. Jing Yi lifted the lid, and the camera was quick to capture the soup bubbling and steaming.","Thankfully, Auntie Wang had prepared many of the base ingredients, so she just had to add them in. It was really convenient.","[It looks really good!]","[To be honest, I'm hungry too. I wonder how long until my takeout arrives...]","[Good thing I ordered takeout in advance! That's how smart I am!]","[It's not that impressive, she just used the soup base prepared by the maid.]","[To be fair, I think some people are just nitpicking.]","All the dishes were now on the table. Jing Zeqian found this scene quite novel and immediately took a photo to share in the group chat.","—One Big Family—","\"Is this takeout?\"","Lin Ruiqing, who was still traveling abroad, hadn't had time to watch the livestream and thought the three had ordered takeout. She was worried that if there wasn't any takeout, the people recording at home probably wouldn't have much good food to eat.","\"Jing Yi made it.\"","\"Yi Yi made this? That's amazing!\" Lin Ruiqing was surprised. The dishes in the photo looked exquisite; she had no idea Jing Yi had this skill.","\"Looks good.\" This was from the usually quiet Jing Beicheng.","\"I'll be home for dinner tonight.\" Jing Zeyou, still at work in the company, suddenly felt a bit unbalanced looking at the photo his brother had sent.","Jing Zeqian's lips curved into a smile, his mood greatly improved as he prepared to enjoy lunch.","\"Big brother said he'll be home for dinner tonight,\" he said while picking up a piece of shrimp.","It really was quite good.","Jing Yi's hand, holding a piece of fish, paused slightly.","[Another mouth to feed... but it's big brother, so it's fine. It's just a few meals.]","She lowered her head to taste the fish. Not bad, crispy on the outside and tender inside. Seems her skills weren't rusty.","Jing Zeqian: ... It's fine if big brother eats, but he's being all wishy-washy about it.","A hint of sourness rose in Jing Zeqian's heart, and his chopsticks moved even faster. Jing Yi gave him a strange look.","[How hungry is this guy?]","A glimmer of amusement flashed in Jing Zejun's eyes, but his movements also quietly sped up. The shrimp was almost gone.","Meanwhile, Wen Qingyan's family group was also having their meal.","To avoid falling into silence again, the staff occasionally threw questions at the two. \"Does Film Emperor Wen have any plans for this reality show?\"","Wen Qingyan pondered for a moment, then looked up at the camera. \"I don't have any specific plans at the moment. I just want to spend more time with family.\"","He had decided to participate in the show on short notice, so how could he have any plans? He'd take it one step at a time. He was bound to meet people on a variety show, after all.","The staff member persisted, \"Then how does Film Emperor Wen plan to spend this time?\"","[Haha, the director must be having a hard time!]","[Isn't this just asking the same question in a different way?]","[I'm dying of laughter. The production team is really going all out to get Wen Qingyan to talk more.]","[No wonder Film Emperor Wen doesn't often participate in variety shows. It's too easy for things to become awkward.]","How to spend the time? Isn't this the same question as before?","Wen Qingyan found it a bit amusing. \"I do have one idea. During the recording, will we always be in our respective families?\"","The staff member replied, \"In the early stages, the five families will carry out activities on their own.\"","Whether they stayed at home or had other activities, it didn't matter as long as it involved the whole family.","\"In the later stages, we'll arrange for the five families to gather together and interact.\"","Wen Qingyan nodded in satisfaction. \"That's good. I was thinking it might be a bit boring with just me and Xiaoyin. It would be nice to gather with the other families.\"","The staff member immediately followed up, \"Does Film Emperor Wen know about the other guests?\"","The production team had previously informed Wen Qingyan about the other four guests. Now they were asking to see his thoughts on the other participants.","Wen Qingyan smiled, \"I know all of them, but I'm not very familiar with most. I've watched Chen Yu's competitions, he's very impressive. The one I'm most familiar with is Zejun, since we've filmed together, so I know him better.\"","[So, who exactly do you want to meet up with?]","[Help! My CP isn't even trying to hide it! He just wants to see Jing Zejun!]","[Calm down, calm down. Film Emperor Wen might just think it's more lively with more people.]","[That's the funniest joke I've heard this year: Wen Qingyan likes lively atmospheres...]","[Even if that's not the case, couldn't he want to meet up with Jing Zeqian?]","At this moment, the bullet comments had become a celebration for CP fans, drowning out all other interpretations."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Health Tea Punishment","paragraphs":["The Jing Family was in the midst of an intense 'battle'.","After dinner, Jing Zejun suggested playing a game for fun.","The three of them found a deck of cards that had never been used and started playing \"Fight the Landlord\" (a popular Chinese card game).","Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi's faces were covered with paper slips, to the point where their eyes were barely visible. In comparison, the number of paper slips on Jing Zejun's face was pitifully few.","[I'm about to die laughing, this isn't \"Fight the Landlord\" at all, it's just a one-sided battle between Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi.]","[No matter what roles they're playing, Young Master Jing and Jing Yi are both determined to make the other lose!]","[Haha, I never thought I'd be so entertained watching others play cards on a livestream!]","[Jing Yi just 'bombed' Young Master Jing again!]","\"Bomb!\"","Jing Zeqian was so angry that the paper slips on his face were shaking. \"Jing Yi, we're both farmers! Jing Zejun is the landlord! I play a pair of threes, and you respond with four fours?!\"","\"I don't care! Who told you to criticize my health tea earlier? Now, can you beat this or not?!\"","After dinner, Jing Yi had originally wanted to brew some health tea to aid digestion, but Jing Zeqian immediately recognized it as the same tea his brother had tricked him into drinking before!","He promptly refused and criticized it extensively.","Jing Yi then decided to use the tea as a punishment for losing the game - whoever ended up with the most paper slips on their face would have to drink the entire cup of health tea without leaving a drop.","[Now I'm even more curious about that health tea, just how bad can it taste?!]","[I saw it! Jing Zejun secretly tried a sip earlier, and her expression immediately turned to one of existential crisis!]","[Young Master Jing seems to be losing, his face is almost out of space for more paper slips.]","[Hahaha, I can't wait to see who'll be the lucky one to drink it!]","Jing Zejun, sitting to the side, was also laughing so hard she could barely muster any strength. She lay on the sofa, looking at the cards in her hand.","She felt that no matter how bad her cards were, she wouldn't lose. After all, she had tasted the tea earlier, and there was no way she could swallow a whole cup.","Looking at the paper slips on the faces of the two beside her, she was pretty sure she'd be lucky enough to avoid the tea.","Jing Zejun also played a pair of threes. Jing Zeqian glanced sideways at the motionless Jing Yi, \"Your turn. You've already played a bomb, can't you beat a pair of threes?\"","\"Pass.\"","Jing Zeqian glared at her and quickly played a pair of Aces. Now it was Jing Zejun's turn to pass, shaking her head to indicate the next player.","Just as Jing Zeqian was about to play again, Jing Yi swiftly laid down a pair of Jokers.","\"...Didn't you just say you couldn't play anything?!\"","\"A pair of Jokers for a pair of threes would have been a waste of good cards.\"","Jing Zeqian gripped his cards tightly, recalling the four fours she had just played. And that wasn't a waste?","\"Pass!\"","Jing Yi looked at the cards in her hand. They had agreed beforehand that even if teammates lost, the one with more cards would have to add an extra paper slip.","She played a pair, which Jing Zeqian promptly topped.","\"Three with one\" - three sixes with a pair of sevens.","\"Three with one!\" - three eights with a pair of twos.","Jing Zeqian silently looked up at Jing Yi. Who on earth taught her this reckless way of playing?","\"You had a pair of twos? Why didn't you use them earlier?\"","Jing Zeqian's tone was almost despairing, while Jing Zejun on the side was shaking with laughter.","In the end, Jing Zejun emerged victorious, while Jing Zeqian, having two more cards than Jing Yi, had two more slips added to his face.","When Jing Zeyou returned home, he found three people in the living room, two of whom were so covered in paper slips that their faces were barely visible.","\"Are you playing cards?\"","Jing Yi, happy about beating Jing Zeqian, waved at Jing Zeyou.","\"Big brother, you're back! Want to join us for a game?\"","Jing Zeqian beside her vehemently refused, \"Big brother, don't play with her! She's terrible at cards!\"","[Ah! The CEO is back from work!]","[I haven't seen the CEO all day!]","[Finally, I've been waiting for this! CEO, please appear more often!]","Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a smile. It seemed they were having quite a good time at home; he had been worried they might feel uncomfortable.","He was about to go upstairs when he noticed a familiar liquid on the table. His breath caught, and he looked at Jing Yi, probing, \"That drink is...?\"","\"Oh, it's health tea. I originally made it to help with digestion, but now it's become a punishment.\"","Jing Zeyou understood. As long as it wasn't left for him, it was fine. It did indeed seem like a punishment.","[I bet the CEO has definitely tried Jing Yi's health tea before!]","[Hahaha, I'm getting more and more interested in this tea! Even the mighty CEO is afraid of it!]","[Come on, let's place bets on who will end up with the health tea!]","[I bet a salted fish it'll definitely be Young Master Jing!]","After Jing Zeyou went upstairs, the three of them started counting the paper slips on their faces.","Jing Zejun quickly finished counting her slips - only five.","Meanwhile, Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi were still counting. Not only were the people present tense, but the online viewers were also on edge.","Jing Yi finished counting first, and after a few seconds, Jing Zeqian finished too.","She decided to take the initiative, \"How many do you have?\"","Jing Zeqian, not willing to give in, held onto his paper slips tightly, \"You tell me first!\"","\"No, you first!\"","\"...How about we say it together?\" Jing Zejun worried that if they kept this up, they might not even make it to dinner.","They both nodded in agreement, and Jing Zejun started the countdown.","Three, two, one...","\"28!\"","\"25!\"","Jing Yi happily raised both hands, cheering, \"Yay! I won! Jing Zejun, I won!\"","Jing Zeyou came downstairs to see the two girls holding hands and cheering, while Jing Zeqian was staring at the paper slips in his hand in disbelief.","It seemed his brother would have to drink that health tea, Jing Zeyou quickly concluded.","Jing Yi's almond-shaped eyes curved into crescents as she personally handed the health tea to Jing Zeqian, \"Second brother, here you go!\"","Jing Zeqian hadn't expected to encounter this health tea again so soon.","His hand trembled slightly as he held the cup, \"If I drink this, I might not be able to continue filming the variety show...\"","Jing Yi glared at him, \"How can it be that bad?! This is health tea, not poison!\"","He felt it wasn't an exaggeration at all. If he wasn't mistaken, he was probably the only one in the family who had drunk this stuff before.","A bet's a bet!","Jing Zeqian pinched his nose and gulped it down in one go.","\"Water!\"","Jing Zeyou had already prepared water and handed it to Jing Zeqian.","Seeing Jing Zeqian's expression, he felt somewhat relieved that he had come home a bit late.","[Hahaha, Jing Zeqian is absolutely hilarious!]","[The CEO must have tried that tea before, otherwise he wouldn't be so sympathetic!]","[Help, I could watch them play cards forever, I'm dying of laughter.]","As night fell, the Jing family began to busy themselves with dinner preparations.","The task of washing vegetables was still assigned to Jing Zeqian, while Jing Zeyou was responsible for handling the meat dishes. For Jing Zeyou, this was quite a novel experience.","Then there was Jing Yi in charge of cooking and Jing Zejun responsible for plating. For a while, the kitchen was filled with a warm, familial atmosphere.","Jing Zeyou finally got his wish to eat dinner prepared by Jing Yi."]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: The Sisters Li Shaosheng","paragraphs":["The Jing family's dinner was coconut chicken hotpot. At this time, the aroma began to fill the dining room. At the usual time, online viewers once again started watching the variety show as if it were a mukbang.","Jing Zeyou picked up a piece of chicken. The light sweetness of coconut blended perfectly with the savory flavor of the chicken.","As a result, another dinner photo was added to the family group chat.","\"Beicheng, Yi Yi made coconut chicken tonight!\"","Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing had gone hiking today and had just returned to their hotel room, exhausted.","Lin Ruiqing lay on the sofa and opened Jing Zejun's variety show livestream to see the four children eating dinner.","She hadn't had any appetite before, but now she suddenly felt a bit hungry.","Jing Beicheng came out of the bathroom, wiping his hands as he walked to Lin Ruiqing's side. Looking at the scene on the phone screen, it seemed quite lively.","A barely perceptible smile touched the corners of his mouth.","\"It seems they're doing just fine even without the family cook at home.\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled in agreement, \"It's just tough on Yi Yi.\"","Jing Beicheng looked at the screen again and reassured her, \"Don't worry, using similar ingredients should be fine. The director won't keep asking them to cook all the time.\"","\"That's good. Should we have coconut chicken tonight too?\"","The smile on Jing Beicheng's lips deepened, his whole demeanor appearing very gentle.","\"Sure, I'll have the hotel send some up.\"","\"Where are we going tomorrow?\"","Lin Ruiqing unconsciously rubbed her slightly sore calves, which Jing Beicheng took over and continued to massage.","Although the itinerary was exciting, they weren't as young as they used to be and couldn't handle it as well.","Jing Beicheng continued massaging her calves, \"We'll rest at the hotel tomorrow. We're not in a rush anyway. I'll have the hotel arrange for someone to come and give you a relaxing treatment.\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi and the others were also discussing tomorrow's plans.","Jing Zeyou ladled two bowls of soup, placing them in front of Jing Yi and Jing Zejun.","Seeing Jing Zeqian's wistful gaze, he ladled a bowl for him too.","\"Is big brother going to Hengjing again tomorrow?\" Jing Zejun asked.","He nodded, \"Yes, there are still some matters to attend to.\"","Jing Zejun remembered Director Xu's request at noon, \"Would it be alright if we came to the company to find you?\"","Director Xu knew that online viewers were very curious about the world-renowned Hengjing Group, but didn't dare to disturb Jing Zeyou directly, so he could only ask Jing Zejun for help.","Of course, there was nothing inconvenient about it. They weren't going to heavily guard even the front gate, after all.","Jing Zeyou shook his head, \"It's not inconvenient at all.\"","\"Then we'll come to see you in the morning.\"","Jing Zeqian, who had been quietly competing with Jing Yi for chicken pieces, heard Jing Zejun's plan for tomorrow and said, \"That works out well. I'll stop by the company tomorrow too.\"","He hadn't been to the office for several days and could take care of some work that couldn't be done online.","[What?! I was looking forward to seeing Hengjing tomorrow, but now we won't be able to see young Master Jing?]","[It's such a difficult choice between the two! Why can we only choose one?!]","[We can go to Hengjing tomorrow?!]","And so, they smoothly settled on their plans for the next day.","...","Early in the morning, as soon as Li Shaocheng's livestream began, fans immediately flooded in. However, the background of the livestream wasn't Li Shaocheng's home this time.","Li Shaocheng waved at the camera, \"Good morning, everyone!\"","[Good morning, Chengzi!]","[Good morning! Chengzi is as beautiful as ever!]","[Chengzi, where are you and your sister going so early in the morning?]","Li Shaocheng smiled and said, \"Are you all curious about my sister's and my plans for today? We're going to our alma mater!\"","She waved the lunchbox in her hand, \"I even brought a lunchbox! This is today's breakfast.\"","\"Sister, let's go!\"","Li Shaocheng's Sister beside her seemed to have just realized what was happening, forcing a smile as she was led along by her arm.","Li Shaocheng turned to the side and pointed in a direction for the camera, indicating that was their alma mater.","Li Shaocheng's Sister's gaze seemed distant, looking at the school gates in front of her with some nostalgia.","She wasn't much older than Li Shaocheng, so they had spent some time together at this university during a certain period.","\"Sister!\"","\"Ah.\"","Li Shaocheng's Sister snapped back to reality.","Li Shaocheng smiled and pulled her over, a flash of displeasure crossing her eyes.","\"What are you daydreaming about? We're already at the school.\"","Li Shaocheng's Sister laughed awkwardly, \"It's nothing, I'm just a bit groggy from waking up too early.\"","[As expected of a prestigious school!]","[Does Sister Cheng seem a bit off?]","[The sister looks much worse than the younger one.]","[Actually, Chengzi looks more like the older sister.]","Li Shaocheng's Sister's first appearance on camera was with simple black-framed glasses and a plain sweatshirt, quite different from the glamorous Li Shaocheng.","The Li sisters walked into the campus, with Li Shaocheng introducing the campus scenery to her online viewers along the way.","\"That building is where my sister and I had our classes. I actually really loved the foreign language major at first, but my sister had always been my goal, so I steeled myself and applied for her biomedical major.\"","Li Shaocheng boasted, while her sister listened quietly beside her.","It was indeed a tough decision. Just because she studied biology, her sister refused to apply for the subject she was good at.","[It's impressive, but doesn't it feel a bit odd?]","[... This? It's hard to comment on.]","[Why not apply for what you like? For majors, is it necessary to have the same goal?]","[Chengzi loves her sister too much!]","[Chengzi is the best!]","[That's right, some people shouldn't be saying unnecessary things here. You'd better not be from next door!]","After touring around with the camera crew, the two finally got tired and found a lawn to sit on and eat breakfast.","Li Shaocheng's Sister instinctively wanted to open the lunchbox and hand it to Li Shaocheng.","But before she could, Li Shaocheng suddenly took the lunchbox, giving her a meaningful look. When facing the camera again, she resumed her sweet and lively demeanor.","The sister's hand curled slightly and withdrew.","Li Shaocheng opened the lunchbox and showed it to the camera, \"Ta-da! Today's breakfast is sandwiches! I even cut them into shapes, aren't they cute?\"","Then she handed one to the person beside her.","\"Sister!\" \"Thank you.\"","The cameraman moved in for a close-up shot, and a staff member asked, \"This university seems quite far from Chengzi's hometown. What made you decide to study here and then settle down here?\"","\"I settled down here because after I started studying here, I was discovered by a talent scout,\" Li Shaocheng said with a bashful smile.","[So she was indeed discovered!]","[I have to say, the talent scout really had an eye for talent!]","[I know what happened next! After being discovered by the talent scout, she successfully debuted and became the center of a girl group!]","\"Then, coincidentally, my sister also works here, and I wanted to live with her, so I settled down here. As for why I chose this school, you'd have to ask my sister. My parents were quite surprised at the time too.\"","Li Shaocheng's Sister was eating a sandwich when she heard these words and froze for a moment, forcing a smile to appear natural.","\"There wasn't really any special reason. It's a prestigious school, everyone aspires to attend one.\""]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: Here he is again","paragraphs":["People were coming and going at the school when a student recognized Li Shaocheng. \"Is that Orange?!\" a girl asked cautiously as she approached.","Li Shaocheng's lips curved upwards, displaying a perfect idol smile. \"Hello.\"","The girl became excited, her face slightly flushed. \"Orange! I'm your fan! I love you so much!\"","Li Shaocheng stepped forward and hugged her. \"Thank you!\" The girl grew even more excited. \"Can I take a picture with you?\"","\"Of course!\"","\"Is that Li Shaocheng?\"","\"It really seems to be Li Shaocheng! They're taking photos!\"","Other students noticed and gathered around.","As Li Shaocheng smiled brightly and greeted the students, her sister watched the scene quietly, lost in thought.","A staff member asked, \"How does it feel to see your younger sister so popular?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister forced a slight smile. She had rehearsed this question beforehand.","\"I feel very proud. Orange has always been exceptional since she was young. Seeing her grow from a little girl into such a popular idol makes me feel very gratified.\"","The staff member got the answer they wanted and didn't probe further. The camera shifted back to Li Shaocheng in the crowd.","[Ah! I go to this school, but I went home yesterday! I missed out on a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!]","[So jealous! Not only did they get Orange's autograph but also a photo with her!]","[Does anyone else think Li Shaocheng's sister's answer was a bit odd? It sounded rehearsed.]","[Her sister is a bit wooden, Orange has mentioned this before.]","Meanwhile, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were getting ready in their rooms, preparing to go to Hengjing Group.","Jing Zeqian was having breakfast alone in the dining room. It was seafood porridge that Jing Yi had prepared early in the morning.","Although a large part of it was because she was craving it, it didn't stop Jing Zeqian from enjoying it immensely.","When dining alone, he was the perfect image of a noble young master.","The audience was completely captivated by his elegant movements.","[Although Young Master Jing is very handsome, looking at that porridge is making me so hungry...]","[Young Master Jing is incredibly handsome when he's not talking!]","[To be precise, he's incredibly handsome when he's not arguing with Jing Yi!]","After Jing Zeqian had finished breakfast and left, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun finally came out of their rooms. Since they had eaten breakfast earlier, they headed straight to the garage after coming downstairs.","The camera crew quickly followed, arriving at the familiar garage. As usual, they panned around the garage.","Jing Yi had originally planned to drive 'Black Night', but seeing the camera crew behind her, she realized there wouldn't be enough space.","In the end, she decided to drive the SUV she usually used.","Half an hour later, they arrived at the Hengjing Group building.","The camera immediately panned upwards, giving the audience a full view of the towering skyscraper before them.","It was actually Jing Yi's first time coming to Hengjing Group, this globally renowned technology company.","Jing Yi parked the car in the parking lot. This time she had learned her lesson; even though there were parking spaces on the street, the parking lot was safer.","The two of them, along with the camera crew, walked into the lobby where Assistant Chen, Jing Zeyou's assistant, was already waiting at the entrance.","According to the time Mr. Jing had told him, he calculated that Jing Yi's group should be arriving downstairs soon, so he had been waiting at the entrance a few minutes early.","\"Miss Jun, Miss Yi,\" he greeted politely.","\"Hello!\"","[You know, even a random employee from Hengjing looks good!]","[That's not just any employee, that's Mr. Jing's special assistant.]","[Did anyone else notice his way of addressing them? It's so thoughtful!]","[Indeed, two 'Miss Jing' would be too easy to mix up.]","[I'm just concerned about how wide this building is. Is it really just for Hengjing employees?]","Assistant Chen led the group to Jing Zeyou's floor. This floor only had Jing Zeyou's office and the staff of the CEO's office, so it was relatively quiet.","Because Jing Zeyou had instructed him beforehand, he didn't stop the camera crew from filming along the way.","Assistant Chen poured hot drinks for Jing Yi and Jing Zejun, then turned to the staff members, \"Thank you all for your hard work. Your drinks are over there. We prepared a variety since we didn't know everyone's preferences.\"","The camera panned to a nearby table piled with coffee, milk tea, juice, and mineral water. There was enough for everyone to have one of each flavor, not to mention the desserts on the side.","\"Please wait a moment, ladies. Mr. Jing will finish his meeting in five minutes.\"","A staff member quickly asked, \"Can we film on this floor?\"","Assistant Chen smiled, \"Of course. Except for the CEO's office and the meeting room over there, you're free to film anywhere else.\"","After getting permission, the camera crew went to other rooms to film.","Jing Yi's eyes also showed curiosity. \"This is my first time visiting my brother's company,\" she said, peering inside with interest.","While the two were chatting, the camera crew soon returned. Although they were told they could film freely, they had enough footage and didn't need to record every detail.","At this moment, the door to Jing Zeyou's office opened, and the camera immediately turned towards it.","However, the person who appeared in the frame wasn't Jing Zeyou, but a man in a black suit.","He had calm features and clean, sharp facial lines. His handsome face was expressionless, and his well-fitted suit showed off his tall, slender figure. He seemed to tick every box of the audience's preferences.","[Two minutes! I need this person's information!]","[Hengjing has too many handsome guys!]","[He's so handsome!]","[Forget two minutes, I could wait a whole day! Director Xu, where's your character introduction tag?!]","Shen Huaichu's assistant immediately noticed the camera and stepped forward to block Shen Huaichu, giving a warning look to the camera crew.","Realizing the person's identity and unwillingness to be on camera, the staff quickly moved the camera away.","Jing Zeyou then came out from inside. \"I apologize, it's the variety show's camera crew. I forgot to inform Mr. Shen beforehand. It was my oversight.\"","Jing Zeyou had been discussing a contract with Shen Huaichu and momentarily forgot that the home camera crew would be coming to the company today.","Shen Huaichu gently pushed his assistant aside, his voice devoid of inflection. \"No need to apologize, Mr. Jing. It's not a big deal.\"","Shen Huaichu's gaze turned to Jing Yi on the sofa, and at the same time, Jing Yi looked over, her eyes not particularly friendly.","[It's that impolite and self-important person!]","Surprise flashed in Jing Zeyou's eyes. The rich young master Jing Yi had encountered last time was Shen Huaichu?","Even though he couldn't hear what Jing Yi was thinking, Shen Huaichu could see the unusual emotion in her eyes.","He wasn't particularly surprised. After that day, he had looked up Jing Yi's information, but the person he saw seemed different from the rumors.","\"Mr. Jing, I'll take my leave now.\"","\"Take care.\"","Seeing Jing Yi's almost tangible piercing gaze, Shen Huaichu's lips curved slightly upward as he turned and strode away.","Jing Yi's eyes, tinged with a hint of anger, followed his departing figure.","[What's with that attitude! Self-important person!]"]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: Part-Time Bodyguard","paragraphs":["\"Today, we're going to announce a task regarding next week's living expenses,\" Director Xu said.","Jing Zeyou took the task card handed to him by Director Xu and looked at the 'part-time job task' inside with some confusion.","Seeing this, the other three gathered around.","Director Xu continued, \"Before we start recording next week, we'll strictly control expenses based on the earnings from this part-time job.\"","Jing Yi's eyes widened as she looked at the task card in front of her.","[What?! I have to control my spending in my own home?!]","\"Of course, no matter where you all go next week, you must use only the money earned from this part-time job.\"","Jing Yi raised her hand, and Director Xu gestured for her to ask her question.","\"I want to ask, doesn't my big brother going to the company count as work?\"","Director Xu couldn't help but laugh, \"That definitely doesn't count.\"","[How daring! Asking the CEO of Hengjing to do part-time work?!]","[Haha, how could that be considered part-time work? Is there any part-time job that pays millions per minute?!]","[This perspective is quite fresh...]","[The production team is being unreasonable. How can working for yourself not count as work? Haha]","[Who would dare to ask the CEO of Hengjing to work for them?!]","Jing Zeyou spoke up, \"Where do you all want to go next week?\" He needed to know the destination first to plan the next steps.","Jing Zejun hesitated for a moment, \"How about going on a trip?\" It was getting boring staying at home all the time.","Jing Yi nodded eagerly in agreement. She had been restless for a while now. Recording a variety show was different from just lounging at home. Even though there would be many cameras when they went out, it was still better than being stuck at home.","Seeing that the other two had expressed their opinions, Jing Zeqian didn't object, \"Where do you want to go?\" He wondered where he should find a part-time job.","As they were all pondering, Jing Yi seemed to have thought of something, her eyes lighting up.","\"How about a road trip?\" This way, they could go wherever they wanted.","Jing Zeqian also became interested, \"Sounds good! Feels like it would be fun!\"","[Wait, they know they need to earn money for the recording, yet they suggest an expensive road trip?]","[Exactly, I don't know what she's thinking. Does she think she doesn't have to earn money herself?]","[But a road trip, doesn't it sound fun?]","[They have brothers who can earn money, why are you all getting so worked up?]","Regardless of the debate in the comments, the four of them had already decided on the road trip. The next issue was how to earn money.","Although a road trip would be fun, it would certainly require a considerable amount of money.","Jing Yi cupped her chin, looking troubled. Her skills were limited, and she couldn't think of what to do for work.","Jing Yi started to list her skills.","[Racing? Earn prize money from competitions? No, that's too slow. It's best to have something that pays daily.]","Jing Zeqian, hearing her plan to earn money through racing, instinctively wanted to object, but he was relieved when Jing Yi immediately dismissed the idea.","[How about being a bodyguard?]","Jing Yi recalled her decent self-defense skills and shifted her gaze to the three family members in the room.","First was Jing Zeyou, but Jing Yi quickly ruled him out.","[No good, big brother is very busy, and besides, his driver is already his bodyguard. I can't take someone else's job, can I?]","Jing Zeyou didn't object, but he worried Jing Yi might get bored.","Jing Yi then looked at Jing Zeqian.","He unconsciously straightened his back, feeling a bit smug. If Jing Yi wanted to be his bodyguard, he wouldn't mind accepting.","[This is even worse! Following him would definitely give me a headache from his constant lecturing! And he'd probably make me memorize the entire history of Startrack! Too scary!]","Jing Zeqian gritted his teeth a bit.","Finally, Jing Yi settled on Jing Zejun.","[I'll stick with Junjun! It won't count as earning money from family, and I can protect her!]","Jing Yi quickly raised her hand.","Director Xu felt a twinge of unease, not knowing what strange idea this young lady had come up with this time.","\"Can I be Junjun's bodyguard?\" Jing Yi asked.","Director Xu was taken aback, \"There's a rule that says no cheating. Working for family members counts as cheating.\" Besides, with Jing Yi's small frame, how could she be a bodyguard?","[...Why does she always try to exploit loopholes?]","[Everyone else is recording properly, why is she always trying to bend the rules?]","[She doesn't think this is cute, does she? Being a bodyguard isn't something just anyone can do.]","[She's probably just trying to ride on Jing Zejun's popularity.]","Hearing Director Xu's words, Jing Zejun immediately retorted, \"If Yi Yi becomes my bodyguard, she'd be earning money from my company, not from me personally.\"","Jing Zejun wasn't lying about this. Her manager and assistant were directly employed by Great Qin Entertainment, and their salaries were paid by the company.","Director Xu grew a bit anxious and continued, \"But being a bodyguard is still cheating. The job content doesn't match the guest's actual abilities.\"","At these words, the expressions of the three Jing family members became somewhat complex, making Director Xu wonder if he had said something wrong.","Jing Zeyou looked up at Director Xu, \"As long as we can prove that Yi Yi has the ability to handle this position, she can be Junjun's assistant bodyguard, right?\"","\"...Yes,\" Director Xu replied reluctantly.","Jing Zeyou gestured to Jing Yi, who stood up, flexing her wrists.","\"Then send someone out to spar with me for a few rounds.\"","Director Xu looked at Jing Yi with a complicated expression, while the staff behind him also looked scared. This was the Jing family's precious daughter - what if they accidentally hurt her? Would they still have their jobs?","[Can't she stop messing around? The staff are just trying to make a living, who has time to play with this rich girl?]","[But it was the CEO who spoke up? Maybe Jing Yi actually has some skills?]","[You're joking! If this isn't fake fighting or just playing along with her, I'll eat my keyboard!]","Jing Zeqian crossed his legs, leaning back lazily on the sofa. Seeing the staff members timidly hiding in the back, he smirked.","\"Don't worry, if anything breaks, it's not on you. If you can land a hit on her, there's a bonus in it for you. Just send out a few strong ones.\"","Jing Yi glared at him, then continued to stand in place, waiting.","Hearing Jing Zeqian's words, Director Xu felt more at ease. The living room was full of cameras, and the boss of Startrack Company wouldn't go back on his word.","Director Xu called for two of the more robust-looking staff members.","Both looked somewhat nervous, \"Miss Jing, we apologize in advance...\"","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving, \"It's fine, just come at me together.\"","The two exchanged a glance, then attacked simultaneously.","Jing Yi's smiling eyes instantly turned cold. She calmly observed their movements, swiftly dodging their punches while quickly kicking one of them in the knee.","Seeing his companion fall so quickly, the other man's eyes showed surprise, but he still gritted his teeth and charged forward.","He raised his foot, preparing for a flying kick, but Jing Yi caught his leg. Her right elbow moved with incredible speed towards his chin. The staff member closed his eyes in fear.","But he only felt a gust of wind. Jing Yi had stopped a split second before making contact with his chin.","She smiled and released him, then helped up the still-shocked staff member who was lying on the ground."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Do You Qualify as a Bodyguard","paragraphs":["The live comments suddenly calmed down. Although they had guessed it might be staged, it wasn't until Jing Yi began her demonstration that they realized...","How could this possibly be fake?","Putting aside Jing Yi's evasion speed, her reaction time and attack moves were absolutely shocking.","[...Those moves are way too fast!]","[I'll stake my entire career on this! She definitely knows Sanda!]","[Should I be grateful Jing Yi doesn't know me? Otherwise, those things I said earlier...]","[Who would have thought such a sweet and pretty girl could be so fierce in combat?!]","It wasn't just the online viewers who were surprised; Director Xu, who had been watching the whole time, was even more shocked.","Just minutes ago, he had been worried that his staff might accidentally hurt Jing Yi. Now, after seeing her dodging and attacking moves, as well as the two staff members lying on the ground, he was stunned.","\"So, Director Xu? Am I qualified to be a bodyguard?\" Jing Yi helped the men up, her lips curving into a smile as she looked expectantly at the director.","He nodded with difficulty. What else could he say?","And just like that, Jing Yi's bodyguard gig was confirmed.","Director Xu then turned to look at Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian, who were sitting on the sofa enjoying the show. \"What kind of part-time jobs are Mr. Jing and Young Mr. Jing planning to do?\"","He felt a bit nervous inside. One managed Hengjing, the other managed Startrack, and here he was asking them about 'part-time jobs'!","But he had to admit, it felt a little satisfying...","Jing Zeyou had already thought it through. \"Isn't it enough if two people from the family complete the task?\"","Director Xu hesitated for a moment, then nodded. There was no rule that everyone had to do a part-time job.","Since Jing Zeyou had said this, it meant he had it figured out, so Jing Zeqian decided not to worry about it anymore.","Meanwhile, on the social media platform Weibo, the video of Jing Yi and the staff quickly went viral and topped the trending list.","[The contrast is too big!]","[Wow! She's so cool!]","[I thought she was a sweet girl, but she's actually like a drill instructor!]","[Is this the fake young lady from before? Is she also planning to enter the entertainment industry?]","[This is from the family reality show she's doing with Jing Zeyou. I recommend it, I'm dying of laughter from her and Young Mr. Jing!]","[Isn't this obviously staged? Has Director Xu sold out for money?]","[To the person above, this was a live broadcast, not an edited video.]","On another side, Wen Qingyan and Wen Yin were deep in thought. They hadn't yet decided what to do for the next episode, but without money, they couldn't do anything. So, the two were pondering ways to earn money.","Wen Yin cautiously glanced at his brother and carefully suggested, \"Brother, why don't you do photo ops? If we charge 20 yuan per photo, we'll make a fortune.\"","What a terrible idea. Wen Qingyan gave him a look of exasperation.","But the online viewers thought this idea wasn't bad at all. By the looks of it, even if the price was ten times higher, there would probably still be a constant stream of customers.","Unfortunately, his brother rejected the idea, so Wen Yin had to think of other part-time job options. He muttered, \"I thought it was quite a good idea.\"","\"How about street busking?\" Noticing Wen Qingyan's expression, Wen Yin quickly added, \"I mean, I'll do the street busking.\" He certainly didn't have the guts to suggest his brother perform on the street.","Wen Qingyan was an incredibly talented actor. God had opened that door for him, but closed another – namely, the skill of singing.","The more Wen Yin thought about it, the more feasible it seemed. If he sang on the street, his brother's fame would surely attract quite a crowd!","\"Then what can I do?\" Wen Qingyan asked.","Wen Yin blurted out, \"Be the mascot!\"","[Hahaha, the little brother really dares to say it!]","[Can't be helped, singing is the one thing the great actor Wen just can't do.]","[I want to go! I want to go!]","[Sisters in the same area are so lucky!]","In the end, Wen Qingyan had no choice but to agree. After all, he wouldn't be the one singing.","Meanwhile, athlete Chen Yu and his wife had decided on their part-time job as swimming instructors at a pool.","Singer Cheng Cheng planned to work part-time as a service staff member at a hospital, which would also allow the show to film some content about his parents' work.","As for Li Shaocheng, she had just received her task.","\"Earn money through part-time work?\" Li Shaocheng's eyes widened slightly. \"Sister, do you have any ideas?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister was as quiet as ever, only saying a few words, \"I don't have any ideas yet.\"","Li Shaocheng didn't seem to mind, smiling sweetly, \"I have an idea. Why don't we make some cute desserts and sandwiches, and then sell them at the market?\"","[As expected of Chengzi, she has so many skills! She can even make desserts!]","[Chengzi said she loves eating sweets, but look how thin she is. She must have one of those metabolisms that doesn't gain weight!]","[Chengzi is so cute, unlike that rough person next door!]","[Yeah, what's so great about knowing Sanda? Is it worth showing off so much?]","[Are you talking about Jing Yi? I didn't see her showing off...]","[Fans pretending to be neutral observers, get out! You're not welcome here!]","[Better leave quickly, her fans are notorious for 'biting'...]","As the comments started to argue, Li Shaocheng was still discussing the market stall plans with her sister.","\"Sister, what are you planning to do?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister thought she was genuinely asking and was about to answer when she caught the look in Li Shaocheng's eyes.","She immediately understood that it wasn't really a question at all.","She forced a smile, \"How would I know how to do that? You know I've never been good at making desserts, right?\"","Li Shaocheng beamed, \"Then sister, you can be my assistant! We'll make some puddings, cakes, and oh, those sandwiches you like...\"","\"...Okay.\"","And so, the dessert-making plan was settled.","As night fell, the day's live broadcast came to an end. Li Shaocheng was saying goodbye to the viewers with a bright smile.","After the staff left, Li Shaocheng's smile faded.","She turned to her sister, pointing at the pile of ingredients they had chosen earlier for tomorrow's part-time job task.","Li Shaocheng looked impatient, \"Sis, you know how to make them, right? You picked all those ingredients. They need to be ready before the cameras start rolling tomorrow morning.\"","Her sister nodded silently, which displeased Li Shaocheng.","\"It's fine if you're usually this wooden, but can't you act a bit more lively in front of the camera? Mom and Dad told you not to drag me down. I should have brought them to film instead of a block of wood like you!\"","Li Shaocheng frowned as she prepared to go back to her room to rest. Seeming to remember something, she turned back and instructed, \"Remember to make the desserts.\"","Her sister stared at the pile of dessert ingredients in front of her, still expressionless, and murmured, \"That's why I said I wanted to go somewhere far away, to get away from you all. You were the ones who insisted on following me...\""]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: A Day of the Bodyguard","paragraphs":["On Jing Yi's first day as a bodyguard, she woke up earlier than everyone else.","By this time, Jing Yi was already seated in the living room.","Jing Zeyou was adjusting his cufflinks as he came downstairs. Upon seeing Jing Yi, he paused, his eyes betraying a hint of surprise.","\"Yi Yi?\"","Jing Yi turned her head to greet him, \"Good morning, Big Brother.\"","It wasn't just Jing Zeyou who was surprised; the online viewers who had entered the livestream early were also taken aback at the sight of Jing Yi.","Unless she had to wake up early to cook, Jing Yi was usually the last one to come downstairs.","Jing Zeyou voiced the viewers' curiosity, \"Why are you up so early today?\"","Jing Yi walked to the kitchen and brought out today's breakfast of toast and fried eggs. She also brewed a cup of coffee for Jing Zeyou.","\"Aren't I supposed to be Jun Jun's bodyguard? I got up early to prepare. We're going to a magazine photoshoot later.\"","Jing Yi had thoroughly familiarized herself with Jing Zejun's schedule for the day, which mainly consisted of two events: a magazine photoshoot and a talk show appearance.","\"Thank you. Have you eaten?\" Jing Zeyou asked as he accepted the plate and coffee.","She smiled, her dimples showing, making her look adorably pretty. \"Jun Jun mentioned there's a great handmade bun shop near the photoshoot location. I'm planning to go there with her later.\"","Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a smile as he enjoyed the breakfast Jing Yi had prepared due to her early rising.","[As expected, only food can make Jing Yi wake up early!]","[Haha, I knew there was a reason she only made two portions of breakfast.]","[First day as a bodyguard, early rise!]","[If this job requires early mornings, I doubt Yi Yi will be up for it.]","[The way Jing CEO looks at her is so doting!]","Meanwhile, Jing Zejun hurried down the stairs. \"Yi Yi, I'm ready. Let's go.\"","Jing Zejun called out to Jing Yi as she headed towards the door. She noticed Jing Zeyou in the dining area, \"Good morning, Big Brother.\"","\"Leaving so early?\"","\"We're almost due to meet the photographer.\"","The two waved goodbye to Jing Zeyou, with the camera crew hurrying to keep up.","Since she was playing the role of an artist's bodyguard today, Jing Yi chose a more business-like sedan.","The camera crew sat in the car, focusing their lens on Jing Yi, who was concentrating on driving.","\"Do you have any preparations for your first day as a bodyguard?\"","Jing Yi turned the steering wheel, keeping her eyes on the road. \"Of course! I've made thorough preparations and I'm well-versed with Jun Jun's schedule for today.\"","Besides being a bodyguard, she was also Jing Zejun's assistant for the day.","An hour later, Jing Zejun was seated in the makeup room. Her executive manager was coordinating with the magazine's photographer and the wardrobe stylist.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was responsible for sitting nearby, eating breakfast, and occasionally feeding Jing Zejun.","Watching Jing Zejun take just one bite before stopping, Jing Yi once again marveled at how being a celebrity wasn't for everyone.","Wondering if she wasn't being a very competent assistant, Jing Yi casually asked Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun laughed, \"Didn't you drive me here today? Besides, aren't you my bodyguard? A bodyguard's duty is to stay by my side and protect me, which you're doing perfectly well so far.\"","Jing Yi then contentedly resumed her breakfast. The makeup artist glanced at her discreetly.","This wasn't just incompetence; if she hadn't been told, she would have thought Jing Yi was just here to keep Jing Zejun company.","A staff member from the magazine knocked on the door, \"Miss Jing, are you ready?\"","\"Yes, I am.\"","As Jing Zejun was about to leave, she suddenly remembered Jing Yi was still in the makeup room. \"Yi Yi, if you're bored, you can take a walk around. I'm shooting outdoors and it's a bit chilly, so don't stand guard over me.\"","The executive manager looked at Jing Yi, who had just finished her breakfast, and thought to herself: She's even worried about her getting cold? This doesn't sound like instructions for an assistant at all.","Jing Zejun left for the outdoor shoot with her executive manager, while Jing Yi cleaned up her breakfast packaging before following them out.","Since she was playing the role of a bodyguard, she thought she should at least try to be competent. Ten minutes later, Jing Yi fell asleep on the lounge chair.","Just a moment ago, she had been watching Jing Zejun strike various poses, but gradually her eyelids grew heavier, and she ended up falling asleep on Jing Zejun's lounge chair.","The camera knowingly panned to the sleeping Jing Yi, then back to Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun had just finished a set and was about to change into the next outfit when she noticed the sleeping Jing Yi. Her lips curved into a smile, her eyes filled with amusement.","\"Sister Li, could you please bring a jacket to cover Yi Yi?\" She must have gotten up too early today.","The magazine photographer nearby was somewhat bewildered. It was the first time he'd seen an assistant who was more of a diva than the artist. Their own artist was still in the middle of a photoshoot, yet she was sleeping there?","[I suddenly feel like shipping these two sisters!]","[Jun Jun is so gentle!]","[Wasn't she supposed to be the bodyguard? Now she's sleeping there? Is money that easy to earn?]","[But her employer doesn't seem to mind.]","[Why does Orange spend all night making desserts, while she just needs to sleep on a lounge chair to count as working?]","[Exactly! It can't be that easy, right?]","[Hey, did you guys enter the wrong livestream? If you want to be sour, go back to your own idol's stream!]","[What's going on? Have Li Shaocheng's fans invaded Earth?]","Meanwhile, Li Shaocheng had prepared desserts and set up a small stall even before the event started.","At this moment, there was a surge of people in front of their stall.","Li Shaocheng smiled and reminded her fans to be careful, \"Please watch your step!\"","Her sister beside her looked somewhat haggard, but no one paid attention to her. All eyes were on Li Shaocheng, who was handing out cakes packaged by her sister to the fans, always with a smile on her face.","Soon, the small stall in front of Li Shaocheng was empty. Disappointed fans had no choice but to leave reluctantly.","The area around the stall quieted down. Li Shaocheng lowered her head to tidy up the stall, her eyes betraying her displeasure.","Seeing her sister moving at a leisurely pace, she felt even more annoyed.","\"You should...\"","Li Shaocheng wanted to urge her to finish cleaning up quickly so she could rest. She had been busy all morning giving out cakes and collecting money, and she was exhausted!","The irritation was about to spill from her lips when Li Shaocheng realized the camera was still rolling. She quickly composed herself and whined to her sister.","\"Sis, let's eat out later, okay? I'm so tired, I don't think I have the energy to cook.\"","\"Alright.\"","The online viewers were filled with sympathy.","[I feel so bad for Orange. Why can't her sister help at all?]","[Exactly! Always with a sour face. Orange did everything, worked all night, and even had to man the stall herself!]","[But I saw that her sister was the one packaging the cakes. Li Shaocheng was just handing them to fans and socializing.]","[I think I just saw Li Shaocheng lose her temper...]","[Of course she'd be upset, she's been busy all night and must be exhausted! And her sister is like that!]","[I came to see how hard your idol is working. A small cake for over 100 yuan?]","[It's not like we're selling to you! Why are you barking?!]"]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: The Hidden i Man","paragraphs":["In the afternoon, Jing Zejun had a talk show interview scheduled.","Jing Yi, feeling a bit embarrassed about falling asleep earlier, refused to leave Jing Zejun's side while he was preparing.","Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi, who was sitting upright beside him, with an amused expression.","\"Yi Yi, you really don't need to watch over me. Everything's prepared, and we can go home after the recording is finished.\"","Jing Yi shook her head, refusing to leave. Since this was the last work commitment, she wanted to stand guard until the very end.","Before Jing Zejun could say anything more, the executive manager came over to announce the start of the rehearsal.","Jing Zejun had no choice but to give in. \"Alright, you can stay for the rehearsal, but during the actual recording, find a seat and rest.\"","Jing Yi nodded in agreement.","After the rehearsal ended, Jing Zejun was discussing the final segment with the host. Jing Yi looked around and noticed a few people in the audience holding banners with 'Jun' written on them.","Curious, she walked over to them.","The group consisted of several girls who appeared to be about Jing Yi's age. They became excited when they saw her approaching.","They knew she was Jing Zejun's sister, and judging by Jing Zejun's attitude, he seemed to care a lot about her.","\"Little sister!\" One of the girls couldn't help but call out. Seeing Jing Yi look their way, she quickly covered her mouth, looking flustered.","Jing Yi asked, puzzled, \"Were you calling me?\"","The group nodded in unison. Jing Yi looked at them and asked, \"Why are you calling me little sister? We look about the same age.\"","\"Because you're Jun Jun's sister!\" another girl exclaimed excitedly.","Well, now her seniority had dropped even further...","\"Are you all Jun Jun's fans?\" Jing Yi sat down next to them and started chatting.","She learned from them that they were all university students from nearby. They had found out about Jing Zejun's talk show interview from the studio's schedule release and had signed up early to attend.","So you need to sign up for these things, Jing Yi thought.","Looking around at the audience seats, she felt it wouldn't be bad to sit with Jing Zejun's fans.","\"Wait for me a moment. I'll go ask Sister Li if I can sit with you in the audience seats during the recording.\"","The girls watched Jing Yi walk away, feeling excited.","\"Jun Jun's sister is so pretty too!\"","\"Yeah, but in a different way from Jun Jun!\"","\"It's good we didn't listen to what people were saying online. Jun Jun seems to have a great relationship with his sister!\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi found Jing Zejun's executive manager and inquired about the seating arrangement.","The manager looked over and said, \"Of course it's no problem. Jun Jun was worried you'd be bored and reserved a front-row seat for you. If you want to sit over there, just use this ticket to exchange seats with someone in that area.\"","She thought that nobody would refuse a front-row seat in exchange for one further back.","After sorting out the seating issue, Jing Yi brought several cups of coffee over to the girls.","\"Thank you for supporting Jun Jun. Could I have one of those banners?\"","Jing Yi had specifically brought coffee to trade.","The girl next to her quickly handed one over. After all, they had brought many to give to any 'Junzilan' they might meet during the recording.","Jing Yi opened the banner. It had a plum-colored gradient background with Jing Zejun's image and his name in artistic font. One glance was enough to see how much care had been put into it.","The camera crew zoomed in on the banner.","Then, viewers saw Jing Yi, with excitement in her eyes, unfurl the banner and wave it towards the center of the stage.","[Pfft! I suddenly find Jing Yi quite adorable!]","[Haha, the bodyguard has turned into a cheering fan.]","[You could say she's wearing multiple hats now.]","Jing Yi sat in her seat, chatting with the fans for a while. The audience seats gradually filled up.","Some audience members recognized Jing Yi and kept turning to look at her.","\"That's Jing Zejun's sister, right?\"","\"Yes! I was watching their livestream today. Seems like she came as a bodyguard.\"","The show began its official recording. The livestream couldn't reveal the entire content of the show, so the camera only occasionally panned to Jing Zejun, mostly focusing on Jing Yi's reactions.","This variety show seemed to revolve around asking questions to the celebrities, and Jing Zejun wasn't the only guest.","However, perhaps due to the unique atmosphere in the studio, the host frequently directed questions towards Jing Zejun.","\"Because Zejun has been receiving a lot of attention lately, finding your parents recently must have been a major turning point in your life.\"","Jing Zejun nodded with a smile, \"Yes, it was.\"","The host continued, \"How do you view this turning point?\"","Jing Zejun hesitated for a moment before saying softly, \"Actually, for me, the only significance is that I once again have a family.\" Though it was just a gentle statement, it moved many in the audience.","The livestream viewers couldn't hear what was being said on stage, but seeing Jing Yi's expressions, they too felt somewhat emotional.","[I feel like everything else could be faked, but the closeness between these two sisters can't be.]","[Sometimes when I look at Jing Zejun, I feel like she relies more on this sister than on her two brothers.]","[There's more to relationships between girls than just competition...]","Jing Zejun's answers were impeccable. The host pressed further, \"But this change also brought about a shift in your identity, didn't it?\"","The studio grew quiet, as if no one had expected such a pointed question from the host. However, Jing Zejun seemed prepared.","Before the rehearsal, a staff member had approached her, hinting that some interview questions might be a bit sharp.","Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"Yes, these material conditions are unavoidable, and even my second brother is in the entertainment industry.\"","The host hadn't expected Jing Zejun to answer so frankly.","\"Actually, it's not just you. During the time when your identity was revealed, almost everyone was questioning why I was still following my original path when I had found a powerful and influential family. Even my family members thought the same.\"","\"That's also something I'm curious about,\" the host chimed in.","Jing Zejun smiled, her face radiating a gentle warmth. \"I was almost defeated by everyone's doubts and chose to compromise, but there was one person who truly understood me.\"","Jing Zejun turned to look at Jing Yi sitting in the back row. The camera immediately focused on Jing Zejun, then panned back.","\"She would stand in front of me first, shielding me from all doubts. Only she knew that if I compromised in the face of others' doubts, the audience would no longer call me Jing Zejun when they saw me again...\"","In an instant, all the audience members turned to look at Jing Yi.","She had been immersed in Jing Zejun's words, but seeing so many gazes directed at her, she smiled awkwardly in various directions.","[Hahaha, although we don't know what's being said on stage, Jing Yi's expression is too cute!]","[Didn't expect her to be a hidden introvert!]","[That lost little look, hahaha!]","Jing Zejun's gaze softened a bit more."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: Family Relations","paragraphs":["Browsing social media, netizens are discussing what Jing Zejun said on a variety show.","\"Does anyone know what Jing Zejun said during today's variety show recording?\"","Below the topic, the most liked comment:","[I know! I was there. The host asked Jing Zejun how she felt about her identity change, and she talked about the doubts she's been facing lately.]","[The important part is! She said Jing Yi is the only person who knows how she feels, and that Jing Yi would stand up for her. Finally, Jing Zejun said if she compromised, audiences wouldn't call her Jing Zejun anymore when they see her again!]","[I was there too! I burst into tears when I heard that! Is this what they mean by 'another me in this world'?]","[What does that mean? What does she mean by 'wouldn't call her Jing Zejun anymore'?]","[It's obvious! If she hadn't insisted, people would probably call her Jing Zeqian's sister now, or Hengjing Group CEO Jing Zeyou's sister.]","[But don't people already know her identity now? Isn't this just drawing attention to it?]","[At least it lets everyone know her stance.]","As netizens chatted, the topic drifted, and they began comparing the relationship between the Jing sisters to that of the Li sisters.","With both pairs being sisters and all four appearing on the same variety show, the discussion became increasingly heated.","[I think Jing Zejun and Jing Yi's relationship seems closer. There's always something off about Li Shaocheng and her sister.]","[Me too! I didn't dare say it before, but I can't even remember Li Shaocheng's sister's name now...]","[At least our Li Shaocheng and Sister Juzi are blood-related. The other pair seems to be riding the popularity wave too hard!]","[Some fans shouldn't pretend to be neutral observers! Fake is fake! Stop pretending to have a deep sisterly bond!]","[Well, can you tell me what Li Shaocheng's sister's name is then?! You keep calling her 'Li Shaocheng's sister', doesn't she have her own name?]","Li Shaocheng, reading the discussion under the topic, grew increasingly angry. \"What's wrong with you? Didn't I tell you to interact more with the fans? Why are there still so many supporting Jing Yi down there?!\"","Her manager calmly sat on the sofa, ignoring her outburst.","\"I'm talking to you! What's with your attitude?!\"","The manager glanced up at her, \"My attitude? The company finally found you a variety show that could make you popular, and this is all the attention you've gained? And you're asking about my attitude? Li Shaocheng, don't be so arrogant.\"","Li Shaocheng restrained herself a bit, but still gritted her teeth, \"Brother Lu, you've seen it too! It's not me causing trouble, it's Jing Zejun and Jing Yi! If it weren't for them, how could I be overshadowed? Those people even say I'm not as good as her!\"","\"So what do you plan to do? Hire water armies? Don't forget what her brother does. If it's traced back to you, that's one thing, but what if it's traced back to the company? Think more about how to gain fans on the variety show.\"","The manager stood up, dusted off his clothes, and turned to leave. A C-list celebrity about to fade into obscurity, he didn't know why he was wasting so much time.","Li Shaocheng stared at his back, her eyes full of hatred.","Not as good? She wasn't as good at anything!","Li Shaocheng swept everything in front of her onto the floor, thinking of her manager's mockery, her whole body trembling with anger.","She clenched her teeth, \"I don't believe I can't outdo you fake sisters!\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi, who had just finished her first recording and was unaware of being on someone's mind, was taking a nap in her room.","After she had slept enough, she went downstairs and saw the familiar Aunt Wang.","\"Aunt Wang! You're finally back!\"","Aunt Wang had just brought out her lunch, and seeing Jing Yi's smiling face welcoming her, she was also very happy.","\"If you hadn't come back, I would have starved to death,\" Jing Yi said exaggeratedly.","But Aunt Wang's crow's feet deepened, \"Aren't you quite good at cooking?\"","If she hadn't watched the livestream, she would have thought Jing Yi had been starved during the recording.","During her time off at home, Aunt Wang would watch the Jing family's livestreams. Seeing Jing Yi cooking so well, she was quite surprised.","Jing Yi picked up a piece of Aunt Wang's signature dish, put it in her mouth, and her face was full of satisfaction.","\"Those were just home-cooked meals. How can they compare to Aunt Wang's cooking!\"","It wasn't an exaggeration - so far, no one could cook better than Aunt Wang!","She felt like all the fatigue from this period had been healed!","Seeing the person in front of her eating with such relish, Aunt Wang looked at Jing Yi lovingly. Her way of eating really made one's appetite grow.","\"Have big brother and the others already gone to work?\" Jing Yi raised her head to ask Aunt Wang during a pause.","\"Zeyou and Zejun left early in the morning, and Zeqian went to the company after having breakfast this morning.\"","It wasn't surprising that Jing Zeyou went to work punctually as always.","Jing Yi also knew that Jing Zejun was going to discuss endorsement matters with advertisers today.","What was surprising was that Jing Zeqian was so diligent to go to work when they had just finished recording and could rest.","Indeed, she was the only one with nothing to do! Jing Yi contentedly took a sip of the soup. This was truly comfortable!","Meanwhile, in the CEO's office of Hengjing Group, Assistant Chen stood in front of the desk, reporting to Jing Zeyou about the matters he was asked to investigate a few days ago.","\"...After General Shen left Huarui Group in the morning, those vans followed him, then forced his car onto a small road at Shubo Road. A few minutes later, Miss Yi also followed the navigation's directions to the small road, which is why she encountered the people from the vans surrounding General Shen.\"","Jing Zeyou's fingers lightly tapped on the desk, his eyes deep in thought, seemingly pondering something.","Assistant Chen lowered his head slightly, waiting for Jing Zeyou's next instructions.","Jing Zeyou spoke: \"Have you found out who the people in the vans were?\"","Assistant Chen immediately replied: \"We've clarified that. They were hired by General Shen's aunt, who is the wife of the former Huarui Group president. General Shen called the police that day and had them arrested.\"","At this point, Assistant Chen couldn't help but criticize in his heart. Mrs. Shen really had poor judgment in people.","Not to mention her choice of husband, who was incompetent - Huarui Group was in such a state under his management - and morally questionable, even keeping several mistresses.","As for the people she hired, she spent so much money just to get a bunch of thugs who could only bluff. They only dared to bring sticks to a fight and were taken down in just two or three moves.","Jing Zeyou knew some of Shen Huaichu's family affairs, but these weren't his main concern.","The reason he asked Assistant Chen to investigate the incident of Shen Huaichu being surrounded was only for Jing Yi's sake.","Jing Yi rarely had such a poor attitude towards someone, and knowing that the person she encountered in the previous fight was Shen Huaichu, these things together made Jing Zeyou worry about any emotional entanglement between Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: How Reluctant to let go of Jing Zéqiān","paragraphs":["Jing Zeyou admitted that Shen Huaichu was a formidable person and an excellent business partner. He admired Shen Huaichu's abilities.","However, as Jing Yi's brother, he didn't think Shen Huaichu was suitable for her.","Shen Huaichu's methods were ruthless, indicating he was a fierce character - someone not easily swayed and cold-hearted.","Add to that his complicated family background...","The more Jing Zeyou thought about it, the more his brows furrowed.","But for now, it seemed the two had only met by chance.","Since he learned that Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu had just encountered each other coincidentally, Jing Zeyou didn't ask Assistant Chen to investigate further.","\"That's all, you can go now.\"","Assistant Chen bowed slightly, \"Yes, sir.\"","He turned and left the office, closing the door behind him.","...","\"Boqi, when can I leave Startrack?\"","In a private residence in North River, Jiang Miaomiao lay in a man's arms.","The man on the sofa wore a white shirt, his tie loosely hanging around his neck, clutched in Jiang Miaomiao's hand. His shirt cuffs were adorned with sparkling diamond cufflinks.","Hearing Jiang Miaomiao's question, he tilted his head back leisurely, a pair of thin-framed glasses perched on his nose bridge, a faint smile playing on his lips.","\"Didn't I tell you? After you attend the celebration banquet and finish the task, I'll take you away.\"","Jiang Miaomiao's hand, gripping the man's tie, paused slightly.","In a while, Startrack would host a celebration banquet for Jiang Miaomiao to celebrate her Golden Lotus Award.","This award was insignificant in her acting career, but Jiang Miaomiao still had her agent and the company plan such an event.","Why?","Naturally, it was for the task the man had assigned her: to hand Jing Zeqian a glass of wine at the banquet - a glass of wine laced with something.","Seeing her lower her head without speaking, a fleeting darkness passed through the man's alluring eyes, seemingly concealing an inexplicable danger.","His tone betrayed no displeasure, \"What's wrong? Can't bear to part with Jing Zeqian?\"","\"No, that's not it!\"","Jiang Miaomiao immediately raised her head to deny, fearing the man would misunderstand.","She just felt that the powder the man had given her might cause too severe consequences.","After all, Jing Zeqian was the one who had led her to her current achievements. She occasionally wondered if she was being too heartless.","The man noticed Jiang Miaomiao's hesitation, his lips curling into an imperceptible, mocking smile, though his embrace remained gentle.","\"Don't worry, this dosage won't cause Jing Zeqian much suffering. At most, it will only impact Startrack a bit.\"","Seeing Jiang Miaomiao still wavering, displeasure flashed in the man's eyes, disappearing moments later.","\"You know that our family has been secretly vying with the Jing family for status in North River. If I want to marry you, don't I need to give my family a gift first? This way, my father will have a better impression of you.\"","\"Besides, with the Jing family's power, that little thing will at most cause them some trouble.\"","On this point, the man wasn't lying. He never expected that small amount to completely bring down the Jing family. Startrack wasn't that important in his eyes either.","His ultimate goal was the Hengjing Group, and Jing Zeyou, who would be too preoccupied with saving Jing Zeqian to focus elsewhere.","After learning about the cooperation between Hengjing and Huarui Group, this idea grew stronger in the man's mind.","He couldn't let their cooperation succeed!","Therefore, he had Jiang Miaomiao plan this celebration banquet, where she would execute his plan.","Jiang Miaomiao bit her lip lightly, determination flashing in her eyes.","She leaned back into the man's arms, appearing dependent.","The man's lips curved slightly. He knew Jiang Miaomiao would definitely complete this task.","After all, she had no other choice now.","The man's hand gently stroked Jiang Miaomiao's hair. In an angle she couldn't see, his dark eyes were filled with bone-chilling indifference.","At this moment, what lay in his arms seemed not to be a warm person, but an obedient pet.","Meanwhile, Wen Qingyan had rarely returned to Startrack to handle some work-related matters.","\"Next week there's only the script reading session, and oh, at the end of the month there's Jiang Miaomiao's celebration banquet.\"","Wen Qingyan stopped flipping through the script and looked up at his agent in confusion, \"Celebration banquet? For that Golden Lotus Award from before?\"","Jiang Miaomiao winning the Golden Lotus Award wasn't a secret, but considering her previous award history, this award was practically worthless.","Suddenly holding a celebration banquet seemed somewhat odd.","The agent nodded. He had also just heard the news after arriving at Startrack today and found it equally strange.","On his way to handle work, he had met Jiang Miaomiao's agent and heard about the celebration banquet for her.","\"A celebration banquet for Sister Miaomiao?\"","\"Yes, it's perfect timing as she's about to finish filming. Let her relax a bit. We've already invited Mr. Jing. Remember to inform Wen.\"","Jiang Miaomiao's agent's tone didn't sound much like an invitation, more like he had just remembered to mention it after bumping into him.","Wen Qingyan's agent was used to this.","Although Jiang Miaomiao and Wen Qingyan were both Startrack artists, one an actress and one an actor, seemingly without any competition between them.","But Jiang Miaomiao seemed to have an obsession with always being one step ahead, regardless of who it was. So she wasn't very friendly towards Wen Qingyan either, at most exchanging pleasantries when they met at the company.","As for Wen Qingyan, he didn't much like Jiang Miaomiao's way of dealing with people either.","The industry praised her for her good acting, good personality, and high professional ability, but Wen Qingyan knew how Jiang Miaomiao had acquired her acting skills, so his attitude towards her wasn't very warm either.","Startrack staff secretly referred to the two as 'kings who never meet'.","\"Are you going? I heard she's already invited Mr. Jing.\"","\"I'm not going. I'd rather spend that time discussing good excuses with Little Yin.\"","Besides, isn't this Jiang Miaomiao's standard operation? What's so special about it?","The agent looked at him helplessly, \"You really are a man of action!\"","He felt that the previous dating contingency plan could be taken out and revised. You never know when it might need to be sent out.","The excuse Wen Qingyan mentioned was preparing a reason for a 'chance encounter' with Jing Zejun and her group.","Yes, he had already extracted information from the program team about Jing Zejun and her siblings planning a self-driving tour for next week's recording.","Originally thinking he'd have to wait until the later stages of the program recording to see Jing Zejun, now hearing this news, how could Wen Qingyan patiently wait until later?","He could completely fabricate a chance encounter and join the self-driving tour.","Wen Qingyan looked up at his agent, \"Since you're just standing there bored, help me think of a few excuses.\"","The agent couldn't help but roll his eyes. His big star was always saying he was idle. If he didn't have to accompany this ancestor to the company, he didn't know how busy he'd be!","\"Why can't you just say it's a coincidence?\"","\"Too deliberate.\"","The agent was speechless. He didn't believe Wen Qingyan could come up with an excuse that wasn't deliberate.","After all, any excuse would seem somewhat deliberate. Might as well just say it was a coincidence."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: The Masquerade Ball","paragraphs":["Early in the morning, Jing Yi was called out by Shen Xi.","Jing Yi dozed off in the passenger seat with her mouth slightly open. She only groggily woke up when the car stopped. As she followed Shen Xi's footsteps, she was still a bit unsteady. Seeing her 'dead tired' appearance, Shen Xi quickly stepped forward to pull her along.","Jing Yi yawned, \"Xixi, what kind of party is worth you dragging me out of bed so early?\" She had never heard of a party starting in the morning...","Shen Xi was leading the way, pulling Jing Yi along while also trying to make sure she didn't bump into any obstacles.","\"Don't we need time to prepare? If we start getting ready in the afternoon, how could we possibly make it in time? Besides, Jing Yi Yi, it's already 10 AM!\"","Even though she had dragged Jing Yi out early, it was already 10 o'clock after breakfast. How could she still be so sleepy?","Jing Yi couldn't help it. Yesterday, she was discussing going to the race track with Jing Zeqian, but he said he'd take her when he had time.","Unwilling to accept this, Jing Yi made a bet with him over a game - whoever lost would have to compromise. As a result, they ended up playing until very late...","Shen Xi pushed open a large door and ushered Jing Yi in first.","What followed was several hours of makeup and styling, during which they also managed to eat some takeout.","Jing Yi, who finished first, sat on the sofa watching Shen Xi, who seemed to be enjoying the process. She couldn't understand how someone could sit in front of a mirror for hours without changing expression.","As Jing Yi watched, she wanted to reach for some snacks on the coffee table, but the tightness around her waist stopped her.","The outfit she was wearing today apparently didn't allow for eating too much.","It was an ensemble with a touch of gothic style - a deep red, almost black, strapless form-fitting gown. The bodice featured a high-waisted lace-up design, while the skirt had two layers, one short and one long.","The stylist didn't do much with Jing Yi's hair, just some simple styling. A few strands at the front were braided into small plaits, while the rest of her wavy hair cascaded down her back, fully revealing her delicate face.","Around her neck was a choker necklace designed like a thorny rose stem.","Beside her lay an intricately crafted mask. Its outline was formed by delicate rose branches, with lifelike miniature rosebuds carved onto the twigs.","Shen Xi loved Jing Yi's entire look, but Jing Yi herself had no thoughts beyond sighing about how tired she was.","Jing Yi sighed again and continued to rest her face in her hands as she waited for Shen Xi.","Earlier, while they were getting styled, Shen Xi had told her that the party was being thrown by a friend of hers. To make it more fun, they had decided to make it a masquerade ball.","\"You know how it is with rich people. When they're bored, they throw parties to liven things up,\" Shen Xi's tone suggested that she often attended such events.","Jing Yi looked at Shen Xi's satisfied expression in the mirror, propped her chin on her hand, and said lazily, \"How would I know? If I had that much time, I'd rather sleep than throw a party.\"","\"All you think about is sleep!\"","On the other side, the makeup artist had finished the final touches and smiled at Shen Xi, saying, \"Miss Shen, we're all done. You can go change now.\"","Just as Jing Yi thought it was finally over and was about to breathe a sigh of relief, she realized that the styling was just the beginning of the ball!","When Shen Xi came out, she was wearing a silver-white pleated gown with a metallic silver chain shawl, holding a matching mask in her hand.","\"Wow! Who's this young lady? She's so beautiful!\"","Shen Xi glanced at Jing Yi with a smile, ignoring her teasing.","\"But Miss Shen, I suspect this ball isn't just a simple party, is it?\"","If it were really just a casual party thrown by a friend for fun, would Shen Xi spend an entire day preparing?","Seeing that Jing Yi had noticed something was off, Shen Xi laughed a bit sheepishly.","Indeed, it wasn't just for fun. This masquerade ball had invited many single young people from North river.","\"So, you're going to meet handsome guys?\"","Jing Yi and Shen Xi got into the car heading to the final party venue.","\"What else? There will probably be lots of young people there, which means lots of handsome guys!\"","Jing Yi was skeptical about Shen Xi's expectations. She even wondered how they would know if someone was handsome when everyone was wearing masks.","Shen Xi tapped Jing Yi's forehead lightly, as if disappointed in her. \"It's not a full-face mask, how could you not tell?! Besides, what's important is the aura! The aura!\"","Jing Yi could only concede, \"Alright, alright! Good luck to you!\"","\"Good luck to us!\" Shen Xi added.","Jing Yi politely declined. She wasn't interested in this ball. Even Jing Zeqian's company might not have many handsome guys, let alone a mere ball.","Her only thought was wondering if there would be food at the party...","Seeing that Jing Yi didn't respond, Shen Xi continued, \"Come on, react a little!\"","\"What?\"","Jing Yi seemed to have just snapped out of it, her round eyes wide with confusion.","Shen Xi sighed helplessly, \"I'm saying, what if you meet a handsome guy at the ball, and he turns out to be your soulmate, and from then on you live happily ever after...\"","\"Stop right there!\"","Jing Yi quickly cut off Shen Xi's dreamy imagination. It had always been like this - every time the topic of love came up, she would get this lovesick look on her face.","Yet ironically, she had never been in a relationship. Whenever someone was about to pursue her, her interest would immediately plummet, cooling off incredibly fast.","The most memorable instance was during their junior year in college. Jing Yi had just become close friends with Shen Xi, and during that time, Shen Xi kept going on about how handsome a certain senior was, describing him as her ideal type of a 'refined bad boy'. Jing Yi's ears nearly grew calluses from listening to it so much.","She even heard that Shen Xi had prepared an incredibly expensive gift for this soon-to-graduate senior as a graduation present. Jing Yi's first thought was just how expensive the gift must have been!","Later, she gave him the gift, and the very next day, the senior came to find Shen Xi.","Jing Yi was with Shen Xi at the time and witnessed the senior's confession firsthand.","But Jing Yi thought more deeply about it. The senior was about to graduate, and he came to confess the day after receiving the gift. She couldn't help but think there was more to it.","She was a bit worried that Shen Xi might get hurt, and even feared she might agree immediately. Who knew that Shen Xi's first reaction would be, \"Huh? Date?\" Her tone even carried a hint of reluctance.","Not only was the senior surprised, but Jing Yi hadn't expected this reaction from Shen Xi either. She had thought they were just in a simple 'gifter' and 'receiver' relationship.","From then on, Shen Xi's view on love remained a puzzle to Jing Yi.","\"Don't worry about whether others can meet their soulmates. First, think about when you'll be able to stay put and not run away when someone confesses to you. Then we can talk about other things.\"","Shen Xi felt a bit defiant but couldn't argue back. After all, Jing Yi wasn't wrong. Otherwise, she wouldn't have remained persistently interested in handsome guys while staying single."]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Playing Tricks, Be Professional About It","paragraphs":["\"Miss, we've arrived,\" Shen Xi's driver announced as they reached the venue for the masquerade ball.","Shen Xi eagerly peered inside, excited for this mysterious and free-spirited gathering.","The ball was held outdoors in a vast camping area. The lighting wasn't overly bright; instead, strings of lanterns hung overhead, emitting a soft glow that made the evening feel incredibly romantic.","It was quite an impressive setup.","Jing Yi glanced around, observing the masked guests. Some were chatting with drinks in hand, while others had paired off and were dancing in the center of the dance floor.","Shen Xi seemed to spot a familiar face and waved to a girl who approached them. \"Xixi, you made it!\"","Shen Xi nodded with a smile, \"Shu Man, thank you for inviting me to your ball! This is my friend; you can call her Little Yi.\"","\"Hello,\" Jing Yi politely greeted the host.","\"Hi, your mask is beautiful,\" the girl commented, her gaze lingering on Jing Yi's exquisite mask for a few seconds.","Jing Yi smiled and replied, \"Thank you.\" She did indeed love her mask.","Shen Xi didn't introduce Jing Yi in detail, as the masks made it impossible to identify anyone anyway. Given Jing Yi's status, she wouldn't have had a moment's peace all evening otherwise.","\"Well, Xixi, have fun with your friend. I need to go greet the other guests,\" Shu Man said.","\"Alright, go ahead.\"","Shen Xi handed Jing Yi a glass of champagne, occasionally glancing at the passing guests.","\"Yi Yi, look at that one!\" Shen Xi's eyes were fixed on a man wearing a tailcoat and black cape, with a deep red mask.","\"...Is he cosplaying?\" Jing Yi wondered. Perhaps as a vampire.","No wonder Shen Xi had spotted him immediately; he was the only one dressed that way.","\"Go talk to him,\" Jing Yi nudged Shen Xi's shoulder.","Shen Xi shook her head, \"No way, I brought you here. How could I leave you alone?\" She wasn't that kind of person!","Jing Yi couldn't help but laugh, \"Don't worry, go chat him up. I'll wander around a bit.\" After all, they came to meet handsome guys, not to stick together the whole time.","Shen Xi hesitated, then held up ten fingers, \"Ten minutes! I'll come find you in ten minutes!\"","\"...Alright.\"","Jing Yi watched Shen Xi's retreating figure, noting how her dress sparkled in the light.","Jing Yi looked around and walked to one side. Though she wasn't interested in the party itself, the night view of North river was breathtaking!","She leaned against the railing, enjoying the gradually warming weather and the gentle breeze.","It felt so nice!","Jing Yi set down her glass, intending to walk further to see more of the scenery.","However, instead of scenery, she spotted a familiar face! The man was reclining in a lounge chair, alone, holding a wine glass and gazing at the night view of North river.","Who else would pose like that but Shen Huaichu?!","Ever since seeing him at Hengjing, Jing Yi knew he was the newly appointed CEO of Huarui Group, the one Shen Xi said had shaken things up upon his return - Shen Huaichu!","Seeing someone she'd rather avoid, Jing Yi was about to turn and leave when two girls approached him.","Jing Yi's eyes darted around, her beautiful dark eyes glinting mischievously.","Perhaps she could watch the drama unfold before leaving.","The two girls had barely spoken a word when Shen Huaichu, who had been sitting quietly, already looked impatient. Whatever he said made the girls' expressions turn sour.","It seemed there would be no drama after all; Shen Huaichu was completely frigid.","Maybe she could cause him some trouble instead?","Jing Yi's lips curled into a smile as she adjusted her mask. She deliberately chose a corner position to make herself look more lonely and pitiful, ensuring the two girls could see her without being too obvious.","The two girls walked in her direction, still complaining about Shen Huaichu. \"What kind of person comes to a masquerade ball with such a cold attitude?!\"","\"Well, he is quite handsome though.\"","\"...I suppose he's not bad looking.\"","As they walked, they noticed Jing Yi in the corner and stopped.","\"Miss, are you alright?\"","Jing Yi looked up, intentionally using a trembling voice, \"I'm fine, I just... wanted to watch him from afar.\"","The girls exchanged glances, their eyes full of curiosity. If they weren't mistaken, she was looking in the direction of the man they'd just spoken to!","\"Is that man on the lounge chair your boyfriend?\" They weren't really trying to help; they just wanted to know Jing Yi's relationship with him.","Jing Yi seemed hesitant but nodded, continuing as if confiding in them, \"I know it's all my fault. I'm not elegant enough, not pretty enough, not virtuous enough...\" Her voice grew increasingly sorrowful.","The two girls looked Jing Yi up and down. She had flawless skin, a perfect figure, and though they couldn't see her whole face, she was clearly a beauty.","Their expressions grew complicated, \"...He's not satisfied with someone like you?\"","Jing Yi wiped away a tear from the corner of her eye, hiding a smile as she painted Shen Huaichu as the perfect combination of a phoenix man, a PUA, and a toxic male.","Shen Huaichu looked up, noticing the group of people who had been glancing at him with less than friendly looks for the past few minutes.","Shen Huaichu didn't care until he spotted a familiar face.","The person standing in the middle, gesticulating dramatically.","\"It's that man in the black suit.\"","\"What? He looks decent, but he's actually that kind of person!\"","\"Exactly! He's such a scumbag.\"","Their voices grew louder, and Jing Yi's smile widened. It was time for her to make her exit.","At that moment, Shen Huaichu slowly stood up and walked towards them.","Seeing Shen Huaichu approaching, Jing Yi instinctively hunched down, trying to sneak away. But whether it was due to Shen Huaichu's overpowering presence or not, the crowd quickly dispersed.","Jing Yi cleared her throat, trying to boost her courage and act nonchalant as she attempted to leave.","\"Stop right there.\"","Wait, why was she feeling guilty? Wasn't she wearing a mask?","While Jing Yi was frantically thinking of how to escape, she didn't notice Shen Huaichu's long arm reaching out, about to touch her mask.","In an instant, Shen Huaichu had removed her mask. He smirked and drawled, \"Miss Jing, what a coincidence.\"","Oh no, she'd been caught red-handed!","Before Jing Yi could make her next move, Shen Huaichu leaned in closer. Jing Yi panicked and stumbled backward, tripping over a lounge chair and falling into it.","\"Next time you want to play tricks on someone, be more professional. Do you think a few slanderous words count as a prank?\" His voice was low and tinged with danger, and Jing Yi could feel his warm breath as he spoke."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Is He Your Uncle","paragraphs":["The number of people dancing in the center of the ballroom was increasing, and the atmosphere was becoming more lively. No one noticed the somewhat intimate actions of Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu in the corner.","Jing Yi's bright black eyes stared intently at the man in front of her, her mind filled with the thought that she couldn't lose!","\"Uncle?\" Shen Xi's voice came through.","Uncle?!","Jing Yi abruptly pushed Shen Huaichu away and quickly stood up, looking towards the newcomer. It wasn't just Shen Xi; there was also a man beside her.","Shen Huaichu, who had been pushed away, didn't seem angry at Jing Yi's actions. He straightened his suit collar and shifted his gaze to Shen Xi and the man.","Jing Yi looked at Shen Xi, then at Shen Huaichu, with an expression of disbelief.","\"Xixi, he's your uncle?!\"","Shen Xi, equally surprised, nodded dumbly.","She hadn't expected that in just ten minutes, her best friend would have such an explosive development, and with her uncle no less!","Indeed, Shen Huaichu was the Shen family gentleman Shen Xi had mentioned earlier, who was distantly related. Given their generational difference, Shen Xi was indeed supposed to call Shen Huaichu \"uncle.\"","Although Shen Xi hadn't met Shen Huaichu many times, her parents had repeatedly reminded her about their generational relationship.","Receiving Shen Xi's clear response, Jing Yi felt bewildered. She had thought Shen Huaichu and Shen Xi were just relatives, but he was actually Shen Xi's uncle? Wouldn't that make her own generational status even lower?","If she had known earlier, she wouldn't have entangled with him here. Now things were more complicated!","As the three were lost in their thoughts, the man beside them watched the scene with great interest.","\"Brother,\" Gu Lin said with a smile as he walked to Shen Huaichu's side. Jing Yi finally took notice of this man.","He looked about the same age as Shen Xi, but since he called Shen Huaichu \"brother,\" it meant he was also an elder of Shen Xi's uncle's generation.","Jing Yi inwardly complained about these confusing generational relationships - so young, yet already someone's uncle.","Gu Lin was the son of Shen Huaichu's aunt, his cousin.","Shen Xi glanced at Shen Huaichu, then quietly moved a chair to sit beside Jing Yi.","\"You didn't tell me Shen Huaichu was your uncle?!\"","\"How did you end up with my uncle?!\"","Two voices whispered simultaneously in each other's ears.","Jing Yi looked up at Shen Huaichu, saw that he was talking about something with Gu Lin and not paying attention to them, then felt relieved enough to continue talking with Shen Xi.","\"I met him by accident.\"","\"Didn't I say my family had some distant relation to his?\"","\"But you didn't say it was an uncle-niece relationship!\"","Shen Xi looked at Jing Yi with admiration in her eyes. Her uncle was such a cold person, yet Jing Yi had the courage to approach him. She was truly impressive.","Jing Yi glared at her, \"Quickly throw all those thoughts in your head into the trash!\" This girl would start imagining romantic love stories at the slightest provocation!","Realizing she'd been found out, Shen Xi chuckled sheepishly.","She just hadn't dared to be unrestrained in front of Shen Huaichu, so she had only thought about it in her heart, but even that had been seen through.","On the other side, Gu Lin was also probing Shen Huaichu about his relationship with Jing Yi.","Don't think he hadn't seen how intimate they were earlier, especially considering it was Shen Huaichu.","He might be able to get first-hand information from Shen Huaichu, which he could then report to his mother!","Shen Huaichu, perceiving Gu Lin's intentions, gave him a cold look. \"You're thinking too much.\"","Gu Lin raised an eyebrow and shrugged. Fine, he wouldn't be getting any useful information from Shen Huaichu.","He shifted his gaze to Jing Yi; they seemed to have finished discussing his brother.","Gu Lin had heard about the Jing family bringing back two daughters, especially since the family had been recording a reality show recently.","\"Hello, Miss Jing,\" Gu Lin greeted first.","\"Hello,\" Jing Yi replied, unsure of the other's status and how to address him.","Gu Lin smiled, \"My name is Gu Lin, his cousin.\"","As this was Jing Yi's first time meeting Gu Lin, she naturally wouldn't be as discourteous as she was with Shen Huaichu.","\"Mr. Gu.\"","\"Does Miss Jing know my brother?\"","He didn't mention their intimate behavior from earlier, but the question was still quite direct.","Jing Yi glanced at Shen Huaichu, then forced a smile and said, \"I don't know him! I just thought Mr. Shen looked very much like an annoying person I know. I didn't expect such a coincidence...\"","Shen Huaichu's gaze turned towards her, seemingly unbothered by the slight, his cold eyes carrying a different meaning.","Then they heard, \"What a coincidence to meet Xixi's uncle!\"","Gu Lin looked from one to the other. This atmosphere of daggers drawn didn't seem like that of strangers at all.","To ease the awkward atmosphere, Gu Lin continued chatting with Jing Yi, \"I've been watching the live stream of Miss Jing and her family recently. It's very interesting.\"","This wasn't just a polite comment from Gu Lin, though he mainly watched it with his mother.","\"Is that so? Thank you.\"","Jing Yi's eyes curved into a smile. Paired with her red and black gown, she looked like a dark-themed girl, both cute and beautiful, with a mysterious allure.","She seemed to be chatting happily with Gu Lin. Noticing the change in Jing Yi's attitude, Shen Huaichu's dark eyes narrowed slightly.","\"I only found out from the live stream that Miss Jing likes sports cars?\"","\"It's alright, after all, driving 'Black Night' is very different from other cars.\"","At the mention of 'Black Night', Gu Lin became very interested. \"I can imagine. Anyone who likes cars would find it hard to resist the charm of 'Black Night'.\" He had been fortunate enough to see it at an auction and had indeed thought about bidding for it.","Unfortunately, the price Jing Zeyou offered was just too high...","\"In a while, the Shanchi Racing Track in North River should be hosting a sports car championship. If Miss Jing is interested, you could go watch.\"","Jing Yi's eyes lit up at hearing this, but soon she looked dejected again. \"I've heard about it too, but my second brother won't let me practice at his racing track, let alone participate.\"","Now it was Gu Lin's turn to be surprised. He had thought Jing Yi just liked cars, he didn't expect she could race too. \"Miss Jing, you can race?\"","Jing Yi smiled, \"A little bit.\"","Gu Lin was skeptical about this 'little bit' for now. He was about to inquire further when he noticed Shen Huaichu's displeased expression. He suddenly remembered Shen Huaichu's aversion to such entertainment.","He didn't continue the topic, and Jing Yi also sensed something amiss, though she didn't pay it much mind. Instead, she noticed that Shen Huaichu was still holding her mask.","If it were anything else, she might have let it go, but that mask happened to be one Jing Yi really liked.","Jing Yi reached out towards Shen Huaichu, \"Mr. Shen, can you return my mask?\"","Shen Huaichu sat in the lounge chair, his dark eyes carrying a hint of coldness and playfulness. He glanced at Jing Yi indifferently, waving the mask in his hand.","\"Is Miss Jing referring to this?\"","What else could it be!","Jing Yi forced a smile, her eyes flashing with anger, \"Yes!\""]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: The Tale of Shen Tu","paragraphs":["Jing Yi had thought Shen Huaichu would return it to her, but he pulled his hand back.","He curled his thin lips slightly, \"I thought this was a gift from Miss Jing.\" Beside him, Shen Xi's eyes widened in shock as she stared at Jing Yi.","Had their relationship already progressed to the gift-giving stage?","Jing Yi glared angrily at Shen Huaichu. He was doing this on purpose, wasn't he?!","She laughed bitterly, standing up. Gu Lin was curious about what she planned to do, while Shen Xi had already instinctively moved her stool back a bit.","They watched as Jing Yi walked over to Shen Huaichu's side, suddenly bending down and leaning in close to him.","Shen Huaichu gazed at Jing Yi's smiling eyes, curved like crescent moons. He could even catch a whiff of the faint citrusy scent on her, delicate and sweet.","Shen Xi covered her mouth as she watched the 'intense' scene unfolding before her, while Gu Lin was also intently watching the drama play out.","A few seconds later, when Shen Huaichu came to his senses, Jing Yi had already snatched the mask from his hand.","Jing Yi's lips curled upward as she leaned close to Shen Huaichu's ear, whispering, \"Mr. Shen, it seems I can tease you too.\" She waved the mask at him triumphantly.","\"Well then, Mr. Shen, Mr. Gu, I'll be taking my leave.\" Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu one last time, raising an eyebrow slightly. \"Xi Xi, let's go.\"","With that, Jing Yi turned and left. Shen Xi hurriedly said goodbye to the two older men and followed in Jing Yi's footsteps.","Shen Huaichu stared at Jing Yi's retreating figure, a smile playing on his lips, but the aura around him grew increasingly cold and dangerous.","Gu Lin remained silent, not daring to speak, but he made a mental note about Jing Yi's character.","Meanwhile, Shen Xi had lost all interest in handsome guys and was pulling Jing Yi aside to ask about her relationship with Shen Huaichu.","\"Spill it! When did you meet my uncle without telling me?!\"","Jing Yi still couldn't get used to Shen Xi calling Shen Huaichu her uncle. It always felt strange to her...","\"It was the day your car got hit. My GPS led me astray, and I ran into a situation where he was being surrounded...\" Shen Xi excitedly interjected, \"And then it was a hero saving the damsel in distress?\"","Jing Yi gave her a sidelong glance, quickly pouring cold water on her fantasy, \"You're imagining things. I was completely caught up in an undeserved disaster, and on top of that, I was suspected of being a spy sent by someone, by that arrogant guy!\"","The excitement in Shen Xi's eyes faded, replaced by a look of disappointment. \"I thought it was a love at first sight scenario...\" Love at first sight indeed, she almost got detained, Jing Yi thought sarcastically.","Shen Xi wasn't surprised that Shen Huaichu had been surrounded. After all, she had heard about the revenge plots against him through various channels.","\"I should be the one asking you! Why didn't you tell me Shen Huaichu was your uncle?\"","Shen Xi was confused, insisting she had mentioned their family relationship before.","That's not the same at all!","\"Forget it, just know that there's nothing between Shen Huaichu and me. If there is anything, it's that he's someone I dislike!\"","Seeing Jing Yi speak so decisively, Shen Xi didn't dare to argue, though she still imagined a scenario in her mind where the male and female leads come together due to an unexpected encounter!","\"Enough about me, weren't you going to meet that 'vampire' guy? How did it go?\" Jing Yi changed the subject.","At the mention of him, Shen Xi seemed less enthusiastic. Before they talked, his vampire costume had looked pretty cool, but after chatting, she found him rather ordinary.","Jing Yi was curious, \"Why? Did he say something?\"","\"I had barely said a few words before he was trying to ask me out for dinner tomorrow! Isn't that a bit too forward?\"","\"......\" Whatever makes you happy.","On the other side, Gu Lin curled his lips into a smile, leaning back in a lounge chair with a glass of champagne.","\"Brother, it seems there's some misunderstanding between you and Miss Jing.\"","Although he didn't know exactly what misunderstanding there was between the two, it was clear that Jing Yi didn't think much of Shen Huaichu, and Shen Huaichu's attitude also struck him as odd.","Shen Huaichu's fingers lightly traced the edge of his glass, his chiseled face devoid of expression, his deep-set eyes unfathomable.","\"Misunderstanding? There isn't any.\"","Shen Huaichu was certain there was no misunderstanding between them; Jing Yi simply didn't like him, that's all.","\"Is that so?\"","Gu Lin withdrew his curious gaze. His brother's mood didn't seem great at the moment, so he'd better be tactful.","\"What was that about a livestream earlier?\"","Gu Lin looked up blankly, momentarily unable to recall what livestream Shen Huaichu was referring to, before remembering the 'family livestream' he had mentioned to Jing Yi.","His brother's attitude toward Jing Yi was definitely unusual!","\"Oh, the other daughter of the Jing family is a celebrity, right? They're filming a family reality show recently.\" Shen Huaichu then recalled the cameras he had encountered last time.","So that's what she meant that day.","Shen Huaichu drained the wine in his glass in one gulp, set the glass back on the table, and stood up.","\"I've accompanied you to the gathering as requested. Remember to tell Aunt about it.\"","With that, Shen Huaichu left. Gu Lin swirled his wine glass, watching his brother's retreating figure with a playful look in his eyes.","...","At the Gu residence, a middle-aged woman sat on the sofa, scrolling through videos on her phone. Jing Yi's voice could be heard from the video exclaiming, \"Four fours!\"","Gu Lin knew immediately that she was watching Jing Yi's videos again.","Hearing Gu Lin open the door, Shen Tu looked up at her son briefly before quickly lowering her head back to the video.","\"You're back? Did your brother go with you?\"","This gathering was at Shen Tu's insistence that Shen Huaichu attend, otherwise he would only move between his company and home.","\"He did, and stayed for quite a while.\"","Although Shen Huaichu had spent most of the time alone, Gu Lin couldn't betray his brother.","Gu Lin leaned in, \"Mom, you're watching Jing Yi's videos again? Don't you ever get tired of them?\"","\"What can I do? The Jing family's recording doesn't start for another two days, so I can only watch these videos. You don't know how adorable Yi Yi is.\"","She's already calling her 'Yi Yi'? If I told you your nephew might be interested in that 'Yi Yi', you probably wouldn't have the heart to watch these videos anymore.","But Gu Lin wasn't about to 'court death'. If his brother found out, he'd have plenty of ways to deal with him!","Shen Tu had only heard about the Jing family participating in a reality show by chance. She was surprised, given the Jing family's status, she really couldn't understand why they would participate in a reality show.","Who knew that after watching the livestream, she'd become completely hooked.","After finishing all the videos, Shen Tu finally put down her phone and asked Gu Lin about the gathering today.","After her eldest brother and sister-in-law passed away, her nephew had completely changed, until he started planning to take back the Huarui Group and the Shen family.","At that time, Shen Huaichu was only nineteen, but it had been ten years since his parents' death.","When Shen Tu heard about his plan, her whole body trembled. So the car accident back then really was her second brother's doing.","Unfortunately, the only witness had perished along with that car accident years ago.","\"Aren't you afraid I'll tell him? He is my second brother.\""]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Self-driving Tour","paragraphs":["At that time, Shen Huaichu was still a young man who had just come of age, with far less control over his emotions than he has now.","His cold face bore barely suppressed anger and sorrow.","\"Aunt, this plan is just a rough draft, one that's impossible for me to achieve with my current abilities. So I've prepared myself for the next ten, twenty, even thirty years. I will definitely take back what belonged to my parents!\"","Shen Tu felt deeply saddened - for her deceased elder brother and sister-in-law, for her greedy and selfish second brother and his wife, and for Shen Huaichu.","\"What about your own life?\"","Shen Huaichu's expression held a hint of bitterness, \"Aunt, what life do I have left?\"","Now that the dust had settled, Shen Tu also hoped that Shen Huaichu could go out and see the world.","\"Yes, we also ran into Shen Xi and her friend.\"","Gu Lin handed his coat to the maid and collapsed onto the sofa.","\"Shen Xi?\"","Shen Tu couldn't immediately recall who Shen Xi was, so Gu Lin mentioned the name of Shen Xi's father.","\"Oh! That little girl with the round face!\" Shen Tu remembered that she and her mother had attended a banquet hosted by the Gu Family.","\"Shen Xi's friend?\" Shen Tu was pondering Gu Lin's choice of words.","Gu Lin, resting on the sofa, furrowed his brow for a moment, but fortunately, Shen Tu didn't ask any further questions.","......","In the evening, Jing Zeyou was arranging work with Assistant Chen on the balcony. A new round of filming was about to begin, and he wouldn't be able to be at the company for some time, so some work needed to be arranged in advance.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were video chatting with Jing Beicheng and his wife, while Jing Zeqian sat beside them. He found this video call behavior too mushy, so he didn't join in.","\"Auntie, is Tianqiu Mountain fun?\" Jing Yi looked at Lin Ruiqing on the screen with an expectant face.","After the couple had reached their destination, they had reported their safe arrival. The family hadn't expected their first stop to be mountain climbing.","\"It's fun, a bit tiring, but quite interesting,\" Lin Ruiqing said.","Jing Zejun leaned against Jing Yi, smiling at Lin Ruiqing in the video, with Jing Beicheng showing only half his face in the background.","\"How about you? Have you been doing well lately?\"","\"Pretty good. We're starting the second round of filming in a couple of days. Otherwise, we might have run into you.\"","\"That is a bit of a shame.\" After all, they were planning to fly to another country the day after tomorrow.","\"How carefree!\" Jing Yi's eyes were full of envy. Jing Zeqian glanced at her, not quite understanding where her envy came from, given that she was also going on a trip in a few days.","As they chatted, Lin Ruiqing thought of the scene from the last filming where Jing Yi was cooking.","\"Yi Yi, don't cook when you're out traveling. Your brothers can eat anything.\"","Lin Ruiqing truly felt sorry for Jing Yi cooking for those few days last time. Someone who loved to sleep in so much had to get up early to make breakfast.","She never thought that girls must cook, and besides, they had a cook at home, so why couldn't they use her? Moreover, they had brought two older brothers along, so why did the youngest in the family have to take care of them?","Jing Yi smiled at Lin Ruiqing, \"Don't worry, Auntie! Next week we'll be on a road trip, so I won't need to cook!\"","\"That's good. You and Junjun just enjoy yourselves and don't worry about these trivial matters. You hear that, Xiao Qian?\" Lin Ruiqing suddenly called out to Jing Zeqian, and Jing Zejun turned the camera towards him.","Jing Zeqian replied resignedly, \"I heard.\" If he couldn't hear something said that loudly, he'd truly be deaf.","\"Auntie, when are you planning to come back?\" Jing Yi leaned against Jing Zejun, her voice soft.","It wasn't just Jing Yi; even Jing Zejun was missing Lin Ruiqing and the others.","Jing Zeqian glanced at the two of them, \"Are you two still not weaned?\" Jing Yi glared at him.","\"You menthol! You're just jealous!\"","Lin Ruiqing looked at the two girls in the camera, her expression loving and gentle, \"We'll be back at the end of the month, and we'll rest for a few days after we return.\"","Indeed, daughters are more considerate. Of the two sons, one was a 'workaholic', and the other seemed like he was there to collect a debt.","Jing Yi burst out laughing.","This meant they would come back to regroup for a few days and then continue traveling, right? Who would have thought that once Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng went out, they couldn't stop?","After chatting with Lin Ruiqing for a while, Jing Yi and the others ended the video call.","Hearing Lin Ruiqing talk about the fun of traveling, Jing Yi was reminded of their upcoming road trip in a few days.","Her expression showed some excitement, \"Junjun, if we're going on a road trip, where do you want to go?\" She sat cross-legged on the sofa, discussing potential destinations with Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun was also getting interested, influenced by Jing Yi's enthusiasm, \"How about the seaside? There's a famous bioluminescent ocean in the city next to North river. They say the seawater glows at night!\"","\"How magical is that?\"","\"Sounds great! Let's set that as our first destination, and then we can plan a route based on all the places we want to visit!\"","Jing Zeqian silently listened to the two making plans, but eventually couldn't resist dampening their enthusiasm.","\"The so-called bioluminescence is produced by a type of single-cell dinoflagellate. In the ocean, when the concentration of dinoflagellates is high enough, it can create the 'bioluminescent ocean' phenomenon. The reason they glow is that these algae cells contain luciferin and luciferase, which react and release blue light when disturbed externally. And it's not necessarily a good phenomenon.\"","\"What are you doing?!\" Jing Yi stared at him with her round eyes.","Jing Zeqian replied curiously, \"Providing you with some basic biochemistry knowledge.\" He then added, \"Also, I must remind you that our filming time is only one week. Considering travel time and sightseeing time, it's impossible to plan for so many destinations.\"","Although Jing Zeqian had dampened their spirits twice, Jing Yi had to admit he was right. Her expression showed some disappointment.","Jing Zeqian looked uncomfortable. He didn't like seeing Jing Yi so listless, lacking her usual vitality.","\"Why the long face? If you want to go, we can always go together after the filming is over.\"","\"Easy for you to say. After it's over, everyone will be busy with their own things again. When will we have another chance to travel together?\"","Meanwhile, Jing Zeyou had finished dealing with company matters.","\"For camping, let's go to Xiyuan. It's quite close to North river, and I happen to have a house in the mountains there. This way, we can fulfill three of your plans in one go.\"","Jing Zeyou sat down next to the group and methodically explained the plan.","Although it couldn't satisfy all of their planned itinerary, his proposal was already the best option.","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zeyou with admiration.","\"That sounds great! Big brother, you're amazing!\"","\"As expected of a CEO, how impressive!\"","Jing Zeqian glanced at Jing Yi. She was being such a bootlicker!"]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Rich Rich","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Shen, here are this morning's meetings and activities, already coordinated with all departments. Also, these are the contracts and documents needed for the meetings. The detailed schedule has been sent to your email.\"","The assistant placed the folder on Shen Huaichu's desk, then stepped back to her position.","Shen Huaichu didn't look up, simply saying, \"I see.\" Seeing this, the assistant left the office.","After leaving, the assistant felt puzzled. She thought she had heard lively sounds coming from Shen Huaichu's computer.","Was it her imagination?","In the CEO's office, Shen Huaichu was watching a live reality show featuring the Jing family.","Jing Yi appeared on the screen. She looked a bit sleepy but seemed happy, probably because they were going out.","His first impression was that she seemed to get along well with the Jing family.","He had investigated Jing Yi's background and knew that Jing Zeyou treated this sister quite well. Now it appeared their relationship was even better than he had imagined.","Looking at Jing Yi's crescent-shaped eyes and dimples, Shen Huaichu found it somewhat irritating.","If a little hedgehog only pricks one person, wouldn't anyone be happy to be that person?","Shen Huaichu's face remained expressionless, but a hint of annoyance flashed in his eyes as he reached out to close the screen.","'Mr. Shen, it seems I can tease you like this too.' The image of Jing Yi from that day flashed in Shen Huaichu's mind.","He hesitated.","Meanwhile, at the Jing family home where they were recording the second episode of the reality show, the family was in a standoff with the director.","Director Xu was confirming Jing Yi's part-time job payment with Jing Zejun, and there was some disagreement between them.","Jing Zejun secretly glanced at Jing Yi. They had messed up. They had planned everything else yesterday, but they hadn't discussed this!","[Director Xu, I'm reporting them! They're 'colluding'!]","[Haha, Jun and the others probably didn't discuss how much to set.]","[Indeed, charity begins at home!]","Jing Yi, thinking that they should aim for as much money as possible for the road trip, secretly held up two fingers to Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun immediately turned to Director Xu and said, \"Twenty thousand!\"","Director Xu silently looked at the two. Did they think he was blind?","\"That's impossible! Please provide relevant proof!\"","Not to mention it was only a two-day part-time job, and it wasn't even for a top-tier bodyguard. Where did such a high daily rate come from?","After some negotiation, Jing Yi's part-time job payment was set at two thousand.","This was a drastic 'discount'. How could four people go on a road trip with just two thousand yuan? Now all their hopes rested on Jing Zeyou.","The three people in the living room turned to look at Jing Zeyou in unison. They saw him calmly take out several documents from the side and hand them to Director Xu.","He explained, \"This is the proof of my work modifying a company's software program. There are detailed records inside.\" This was his part-time job, which took ten minutes.","Director Xu took the documents in a daze. He hadn't expected someone to actually get official proof.","Looking at the payment amount on the document, Director Xu's eyes widened as he exclaimed, \"One hundred and twenty thousand?!\" Wasn't it just modifying a program?","In his shock, Director Xu quickly displayed the general content of the document to the camera, of course, hiding some personal information.","[Big brother?! One hundred and twenty thousand?! What kind of part-time job is this?!]","[As expected of the eldest brother! He easily earned one hundred and twenty thousand!]","[Isn't this strange? Orange worked so hard to earn twenty thousand, and he just casually makes six times that? Isn't the show being too biased?]","[What? Does the person above know what they're talking about? This is modifying a program, not baking cakes.]","[Fans, please go to your own idol's page. Mr. Jing has laid out the evidence in black and white, even showing the details of the modifications!]","[As a fellow 'programmer', I understand the value of Mr. Jing's 'part-time job'!]","Regardless of how much the fans argued, Director Xu had already set the travel budget for the Jing family, after all, they had provided such detailed proof.","\"Well then, the Jing family's budget for this recording is one hundred and twenty-two thousand!\"","Jing Yi no longer cared about her own meager part-time job earnings and excitedly asked, \"So, Director Xu, can we go pack our luggage and get ready to leave?\"","Seeing him nod, Jing Yi pulled Jing Zejun upstairs, with the camera crew quickly following.","Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou weren't in a hurry to go up, both still dealing with matters at hand.","\"Don't you two need to go pack?\"","Jing Zeqian looked up, his tone lazy, \"It's just a week, we can pack quickly.\" Moreover, due to their work, the servants had already prepared travel luggage in advance. They could just grab it and go.","The camera then moved to Jing Zeyou, who was working. \"Mr. Jing, where's your first stop?\"","Jing Zeyou didn't look up, his gaze focused on the screen. Only after arranging the last bit of work could he relax and accompany his sisters on the trip.","\"The first stop is Xiyuan. Yi Yi and the others want to go camping, and we happen to have some properties there.\"","Jing family properties? Director Xu looked a bit troubled. \"Mr. Jing, according to the rules, all travel expenses must come from the money earned from part-time jobs.\"","What if netizens made an issue of this...","Jing Zeyou finished his last task, closed his laptop and set it aside, then looked at the camera. \"I understand. I'll pay according to the standard rates.\"","Jing Zeqian added from the side, \"Don't worry, Director Xu. We're even renting the vehicle we'll be traveling in.\" He waved his phone, showing a chat record with a car rental company. He had just arranged to rent an RV.","It was Jing Zeqian's first time doing so much preparation work himself.","Director Xu breathed a sigh of relief, looking at the two with gratitude in his eyes.","When inviting the Jing family, he had been worried. Although the Jing family brought their own popularity, they were after all a wealthy family in high positions, and Hengjing Group was a top global conglomerate.","He had prepared himself for the Jing family to be difficult to deal with, but over this period of interaction, the Jing family turned out to be even easier to work with than most celebrities he had encountered.","[Ah! I have to say it again, Mr. Jing is so handsome! So there really are CEOs in real life who are this polite, modest, and super capable!]","[Young Mr. Jing is cooperating too! Although he always argues with Jing Yi, he quietly prepares everything for his sister!]","[It's too hard to choose! The steady and elegant Mr. Jing or the cool and tsundere Young Mr. Jing!!!]","[Sisters, I suggest you stop daydreaming.]","Meanwhile, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were packing in the room. Since it was only a week-long trip, they decided to just bring one large suitcase.","Although it was Jing Yi's room, it was Jing Zejun who was packing clothes inside."]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Setting Off on a Self-Driving Journey","paragraphs":["Jing Zejun was in Jing Yi's room, packing clothes for their upcoming trip.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi had already prepared her luggage, showing her clothing bag, toiletry bag, and various small item bags to the camera. She then sat comfortably on the sofa, waiting for Jing Zejun.","\"Is this all Yiyi is preparing? Aren't you going to pack any makeup?\" The camera panned to the suitcase, where Jing Yi's things only occupied half the space, even leaving some room for Jing Zejun to put her small items.","\"This is quite a lot already. I don't really like wearing makeup, so I didn't prepare any,\" Jing Yi replied.","[I've been wanting to say this for a while - it seems like both Jing Yi and Jing Zejun appear on camera without makeup!]","[Jun-jun is famously known for disliking makeup. She only wears it for shows, but in everyday paparazzi shots, she's bare-faced.]","[You guys really believe everything you hear?]","The cameraman continued to ask, \"Isn't Zejun's room next door? Why is she packing things in your wardrobe?\" The camera moved towards the figure in the walk-in closet.","Jing Yi laughed and said, \"She occasionally sleeps in my room, so she keeps some of her clothes here.\"","[Did I just change color?!]","[Ah! These sisters are too shippable!]","[It's got to be the true and false princess story. I could write a whole novel about this!]","[They're probably faking it. It's a common trick in the entertainment industry.]","[Their sisterly relationship is genuinely good!]","[Let's not bother with someone who chooses to be blind.]","A few minutes later, Jing Yi came downstairs with her luggage.","Seeing this, Jing Zeqian stood up and took the luggage from her, feigning disgust, \"Are you planning to move out? Why did you pack so much?\"","Jing Yi initially wanted to retort, but seeing his actions made her heart soften. She remembered the first time she came to the Jing family...","\"Why are you just standing there? If you keep dawdling, who knows if we'll make it there by tonight.\" So much for being touched!","Jing Yi pulled Jing Zejun towards the exit, pretending not to see Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian received a look of disdain, feeling confused, \"Brother, did you see Jing Yiyi's attitude? I was just trying to help her with her luggage.\"","Jing Zeyou sighed, \"If you talked less, she wouldn't treat you like this.\" He patted Jing Zeqian's shoulder lightly and strode out of the living room, with Jing Zeqian hurrying to follow.","The self-driving tour officially begins!","The RV Jing Zeqian rented was quite spacious, considering they had to accommodate the camera crew as well.","Jing Zeyou drove along the winding mountain road, with scenery unfolding like a painting scroll, captivating everyone.","The camera occasionally panned to the four of them - Jing Yi and Jing Zejun resting in the back of the RV, Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou chatting, then moved to the view outside the window.","On both sides of the road, lush green trees swayed in the breeze, as if waving to passersby.","As they progressed along the mountain road, peaks gradually came into view. The camera captured a vast expanse of green grassland, like a piece of jade nestled among the mountains.","A gentle breeze blew through, dispelling the stuffiness in the vehicle and bringing a refreshing feeling.","The comfort was so overwhelming that even the cameraman couldn't help but gaze out the window. Unlike the big city, this place seemed capable of chasing away any fatigue.","[I'm so envious! A self-driving tour! It looks so comfortable!]","[The atmosphere between them is so nice!]","[I'm about to fall asleep watching this...]","[This road looks so familiar. I think Actor Wen's route was similar...]","The Jing family's live stream remained quiet for a while, with only the soft conversation between Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou in the RV. However, the popularity of the live stream didn't decrease; instead, viewers were immersed in this peaceful moment.","Several hours later, they arrived at their final destination.","It was a mountain villa backed by a forest, with a large grassland in front. Various camping equipment and ingredients had been prepared in advance.","\"You two sleep too much...\"","Jing Zeqian got out of the car to move the luggage, grumbling, but Jing Yi and Jing Zejun paid no attention, already starting to tour the residence.","With no other choice, Jing Zeqian had to play the role of the laborer.","[This looks too comfortable!]","[How much would this cost...]","[I can solve this problem! Mr. Jing said that since this place is a Jing family property, the market price is about one-twelfth of his working salary, and that's for one day.]","[Even without internet, I could live here for a lifetime!]","[Wait, something's not right with Wen Qingyan's route. It's too similar!]","A small portion of viewers noticed the similarity with Wen Qingyan's route, but most were still immersed in the Jing family's mountain villa.","\"Shall we rest for an hour before preparing for camping activities?\"","All three agreed, considering Jing Zeyou was the most tired after driving for several hours.","Then the Jing family's live stream fell silent again, leaving many viewers amused.","Meanwhile, in Wen Qingyan's live stream.","He was about to start driving, with Wen Yin sitting in the passenger seat.","Viewers watching the scenery in the camera felt increasingly uneasy.","[I want to say, this feels like déjà vu...]","[I just came from Jing Zejun's live stream. This road, haven't I seen it before?]","[I thought everyone was overthinking it, but it really is the same road...]","[If you're trying to say this is a coincidence, I wouldn't believe it even if I died!]","While the comments were still in heated discussion, the camera crew also received a notification. They turned to look at Wen Qingyan driving, who seemed to be in a good mood.","A crew member opened his mouth, ready to say something, but hesitated and swallowed his words.","Never mind, if the fans weren't worried, why should he be?","Wen Yin secretly glanced at the live stream, trying to cover up, \"Brother, the air here is really good! But it seems there's no place to stay. Is it okay for us to drive around aimlessly like this?\"","Wen Qingyan's lips curled up, a glimmer of amusement in his eyes, which earned him a secret glare from Wen Yin.","He was trying to cover up, while this person didn't seem to care at all!","Wen Qingyan finally said, \"It's fine. Worst case, we'll sleep on the streets. What's there to fear for two grown men?\"","Going back to the morning, when the two decided to start a self-driving tour this week, not only the viewers fell silent, but even the production team was speechless.","\"Actor Wen is also planning a self-driving tour?\"","Wen Qingyan seemed a bit confused, \"Also? Who else is going?\" The staff member fell silent. She didn't believe that after so many days, Wen Qingyan's side hadn't received any news about the Jing family's self-driving tour!","\"So where have Actor Wen and Little Yin decided to go?\"","Wen Qingyan's smile became even more gentle, \"We haven't decided yet, but we might tour the neighboring province.\"","Staff member: ...","Neighboring province? Could it be Xiyuan where Jing Zejun and the others were going?","It wasn't until he heard the executive director's report that Director Xu remembered why Wen Qingyan had agreed to this variety show. He had thought the actor wanted to avoid unpleasant guests, but it turned out that from the beginning to the end, it was all for one person...","Director Xu hesitated for a moment, sitting in the van, watching the RV driving in front.","\"Little Liu, get ready. Our moment of glory is about to arrive.\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Surging Heat","paragraphs":["As soon as Wen Qingyan approached where Jing Zejun and others were, the topic was already trending on social media: 'Dear Family' Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun on vacation!","Below the topic were images of Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun's road trip, clearly showing that the scenery passed by their two cars was exactly the same!","[I swear! Wen Qingyan is definitely doing this on purpose! All that talk about 'going wherever the road takes me' is a lie!]","[Is my 'Jun Qing' ship finally becoming real?! After so many years, is it really happening?!]","There were even thoughtful variety show fans who highlighted the conversation between Wen Qingyan and Wen Yin.","[Look at the expression on Wen's brother's face, it's totally a 'listening to big brother's nonsense' look!]","[Don't tell me it's a coincidence! Coincidentally going to Xi Yuan is one thing, but now coincidentally ending up at the Jing family villa?! That's in the deep mountains!!!]","[Could it be that Jing Zejun is the person his brother has had in his heart all these years?!]","[What? What?! What did I miss, people above?!]","[I think it's 90% certain now. If not, either I've been blind as a ten-year fan, or my brother has a GPS in his brain!]","[I knew there was a reason he suddenly agreed to do a variety show! I thought it was because his boss was also there, so he compromised. I was so naive! Really!]","[What on earth are you all talking about? What secret can't be openly discussed?!]","[This variety show director is really raking it in...]","[I'm crying my eyes out! My 'Jun Qing'! I once thought they would always just be strangers!]","[Can CP fans stop being so self-indulgent? Could it be that your beloved brother only became interested after seeing Jing Zejun enter a wealthy family?]","[Watch your mouth, person above! Even if the Jing family is wealthy, Wen Qingyan hasn't been in the entertainment industry all these years for nothing!]","['Jun Qing'! Jiu Sheng, your Yuan Chen brother has come to find you!]","The popularity of the 'Dear Family' variety show skyrocketed instantly. Fortunately, Director Xu was prepared, otherwise the live stream would have crashed from the traffic.","The audience was mainly concentrated in Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan's live stream, while the other streams had relatively weaker viewership.","Before this, Li Shaocheng was also planning a trip. She received a message from her manager and found an excuse to go to the bathroom, where she opened the app.","Sure enough, she saw everyone discussing Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan's situation.","Li Shaocheng could barely contain her anger, accompanied by a feeling of humiliation.","The popularity of the two seemed to mock her: See? They can easily surpass you with a single action. You sisters just can't compare to the Jing Zejun sisters, you're simply not as good as Jing Yi!","Li Shaocheng gripped her phone tightly, unable to regain her composure in the bathroom for a long time. Outside, the staff were starting to worry, as Li Shaocheng's expression hadn't looked good earlier.","\"Sister, is Shaocheng feeling unwell?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister looked up in confusion, understanding the staff member's implication, and went to the bathroom door.","\"Chengzi, are you alright?\"","\"Get lost!\" Li Shaocheng's angry voice came through.","Her sister instinctively looked at the staff, her expression a bit embarrassed, but she immediately covered for her, \"Chengzi might not be feeling well, I'll go check on her.\"","[Come on, that attitude is way too bad...]","[I've always felt that Li Shaocheng and her sister's relationship seemed fake.]","[Chengzi is just not feeling well! Don't take this opportunity to sow discord in their relationship!]","[Who hasn't argued with family before! Chengzi looked really unwell earlier, she must not be feeling good physically.]","As her sister was about to knock, Li Shaocheng inside realized they were still filming and quickly changed her expression, opening the door.","\"...Chengzi, are you feeling unwell?\" Li Shaocheng immediately pretended to have a stomach ache, \"Sister, I'm sorry, my stomach was hurting so badly, that's why my tone was off just now. Please don't be angry with me.\"","Whether it was true or not, Li Shaocheng's sister hadn't planned to make an issue of it anyway, and stepped forward to support her.","Even the staff gathered around, \"Shaocheng, are you okay? Do you need to go to the hospital?\"","Li Shaocheng weakly shook her head, indicating that she just needed to rest in her room for a bit, and let her sister help her there.","The comments were filled with sympathetic messages.","After Li Shaocheng was sent back to her room, the camera could only focus on her sister. To avoid awkwardness, the staff suggested she could make something simple for Li Shaocheng to eat.","Li Shaocheng's sister thought this was indeed better than just sitting idly on the sofa.","She went to the kitchen, while netizens were still discussing Li Shaocheng's condition. They were surprised to see her sister enter the kitchen.","Li Shaocheng had mentioned before that her sister was too busy with work to cook for herself, but her sister's actions didn't look like those of a novice.","A staff member curiously asked, \"Sister, so you actually know how to cook?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister's hand paused, her eyes clearly flashing with panic, \"I just... I've watched Chengzi cook so many times, so I'm trying it out. I'm not as good at cooking as Chengzi.\"","The staff member didn't say whether they believed her or not, and continued filming her actions.","After being called out by the staff, the sister's movements notably slowed down, deliberately feigning clumsiness.","[See? Isn't it strange?]","[Chengzi's sister probably does know how to cook...]","[No matter how many times I watch Li Shaocheng's part, it always feels odd.]","[You're all overthinking it! I don't find it strange at all.]","Later, more fans came to explain in the comments, but some netizens still remained skeptical.","Meanwhile, Li Shaocheng was unaware of the arguments in her live stream. She was contacting internet trolls to cause trouble in Jing Zejun's live stream.","Since her manager wouldn't help her, she'd solve it herself!","Her live stream already had lower viewership than the other two, and now they were stealing even more attention. How could Li Shaocheng accept this?!","She had considered following Jing Zejun to his travel destination, but it was too late now. If she followed now, it would obviously look like she was jumping on the bandwagon.","At that point, not only would she fail to gain fans, she'd likely face even more ridicule.","At the same time, Li Shaocheng in her room was frantically thinking about how to film this episode of the variety show to win back popularity.","On her sister's side, the porridge was almost ready. She was hesitating whether it would be better to call Li Shaocheng out, to give her a heads up and avoid another incident like earlier.","But the staff had already signaled for her to take it over.","Such a heartwarming scene between sisters, the show producers definitely wouldn't want to miss it.","Her sister sighed internally, but still picked up the bowl of porridge and walked towards Li Shaocheng's room.","The camera crew quickly followed with their equipment, waiting for the anticipated scene.","She gently knocked on the door."]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Chance Encounter","paragraphs":["Li Shaocheng's door opened, revealing that weak and pitiful expression once again.","\"Orange, I made some porridge. Would you like to try it?\" Hearing her sister's words, Li Shaocheng's expression suddenly changed. She shot a sharp glance at her sister and questioned, \"You made porridge?!\"","Even the filming crew was taken aback for a moment before Li Shaocheng realized her mistake and quickly changed her expression.","\"Sister, I'm so surprised! You don't know how to cook, yet you made porridge for me. You didn't hurt yourself, did you?\"","Li Shaocheng held her sister's hands, seemingly wanting to examine them closely for injuries.","Her sister was about to answer that she hadn't when she felt the pressure on her hands. She quickly changed her response: \"I got a little burned, but it's okay. It was my first time making porridge, but I had watched you do it before, so it went fairly smoothly. Should I bring it into your room?\"","Li Shaocheng nodded, making room for her to enter.","\"Then you rest up, and I'll head out, okay?\"","\"Alright, thank you, sister!\"","After her sister and the cameraman left, Li Shaocheng glared fiercely at the bowl of porridge. If she hadn't been worried about being overheard, she would have smashed it!","However, Li Shaocheng's momentary lapse in her pleasant expression was caught by many netizens.","[I finally figured out what's off! Li Shaocheng gives me the feeling that she's just playing the role of a good sister!]","[Exactly! What normal sister would put her hands on a bowl of porridge her sister is holding? Is she worried it's not hot enough?!]","[I just saw that the sister's hands were red...]","[People with dirty minds see everything as dirty! Is it wrong for Orange to care about her sister?!]","[I just want to say it's terrifying when you think about it.]","Meanwhile, in Jing Zejun's livestream, fans were eagerly waiting for his encounter with Wen Qingyan, too busy to pay attention to others' arguments.","Jing Yi woke up in the afternoon, just in time to see the sunset from the villa. She stretched comfortably.","Downstairs in the camping area, Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian were already preparing ingredients for the evening's camping meal.","Seeing Jing Yi come down, Jing Zeqian was about to tease her when his phone rang. He took it out and saw it was Wen Qingyan. \"Hello, Qingyan? Are you stuck outside?\"","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, while the livestream comments exploded with laughter.","[I'm dying of laughter! He came for a chance encounter, but there's security at the villa!]","[I have to say, the Jing family's security is really on point everywhere!]","[Hahaha! Actor Wen should be grateful his boss is filming this variety show!]","[Help! Little Yin must be so embarrassed, someone save the child!]","Jing Zeyou looked up at Jing Zeqian, who had just hung up the phone, and asked, \"What's wrong?\" Jing Zeqian replied with a complicated expression, \"Wen Qingyan is at the foot of the mountain...\"","Jing Zeyou was confused, \"The foot of the mountain?\" He couldn't understand why Wen Qingyan would be there, while Jing Yi was already excitedly calling upstairs to Jing Zejun, \"Junjun! Actor Wen is here!\"","Oh my goodness! To think someone would chase after a person all the way to the mountains – it had to be Actor Wen!","Hearing Jing Yi's voice, Jing Zejun hurried downstairs, equally shocked by the news.","A few minutes later, security let Wen Qingyan and his companion in, and their business car parked in front of the villa.","\"Mr. Jing.\"","Wen Qingyan greeted Jing Zeqian with a smile, appearing completely at ease. Beside him, Wen Yin was blushing and looking uncomfortable. Seeing Jing Zeqian approach, he quickly lowered his head and greeted, \"Hello, Mr. Jing!\"","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms and, after nodding in acknowledgment to Wen Yin, scrutinized the people before him. \"Qingyan, what brings you to Xiyuan?\"","To save face for his company's artists, Jing Zeqian only mentioned Xiyuan, not directly asking why they were in front of his private villa!","Wen Qingyan seemed oblivious to Jing Zeqian's displeasure and replied with his usual gentle smile, \"We're filming a variety show, aren't we? Little Yin and I originally planned to drive wherever the road took us, but when we reached Xiyuan, we found out you were also filming a show here, so we came over.\"","Jing Zeqian continued to stare at him with crossed arms, while Jing Zeyou's expression was also somewhat strange. Only Jing Yi was thoroughly enjoying the spectacle.","Jing Zejun was the only one who seemed delighted by the surprise. \"Brother Qingyan! What a coincidence! You're on a road trip too?\"","Four pairs of eyes turned to look at him simultaneously. Even Wen Yin found it unbelievable that Jing Zejun would actually believe his brother's flimsy excuse...","Oh, my dear Junjun, only you would think Actor Wen really came here by chance!","Jing Zeqian also chimed in sarcastically, \"What a coincidence indeed! The villa is surrounded by mountain valleys for five miles in every direction, yet you managed to drive here?\"","Jing Zeqian didn't care about any \"ace\" status now; he only knew that the man before him must have set his sights on his sister!","This sly fox had been hiding his intentions for so long!","Jing Zejun finally caught on and looked at Wen Qingyan with surprise. The man smiled at her, his eyes seeming to hide something.","Jing Zejun's ears grew hot, and she avoided his gaze, looking at Jing Yi beside her, who was still enjoying the show. She felt even more embarrassed and lightly tapped Jing Yi's forehead, warning her to be more restrained.","But this only made Jing Yi laugh even harder.","[Junjun finally understands! My goodness, I've never thought she was this slow before.]","[Haha, I saw Jing Zejun 'threatening' Jing Yi!]","[As expected of the young Mr. Jing, he's so good at snarking!]","[This is so exciting! Am I watching a dating show?]","Regardless of Wen Qingyan's intentions for coming, Jing Zeqian couldn't very well send them away now that they had made it all the way here.","\"Well then, come help prepare dinner.\" He certainly wasn't going to feel sorry for Wen Qingyan driving for several hours!","Wen Qingyan's smile deepened a bit; the first step of his plan had been successfully completed!","Jing Zejun looked at Wen Qingyan, \"Brother Qingyan, long time no see.\" She finally had a chance to greet him properly.","Wen Qingyan replied softly, \"Zejun, it's been a while.\"","Since the end of \"Jun Lin,\" although they occasionally met at award ceremonies, they rarely had the chance to talk, given how far apart their seats usually were.","The live comments were going crazy, and Jing Yi was nearly losing it as well.","She had been called over by Jing Zeqian to help, and while washing ingredients, her eyes remained fixed on the two in front of her, her lips curling into an involuntary smile.","\"Focus on washing the vegetables!\"","Jing Yi secretly glared at the extremely moody person beside her. Jing Zeqian wasn't in a good mood today, so it was best not to provoke him.","After scolding Jing Yi, Jing Zeqian immediately looked over at Wen Qingyan, who was still chatting with Jing Zejun!","\"Wen Qingyan! Are you not planning to eat dinner tonight?!\"","Jing Zeqian's attitude made Jing Zejun a bit embarrassed, but Wen Qingyan didn't seem to feel offended. He simply smiled, excused himself to Jing Zejun, and went over with Wen Yin to help.","In the past, Wen Qingyan's fans would have certainly fought back, but who could blame them when their idol was here to pursue a potential partner?","At this moment, Jing Zeqian wasn't Wen Qingyan's boss, but a potential brother-in-law that needed to be won over!"]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Truth or Dare","paragraphs":["As night fell, the starry sky glittered brilliantly. A cool breeze caressed their faces as a lively group gathered in front of a villa deep in the mountains.","The festive atmosphere was largely driven by Jing Yi and Wen Yin. While most of the others, including Jing Zejun, had finished eating, Jing Yi was still munching on skewers. Jing Zejun worried she might overeat, wondering if the box of digestive pills he'd brought would be enough. Meanwhile, Wen Qingyan kept his eyes fixed on Jing Zejun the entire time.","Thus, the table's line of sight became:","Wen Yin → Jing Zeqian → Wen Qingyan → Jing Zejun → Jing Yi","Jing Yi, for her part, stared intently at the meat skewers on the table, while Jing Zeyou remained aloof from their 'interactions'.","Jing Zeyou was well aware that Wen Qingyan likely had ulterior motives for being there. However, from his perspective, Jing Zejun showed no interest, so whether Wen Qingyan was worth evaluating remained to be seen. Besides, with his brother keeping watch, Jing Zeyou felt no need to intervene.","Jing Zeyou placed a cup of digestive tea in front of Jing Yi, genuinely concerned she might have trouble sleeping if she ate too much.","Jing Yi finally stopped eating, though the food on the table still tempted her. She reclined in her chair, sipping the digestive tea Jing Zeyou had brought her while glancing towards the production crew. Jing Zeyou had arranged for the staff to have sushi, pizza, and other quick meals.","Their food looked quite appetizing too...","Jing Yi's gaze was so intense that Jing Zeyou nearly laughed out loud. Was this the epitome of 'eating from your bowl while eyeing the pot'?","Nearby, Jing Zeqian was still watching Wen Qingyan. \"Qingyan, you're not planning to tag along with us for the next few days, are you?\" Wen Qingyan shrugged, his expression mild. \"Well, since we're all on a self-drive tour, it might be convenient to follow Mr. Jing.\"","Jing Zeqian was beginning to find having Wen Qingyan as an employee quite troublesome!","The mountain breeze carried the unique fragrance of plants, effortlessly drawing people in. Jing Yi, ignoring their conversation, leaned back in her chair to enjoy the gentle caress of the wind.","[It looks so relaxing! I wish I could travel to a place like this with my family!]","[I'm tired of just saying I'm envious!]","[Is this how the rich play? With that money, they could donate to the poor instead!]","[Is the previous commenter some kind of saint? Why so high and mighty?]","[Doesn't everyone know that Hengjing has its own foundation with detailed donation plans for different groups, and many charity organizations use Hengjing's fundraising systems?]","Seeing the atmosphere grow stale again, Director Xu held up a small sign suggesting they play some games.","Jing Zejun thought for a moment. \"How about Truth or Dare?\"","\"Okay,\" came Jing Yi's listless reply.","Jing Zejun wasn't even sure if Jing Yi had heard what she'd said before agreeing. She took Jing Yi's hands and pulled her to sit up, then looked towards Jing Zeqian and the others. \"Brother, do you want to play?\" Since they were just sitting around bored anyway, everyone agreed.","The production crew passed over some props – a spinner and some paper and pens.","Jing Yi perked up a bit, looking at the items on the table. \"Are we supposed to write down punishments and questions?\" Seeing Jing Zejun nod, she eagerly grabbed a pen and started writing enthusiastically.","Jing Zeqian didn't need to guess to know that whatever she was writing probably wasn't anything good, so he hurriedly picked up paper and pen to write something as well.","\"Shall we start then?\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian looked intently at the spinner, nodding.","Jing Zejun gently spun the wheel, and it began to turn! Only those two watched the spinner nervously, fully engaged.","[What's with these two? They looked so disinterested earlier.]","[Haha, as long as there's a chance to tease each other, they'll never be bored!]","[Jing Yi looks so adorable like this!]","[I'm getting a bit nervous too...]","The spinner stopped, pointing at Jing Zeqian.","Jing Yi jumped up excitedly. \"Yay! Truth or dare?\" Jing Zeqian deflated, not expecting such bad luck. \"Dare!\"","Jing Yi put on a devious expression as she drew a slip of paper from the box and read aloud: \"Wax your leg hair!\" With that, she excitedly went to ask the production crew for supplies.","They actually found her a roll of tape.","Jing Zeqian was certain! This had to be something Jing Yi wrote!","Resigned, Jing Zeqian rolled up his pant leg. \"Let's get this over with!\"","Seeing Jing Yi apply a large strip of tape, his eyes widened. \"Why are you using such a big piece?!\" Jing Yi looked at him innocently. \"It'll hurt the same no matter how much I use.\"","As she spoke, she quickly ripped off the tape!","\"Ah!\"","What nonsense about it hurting the same! Did Jing Yi think he was in kindergarten?!","Jing Zejun couldn't help but laugh out loud, and even Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a smile.","\"Again!\"","Jing Zeqian angrily spun the wheel. At that moment, as if the god of variety shows had descended, the arrow pointed to Jing Yi.","The camera quickly zoomed in for a close-up, capturing the bewilderment in Jing Yi's eyes.","\"Come on! Forehead flick!\"","Jing Yi hurriedly pushed away the person rushing towards her. \"You didn't even ask if I wanted truth or dare!\" Jing Zeqian feigned innocence. \"Oh? We're supposed to ask? I've already drawn, so next time!\"","Then, with lightning speed, he delivered a flick to Jing Yi's forehead.","The sound was so loud it was picked up by the microphones.","[I knew they'd end up fighting!]","[Young Mr. Jing is really something else. Every time I think he's super cool, he shows me his incredibly childish side!]","[He's only this childish when playing with his sister.]","[Young Mr. Jing got his revenge right away. Jing Yi's forehead is all red.]","Wen Qingyan had never imagined his boss had this side to him. At this moment, he could no longer recall Jing Zeqian's image at the company; all he could see was him playing tricks with Jing Yi.","Having been outwitted, Jing Yi was itching for revenge, but the spinner refused to land on Jing Zeqian again.","The pointer landed on Wen Qingyan, who chose truth.","Jing Zejun rummaged in the box and pulled out a slip. Upon seeing its contents, she hesitated.","But the camera had already zoomed in, so she had no choice but to read: \"Is there someone here that you like?\"","Wow! It was actually drawn, what a coincidence!","Indeed, that was a truth question Jing Yi had written specifically for Wen Qingyan, but she never expected it to actually be drawn!","The atmosphere grew tense. Just as Jing Zejun was about to change the question, Wen Qingyan spoke up, \"If I can't answer, what's the punishment?\"","As everyone knew, if you couldn't answer a truth question, you'd be punished. But why wouldn't he be able to answer this question?","Wasn't this tantamount to admitting it?!","Jing Yi pressed her lips together tightly, trying hard to contain her excitement. The viewers watching the livestream shared similar thoughts, flooding the danmu with comments!","Jing Zejun quickly made up a random punishment, glossing over the moment."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Freedom with Shackles","paragraphs":["The Game Continues","Jing Yi lay contentedly in her chair, while Jing Zejun looked at her with amusement.","It was Jing Zeyou's turn to spin the wheel. The pointer wavered and finally pointed at Jing Yi. Just as Jing Zeqian was about to act, Jing Yi quickly said, \"I choose truth!\"","He sat back in his seat, somewhat disappointed.","Jing Zeyou drew a piece of paper from the box. He glanced at it, then looked up at Jing Yi.","He gently pinched the paper, not letting anyone see what was written on it. \"If you could go back in time, would you still choose to board that plane?\"","Jing Yi was momentarily stunned, then began to ponder seriously.","Jing Zeqian and Jing Zejun were both a bit nervous, waiting for Jing Yi's answer. Wen Qingyan didn't know what incident Jing Zeyou was alluding to, but it seemed very important to the Jing family.","Jing Yi looked up with a smile, her eyes curved in happiness, clear laughter in her gaze, dimples appearing one deep and one shallow.","She said, \"Of course! If I hadn't, think of how much I would have lost!\"","The 'loss' Jing Yi referred to was certainly not about money.","Even without hearing Jing Yi's voice, Jing Zeyou and the others knew she wasn't talking about material possessions.","Jing Zejun smiled and moved closer to Jing Yi, while Jing Zeqian's lips curled up as well.","The warm atmosphere made Jing Yi feel a bit awkward. She coughed lightly a few times, urging everyone to continue, and spun the wheel herself.","This time it landed on Jing Zeqian. Unsurprisingly, he chose truth. Jing Yi had to draw a question, and after seeing it, she read with some surprise, \"Why did you establish Startrack?\"","Jing Zeyou leaned back slightly in his chair, looking up at Jing Zeqian. This was the question he had written.","He had asked Jing Zeqian this question several times before, but the answers he got were probably not convincing even to Jing Zeqian himself.","Unlike other wealthy families, the Jing Family had always believed that whoever had the ability should take on the responsibility of being the heir. But Jing Zeyou cared more about his brother's wishes. After all, a company was just a company; nothing was more important than his family.","But Jing Zeqian had refused, saying he wasn't cut out for it and would just rely on his brother to support him in the future.","For many years, this question had been bothering Jing Zeyou.","Jing Zeqian turned to look at Jing Zeyou, hesitating for a moment. \"There are two reasons. One reason was to find Junjun faster.\"","The entertainment industry was a place where one could come into contact with more people, and Jing Zeqian had considered this point when making his decision.","Jing Zejun looked at Jing Zeqian, her eyes flashing with emotion. Her family had never given up on her...","Jing Zeqian, clearly uncomfortable with the sentimental atmosphere, quickly answered the other reason, \"The other reason, you could say, was youthful competitiveness.\" He wanted to prove that even without the Jing Family, he could still achieve what he was meant to have.","Jing Zeyou's gaze was complex. So this was why Jing Zeqian had chosen the entertainment industry, the only field the Jing Family hadn't touched before.","Jing Zeqian picked up the glass of wheat juice in front of him and drank it all at once, as if trying to hide something.","Due to his personality, Jing Zeqian had never been interested in things like the internet or finance since he was young. With his brother taking care of those areas, his life had been relatively easy.","Later, this ease disappeared along with the gossip of others.","When he was younger, Jing Zeqian was surrounded by a bunch of young masters, and he once thought that was what 'like-minded friends' meant. Later, he realized it was just because of his status as the young master of the Jing Family.","Jing Yi cupped her chin, looking at Jing Zeqian. \"So, you were a young master who had never experienced hardship, and then got a harsh lesson from society, right?\"","Jing Zejun and Jing Zeyou, who had been feeling sympathetic, heard Jing Yi's words and found their emotions caught in an awkward middle ground.","Jing Zeqian was also taken aback, but he couldn't deny that what Jing Yi said was true.","[Ah! I was feeling emotional just now, and now you hit me with this?!]","[So what did Jing Zeyou mean by boarding the plane? Why are they speaking in code?!]","[It's probably referring to the flight when the Jing Family went to bring Jing Yi home.]","[He really is a young master, doesn't know the hardships of life.]","[He's already luckier than most people, how can he be so ungrateful?]","[... Has anyone else noticed that there seem to be more sour comments in the live stream recently?]","As the sky gradually darkened, Jing Zejun saw that it was about time and decided to draw one last person to end the game.","Jing Yi was already getting sleepy, leaning against Jing Zejun's side, her eyelids heavy as she looked at the spinning wheel. But she was startled by the pointer in front of her.","What kind of luck was this? Even the last spin landed on her?","Since all the dares had been used up, Jing Zejun could only choose a paper from the truth box.","This one was written by her. Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi and asked seriously, \"What does your hobby mean to you?\"","Such an ordinary truth question? Wen Qingyan and the others were a bit surprised, unsure if this was a truth or an in-depth interview.","Jing Yi, however, didn't blurt out an answer as boldly as imagined. She stared at the paper slip, lost in thought.","\"Yi Yi, a child at the orphanage is sick, so Grandma can't attend your sports meet. Have fun with your classmates.\"","\"Yi Yi, don't play such dangerous games after work in the future. If I hadn't happened to see it, I wouldn't have known you were playing those risky games!\"","\"Okay, Grandma, I was just curious and wanted to take a look. Don't worry, I won't play them anymore.\"","The grandmother at the orphanage was very kind to her. She had to take care of many children, so Jing Yi couldn't let her worry. But in reality, no classmates played with her; she was grateful if they just didn't bully her.","\"Yi Yi, are those your friends? Are they racers?\"","\"Oh, they're just the people who helped me last time. Don't worry, I'm just having a meal with them to thank them.\"","\"Is that so? I thought those hobbies seemed pretty cool.\"","\"How are they cool? They're so dangerous!\"","Grandma Jing only had her as a child, and she couldn't let Grandma Jing worry about her at such an old age.","What does my hobby mean to me?","Jing Yi stared at the distant valley and murmured, \"To me, it means... freedom in shackles.\" Racing was freedom, it was what she loved, but it was also confined. A freedom that couldn't be released.","The audience in the chat didn't understand what Jing Yi meant, but the Jing family members did. Among the three, Jing Zeqian had the strongest reaction.","Wen Yin looked at Jing Zeqian's bewildered expression with confusion.","Jing Zejun gently stroked Jing Yi's hair. Her purpose in writing this question was to make Jing Yi think carefully. Was she really content with just avoiding or even giving up?","It was also to help Jing Zeqian understand how Jing Yi felt about her hobby.","Their second brother loved her very much, and he loved Yi Yi too, but his methods often put them in difficult positions.","Jing Zeyou lightly patted Jing Zeqian's shoulder. He also hoped that his brother could truly understand how to be good to someone, rather than always doing things his own way.","After speaking, Jing Yi had already started yawning lazily."]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Sunrise","paragraphs":["Li Shaocheng was still in her office at the company. After much thought yesterday, she decided to do what she does best - singing and dancing - in order to compete with the popularity of Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan.","She recruited a few new artists from the company to pretend to be her and teach them to dance, which did increase the viewership of her livestream somewhat.","Li Shaocheng had just finished today's livestream, and the staff had just left.","Her manager burst angrily through the door.","\"Li Shaocheng! Didn't I tell you not to mess with the Jing family?!\"","The manager looked furious, and Li Shaocheng momentarily panicked when questioned.","She had indeed hired internet trolls to disrupt Jing Zejun's livestream, but she didn't expect to be found out so quickly. \"Brother Lu, let me explain...\"","\"Explain? What is there to explain?! They've already complained to General Xu. What more do you have to say?!\"","Li Shaocheng felt even more panicked, her lips turning pale. The anger she felt when hiring the trolls was gone, replaced by regret.","She stepped forward and clutched her manager's sleeve, pleading, \"Brother Lu, please help explain to General Xu. I didn't mean to, I really didn't mean to. I just, I just lost my temper for a moment! And my livestream...\"","The manager didn't let her finish, impatiently shaking her off. \"Let me tell you, Li Shaocheng, forget about being a has-been girl group member. Even if you were in a popular girl group, as long as the Jing family says the word, you won't be able to survive in this industry!\"","Li Shaocheng's breathing became rapid, seemingly unprepared for such severe consequences.","The manager glanced at her, trying to calm his anger. If it weren't for Li Shaocheng, he wouldn't have been scolded so harshly by General Xu!","\"This time it's just a warning. Finish recording this variety show first, and we'll put your future work arrangements on hold.\" With that, the manager left.","This meant she was going to be shelved...","Li Shaocheng's clenched fists trembled slightly, her eyes still hiding deep resentment.","Her sister, standing in the corner, was worried and cautiously probed, \"Chengcheng, are you alright?\"","Li Shaocheng turned and glared at her angrily, \"It's all your fault! If you weren't so useless, how could my livestream viewership be so low? How could I end up in this situation?!\"","Her sister stepped back a few paces, frightened by Li Shaocheng's gaze, but the accusations didn't stop.","\"You stand there like a wooden block every day and can't even speak! You can't even maintain a persona when I ask you to. Look at the popularity of that sister duo next door, and then look at you! Who wants to drink your porridge! I told you not to cook! Not to cook! But you still did it. Do you want to show off that badly?\"","\"I didn't mean to...\"","\"Enough! I don't want to see you! Get out!\"","At that moment, Li Shaocheng's sister's first reaction wasn't embarrassment, but relief.","She said nothing and turned to leave, leaving Li Shaocheng inside to continue screaming and venting.","...","Early morning, the Jing family's livestream had just opened. It was still dark outside.","[...I thought my eyes were playing tricks on me, but it really is streaming?!]","[Isn't it a bit too early? Don't the production team sleep?]","[This probably isn't about the production team not sleeping, but the guests not sleeping!]","[Let's guess, who will be the first to appear?]","[It probably won't be Jing Yi.]","Then the few viewers who had entered the livestream were shocked to see Jing Yi's figure!","She walked out of her room, saw the camera move towards her, approached it, and waved her hand, greeting softly.","\"Good morning everyone, although it's not even six o'clock yet...\" She muttered to herself: \"Actually, there's no need to be quiet, everyone's going to wake up anyway.\"","Jing Yi looked out the window. It was still dark, and she couldn't even see the forest outside.","They had agreed last night to watch the sunrise.","Just as Jing Yi was lamenting how early it was, Jing Zejun also walked out of her room, quietly greeting the camera.","The two walked into the kitchen. \"Yi, do you want to eat something to tide you over?\" They still had to wait for the sunrise, and she was worried Jing Yi might get hungry.","Jing Yi leaned in, looking at the ingredients in the refrigerator. \"Let's just make some coffee, and I'll toast some bread.\" She took out the bread from the fridge, preparing to put it in the toaster.","At this moment, Wen Qingyan also came out of his room.","\"Good morning.\"","\"Good morning, Brother Qingyan.\"","\"Good morning, Actor Wen.\" Wen Qingyan rolled up his sleeves and walked to Jing Zejun's side, asking, \"Is there anything I can help with?\"","Because of yesterday's events, Jing Zejun was no longer as natural with Wen Qingyan as before.","Jing Yi lowered her head and smiled faintly, silently dealing with the breakfast in her hands.","[Big brother isn't even trying to hide his thoughts, is he?!]","[Is it this sweet so early in the morning?]","[Is the person above in the wrong livestream? Oh right, I forgot that the two livestreams show the same thing anyway!]","Jing Zejun hurriedly said, \"Actually, there's not much to help with, we're just making some coffee.\" Wen Qingyan smiled gently, \"Then let me help prepare the coffee.\"","Since he insisted, Jing Zejun could only agree. Jing Yi silently moved to the side to toast the bread, occasionally glancing at the two.","[I'm invisible, I'm invisible.]","Wen Qingyan noticed that Jing Zejun's hand had stopped, and asked with concern, \"What's wrong?\" Jing Zejun quickly shook her head, \"It's nothing.\" She just suddenly had an itch to tap the person watching from the side.","The three quickly prepared breakfast. Jing Yi carried the toasted bread and walked towards the outside of the villa.","The camera followed them to the lawn outside the villa. In front of them was a valley, with only a faint white light visible.","Jing Yi put down the bread, glanced at the mountain peak, then looked back at the villa. \"Second brother and the others haven't come down yet.\" She took out her phone, \"Second brother! The sun is about to come out, what are you still dawdling for?\"","A few minutes later, Jing Zeyou and the other two came downstairs and walked over to sit down in a row.","\"Jing Yi, I never thought there'd be a day when you'd be waking me up.\"","Jing Yi looked at him defiantly, \"Don't look down on me! The bread you're eating was toasted by me early this morning!\"","Over there, the sky began to gradually brighten. A faint beam of light shot out from above the horizon, gradually becoming brighter and wider.","Jing Yi excitedly patted the person next to her, \"Stop chatting! The sun is coming out!\"","Everyone's gaze turned towards it, immersed in the beautiful scenery before them.","Soon after, the distant mountains were tinged with a faint golden color, with mist swirling around them. The glow of dawn grew brighter, and gradually, the sun began to rise, revealing its full face.","At that moment, the world seemed to freeze in silence, leaving only the soft sunlight and the brilliant sunrise scenery.","The six of them sat quietly, enjoying the moment of sunrise.","The camera pulled back, showing them sitting in a row, with the rising sun in the distance. This scene was almost too beautiful to be real."]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Farewell, Little Tomato","paragraphs":["In the morning, the sun had fully illuminated the valley, casting a golden glow on the villa's front, creating a warm atmosphere.","The livestream rooms gradually filled with netizens, with both families' streams maintaining their usual high popularity.","[I heard they watched the sunrise this morning?! Did I miss out on something amazing?]","[Yes, you did. I can only say it could be ranked as one of the most heartwarming scenes of the year!]","[I heard Wen the movie star and Jing Zejun made breakfast together? Did I miss that too?!]","[Well, I can't wake up for a 6 AM livestream. I'll just watch the highlights later!]","[There's been so much happening this morning!]","While the comments were still buzzing about the sunrise viewing, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun had already set off for a stroll in the woods.","The trees in the valley were tall and straight, with lush foliage forming natural screens. Sunlight filtered through the gaps in the leaves, falling on the tree bark and making it appear particularly vibrant.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun walked along the forest road, venturing deep into the woods.","Not far away, a clear spring emerged from the rocks, forming small streams that meandered through the forest, carrying crystal-clear water. A few fallen leaves floated on the surface, drifting along with the current.","Jing Yi pointed at the road with interest, \"This road would be perfect for mountain racing!\"","Jing Zejun smiled at her. With fewer people around, Jing Yi tended to speak her mind more freely.","She didn't need Jing Yi to be a well-behaved, sensible sister; she preferred Jing Yi to be a girl who could grow up freely.","Just as Jing Yi protected her, Jing Zejun also wanted to protect that other side of Jing Yi.","Whether she liked car racing or kickboxing, it didn't matter.","Meanwhile, Jing Zeyou and Wen Qingyan were preparing lunch, while Jing Zeqian was helping Wen Yin prepare some simple ingredients nearby.","Jing Zeyou was flipping steaks, the meat sizzling in the pan. This was one of the few main dishes he knew how to cook.","Wen Qingyan was also preparing his specialty dishes nearby. Jing Zeyou casually asked, \"Did you and Zejun meet while filming?\"","Wen Qingyan looked up and smiled, \"Sort of.\" Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly. 'Sort of'? That meant not exactly. It seemed they had known each other even earlier than he had imagined.","\"Mr. Jing, please just call me Qingyan.\"","He hadn't found the title 'Wen the movie star' strange before, but after hearing it so often these past two days, it did feel a bit odd. Maybe it was because of Jing Zejun's family, or perhaps due to Jing Zeyou's own aura, but Wen Qingyan felt somewhat uncomfortable with the formal address.","Jing Zeyou accepted his suggestion.","From then on, the two men engaged in more casual conversation.","[Hahaha, if this isn't a brother-in-law interrogation, what is?]","[Even the movie star seems a bit nervous!]","[The contrast between the two sides is so clear - Zejun's side is so heartwarming, while the movie star's side is like walking on thin ice!]","By the time Jing Zeyou's steaks were almost done, he had stopped his questioning and started plating the food.","Wen Qingyan turned his head and sighed in relief. If the 'interrogation' had continued, he might not have been able to hold out much longer. He looked towards the end of the road and asked casually, \"Zejun and Miss Jing Yi haven't returned yet?\"","Jing Zeyou also looked up, \"The scenery around here is nice. Yi Yi loves this kind of landscape, so Zejun is probably accompanying her while she enjoys it.\"","Wen Qingyan remarked, \"They have such a good relationship.\" This wasn't flattery, but a genuine observation from what he had seen over the past day.","Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a smile, \"Yes, they came to the Jing Family around the same time. People outside might wonder how the family would treat two heiresses when they suddenly appeared.\"","Wen Qingyan listened quietly. This was the first time Jing Zeyou had publicly explained this situation, and even the livestream comments fell silent.","\"But more than the attitudes of others in the Jing Family, they were probably more concerned about each other's attitudes.\"","\"When Zejun first arrived, she was very quiet, unsure how to interact with family members. Then Yi Yi came, and suddenly she had something to do - she started taking care of her sister who was one month younger than her.\"","Wen Qingyan lowered his eyes and smiled softly, recalling the scene when he first met Jing Zejun.","Speaking of the two girls, Jing Zeyou's expression softened, \"At first, Yi Yi actually didn't want to come back.\"","Wen Qingyan was surprised; he hadn't expected there to be such a backstory.","Jing Zeyou chuckled unconsciously, \"People say that with the Jing Family's status, how could she bear to pass it up? But comparatively, she might have preferred to stay abroad and live freely.\"","[Come to think of it, Jing Yi was raised by Grandma Jing, so how could she be short of money?]","[Don't be naive, how can that money compare to the Jing Family's wealth?]","[But if I had to choose, I'd choose not to come back too. The Jing Family may be rich, but there are also a lot of people. Just imagining it seems like a hassle to get along with everyone!]","\"It was Grandma's last wish that made her come back. Compared to me and Jing Zeqian, her brothers, Yi Yi is the one who understands Zejun the best. She knows Zejun's passion for acting and what truly matters to her deep down.\"","She could even be the first to sense when Jing Zejun was in danger.","Jing Zeqian, standing nearby, also fell silent, listening quietly. Wen Yin watched as he washed the tomatoes over and over, unsure whether to interrupt - the tomato skins were almost rubbed off.","But in the end, he didn't say anything. After all, this was his brother's big boss. If the tomatoes broke, so be it.","During this time, Jing Zeyou had finished all his cooking, and Wen Qingyan had also completed his tasks. He looked at the pot and felt like something was missing.","Jing Zeyou also felt like something was missing from the plates, \"Zeqian, does it take that long to wash a tomato? And where are the mushrooms I asked for?\"","[Someone please intervene! The tomatoes are about to 'die'!]","[If you need to peel tomatoes, you can use hot water to scald them, no need to rub...]","Wen Yin also heard Wen Qingyan's call and instinctively looked at the tomatoes in Jing Zeqian's hands, their skins already rubbed off.","Jing Zeqian looked at the tomato skins in his hands, realizing he had used too much force. He noticed the young man's gaze beside him, coughed a few times, and pretended as if nothing had happened as he brought over the washed ingredients.","Jing Zeyou looked at the tomatoes in the basin, then raised his head to look at his brother, \"Is this how you washed the tomatoes?\"","Jing Zeqian kept a straight face, \"Yes! This way they're cleaner!\"","They were clean indeed, just a bit worse for wear...","Wen Qingyan smiled as he took the tomatoes and put them in the pot, \"It's fine, they'll all cook the same anyway.\" At least they didn't need to be cut now, since they would all be cooked down.","After all, this was his boss, and he needed to save some face for him, especially since he was the second brother-in-law he needed to win over.","Jing Zeyou was still staring at the cherry tomatoes, while Wen Qingyan continued cooking them all the same. After he sautéed them, the tomatoes would probably lose their shape anyway.","Jing Zeqian avoided Jing Zeyou's gaze, feeling relieved that Jing Yi and the others had gone out and hadn't witnessed this scene."]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: The Abandoned Jing Zeqian","paragraphs":["On the other side of the world, the couple Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing were also watching the livestream of Jing Zejun and the others.","Although they were on vacation, Lin Ruiqing still worried about their four children at home, so she would open the livestream to check on them whenever they weren't out.","Lin Ruiqing laughed so hard she fell back onto the sofa. Beside her, Jing Beicheng hovered his hands protectively, afraid she might accidentally fall to the floor.","\"Beicheng, look at your son. He can't even wash a tomato properly.\"","Jing Beicheng had also noticed the tomato in Jing Zeqian's hands on the screen and remarked disapprovingly, \"That little rascal, he can't even wash a tomato right.\"","On screen, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were also slowly walking back to the villa along the road.","\"Beicheng, the scenery where Yiyi and the others are seems even nicer than Tianqiu Mountain.\"","Lin Ruiqing was intently watching the livestream. Hearing her words, Jing Beicheng leaned in closer. The screen showed a lush green landscape.","Tianqiu Mountain was famous for its terrain and unique lake scenery, different from the valley where the Jing family's Xiyuan Villa was located. But Jing Beicheng didn't want to dampen Lin Ruiqing's enthusiasm.","\"If you like it, why don't we go to Xiyuan first when we get back?\" Though he remembered they had been there before.","Lin Ruiqing shook her head. She was just making an observation. The scenery looked good partly because Jing Yi and the others seemed so happy, and it was clear all four of them were having a great time these past two days.","\"If it were just the two of us going, it wouldn't have the same atmosphere.\"","Jing Beicheng didn't see this as a problem. \"That's easy enough to fix. We'll just bring the kids along next time.\"","Lin Ruiqing gave him a reproachful look. Whenever this topic came up, Jing Beicheng acted as if the four children were little accessories that could be taken along at will.","On screen, Jing Yi was talking to Jing Zejun about \"mountain running.\" Lin Ruiqing asked Jing Beicheng, \"What does Yiyi mean by 'mountain running'?\"","\"'Mountain running' is when car enthusiasts drive on mountain roads.\"","Lin Ruiqing didn't quite understand. She knew Jing Yi liked to go out driving sports cars, but how was this different from driving in the city or on a racetrack?","Jing Beicheng looked at the road on the screen. \"It's not quite the same. In the city, there are too many cars, so you often can't enjoy the pleasure of driving. Racetracks are mainly about pursuing speed. Driving on roads like this is more about the experience.\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded, seeming to understand what Jing Beicheng meant, and turned her attention back to the screen.","She wasn't actually very worried about Jing Yi's love for racing. In fact, Jing Zeqian was probably the only one in the family who was overly concerned. She preferred to believe that Jing Yi was a sensible child who knew how to protect herself.","After learning about Jing Yi's interests, Lin Ruiqing knew what kind of gifts to buy for her.","After Jing Zejun had been found, Lin Ruiqing had given him all the birthday gifts she had prepared over the years, from small longevity locks to large properties.","But since Jing Yi had come to the Jing family, she hadn't yet given her a formal gift.","\"Beicheng, keep an eye out for any car shows around here in the next few days. We could go and look around, buy a gift for Yiyi.\"","\"Alright.\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was unaware that a gift was coming her way. At that moment, she was sitting in a corner with Jing Zejun, watching the 'standoff' between Jing Zeqian and Wen Qingyan.","\"Don't you have your own plans?\" Jing Zeqian was barely maintaining a facade of calm, but in reality, he was grinding his teeth.","The Wen Qingyan in front of him remained as gentle as ever. \"Mr. Jing, it's precisely because we don't have plans that we drove here. Since you're also on a road trip, why don't we just go together?\"","Jing Zeqian had never realized that his company's big-time actor could be so thick-skinned! But he couldn't call him out on it, or this guy would surely be even more smug!","He wasn't about to play into someone else's hands!","Jing Zeqian forced a smile that didn't reach his eyes. \"After all, there are two separate livestreams. Won't you get mixed up following both? And won't it be inconvenient for Director Xu?\"","But Jing Zeqian had misjudged the situation. Director Xu hadn't stopped smiling for days. With such high viewership, how could he possibly give this up?","Director Xu hemmed and hawed, not wanting to hurt Jing Zeqian's feelings, but also not agreeing with him.","Seeing his reaction, Jing Zeqian knew that the production team wasn't an option. He glared at Director Xu, then looked at the brightly smiling Wen Qingyan, which annoyed him even more.","Jing Yi was getting bored of waiting, not knowing how long these two would keep discussing. \"Junjun, why don't we take Big Brother and leave first?\"","Jing Zejun smiled. \"Sure, let's take little Yin along too.\" The boy was standing in the corner with his luggage, looking rather pitiful.","Jing Yi immediately agreed, turning to get into the driver's seat. Jing Zejun walked over to Wen Yin, telling him to put his luggage in the car.","Wen Yin glanced at Wen Qingyan, who was still in 'confrontation', hesitated for a moment, then followed Jing Zejun to put his luggage in the RV. He also boarded the RV, seeing Jing Zeyou working, which made him a bit nervous.","Jing Zeyou looked up at the newcomer and said with a smile, \"Relax, you can do your own thing. Don't mind me.\"","The RV was equipped with gaming devices. After Jing Zejun handed one to him, he returned to the passenger seat. The camera crew quickly followed.","[Hahaha! What kind of plot is this? Whose family's livestream am I watching exactly?!]","[Some people are having so much fun, their little brother has run off with someone else!]","[I predict Jing Yi is about to make a big move!]","[No need to predict, everyone's loaded up, just waiting to drive off!]","[Little Mr. Jing, stop arguing, your sister is about to drive away!]","The netizens' guesses weren't wrong. By the time Jing Zeqian realized what was happening, the RV had already started.","He watched in shock as the vehicle began to move. Wen Qingyan's eyes also held a hint of panic as he looked around, not seeing Wen Yin.","Jing Zejun poked his head out, smiling at the two of them. \"Brother Qingyan, follow our car, and don't forget to bring my second brother! Second brother, see you at the beach!\"","It was then that Wen Qingyan saw his brother. Wen Yin was smiling and waving at him, looking absolutely delighted!","[Hahaha, I'm dying of laughter!]","[I'm about to laugh myself to death! Little Mr. Jing looks so pitiful!]","[Wen Qingyan is still looking for his brother, who has now become someone else's brother.]","Jing Zeqian was about to explode with anger. What kind of siblings were these? They just drove off without him! They had time to take someone else's brother but no time to wait for him?!","Jing Zeqian angrily got into the passenger seat of the car behind, fastened his seatbelt, and crossed his arms. Seeing Wen Qingyan still standing there, he snapped, \"Hurry up and drive! They'll be far away soon!\"","Wen Qingyan sighed, resigned to his fate as he got back into the car.","He could already imagine the heavy, silent atmosphere in the car for the next few hours."]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: The First Seafood Feast","paragraphs":["When Jing Zeqian and Wen Qingyan arrived, Jing Yi and the others had already settled into the cliffside villa by the sea that Jing Zeyou had booked in advance.","The villa featured floor-to-ceiling windows on all sides, making full use of the surrounding natural scenery and perfectly reflecting the colors of the sea and sunlight. It was truly beautiful!","Just outside the villa was a massive infinity pool connected to the ocean, with sofas and lounge chairs nearby - the perfect spot to take in the sea view.","However, Jing Zeqian was in no mood to appreciate the scenery or the beautiful house. He stormed into the villa.","\"Where's Jing Yi?!\" He knew very well that the only person who would think to abandon him on the roadside was Jing Yi.","Jing Zeqian didn't see Jing Yi, but he saw Jing Zejun walking towards him, her eyes glancing towards the sofa.","The sofa faced the glass windows, so Jing Zeqian couldn't see who was sleeping on it.","Jing Zejun tugged at Jing Zeqian's sleeve and said softly, \"Second brother, keep your voice down. Yi just fell asleep.\"","After driving for several hours, Jing Yi had still been full of energy when they arrived. But after sitting on the sofa for a while, gazing at the scenery outside, she had dozed off.","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly. \"Why didn't you tell her to go sleep in her room?\"","\"I was afraid waking her up would make her not want to sleep anymore.\" Besides, the sofa was wide enough to serve as a bed for resting.","Seeing that he understood, Jing Zejun went out to unpack.","Jing Zeqian softened his footsteps and walked to the side of the sofa.","Jing Yi was curled up on the sofa, her sleeping face peaceful. Her long eyelashes cast a faint shadow, giving her a more serene look than usual.","She seemed to be in a deep sleep, not even stirring when the blanket had nearly slipped off.","Jing Zeqian muttered quietly to himself, \"At least she looks well-behaved when she's asleep.\" He carefully pulled the blanket up to cover her better, then left the living room.","[Young Master Jing is so gentle!]","[When he's not bickering with Jing Yi, Young Master Jing is seriously handsome.]","[But I quite enjoy watching the siblings bicker. It shows how close they are.]","[From Jing Yi's perspective, the view outside is truly breathtaking!]","[Hey you above! How can you ignore such a handsome and gentle Young Master Jing!]","By the time Jing Yi woke up, dinner was ready. The table was laden with seafood.","Jing Yi changed into a black spaghetti strap top and light-colored jeans, then headed to the table to replenish her energy.","When she heard Jing Zejun say that everything on the table was prepared by Wen Yin himself, Jing Yi looked in surprise at Wen Yin, who was smiling shyly.","\"Yin, you're amazing!\" Wen Yin smiled bashfully. \"It's not that impressive. My brother and Sister Zejun helped too.\"","Jing Yi still thought it was incredible. She had always believed that people who could handle seafood must be great cooks!","The garlic lobster in front of her had been thoughtfully cut into chunks. Jing Yi's eyes sparkled as she gripped her chopsticks.","\"Well then, I won't stand on ceremony!\"","\"When have you ever stood on ceremony?\"","Though Jing Zeqian's words were sharp, he still peeled a crab each for Jing Yi and Jing Zejun.","Jing Yi put a piece of lobster in her mouth, her eyes brightening even more. \"This is so delicious! Yin, you really are a master chef!\" Jing Yi began eagerly sampling the dishes.","Before long, Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan gradually stopped eating. Jing Zejun had always been very disciplined about eating, and Wen Qingyan was about to start filming, so he was also consciously controlling his diet.","The group at the table started chatting.","Jing Zeqian suddenly remembered Jiang Miaomiao's text from that morning and looked up to ask Wen Qingyan, \"Are you going to the company's celebration banquet at the end of the month?\"","Celebration banquet?","Jing Yi stopped peeling her shrimp and looked up at Jing Zeqian.","Wen Qingyan hesitated slightly. After his manager had told him about this, he had secretly investigated but ultimately found nothing. However, he still felt that this banquet was not quite normal.","He casually inquired, \"I heard Tao mention it. Why the sudden celebration banquet?\" Due to the cameras still filming, Wen Qingyan spoke somewhat vaguely.","In fact, Jing Zeqian also found it strange. Jiang Miaomiao had been acting oddly recently, being all secretive. And while she had been frantically seeking publicity before, she had now entered vacation mode.","Now she wanted to hold a celebration banquet for an insignificant award. Even Jing Zeqian couldn't fathom what Jiang Miaomiao was thinking.","But after all, they had been friends for so many years. Jing Zeqian couldn't possibly reject a simple celebration banquet. \"If she wants to hold one, let her. It's nice to have a lively gathering.\"","[Could it be Jiang Miaomiao?]","Jing Yi put down her shrimp and looked seriously at Jing Zeqian. \"Second brother, this 'she' wouldn't happen to be who I think it is, would it?\" The person beside her nodded.","Jing Zeqian felt like Jing Yi was interrogating him. He mentally crossed out the possibility of a good relationship between her and Jiang Miaomiao, not understanding where Jing Yi's hostility towards Jiang Miaomiao came from. But now wasn't the time to explain.","Jing Yi looked away and continued eating her shrimp.","[End of the month! I'll ask Jing Zeqian later and set a reminder!]","Jing Zeyou's gaze also turned towards them. Jing Yi did seem very concerned about this Jiang Miaomiao, but not in a fan-like way. Rather, she seemed wary. Why was that?","Jing Zeqian also wanted to know. Jing Yi had always disliked Jiang Miaomiao, so why was she suddenly interested in Jiang Miaomiao's celebration banquet?","And it wasn't just Jing Yi. He could sense that Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan didn't have a good impression of Jiang Miaomiao either.","Nevermind, he'd deal with it after the banquet.","[Who is it? Who are they talking about? Stop being so cryptic!]","[Is it Startrack's celebration banquet? Did something good happen recently?]","[It looks like the Film Emperor Wen doesn't really want to go.]","[Isn't it Jiang Miaomiao's celebration banquet at the end of the month? I heard from my reporter friend that she's holding one then...]","[Sister Miaomiao's celebration banquet? But she only won the Golden Lotus Award recently.]","While the comments were still guessing, the people at the dinner table continued chatting.","Wen Qingyan said politely, \"I have work that day, so I won't be able to attend.\" Jing Zeqian didn't say anything, but Jing Yi looked up. \"Second brother, I'll go! Remember to call me when it's time.\"","Jing Zeqian looked at her suspiciously. She wasn't planning to cause trouble, was she?","Jing Yi glared at him. \"What's with that look? Can't I just join in the fun? Jun, are you free at the end of the month? Let's go together!\"","Jing Zejun originally didn't want to get involved. Her relationship with Jiang Miaomiao wasn't great either. But since Jing Yi brought it up...","She thought for a moment. The end of the month seemed clear. \"I'm free. I don't have any work scheduled for those days.\"","Jing Yi looked triumphantly at her second brother, but before she could speak, Wen Qingyan chimed in.","\"Mr. Jing, I just realized I should attend after all. It is an important celebration banquet, after all.\"","Jing Zeyou, Jing Zeqian, and Jing Yi: ...","As well as a suddenly blushing Jing Zejun, and Wen Yin, who found his brother embarrassing and buried his head in his food."]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: The Second Stop - The Island","paragraphs":["\"Brother, what's the point of what they're doing? Aren't they afraid of getting sunburned?\" Jing Zeqian lazily reclined in his lounge chair, looking puzzled towards the beach where Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were running towards the waves and then scampering back as the water rushed in.","Jing Zeyou watched the two girls, a smile tugging at his lips. \"If they're enjoying themselves, that's what matters.\" Jing Zeqian pursed his lips, still disapproving of their childish and silly behavior.","He turned to look at Wen Qingyan, who was also sitting in the shade of the tent. \"Aren't you going out there?\" he asked. Wen Yin had already gone off to ride jet skis, yet Wen Qingyan was still leisurely sitting in the tent avoiding the sun.","Wen Qingyan shook his head. He didn't care for Wen Yin's recreational activities, and with Jing Zejun playing with Jing Yi, it didn't feel right to join them. He'd rather rest in the tent.","Wen Qingyan raised his water glass in a toast to the other two, and the three of them drank together.","[If I hadn't seen them pour it myself, I'd think that was alcohol...]","[These three are too adorable, not a hint of successful businessmen about them!]","[Haha, who clinks glasses when drinking water?]","[Clearly these three are the oldest ones here!]","Meanwhile, Jing Yi spotted the jet skis in Wen Yin's direction and grew interested. \"Zejun, want to try that?\" Jing Zejun looked where Jing Yi was pointing at the jet skis. \"Sure, you can drive.\"","She had been curious about jet skis when she was younger but never dared to try. Now with someone who was a good driver, she naturally wanted to give it a shot.","\"Big brother! Second brother!\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were all geared up and ready to go, with Jing Zejun holding tightly to Jing Yi. Before setting off, they waved towards Jing Zeyou's direction.","Seeing this, Jing Zeqian immediately stood up, then seemed to think better of it and sat back down, though his eyes remained fixed on the two girls.","Jing Zeyou looked at Jing Zeqian, then at the visibly nervous Wen Qingyan, and said with a smile, \"You need to learn to trust her.\" Trust and concern weren't mutually exclusive.","As Jing Yi set off, the director quickly adjusted the cameras to follow, with the cameraman only able to capture their backs.","The livestream showed a panoramic view of Jing Yi riding the jet ski. The sea before them was choppy with waves splashing up. She drove the jet ski out to sea, with Jing Zejun feeling nervous but exhilarated by each bump and jump.","Suddenly, a huge wave came towards them. Without hesitation, Jing Yi drove straight at it, making the jet ski leap into the air and trace a graceful arc, leaving a trail of spray behind them.","The livestream viewers were captivated by the skillful maneuver. Wen Yin, watching from nearby, couldn't help but exclaim, \"Sister Jing Yi is so cool!\"","When they returned on the jet ski, both girls were soaked through but wore excited smiles.","Jing Zeqian walked over with two towels, saying with feigned disgust, \"You look like drowned rats. Hurry up and cover yourselves!\" Jing Zejun smiled sheepishly, taking a towel and draping it over Jing Yi first before covering herself.","Jing Yi was still beaming with excitement. \"Second brother, don't you want to try? It's really fun!\" He had no interest in such frivolity. \"What's fun about getting drenched in seawater?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, clicking her tongue. \"Second brother, you just don't understand the joy of play.\" Even Jing Zejun was still caught up in the thrill of their ride.","\"I suggest you go change clothes first, then we can talk about joy.\" In this state, they'd catch cold as soon as the wind blew!","[Jing Yi's moves just now were so cool!]","[The young Mr. Jing really lives up to his 'tsundere' label. No wonder Jing Yi described him as 'sharp tongue, soft heart'!]","[Haha!]","[Hey you above! Don't think I don't know your mind's in the gutter. Eyes off!]","While Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were changing, Wen Yin had returned to the tent and was telling Wen Qingyan about the jet skis.","\"Brother, Sister Jing Yi looked so cool driving the jet ski!\"","Jing Zeqian arrived just in time to hear this. \"Keep praising her and she'll get a big head.\" Though he said this, the corners of his mouth turned up involuntarily, betraying his good mood.","Wen Yin chuckled, knowing Jing Zeqian was just being modest. But he was genuinely curious, \"Brother Zeqian, is Sister Jing Yi good with vehicles in general?\"","Wen Qingyan glanced at Wen Yin. His brother had been so nervous when first meeting Jing Zeqian, but after just a few days, he seemed even more familiar with him than Wen Qingyan was.","Jing Zeqian sighed, as if conceding. \"She's good. Very good. The first time I took her to a racetrack, she beat my racing buddies. How could she not be skilled?\"","Hearing Jing Zeqian's words, Jing Zeyou's expression turned fond.","Wen Yin's eyes widened in shock. He clearly hadn't expected that such a sweet and pretty girl as Jing Yi would be skilled not just in martial arts but in racing too.","At this moment, the livestream comments were more skeptical, with kinder ones chalking it up to Jing Zeqian's doting brother filter, and less kind ones saying all sorts of things.","But Jing Zeqian didn't know, or if he did, he didn't care. He continued chatting with Wen Yin about Jing Yi's hobbies until Jing Yi and Jing Zejun reappeared, at which point he abruptly changed the subject, acting as if nothing had happened.","\"What are you talking about?\"","Jing Yi's bright almond eyes looked curiously at Jing Zeqian. They had been chatting animatedly earlier, so why did they stop when she approached?","Just as Wen Yin was about to explain that they had been discussing Jing Yi's racing skills, Jing Zeqian quickly cut in, \"Wen Yin was saying there's a famous go-kart track in this area. He was asking if you'd be interested.\"","Wen Yin's mouth opened and closed, stunned. He couldn't recall mentioning anything of the sort, and how would he even know about local go-kart tracks?","Seeing Wen Yin's dumbfounded expression, Wen Qingyan lowered his head to hide his amused smile.","[Some people are just too stubborn! He clearly looked up the information for his sister but has to pretend it was someone else's idea.]","[Wen Yin, this is your mistake. If Young Master Jing says you said it, then you said it!]","[The little brother is so cute!]","[My brother is laughing so hard he's shaking...]","[What? Isn't that too dangerous? Even if Young Master Jing says so, he must be biased.]","[Come on, how dangerous can go-karting be?]","Jing Zejun looked at them oddly, not understanding what kind of wordplay game they were playing.","Seeing this, Wen Qingyan got up and moved closer to Jing Zejun, quietly explaining the situation. Jing Zejun's eyes curved into crescents as a faint smile graced her lips.","Jing Zeqian was busy diverting Jing Yi's attention and didn't notice this exchange, but Jing Zeyou saw it and made a mental note. If someone wanted to be the Jing family's son-in-law, they would need to pass some tests first.","Jing Zeyou raised his water glass and took an elegant sip, standing out amid the lively atmosphere around him."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Excellent Partner","paragraphs":["As expected, Jing Yi was quickly distracted. \"Go-karts? Are we going to play?\"","Given how excited she was, how could Jing Zeqian refuse her?","\"We'll go in the afternoon.\"","As long as they were going, that was fine!","Having received a satisfactory answer, Jing Yi smiled and sat down next to Jing Zeyou. \"Big brother, aren't you all going to play?\" Sitting in the tent all morning, was that okay?","Jing Zeyou declined. He was truly the one not interested in these things. Compared to the entertainment facilities outside, sitting in the tent to rest was more relaxing.","Jing Yi stretched lazily, inadvertently noticing Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan already sitting together, talking about acting.","Jing Yi giggled quietly and whispered to Jing Zeyou: \"Big brother, isn't Wen Qingyan's intention very obvious?\"","She didn't believe that someone as smart as Jing Zeyou wouldn't have noticed something so evident - even netizens had started analyzing it frame by frame.","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly, \"It is very obvious. Why, do you approve of them?\" Jing Yi's eyes widened. This was the official couple in the novel, the designated male and female leads!","But she seemed to think of something and said a moment later: \"Whether I approve or not doesn't matter. My opinion doesn't count.\" She did ship this official couple, but ultimately it depended on how the two of them developed.","After Jing Yi had transmigrated here, she hadn't treated anyone in this world as virtual. Since they were living, breathing people, they had their own thoughts and choices.","Each choice was a key point in changing the outcome.","If no matter what choices were made, the ending would still be the same, then all her efforts during this time would have been in vain. It would have been better to stay abroad from the beginning and have a few easy years.","Jing Zeyou was somewhat surprised. He had thought that since Jing Yi loved to get involved in Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan's affairs so much, she truly approved of them.","Jing Zeyou's gaze held approval, \"You're right. These things still depend on both parties' attitudes.\" At least Jing Zejun still treated Wen Qingyan as a senior, not as a suitor.","When the relationship between the two really changed, it wouldn't be too late to say more.","Jing Yi suddenly looked at Jing Zeyou with a somewhat dangerous gaze, \"Big brother, what are you thinking?\" Although she didn't know why, she inexplicably felt nervous for Wen Qingyan.","Jing Zeyou's eyes flickered slightly, the corners of his mouth turning up, \"I'm thinking about what kind of boyfriend you'll find in the future.\" Jing Yi pointed at herself in confusion, \"Me?\"","Why suddenly mention her?","Jing Zeyou rephrased, \"Or do you think General Shen from Huarui Group is your type?\"","Jing Yi widened her eyes in disbelief, her round bright black eyes looking at the person beside her, \"How is that possible?! That kind of arrogant and cold guy, even being friends with him would be charity!\"","Jing Zeyou lowered his head and chuckled lightly. She really was as consistent as ever in her dislike for Shen Huaichu.","\"Big brother, why did you mention him?\" Jing Yi glanced at the cameras still focused on Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan, asking in a low voice.","Jing Zeyou smiled slightly, looking up, \"Nothing, just giving an example. I suddenly thought of such a person.\"","Jing Yi frowned, her eyes still showing disdain, especially when she thought of Shen Huaichu's mockery at the ball last time. She got even more angry.","What a waste of that handsome face!","However, Jing Yi was very curious about Jing Zeyou's opinion of Shen Huaichu. \"Big brother, what kind of person do you think he is?\" The two companies were cooperating, so from a business partner's perspective, it should be quite different.","Jing Zeyou calmly raised his water glass, \"He's an excellent business partner.\" He couldn't deny this point.","In terms of all-around abilities, Shen Huaichu could be considered an outstanding person. Especially knowing his ups and downs over the years, Jing Zeyou felt even more so.","He added: \"Capable, and at the same time a person who is rational to the point of being cold.\"","Jing Yi nodded in strong agreement. Every time she saw that person, he was so cold!","Jing Zeyou chuckled lightly, \"So as a business partner, he's not bad.\" As for anything else, he refrained from comment.","Just as Jing Yi was about to say something to Jing Zeyou, Jing Zeqian's voice came over, \"Jing Yi Yi, what are you and big brother whispering about behind my back?\"","Jing Zeqian had originally wanted to join Wen Qingyan and the others' conversation, but after all, everyone has their own expertise. Wen Qingyan deliberately steered the topic towards acting techniques, and Jing Zejun seemed very interested in this topic.","There was no help for it. Jing Zeqian could only withdraw first, and when he came back, he saw Jing Yi and Jing Zeyou also whispering.","Jing Yi retorted, \"What do you mean behind your back? Big brother and I were discussing something important!\" Jing Zeqian crossed his arms, looking disdainful, \"What important thing could you have? Tell me, what were you just talking about?\"","To avoid losing in terms of momentum, Jing Yi stood up with her hands on her hips, \"I won't tell you! You didn't tell me about your whispered conversation with Wen Yin earlier either, did you?\"","Jing Zeqian was slightly stunned. He hadn't expected her to still remember that. He had thought he had glossed over it.","Jing Yi's eyes gleamed with triumph. Didn't expect that, did you? Her memory had improved!","\"You tell me what you were just talking about first!\"","Jing Zeqian shrugged and sat back in the lounge chair, looking nonchalant, \"Never mind then, I don't want to know anymore.\"","This round, Jing Zeqian wins!","Wen Qingyan turned his head to look over. Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian were still arguing. \"Are Mr. Jing and Miss Jing Yi alright?\" Jing Zejun looked over and smiled, \"Don't worry, they argue like this every day. It's fine.\"","The live stream was bustling with activity at this moment, and netizens were also engaged in heated discussions.","[New viewer here, is this live stream always like this?]","[Haha, don't worry, you just happened to catch the daily essential segment. Worth it!]","[What were Jing Yi Yi and Mr. Jing saying just now? Couldn't hear clearly.]","[New viewer, right? I suggest you watch it in three sections. Camera 1: CP shipping area, also known as the dating show area, occasionally interspersed with in-depth interviews with the actors.]","[Camera 2: Family with Children area, mainly focused on sibling squabbles. It's recommended to adjust the volume appropriately here.]","[Camera 3: Leisure and Entertainment area, also known as the spectator area. Here you can enjoy the perspective of a top-tier company CEO, as well as the perspective of the boy next door.]","Speaking of which, Wen Yin was truly the only young and helpless audience member present.","Because his brother was pursuing a girlfriend, he was preparing to go play another round of amusement rides by the seaside, but then the argument started next to him.","Now he didn't know whether to leave or stay.","Just as Wen Yin was at a loss, Jing Zeyou brought over a plate of snacks from the side, \"Watch and eat.\" Mainly because Jing Zeyou didn't like eating these things, otherwise he would have also prepared a plate of snacks to watch the show.","Wen Yin felt a bit more settled. Since Jing Zeyou was watching the show, he might as well join in!"]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Sunset Rollercoaster","paragraphs":["The sun was about to set when they finally arrived at the go-kart track Jing Zeqian had mentioned.","This place was known as the Island Racing Valley, featuring both indoor and outdoor go-kart tracks, both of which were nationally renowned.","The setting sun cast its rays on the go-kart track, reflecting a deep glow. The track was paved with smooth asphalt, stretching into the distance, winding and twisting like a parabola across the entire venue.","Being on an island, there wasn't much vegetation along the sides of the track, making it appear even more expansive.","Jing Yi leaned against the railing, looking at the track before her, unable to hide the excitement in her eyes.","Jing Zeqian leaned on the railing, turning to Jing Zeyou, \"Brother, don't say I didn't warn you. You'd better be prepared.\"","Jing Zeyou understood Jing Zeqian's meaning. He smiled and patted his shoulder, \"We're here to have fun. Why do you keep trying to control her?\"","Jing Zeqian snorted coldly. How could he control her now? At least he had given a warning, so whatever happened next couldn't be blamed on him.","[Hahaha, Little Jing's 'mother hen' image is becoming more and more pronounced.]","[What kind of preparation? How dangerous can go-karting be?]","[This go-kart track is huge! It must be thrilling to race on.]","[I'm tired of saying I'm envious...]","After the production team set up the camera positions, Jing Zeqian and Wen Qingyan went to pay.","Soon, Jing Zeyou's group changed into professional gear. Among them, the happy expressions on Jing Yi and Wen Yin's faces were particularly noticeable.","Jing Zeqian muttered under his breath: \"Just like children...\" which happened to be overheard by Jing Yi.","A bright smile spread across her face, the dimples at the corners of her mouth refusing to fade. \"Second brother, if you lose to this 'child', it would be quite embarrassing, you know.\"","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow, crossing his arms, \"Me? Lose to you? Last time I just didn't participate. You wait and see your second brother's superb racing skills!\" Jing Yi smiled confidently, seeming sure of herself, \"Well, we'll see about that!\"","While these two were throwing down the gauntlet, Wen Qingyan was still instructing Jing Zejun on how to quickly master driving a go-kart.","In fact, Jing Zejun had already heard the basic operations from the staff, but she was still a bit nervous until she looked up and saw Jing Yi.","\"Yi Yi\"","Jing Yi came over and crouched beside her, patiently explaining how to avoid colliding with other go-karts while adjusting her posture.","The content was mostly the same, but Jing Zejun clearly felt much more relaxed.","Wen Qingyan stood to the side, staring blankly at the scene before him, suddenly feeling a bit superfluous...","[Hahaha, brother, why don't you make some room? You look a bit out of place!]","[Aren't they saying the same things? Haha]","[One's state of mind can't be faked. Jing Zejun really relies on Jing Yi!]","[I thought Jing's words were just for show, but they really are like real sisters.]","[Never would have guessed that Wen Qingyan's biggest obstacle would be Jing Yi!]","[Wen Qingyan: I thought you were my wingman, but you turned out to be my rival?!]","Wen Qingyan stood to the side, feeling increasingly bitter and somewhat amused at the same time.","Wen Yin chuckled softly; his brother looked a bit pitiful.","The movement beside him caught Wen Qingyan's attention. He looked over, and Wen Yin quickly put on his helmet, sitting in his go-kart position, looking ready to start.","Wen Qingyan turned his gaze back to the affectionate sisters in front of him, noticing the laughter and relaxation in Jing Zejun's eyes. He sighed inwardly.","The road ahead was indeed long and arduous.","No matter how reluctant he felt, Wen Qingyan could only obediently return to his own position. After all, there was no place for him by Jing Zejun's side at the moment.","Jing Zeyou took in everyone's expressions, a glimmer of amusement passing through his deep eyes beneath the helmet.","Didn't he say it wouldn't be easy?","A few minutes later, seeing that Jing Zejun was ready, Jing Yi finally returned to her own kart.","She put on her helmet, her clear and bright eyes showing a seriousness quite different from her usual demeanor. The track ahead seemed not just a racecourse, but Jing Yi's personal battlefield.","Jing Zeqian was right next to Jing Yi, his expression equally serious, exuding an aura different from his usual self.","The live stream comments also became tense, focusing intently on this race.","At the starting line of the track, a large countdown display hung overhead.","The race begins!","The live stream clearly showed that among the six go-karts, two shot out from the starting line like arrows leaving a bow, instantly creating a contrast with the other vehicles.","These were none other than Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian's go-karts.","Wen Yin followed closely behind, then came Jing Zeyou, and finally Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan's vehicles. Wen Qingyan clearly had no intention of joining their competition, staying behind to protect Jing Zejun.","At the front of the track, Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian's go-karts sped along the winding course, nimbly navigating obstacles and turns. Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi's positions were neck and neck.","The tense and exciting race made the live stream audience feel as if they were right there at the scene. The comments quieted down as viewers watched the race intently.","Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel tightly, fully focused on the road ahead, her foot never easing off the accelerator. Just ahead was the classic turn of this famous island racing track.","The race entered its most heated phase. Jing Yi knew that the upcoming turn was the best spot to pull ahead!","Jing Zeqian's go-kart stuck close to the inside of the turn, guarding against Jing Yi's attempt to overtake. But as he entered the turn, Jing Zeqian slightly drifted away from the inner lane.","From the corner of his eye, he saw Jing Yi's black go-kart speed past, executing a perfect cornering overtake.","Jing Zeqian floored the accelerator, trying to catch up, but Jing Yi's go-kart had already pulled a considerable distance ahead.","After shaking off the closely following go-kart, Jing Yi's speed noticeably increased. With the experience from the first lap, she drove even more smoothly in the subsequent laps.","In just a few minutes, Jing Zeyou once again caught sight of Jing Yi's go-kart. Gripping the steering wheel, he watched the constantly accelerating kart ahead, finding it hard to believe this was her first time on this track.","Every turn was executed with utmost fluidity, without the slightest hesitation. Especially after completing one lap, she seemed to know exactly how to anticipate each turn, controlling her vehicle with precision.","Jing Zeyou had previously made an estimate of Jing Yi's passion for racing, but now he had to admit that he had likely underestimated racing's importance to Jing Yi...","Meanwhile, to give the online audience a better immersive experience of Jing Yi and the others' racing process, Director Xu had equipped each go-kart with a dedicated camera.","Initially, he had placed his bets on Jing Zeqian, anticipating that his perspective would be the most popular.","That was until a few minutes later when he saw Jing Yi's go-kart become the most dazzling presence on the track under the setting sun."]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: Would you like to race with me","paragraphs":["In the 'Dear Family' livestream, netizens were immersed in go-kart racing.","[I never thought I'd be experiencing go-karting from this perspective. I'm so amazing!]","[Wake up, person above! It's Jing Yi who's amazing!]","[So this is what Little Miss Jing meant by 'be prepared'! I'm directly shouting out: Master! Take me as your disciple!]","[Wait, driving like this and not becoming a professional racer? Is it because she doesn't like it?]","Jing Yi was the first to cross the finish line!","The black go-kart drifted to a stop nearby. As she removed her helmet, she accidentally loosened her hair tie, letting her long curly hair cascade down. The glow of the setting sun behind her made it seem as if each strand of hair was shimmering. At that moment, Jing Yi's smile was dazzlingly radiant.","Shen Huaichu saw this scene, his gaze lingering on the screen for a long time. He unconsciously took a screenshot.","A few seconds later, Shen Huaichu paused. His slender fingers moved slowly, his pupils dilating slightly. What was he doing?","Shen Huaichu tossed his phone onto the coffee table and lay back on the sofa. His usually expressionless eyes now revealed confusion and frustration.","He got up to pour himself a glass of ice water. The transparent glass touched his thin lips as the cold water slid down his throat. After putting the glass down, Shen Huaichu stood still, his gaze fixed ahead, lost in thought.","Ever since he encountered Jing Yi again, he had been acting increasingly strange. It was odd enough that he started watching the Jing Family's livestreams, but now he was taking screenshots like some kind of pervert.","Could it be that Gu Lin was right?","\"Brother, you seem different when it comes to Miss Jing Yi.\" Hearing this, Shen Huaichu let out a cold laugh, \"That's because you're blind. You should get your eyes checked when you have the chance.\"","Gu Lin: With such a strong reaction? And he still claims there's nothing different?","Shen Huaichu returned to the sofa with a cold expression. The sound of Jing Yi's laughter came from the screen. He glanced at it, then exited the app.","Remembering the screenshot he had taken earlier, Shen Huaichu wanted to delete the photo. Looking at the brightly smiling face in his album, he hesitated. His finger hovered over the confirm delete button, but ultimately, he couldn't bring himself to press it.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi, having won the championship, was boasting to Jing Zeqian.","\"Second Brother! I won!\"","Jing Zeqian had initially wanted to tease her, but seeing her radiant smile, he couldn't bring himself to do it. He gently ruffled her hair and praised her, \"Yes! Jing Yi is really amazing!\"","Jing Yi's smile grew even brighter.","Jing Zeyou and the others also crossed the finish line one after another.","Jing Zeyou took off his helmet and walked over. \"Yi Yi, your second brother wasn't exaggerating.\" Her driving was like a wild horse let loose.","Jing Yi thought Jing Zeyou meant she drove too fast. Her smile dimmed a bit as she was about to say something, but Jing Zeyou's lips curved upward as he reached out to pat her head, saying softly, \"You're really incredible.\"","Jing Yi smiled shyly, feeling a strange tingle in her nose.","Nearby, Wen Qingyan was also very surprised. He walked over to Jing Zejun with Wen Yin.","\"I didn't know Miss Jing Yi was so skilled at racing,\" Wen Yin said excitedly. \"I knew there was a reason she was so good at jet skiing. So she really knows how to race cars!\"","Wen Qingyan looked puzzled. \"...Is there necessarily a connection?\"","Wen Yin smiled brightly. \"Not really, I just think both are impressive.\"","Wen Qingyan: \"...\"","Jing Zejun watched the happy Jing Yi in the distance, his eyes filled with tenderness. \"If there's a chance, she can show you her racing skills. She really loves it and is very talented.\"","The livestream comments were still immersed in Jing Yi's impressive go-kart skills when a middle-aged man approached.","\"Hello, everyone.\"","Jing Yi looked at him curiously. The middle-aged man smiled and introduced himself, \"I'm the owner of this go-kart track.\"","Jing Zeyou greeted him and waited for what he had to say next. Sure enough, they heard him ask, \"I was wondering if this young lady would be interested in racing against me?\" The go-kart owner looked at Jing Yi.","Jing Yi had just effortlessly broken their track's third-place lap record, and she wasn't even a regular customer.","When you've been around go-karts for a long time, you naturally want to compete with skilled drivers. That's why he came over to ask.","Jing Zeqian frowned and stepped forward to block Jing Yi, but she held him back.","Jing Yi knew the owner meant no harm. In fact, many racing enthusiasts would want to compete with someone they admired. Her friends were just like that.","Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents as she smiled and said, \"Sure!\" This was like getting a freebie, right? She could race once more for free.","Seeing her agree, the owner's expression lit up with joy. This group didn't look like ordinary people, and he had thought he'd most likely be rejected.","\"Thank you so much! Just do your best, miss, and be careful. I might have a bit of an advantage on the track.\"","This wasn't the owner bragging. He drove the go-kart around the track almost every day and knew it like the back of his hand.","Jing Yi's smile exuded confidence and composure. She didn't seem concerned at all. \"It's fine. I have an advantage in weight, so I guess we're even.\"","[Exciting! This is like a battle between experts, right?!]","[Am I the only one who noticed that Jing Yi broke the third-place record on her first visit?!]","[Here we go! Time for some no-stakes betting, better late than never!]","[I bet on the owner. With equal skill, familiarity with the track is king!]","[I'm betting on Jing Yi!]","The race between Jing Yi and the go-kart owner began!","The netizens were right; the owner was clearly very familiar with the track. Almost every move he made was instinctive, requiring no thought at all.","For a long time, neither of them managed to pull ahead.","Jing Zeqian and the others stood by the railing, watching the race.","As spectators, their perspective was naturally different from the racers'. Watching the two competing cars, Wen Yin asked, \"Brother, who do you think will win?\"","Wen Qingyan hesitated. \"That owner does look very skilled. It might not be easy to beat him...\"","At this point, Jing Yi also felt the difference in racing against the owner. He was too familiar with the track, knowing every potential overtaking point. She couldn't find an opportunity to pass him at any of the turns.","Meanwhile, the owner in the other go-kart wasn't having an easy time either. He could always see Jing Yi in his peripheral vision. For a first-time visitor to this track, Jing Yi was indeed impressive.","It was already the last lap. Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel tightly, not giving up for a moment. The go-kart owner ahead showed no signs of letting up either.","But the livestream viewers all felt the outcome was already decided.","Suddenly!","At the final turn, the owner's go-kart tires experienced a slight side slip. Although he corrected his direction immediately, it still affected his speed."]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Wherever You Go, Sunshine Abounds","paragraphs":["Now!","The go-kart owner's mistake gave Jing Yi an instant opportunity.","Under her helmet, a flash of light passed through her previously calm eyes as she overtook him!","Jing Yi was the first to cross the finish line!","Jing Zejun widened his eyes in surprise and jumped up excitedly, \"Big brother! Second brother! Yi Yi won! Yi Yi won!\" Jing Zeyou's eyes were also full of joy and pride.","\"Brother! Sister Jing Yi won!\"","Wen Yin's face was flushed with excitement as he shook Wen Qingyan's arm.","On Wen Qingyan's other side, Jing Zeqian was equally excited, putting his arm around Wen Qingyan's shoulders and patting them forcefully, \"Qingyan, isn't my sister amazing?!\"","Wen Qingyan: ...","She is amazing, but could you guys let go of me before getting so excited?","On the track, Jing Yi's go-kart came to a stop. She took off her helmet, her dimples especially prominent as she smiled. She waved energetically at Jing Zejun and the others, her beautiful almond eyes shining with excitement!","Jing Zejun ran over with a smile, his expression elated as he gave Jing Yi a big hug.","\"Yi Yi, you're so awesome!\"","[Wasn't this supposed to be a professional-level race?]","[It got my blood pumping! Jing Yi Yi is so incredible!]","[So when Young Master Jing said Jing Yi was good at racing, he wasn't joking!]","[Unbelievable! Jing Yi Yi must have broken another record!]","At this moment, the owner also walked over. Though somewhat disappointed, he had to acknowledge Jing Yi's excellence. He smiled and extended his hand.","\"Congratulations, you're truly amazing!\"","Jing Yi's lips curved into a smile as she reached out to shake his hand. \"Just lucky.\"","The owner chuckled lightly. He didn't think it was luck at all. He had held an enormous advantage, and even with his mistake at the end, it was still within his skill level.","As for Jing Yi, leaving aside her familiarity with the track, that final overtake alone had already surpassed him. Such composure and calmness truly made her a talent suited for racing.","\"I wonder if you'd be willing to join my racing team. Our team is...\" The owner enthusiastically introduced his team, including the awards they'd won in various competitions, their sponsorships, and year-end bonuses.","\"What do you think?\"","Jing Zeqian stood with his arms folded, watching Jing Yi's awkward expression without any intention of coming to her rescue. If these things the go-kart owner was saying couldn't even attract him, how could they appeal to Jing Yi?","Jing Yi laughed awkwardly a few times. \"I'm sorry, sir, but I'm actually not very good at F1. Thank you for the offer.\"","The owner's pupils widened slightly in surprise and confusion, with a hint of disappointment. But since she had already refused, he didn't push further.","[Haha, the owner looks so disappointed!]","[She's so good that the team owner wanted to recruit her, can you believe it?]","[Although, the resources the owner is offering probably aren't up to par for the Jing family heiress.]","[At least Young Master Jing probably wouldn't be impressed. I heard he invested in his own racing track. In terms of resources, no one can probably offer more than him.]","Meanwhile, on social media, footage of Jing Yi's race appeared in the trending topics. As netizens discussed it enthusiastically, it added even more popularity to the reality show \"Dear Family.\"","After politely declining the owner's offer, Jing Yi and her group returned to their beachside camp.","Even until the evening, Jing Yi's smile hadn't faded, with netizens joking about her good mood.","After dinner, several of them lay down on the beach - to be precise, Jing Yi, Jing Zejun, and Wen Yin lay on the beach, while the other three sat in lounge chairs.","At night, moonlight bathed the earth. The coastal waters glowed with a blue phosphorescence, like scattered diamonds in the sea, creating a dreamlike scene.","In the distance, gentle waves lapped against the rocks, producing a melodious sound, as if the ocean was playing a tender melody for those in the night.","A few people were scattered here and there on the beach, with several wooden lounge chairs in the corner where Jing Zeyou and the other two were resting.","Next to the wooden chairs, a thin beach blanket was spread out, where Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were lying. Wen Yin was lying next to Wen Qingyan's chair.","Looking up, countless stars illuminated the entire night sky. They emitted a soft glow, twinkling like jewels.","The current tranquility and comfort made even the online viewers unconsciously start to enjoy the moment.","It was only because Jing Yi and the others had gotten a bit tired from playing earlier, otherwise they'd probably still be frolicking by the shore.","Jing Yi pointed at the star-filled sky, \"So the sky on a starry night is dark blue.\" It was like a dark blue velvet blanket.","Jing Zejun was also captivated by this scenery, lost in the beautiful view.","\"It's a good thing we didn't just stay at home.\" Jing Yi's eyes sparkled, her dimples showing as she smiled. \"Shouldn't we be making wishes now?\"","Jing Zeqian, who was leaning back in his chair with his eyes closed, heard Jing Yi's words and scoffed, \"What wish are you going to make to the stars? Will they grant it for you?\" They'd be better off using that time to make a wish to him or Jing Zeyou - that way it would be more likely to come true.","Jing Yi sat up and glared at Jing Zeqian. \"This is about romance!\"","[Always raining on other people's parades!]","Jing Zeqian shrugged. If that's what she thought, so be it.","Jing Yi turned to Jing Zeyou with a smile. \"Big brother, what do you want to wish for?\"","Actually, Jing Zeyou's thoughts were similar to Jing Zeqian's. To him, making wishes was impractical - in the time it took to make a wish, he could just make it happen himself.","But since his sister asked, he couldn't not answer. \"For my family to be healthy.\" This was the only wish that couldn't be 100% guaranteed with money or status.","Jing Yi then looked at Wen Qingyan beside him. Wen Qingyan hesitated for a moment before saying with a gentle smile, \"I hope that wherever the people I care about go, they'll be surrounded by sunshine.\"","[Mr. Wen is so smooth!]","Jing Yi secretly glanced at Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun felt his ears burn from Wen Qingyan's gaze. Seeing Jing Yi look over as well, he lightly tapped her shoulder, signaling her to restrain herself.","Jing Yi had to suppress her gossipy heart and asked, \"What about Xiao Yin?\"","Wen Yin smiled shyly. \"I hope that my beloved family and the person I like will all be healthy and well.\" Jing Yi's eyes lit up. \"So Xiao Yin already has someone he likes?\"","Wen Yin froze for a moment, then his face turned red, looking flustered. Jing Yi didn't tease him further and turned to Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun said softly, \"I hope I can become the person I want to be.\" Jing Yi immediately responded, \"Of course you can! You're Jing Zejun!\"","Jing Zejun smiled at Jing Yi, secretly making another wish: He also hoped that Yi Yi could grow freely and be as free as the wind.","\"Then I wish...\" Jing Yi closed her eyes, clasped her hands together, and entered wishing mode.","\"Jing Yi Yi, didn't you forget someone?!\"","Jing Zeqian had been waiting for her to ask him, but after going around the circle, she excitedly started preparing to make her own wish."]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Not as Good as the Sisters Next Door","paragraphs":["Jing Yi opened her eyes and turned her head to look at Jing Zeqian, asking puzzled, \"Didn't you think it was pointless?\"","\"That doesn't mean you shouldn't ask!\"","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zeqian helplessly, with an expression that said 'I'm the only one who indulges you'. \"Alright, alright, so what's your wish?\"","Jing Zeqian gritted his teeth and looked at Jing Yi with a fake smile. \"I wish Jing Yi would be a bit more obedient and stop talking back!\"","Jing Yi spread her hands innocently. \"Now you're being greedy. You already have one obedient sister, yet you're demanding another one to be obedient too. That kind of wish won't come true.\"","\"Hahahahaha\"","Wen Yin couldn't help but burst out laughing, and the others couldn't control their smiles either.","For a moment, the atmosphere was filled with joy.","Jing Zeqian: ...","[I declare Jing Yi the winner of this round!]","[Their atmosphere is so nice! The livestream next door with the Li Shaocheng sisters is almost depressingly gloomy!]","[Dear, it's not convenient to mention other livestreams here, it's easy to start arguments.]","[This is the meaning of travel variety shows, isn't it? So healing!]","\"Tell us your own wish!\"","Jing Yi silently glanced at Jing Zeqian, who was about to lose his temper out of embarrassment...","Jing Zeqian was truly on the verge of losing his temper!","Jing Yi quickly resumed her previous posture and said seriously, \"I hope the story can continue, and not just be a fleeting dream after waking up.\"","The eyes of Jing Zeyou and the other two showed some emotion, and they all looked at Jing Yi with tenderness.","After expressing her wish, Jing Yi didn't immediately open her eyes, but maintained her posture and silently made a wish.","[I hope Grandma is doing well in heaven, I hope Auntie and Uncle stay healthy, I hope Big Brother can get more rest, I hope Jing Zeqian can continue to be proud of his 'Startrack', I hope Junjun can fulfill her dream! It seems like a lot, so I'll make more wishes later!]","Jing Zeyou looked at Jing Yi with her eyes closed, his gaze radiating tenderness.","Jing Zeqian's slender eyes were filled with affection. Jing Yi, your wishes are really quite numerous.","Jing Zejun suddenly leaned against Jing Yi, closing her eyes to hide her slightly reddened eyelids.","This moment of warmth made even the netizens unconsciously captivated.","...","\"Orange, we'll be going now. See you at the next recording!\" The staff packed up their filming equipment and said goodbye to Li Shaocheng.","Seeing her sister standing behind her, they also wanted to say goodbye, but after some thought, decided against it.","After everyone had left the apartment, the assistant next to the staff member asked, \"Brother, is it okay not to say goodbye to Li Shaocheng's sister?\" What he really wanted to ask was, wouldn't it be impolite?","The staff member sighed, \"I wanted to say goodbye too, but didn't you notice that her condition has been getting worse?\"","The assistant finally realized that it was indeed the case, and recently she had become even more unpredictable in her moods.","\"You just stay in the living room, but I have to follow and film upstairs. Whenever we give her sister a bit more screen time, her face darkens.\"","Several times he didn't know whether to move the camera or not, so he simply fixed it in the living room.","The assistant's expression became complicated, \"Aren't they sisters? How come they're not even as...\"","\"Shh! How dare you say that!\"","The staff member looked around nervously. The entertainment industry most fears comparisons of the same type, especially since Li Shaocheng was particularly sensitive about the sisters from the Jing family.","The assistant quickly shut his mouth, momentarily forgetting his professional role.","\"Let's just endure it a bit longer. The next recording will be the last episode, and then we'll join the main group.\"","The assistant breathed a sigh of relief. The days at Li Shaocheng's house were indeed not easy.","Perhaps the audience sees Li Shaocheng's smiling face, but these staff members more often feel the oppressive atmosphere in her home.","In places the camera doesn't capture.","\"Brother, I heard the treatment in the livestream next door is super good!\" The assistant's voice was full of envy.","He could see his colleagues' social media posts - afternoon tea, three meals a day provided, even accommodations arranged by the production team for travel!","The staff member sighed. How could he not be envious? Every time he saw Director Xu's social media, he was incredibly jealous. He strongly suspected that Director Xu had anticipated the Jing family's generosity and chose to follow them!","\"Not only is the treatment good, but the atmosphere is great, and they have high popularity!\" They've been on hot searches several times, while their side is becoming increasingly bleak.","Fortunately, they'll be joining up for the next recording.","Meanwhile, after Li Shaocheng smiled and saw off the production team, she closed the door and her face immediately darkened.","Her sister stood still, breathing lightly. Recently, Li Shaocheng's state had been increasingly off, even making her apprehensive, while also strengthening her resolve.","Li Shaocheng sat silently on the sofa, lost in thought.","\"Sister\"","Li Shaocheng's sister's heart skipped a beat, her heart starting to race. She tried to respond calmly, \"What is it?\"","Li Shaocheng's gaze was fixed straight ahead, not focusing on anything in particular. Her tone was distant, \"Tell me, am I really inferior to those sisters next door?\"","Her sister's nails dug into her palms in her pocket.","Again, this question. She had heard it countless times lately.","The sister licked her dry lips, \"Chengcheng, you don't need to compare yourself to anyone, you are just...\" Li Shaocheng's cold eyes immediately turned to her, \"You also think I'm not as good as them, don't you?\"","The sister took a step back, frightened by her gaze.","Finding courage from somewhere, she looked up at Li Shaocheng, \"No, I just think why do you always have to compare yourself to others, especially people you've never even met.\"","Li Shaocheng was the youngest daughter in the family, deeply loved by her parents since childhood. You could say they gave her the moon and the stars.","She had always been competitive, and with her parents' doting, she couldn't stand anyone surpassing her.","Li Shaocheng was excellent, excellent to the point of often ranking first in her grade during school;","Excellent to the point that because her sister got into a top university for a science and engineering major, she changed her major in her senior year of high school and worked herself to the bone to get into the same school;","Excellent to the point of practicing dance day and night to become the center position.","However, this kind of excellence made Li Shaocheng's sister very afraid, afraid to the point of wanting to escape this family, to escape Li Shaocheng.","When she was young, she had rebelled. She asked her mother why she always had to give in to her sister, always had to be second to her sister?","Her mother said, \"Chengcheng is still young, we need to give her confidence and a sense of achievement.\"","But why did Li Shaocheng's confidence and sense of achievement have to come at her expense? What about her own life?","Li Shaocheng laughed coldly, \"Never met? We've met and they've already surpassed me, shouldn't I care about that?!\"","Those trending topics, those comments, those comparisons, they were all humiliating to her!","Her sister's eyes were filled with bitterness, \"Li Shaocheng, your life shouldn't be measured against others...\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: A Sports Car Gift","paragraphs":["\"So you're telling me to give up? To admit that I'm just not as good as others?!\" Li Shaocheng's ominous voice echoed through the room.","By now, her sister no longer felt fear, only overwhelming exhaustion. \"Should we ask Mom and Dad to come for the next recording?\" she thought. Perhaps their parents could persuade Li Shaocheng not to be so obsessive.","But Li Shaocheng was not receptive to the idea. \"You've already recorded so many episodes, and now you want to bring Mom and Dad in at the end? Do you think the online comments about me aren't bad enough already?\"","Her sister lowered her gaze and said softly, \"Alright, I'll stay with you to finish the recording.\" She also hoped that in the end, Li Shaocheng would let her go...","Meanwhile, Jing Yi and her three companions, who had finished their recording, had just brought Jing Beicheng and his wife home.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were chatting with Lin Ruiqing, while Jing Zeyou was in the study reporting on work matters to Jing Beicheng. Jing Zeqian had left early for Startrack to prepare for Jiang Miaomiao's celebration party.","\"It's a cave system with splashing waterfalls, filled with stalactites and stalagmites. When you enter the cave, there are rock formations like waterfalls, and you can see the actual waterfall from a different perspective...\"","Lin Ruiqing was telling the two girls about the wonders she had seen recently. Because both young women were so attentive, Lin Ruiqing spoke with great enthusiasm.","Soon after, Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou came downstairs. \"Ruiqing, the people from the car show have arrived at the gate,\" Jing Beicheng said.","Jing Yi looked up, confused.","[Did they buy a car while on their trip?]","Lin Ruiqing smiled and took the hands of the two girls beside her. \"The welcome gift for Yi has arrived. Let's go out and take a look together.\"","Jing Yi was even more surprised. \"Welcome gift?\"","[Haven't we known each other for several months already?]","As they walked, Lin Ruiqing explained, \"When you first came to our home, we didn't have time to prepare a welcome gift for you. Now it's time to make up for that. As for Jun, she received hers when she first came to the Jing family.\"","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zejun in bewilderment, and she nodded with a smile.","Still confused, Jing Yi was led by Lin Ruiqing to the courtyard. A truck had already parked in the open space outside, slowly opening its cargo hold.","Inside was a black and red sports car, absolutely stunning. Jing Yi was even more perplexed.","Lin Ruiqing nodded with satisfaction at the cargo hold. She had specifically asked the car dealership to decorate it like a gift presentation, and they had done an excellent job.","\"Your uncle and I bought this at a car show abroad. We know you like racing, but we don't know much about race cars ourselves. We remembered how much you liked Zeyou's sports car, so your uncle specifically asked a friend for advice before choosing this one. What was it called again, Beicheng?\"","Lin Ruiqing had forgotten the car's name and turned to Jing Beicheng for help. He calmly replied, \"It's the 'Ghost' by Koenigsegg, a KR series hybrid supercar. The maximum power output is...\"","While Jing Beicheng was detailing the car's specifications, Jing Yi's eyes were becoming increasingly red.","Jing Beicheng, who was in the middle of explaining the car's performance, noticed Jing Yi's unusual reaction and looked slightly panicked.","Lin Ruiqing glanced over, her expression turning anxious. \"Yi, don't you like it?\" Jing Yi shook her head quickly, her eyes brimming with tears, not wanting the couple to misunderstand.","[I just never imagined that one day I would receive a sports car as a gift...]","Jing Yi sniffled, her voice a bit muffled, \"Auntie, Uncle, I love this gift very much.\" Lin Ruiqing wiped away the tears that had fallen on Jing Yi's cheeks, feeling a bit heartbroken. \"Then why are you crying?\"","Jing Yi looked at the cargo hold, still lit up and decorated with many ribbons, very exquisite.","\"Auntie, don't you think racing is a dangerous hobby?\" Lin Ruiqing thought for a moment before replying, \"It is quite dangerous.\"","Before Jing Yi's eyes could dim, Lin Ruiqing continued, \"But since you like it, you should know how to protect yourself.\" Her eyes were as warm as the winter sun as she said softly, \"Concern and support are not mutually exclusive.\"","Jing Yi's tears fell even harder as she hugged Lin Ruiqing, crying quietly on her shoulder.","[I never thought there would be a day when someone would think I deserve to have this hobby.]","Beside them, Jing Zejun felt a lump in her throat and blinked hard to hold back her own tears.","Lin Ruiqing gently patted Jing Yi's back, a bittersweet feeling welling up inside her. \"Your uncle and I hope we can be your support in anything you do.\"","[Waaah waaah waaah]","Jing Beicheng didn't know whether to laugh or cry. Now he not only had to listen to Jing Yi's audible crying but also her inner crying.","Still, as long as she liked it, that was what mattered.","\"I was originally planning to give you 'Night' as well...\" Upon hearing 'Night', Jing Yi stopped sniffling and looked at Jing Zeyou with teary eyes. \"'Night'?!\"","His lips curved into a gentle smile, his gaze soft. \"You're the only one driving it anyway, so I was planning to just give it to you...\"","Jing Yi became a bit anxious. \"Why do you say 'was planning'?\"","Jing Zeyou nodded towards the new car, continuing to tease Jing Yi. \"Don't you already have a new sports car now?\"","\"But that's from Auntie and Uncle...\" Jing Yi's voice grew quieter, feeling a bit greedy herself, but this was 'Night' they were talking about!","Lin Ruiqing laughed and glared playfully at Jing Zeyou. \"Your big brother is just joking with you. If he said he'd give it to you, then it's yours.\" Since when did he start teasing Jing Yi like Jing Zeqian?","Jing Yi's eyes sparkled, still rimmed with red, filled with surprise as she waited for Jing Zeyou's response.","Finally, he nodded.","Jing Yi rushed over and gave Jing Zeyou a big hug. \"Thank you, Big Brother!\" Jing Zeyou laughed and patted her back lightly. \"Crying and laughing like that, you're still such a child.\"","Jing Yi smiled sheepishly and then clung to Lin Ruiqing's side again.","Lin Ruiqing patted her hand. \"Go take a closer look at your gift.\"","Jing Yi nodded happily and ran over, pulling Jing Zejun along with her.","Now Jing Yi began to carefully admire the distinctive sports car.","Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing had specifically chosen the red and black paint scheme.","The car's front face featured a square design, complemented by sharp, slender headlights. The scissor doors on both sides of the body were embedded like the portholes of a battleship.","With its delicate rear wing and low-slung body, the entire car's silhouette was as sleek and sharp as a warship.","Jing Zejun was also admiring the sports car. Although she wasn't particularly interested in sports cars, she still found this one beautiful.","\"Jun, I'll take you for a ride tomorrow!\" Jing Yi's eyes sparkled as she looked at Jing Zejun, then quickly returned her gaze to the sports car.","Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"Alright.\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled at the two girls. \"Beicheng, it looks like we made the right choice.\" Jing Beicheng's gaze softened. How could they not have made the right choice?","After the car show, they weren't satisfied with any of the exhibited models. So Jing Beicheng contacted some people, and finally managed to buy this car through a friend of a friend."]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: What is Jiang Miaomiao up to","paragraphs":["In the Jing family living room, Jing Zeqian sat on the sofa with his arms crossed, his face clearly expressing \"I'm very unhappy,\" while Jing Yi sat beside him, beaming with an especially bright smile.","Jing Zejun sat to the side, not participating in their war, quietly watching the show unfold.","The so-called \"show\" was Jing Yi's provocation of Jing Zeqian, stemming from the gifts sent by Lin Ruiqing and her husband.","Jing Zeqian glanced at Jing Yi with a sullen look, saying sarcastically, \"First 'Ghost,' then 'Night' - your cars really aren't very cheerful, are they?\"","Jing Yi didn't care, smiling even more brightly, \"That's what makes them cool!\"","Jing Zeqian snorted disdainfully and looked away. He wasn't jealous! Not at all! So what if his parents bought Jing Yi a sports car, and his older brother gave her the world's only one-of-a-kind sports car.","He wasn't jealous!","Seeing that her goal had been achieved, Jing Yi left the area of conflict, satisfied.","\"The celebration banquet is in a couple of days, don't forget,\" Jing Zeqian reminded, almost forgetting the main point in his irritation.","Jing Yi's smile faded a bit, her heart not quite as happy anymore.","Jing Zeqian didn't care whether Jing Yi liked Jiang Miaomiao or not, since they didn't move in the same circles anyway. But what puzzled him was, if she didn't like her, why go to her celebration banquet?","Jing Zeqian was very confused, \"You clearly don't want to go, so why insist on tagging along?\" Jing Yi gave him a helpless look, \"I'm afraid you'll be tricked.\"","She looked at Jing Zeqian seriously, \"Second brother, if I asked you not to go to that celebration banquet...\" Jing Zeqian smiled carelessly, \"What are you talking about? The schedule's already set. It's just a celebration banquet.\"","[That's right, it's just a celebration banquet, yet you insist on going.]","Jing Zeqian was silent for a moment, \"Why don't you not go?\" Jing Yi glared at him, \"No way! I'm definitely going!\"","[Stupid second brother!]","Jing Zeqian frowned, wondering what nonsense she was spouting. How could he be tricked in his own company?","Jing Yi sighed with an exaggerated air of wisdom, looking like a sage beyond her years, which made Jing Zejun laugh. Jing Zeqian rolled his eyes at her.","\"Then come with me when it's time,\" Jing Zeqian said before heading upstairs. Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi and asked, \"Yi Yi, you seem very concerned about Jiang Miaomiao holding this celebration banquet?\"","Her feeling was different from Jing Zeqian's. Jing Zeqian thought it was Jing Yi's hostility towards Jiang Miaomiao, but Jing Zejun felt that Jing Yi was concerned about Jiang Miaomiao's actions, especially those related to Jing Zeqian.","Jing Yi looked upstairs, her eyes complex, \"I just feel that Jiang Miaomiao holding this celebration banquet is very strange. I asked second brother about it, and it's just for an ordinary award. Isn't this a case of having ulterior motives?\"","Jing Zejun frowned slightly. She also knew about this celebration banquet. The Golden Lotus Award wasn't really a big deal, especially for someone like Jiang Miaomiao.","\"Could it be that she just wants to get closer to second brother?\"","She had heard from Wen Qingyan that Jiang Miaomiao was good at presenting herself as being close to Jing Zeqian in public, which was indeed the case.","Jing Yi shook her head, \"Maybe, but I feel it's nothing good, especially when you look at him.\" She nodded towards the direction Jing Zeqian had left. \"He just listens to whatever she says, like an idiot. How can we not worry?\"","Jing Zejun smiled a little. Though she didn't say it out loud, she agreed with Jing Yi's words in her heart.","The entertainment industry was a mixed bag to begin with, and Jiang Miaomiao's character was worth scrutinizing, but second brother seemed to view her through rose-tinted glasses.","Jing Yi snorted coldly, \"His rose-tinted glasses are exceptionally thick!\"","[This stupid second brother won't believe it unless we catch her red-handed!]","Jing Zejun found it somewhat amusing. They didn't even know if there was really a plot, yet they were already preparing to catch someone in the act?","\"So what do you plan to do?\" Surely she wasn't planning to just take her along and crash the party single-handedly?","Jing Yi lowered her head in thought for a moment, her finger on her chin, \"I haven't figured it out yet...\" Jing Zejun was a bit exasperated. Then why put on such a mysterious expression?","Jing Yi shrugged helplessly, \"We'll only know what she's up to once we're there. We'll take it step by step.\"","That was all they could do for now, but how did they suddenly start planning to 'catch someone in the act'? Weren't they just going to attend a celebration banquet?","At Wen Qingyan's apartment","The manager leaned back on the sofa, looking at the person in front of him changing suit after suit with a lifeless expression.","He was already overwhelmed with Wen Qingyan's recent 'big moves,' and now he was forced to act as a wardrobe stylist.","\"Great movie star, don't you have a dedicated wardrobe stylist?\"","Wen Qingyan was still looking at himself in the mirror, turning left and right with a slight frown, feeling it still wasn't quite right.","\"Aren't they off work?\"","The manager pointed at himself with a trembling finger, \"Don't I get to go off work?\"","\"You can sleep here anyway, what are you afraid of?\"","The manager collapsed back onto the sofa, continuing to look lifeless.","He knew it. Ever since Wen Qingyan's sudden change of words during the livestream hit the trending topics, he hadn't had a good day.","This person had changed too quickly! He expressed his disdain... silently in his heart.","The manager turned his head to look at Wen Qingyan, who was still selecting clothes, \"Aren't you afraid of an awkward encounter with Jiang Miaomiao?\" After all, it was her event, and he wouldn't have much say there.","\"I'm going to attend a banquet, not walking into a trap. Besides, I'm not going for Jiang Miaomiao.\"","\"I know that...\" Seeing that Wen Qingyan had walked away, the manager got up and followed, \"I know you're going for Jing Zejun.\" By now, everyone probably knew who Wen Qingyan was going for.","\"I'm just a bit worried.\"","Wen Qingyan gave him a strange look, \"What are you worried about? I'm not the main character, nor am I the focus of her invitation. What do you have to worry about?\"","Wen Qingyan walked to another side, and the manager quickly followed, \"Didn't you also say this celebration banquet was a bit strange?\"","\"I did say that, but didn't you fail to find anything?\"","\"I did find something!\" Wen Qingyan stopped in his tracks, looking at the manager in surprise, \"There really is something fishy?\"","The manager deflated a bit, \"It's not fishy, it's an acquaintance. He's an entertainment reporter. He said Jiang Miaomiao invited several media outlets.\"","Wen Qingyan glanced at him, \"What's strange about that?\"","Celebrities inviting reporters to attend events was a perfectly normal thing.","The manager agreed with this point, but his instinct told him it wasn't that simple. Just the attitude of Jiang Miaomiao's manager was strange enough.","\"What's not normal is, it's just a banquet, why require others to keep it confidential?\" If he wasn't really friends with that reporter, he probably wouldn't have heard this news.","Confidential?","Wen Qingyan frowned slightly. What exactly was Jiang Miaomiao up to?"]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Jing Yi VS Jiang Miaomiao","paragraphs":["Jiang Miaomiao clutched something tightly in her hand, her eyes betraying nervousness and panic. Standing opposite her was the same man from before.","He adjusted his glasses, a fleeting shadow passing through his eyes behind the lenses, but his movements remained gentle.","His slender hand caressed Jiang Miaomiao's face as he said softly, \"Miaomiao, once tomorrow's banquet is over, you can leave Startrack for good. Then I can take you to meet my father.\"","The man placed his other hand on Jiang Miaomiao's lower abdomen and looked up at her. \"And our child.\" This seemed to remind Jiang Miaomiao of something.","She bit her lower lip, determination shining in her eyes as she murmured, \"Bo Qi, you will take me away, won't you?\"","The man continued to gaze at her tenderly. \"Of course. I'll not only take you away, but also our baby. You'll be the lady of the Wang Family from now on.\"","Jiang Miaomiao leaned quietly against the man's chest, gently closing her eyes. She wasn't after becoming the lady of any family; she simply loved this man deeply, truly loved him.","The man stroked her head gently, as if to comfort her, but an indecipherable emotion lurked in the depths of his eyes.","Jiang Miaomiao's celebration banquet was held as planned. Jing Zeqian arrived at the event with Jing Yi and Jing Zejun.","By then, the banquet hall was already a lively scene, mostly filled with Startrack's artists and staff, with a few fellow artists Jiang Miaomiao was close to.","Seeing Jing Zeqian enter, Jiang Miaomiao walked over with a glass of wine, smiling. \"Zeqian, you're here!\"","Jing Yi observed the woman before her discreetly. Their eyes met, and Jing Yi detected a hint of dislike in her gaze.","But it didn't matter; she didn't like Jiang Miaomiao either. Jing Yi greeted her with a sweet smile, \"Sister Miaomiao, long time no see!\"","Jiang Miaomiao also put on a perfect smile, \"Yes, Yiyi, it's been a while. Thank you for coming to my banquet.\"","Jing Yi's smile grew even more innocent, \"Of course! It's a joyous occasion, after all. You won an award, right? How amazing, Sister Miaomiao! It was the Golden Lotus Award, wasn't it?\"","A flash of displeasure crossed Jiang Miaomiao's eyes. She knew, of course, that holding a celebration for such an insignificant award was absurd, but time had been short, and she had no choice but to have her manager organize this banquet.","Jing Yi's words made Jiang Miaomiao uncomfortable. She smiled at Jing Yi, \"For an actor, it is indeed an insignificant award, isn't it, Zejun?\"","Mocking her? Didn't she realize that Jing Zejun was still a nobody in the industry? If it weren't for \"The Emperor's Reign,\" could she even make a comeback?","\"Miaomiao!\" Jing Zeqian, hearing these words, felt uneasy and gave Jiang Miaomiao a warning look.","She didn't seem to realize her words were hurtful until she saw Jing Zeqian's expression. Looking slightly panicked, she covered her mouth and apologized to Jing Zejun, \"Zejun, I just said that without thinking. Please don't take offense!\"","Jing Zejun smiled gently, \"It's alright, Sister Miaomiao. I didn't mind.\" The entertainment industry had always been like this – those with enough achievements could look down on you from the top of the mountain.","In fact, every industry was like this, but it was particularly evident in showbiz.","Although Jing Zeqian was displeased, he didn't want Jiang Miaomiao to lose face at her own banquet, so he didn't pursue the matter further.","Jing Zejun might not have wanted to make an issue of it, but Jing Yi wasn't so kind-hearted. She let out a light chuckle, her eyes curving into crescents as she looked at Jiang Miaomiao.","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow, a sense of foreboding rising in his heart.","Jing Yi's expression grew increasingly innocent, but a cold glint flashed in her eyes.","\"That's right, Junjun is only in her early twenties, so of course she hasn't achieved much yet. She's still young. I heard Sister Miaomiao won Best Actress at 25, right?\"","Before Jiang Miaomiao could feel proud, Jing Yi quickly added, \"That's amazing! Sister Miaomiao, you must tell me your skincare secrets someday. It's been ten years, and you don't have a single wrinkle. Incredible!\"","She emphasized the last four words particularly clearly.","Jing Zeqian silently took half a step back. Jing Yi was going all out now, though surely it hadn't been ten years...","Jiang Miaomiao stared intently at Jing Yi, her smile almost impossible to maintain. Jing Yi certainly knew how to hit Jiang Miaomiao's sore spots accurately.","Jing Yi continued to smile sweetly, \"Junjun is just too young still, but I think she has a bright future ahead. What do you think, Sister Miaomiao?\"","Jiang Miaomiao forced a smile, \"Of course.\"","Seeing Jiang Miaomiao's deteriorating expression, Jing Zeqian coughed lightly, hoping to make Jing Yi tone it down.","Pretending not to hear, Jing Yi continued, \"By the way, what was the name of that film Sister Miaomiao won the award for? I think it was 'Old Friend,' right? I heard that Second Brother specially found that script for you, Sister Miaomiao, and even took care of the production team and promotional planning. You must be very grateful to him, right?\"","Jiang Miaomiao's eyes suddenly showed a hint of panic. For a moment, she even thought Jing Yi knew about her plan...","That's impossible! Only the two of them knew about this matter. Even her manager didn't know the specifics!","\"...Yes, without Zeqian, there would be no Jiang Miaomiao today. Of course, I'm very grateful to him.\"","Jiang Miaomiao smiled at Jing Zeqian, while Jing Yi's gaze held a meaningful look.","Fearing that if this continued, it might really disrupt the banquet, Jing Zeqian said, \"Miaomiao, why don't you go attend to the other guests?\"","Jiang Miaomiao nodded with a smile, but before leaving, she glanced at Jing Yi once more. That face she hated so much!","Jing Zeqian sighed and leaned close to Jing Yi, \"That's enough. Did you really come to cause trouble?\"","Jing Yi glanced at him, \"A few words are enough to cause trouble? You're underestimating her.\" Her gaze followed the direction Jiang Miaomiao had left.","Jing Zeqian tapped her lightly, \"She's gone, why are you still looking?\" Jing Yi glared at him. She was trying to eliminate potential threats for him, and all he did was interfere!","\"I'm going over there for a bit. You two look around on your own.\"","\"Don't drink anything carelessly!\"","Jing Zeqian gave her a helpless look, \"I know.\" It was clear he wasn't taking her warning seriously.","Jing Yi watched Jing Zeqian's retreating figure, concern still evident in her eyes. She didn't know when Jiang Miaomiao planned to make her move. That substance would be invisible in liquid!","\"Zejun.\"","Wen Qingyan had come over.","\"Brother Qingyan.\"","Jing Zejun greeted him with a smile.","Jing Yi turned her gaze back, \"Mr. Wen.\"","Wen Qingyan looked around, not seeing Jing Zeqian. \"Is Mr. Jing here?\"","Jing Zejun glanced in the direction Jing Zeqian had left, \"He went over to Sister Miaomiao's side.\"","Wen Qingyan looked that way too, an indecipherable emotion flashing in his eyes. He had wanted to speak with Jing Zeqian first.","Jing Zejun noticed his expression and asked curiously, \"Brother Qingyan, did you need to talk to my second brother about something?\"","Wen Qingyan hesitated slightly. Jing Yi, also curious, said, \"Should I go get my second brother?\" Talking business with Wen Qingyan was certainly better than letting him stay with Jiang Miaomiao."]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: You Drank","paragraphs":["Wen Qingyan declined Jing Yi's suggestion, \"No need, it's not a big deal.\" After all, he was only speculating without evidence, and it wouldn't be good to rashly bring it up to Jing Zeqian.","Wen Qingyan turned to Jing Zejun, \"I just wanted to remind Mr. Jing that some media reporters were invited to the banquet.\"","Jing Zejun was a bit surprised, \"Media was invited to this banquet?\" Jing Yi looked around, seeing the banquet hall filled with people coming and going, all appearing to be guests.","Wen Qingyan's expression was serious, \"They weren't invited, Jiang Miaomiao called them privately.\"","Jing Zejun immediately understood Wen Qingyan's meaning and exchanged a glance with Jing Yi.","It seemed this banquet indeed had some issues.","\"I just wanted Mr. Jing to be more cautious.\" It's always good to have some precautions, as Jing Zeqian trusted Jiang Miaomiao too much.","Jing Yi sighed, \"What's the use of a warning? He'll find a way to explain it away.\" Even if Jing Zeqian couldn't explain it, Jiang Miaomiao would. Without evidence, it was all useless.","Jing Yi's eyes flickered, feeling too passive staying here, \"Jun Jun, you chat with Mr. Wen for a while, I'll go check on Second Brother.\"","Jing Zejun's brows furrowed slightly, but she could only agree for now.","After Jing Yi left, the concern in Jing Zejun's eyes hadn't dissipated. She always felt that Jing Yi was hiding something from her, thoughts she couldn't hear.","Wen Qingyan comforted her: \"If you're worried, we can go over and check in a bit. The banquet hall is crowded, so at least Jiang Miaomiao won't dare do anything openly.\" Jing Zejun nodded slightly, only able to comfort herself this way.","On the other side, Jing Zeqian was chatting with Jiang Miaomiao. Noticing her somewhat pale complexion, he advised, \"If you're not feeling well, don't drink anymore.\"","Jiang Miaomiao's smile seemed a bit forced as she tugged at the corners of her mouth, \"The first time we met, you said something similar to me...\" She seemed to be lost in memories.","Jing Zeqian smiled, \"I didn't expect you to remember that. I thought you were too drunk at the time.\"","Jing Zeqian and Jiang Miaomiao's first meeting was at a drinking party. Jiang Miaomiao was only twenty then, drinking with investors for a role, and ended up in the hospital. Jing Zeqian was the one who took her there.","\"If you can't drink, don't. Why keep forcing yourself?\" Jing Zeqian looked at the barely conscious Jiang Miaomiao on the hospital bed, somewhat disgusted.","Disgusted with those investors who treated people poorly just because they had some money, and disgusted with the stubborn person on the bed.","Jiang Miaomiao mumbled hazily, \"I can drink. That role... I must get it!\"","Later, Jing Zeqian started an entertainment company, and his first artist was Jiang Miaomiao.","Jiang Miaomiao quickly pulled herself out of the memory, \"Zeqian, I have something I want to tell you. Can you come with me for a moment?\" She was afraid if she thought about it any longer, she'd become more hesitant.","Jing Zeqian didn't think much of it and nodded, following Jiang Miaomiao to the side.","Jiang Miaomiao walked to the bar first, took a glass of wine, and made some subtle movements with her hand. Jing Zeqian followed her in, not noticing Jiang Miaomiao's actions.","Jiang Miaomiao turned around, smiling as she handed the glass to Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian took it naturally, looking at the glass in Jiang Miaomiao's hand and said, \"You shouldn't drink anymore. The main guest getting drunk would be big news.\"","Jiang Miaomiao forced a smile, her hand tightening slightly on the glass she had passed over.","\"I haven't had much. It's rare for everyone to gather, we should be happy! Come on, cheers!\"","Jing Zeqian didn't insist, raising the glass to his lips.","Jiang Miaomiao stared intently at the glass, her whole body tense, as if something was pounding her heart, beating wildly again and again!","\"Second Brother!\"","Jing Yi's voice interrupted Jing Zeqian. Jiang Miaomiao watched as the glass was lowered, and it felt as if her heart stopped at that moment...","Jing Zeqian turned his head to look at Jing Yi, who had hurried over, still breathing rapidly, her hair ornament askew.","Jing Zeqian casually put the glass down on the bar and reached out to adjust Jing Yi's hair ornament, his tone disapproving, \"Why are you in such a rush? You're wearing a formal dress, can't you act more like a young lady?\"","Jing Yi didn't have time to talk to him. She was looking at that glass of wine, and at Jiang Miaomiao who was also staring at it.","\"You drank?!\" Jing Yi's voice was very anxious.","Jing Zeqian was a bit confused, \"Not yet. What's wrong?\" Hearing his words, Jing Yi let out a heavy sigh of relief. Afraid Jiang Miaomiao would notice something unusual, she quickly explained, \"No, it's just that you still have to drive later!\"","Jing Zeqian was even more confused. If he remembered correctly, shouldn't there be a driver in the car?","Jiang Miaomiao looked at Jing Yi who had barged in. She knew the best opportunity had been interrupted. She was unwilling, but with one more person, there was one more chance of exposure. No matter how unwilling, she could only wait for another chance.","Jiang Miaomiao put on a smile again, discreetly taking back the glass Jing Zeqian had put down.","\"Yi Yi, did you come to find your second brother?\" Jing Yi silently watched her actions, stepping forward to stand in front of her, \"No, I came to chat with Sister Miaomiao.\"","Jiang Miaomiao looked a bit surprised, \"Me?\" Jing Yi kept an eye on that glass of wine in her peripheral vision and smiled, \"Yes, the wine over there doesn't taste good. I came to ask Sister Miaomiao for a glass to drink.\"","Jing Yi's gaze slowly focused on Jiang Miaomiao's hand. She looked up, \"How about the one in Sister Miaomiao's hand?\"","A flash of malice quickly rose in Jiang Miaomiao's eyes. She had considered giving it to Jing Yi to drink. Towards Jing Zeqian, Jiang Miaomiao might still have some reluctance, but towards Jing Yi, she had none at all.","However, the person in front of her was too unpredictable.","Jiang Miaomiao couldn't guarantee that after handing the glass to Jing Yi, some unexpected situation wouldn't occur.","She didn't want to take that risk.","Jiang Miaomiao's smile became a bit stiff, and she discreetly moved the glass away from Jing Yi, \"I've already drunk from this glass. I'll pour you another one, there's plenty of wine.\" She prepared to leave Jing Yi's side with the glass.","Suddenly, Jing Yi seemed to lose her balance and bumped into her. The wine spilled on both of them.","\"Ah!\"","Jing Yi looked very flustered, taking tissues to wipe the wine stains on Jiang Miaomiao. Feeling it wasn't clean enough, she then used the thin gauze of her skirt to wipe.","All the while, she kept apologizing: \"I'm sorry! I'm sorry! Sister Miaomiao, I didn't mean to!\"","Due to the emotional rollercoaster, Jiang Miaomiao could no longer maintain her facade of calmness. She pushed Jing Yi away, \"Stop wiping!\"","Jing Zeqian quickly came over, seeing both of them covered in wine stains, \"How can you be so careless?!\" He looked at Jiang Miaomiao, his eyes filled with apology, \"Miaomiao, she didn't mean it. I apologize on her behalf.\"","Jiang Miaomiao still held the empty glass, anger flashing in her eyes, forcing a smile, \"It's fine.\" What kind of apology was this? The person was right here, why apologize for her?!","The formal dress was already ruined. \"Yi Yi, let me take you to change clothes?\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: If I Can't Find Out, I'll Go Kowtow and Apologize","paragraphs":["Upon hearing Jiang Miaomiao's words, Jing Yi immediately declined, \"It's alright, Sister Miaomiao. You go change first. You still have guests to entertain.\"","Jiang Miaomiao's expression was gentle, but her smile didn't reach her eyes. \"Then I'll go change clothes first.\" As she turned away, she was still tightly gripping her wine glass, her face darkening.","After Jiang Miaomiao had walked away, Jing Zeqian frowned deeply, seeing Jing Yi still dabbing at the water stains on her shoulder and arm with tissue paper.","\"Jing Yi, didn't you say you weren't here to cause trouble? If you don't like Jiang Miaomiao, you didn't have to come. No one forced you! Why are you making a scene at someone else's party?!\"","Jing Yi was already nervous, and now being scolded by Jing Zeqian made her mood even worse. \"If I wasn't worried about you falling for someone's trap like an idiot, do you think I wanted to come?!\"","Stung by Jing Yi's words, Jing Zeqian raised his voice, \"Can you stop suspecting people all the time? Even if Jiang Miaomiao's personality isn't great, she's been my friend for nearly ten years. Can't you try to see things from my perspective?!\"","\"Do you think I'd be arguing with you here if I didn't have proof?!\"","What was she supposed to say?! That she could predict the future and knew Jiang Miaomiao's plans? Or that she had read a book and knew the ending?!","And who could she tell?! Who would believe her and not think she was crazy?!","\"How can you suspect someone without evidence? Aren't you being too full of yourself?!\"","Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan hadn't even entered the room yet when they heard the two arguing inside. It sounded different from their usual bickering, so Jing Zejun quickly hurried over.","\"What's going on? Why are you fighting?\"","Only when Jing Zejun entered did he see the large wet patch on Jing Yi's clothes. Her face was flushed red, and her usually lively almond eyes were tinged with anger. Anyone could see she was about to explode with rage.","\"Yi Yi, why are your clothes wet?\"","Jing Zeqian impatiently said, \"Don't mind her. She did this to herself.\"","Jing Yi gently pushed Jing Zejun aside and looked at Jing Zeqian, her fists clenched tightly as she restrained the urge to punch him.","\"She handed you the wine and you were about to drink it without a second thought. Don't you know you should never touch any drink that's been out of your sight?\"","\"I'll say it again, I've known Jiang Miaomiao for almost ten years. Even if you wanted to harm...\"","\"Second Brother!\" Jing Zejun anxiously interrupted Jing Zeqian's words.","He had never treated Jing Yi so poorly before, not even when they first met.","As soon as the words left his mouth, Jing Zeqian regretted them. He pressed his lips together, his expression somewhat unnatural.","But Jing Yi had already understood what he meant to say. Her eyes quickly turned cold as she silently looked at Jing Zeqian.","She lowered her head and gave a small laugh, her tone calm, \"Jing Zeqian, if I can't present evidence to you by the end of today, I'll go kowtow and apologize to your friend of ten years!\"","Jing Zeqian was stunned, not expecting Jing Yi to make such a serious promise. He opened his mouth, wanting to say something.","\"Jun Jun, let's go.\" Jing Yi had already walked past him, her face expressionless.","Jing Zejun glanced at Jing Zeqian and, without hesitation, followed Jing Yi. Seeing this, Wen Qingyan also followed.","Jing Zejun quickly caught up with Jing Yi. \"Yi Yi, shall we go change your clothes first?\" The smell of alcohol on her was quite strong.","Jing Yi tugged at the corner of her mouth. \"It's fine. This is evidence. Let's go to the hospital first.\" As she spoke, she had already gotten into the car.","After escorting Jing Zejun to the parking lot, Wen Qingyan didn't follow further. After all, it was a family matter. \"Call me if you need anything.\" Jing Zejun nodded, said goodbye to Wen Qingyan, and quickly got into the car.","\"Drive,\" Jing Yi's voice came from inside.","The driver turned back, confused. \"Aren't we waiting for the Second Young Master?\"","\"No!\" Seeing that Jing Zejun didn't object, the driver started the car.","In the car, Jing Yi sat with her eyes tightly closed, lost in thought. Looking at her, Jing Zejun's eyes were full of worry.","\"Yi Yi, don't be angry. Second Brother just speaks without thinking sometimes.\"","Jing Yi opened her eyes. Those eyes looked weary, having lost their usual sparkle. Seeming not to want to worry the person beside her, she still managed to curve her lips into a faint smile.","\"It's okay. Jun Jun, call Big Brother first. We're going to that private hospital from before. I'm not sure if they can detect what's on my hands.\"","Only then did Jing Zejun notice the tissue paper and small container in her hand. He looked up in surprise, \"You suspect she put something in the wine?\" Jing Yi's expression was solemn, her eyes betraying a hint of complexity. \"I'm not sure if it can be detected.\"","[I can only take a risk and try. If nothing can be found, it might be even harder to predict Jiang Miaomiao's actions later.]","Trying to lighten the heavy atmosphere in the car, Jing Yi said, \"If nothing turns up, I guess I'll really have to go kowtow and apologize to her.\"","Jing Zejun patted her head, knowing Jing Yi must have been hurt by Jing Zeqian's words. His tone carried a hint of anger, \"Let Second Brother go apologize himself!\"","Jing Yi smiled, lowering her head to hide the disappointment in her eyes.","Ten minutes later, the car arrived at the hospital entrance. Fearing that too much time would make detection even harder, Jing Yi quickened her pace as she entered the hospital, with Jing Zejun following closely behind.","The doctor from before was already waiting for them in the lobby. Seeing the two still in evening wear, one of them smelling strongly of alcohol, he was puzzled.","Jing Yi handed the items to the doctor. \"These are the samples. My big brother has already spoken to you, right?\"","The doctor nodded, \"Zeyou has already informed me. I'll take these for testing now. A nurse will show you two ladies to a waiting room. Or would you like me to prepare a change of clothes for you?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, \"It's fine. There are still some traces on my clothes. Do you need those?\"","The doctor slightly raised the samples in his hand, \"If we can't detect anything from these, it would be even harder to find anything on the clothes.\" Jing Yi thought about it and agreed, no longer worrying about it.","In the waiting room","Jing Yi leaned back on the sofa to rest, clearly smelling the alcohol on her clothes. \"Jun Jun, is the smell on my clothes bothering you?\"","Jing Zejun moved even closer to her, \"It's just a bit of alcohol smell, how could it bother me?\"","\"That's good.\"","Jing Yi closed her eyes, her whole being very quiet. This made Jing Zejun even more worried. He said softly, \"Yi Yi, are you very upset?\"","Jing Yi kept her eyes closed, \"A little bit.\"","[Although I had thought that I probably couldn't compare to his friend of ten years in that fool's heart, hearing him say it still hurts a little. Just a little bit.]","Jing Zejun felt heartbroken but didn't know how to comfort her. He could only silently keep her company.","Not long after, Jing Zeyou also arrived at the hospital, followed by Jing Zeqian, whose expression was complex and at a loss.","After Jing Yi left with Jing Zejun, Jing Zeqian had chased after them from the banquet hall, but by the time he arrived, the car had already driven away. Only Wen Qingyan, who was also preparing to leave, remained.","\"Mr. Jing?\"","\"Where are they?\"","Wen Qingyan raised his chin in the direction the car had gone, \"Just left.\"","Jing Zeqian looked very frustrated. Wen Qingyan thought for a moment and decided to say something to him, \"Mr. Jing, Jing Yi and Zejun are very worried about you.\""]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: There Really Is Something Else in the Liquid","paragraphs":["\"Especially Jing Yi, she went after you because she was worried about you.\"","Jing Zeqian remained silent. He knew Jing Yi was concerned about him, but he didn't understand exactly what she was worried about.","Wen Qingyan hesitated for a moment. \"There's something I'd like to tell Mr. Jing.\" He informed Jing Zeqian that his agent had discovered Jiang Miaomiao had invited some reporters to this banquet.","\"Although I don't know what her purpose is, the invitations were supposed to be confidential. You should be careful,\" Wen Qingyan said before leaving.","While Jing Zeqian was still deep in thought, Jing Zeyou called to say that Jing Yi and the others had gone to the hospital.","\"Hospital?!\" Jing Zeqian panicked, thinking something had happened to them.","Jing Zeyou explained they went to test the contents of the wine glasses.","Standing in the hospital waiting room, Jing Zeqian felt conflicted. He didn't even know what result would be better.","If there was nothing, what would Jing Yi do?","If there was something, what should he do?","Jing Zeqian looked up at Jing Yi, who was resting against Jing Zejun with her back to him. He couldn't hear any of her thoughts...","The doctor knocked and entered. Jing Zeqian's eyes were visibly flustered.","Seeing this, Jing Zeyou stepped forward.","The doctor's expression was far from relaxed. He handed the test report to Jing Zeyou, saying, \"We did indeed find traces of illegal substances in the liquid.\"","Jing Zeqian suddenly looked up at the doctor, frozen in place. When he came to his senses, he quickly walked over to Jing Zeyou and took the report.","His eyes were fixed on the results, his fingers trembling slightly as he held the paper.","Seeing Jing Zeqian's reaction, Jing Zeyou frowned, his expression complex and difficult to read. He understood all too well what Jiang Miaomiao meant to Jing Zeqian.","Or rather, what that time of shared glory meant to Jing Zeqian.","However, no amount of concern for his brother could outweigh his worry for Jing Yi. A flash of cold sternness passed through Jing Zeyou's eyes. Now was not the time for questioning.","Jing Yi only opened her eyes after hearing the results.","[Thank goodness, I've saved my knees. No need to kowtow and apologize to anyone.]","\"Jun Jun, let's go home. I'm a bit hungry,\" Jing Yi said. Because of the banquet incident, she and Jing Zejun hadn't had a chance to eat anything yet.","Jing Zejun took Jing Yi's outstretched hand and stood up, walking with her towards the door.","Jing Zeqian snapped back to reality, standing at the doorway looking uneasy and anxious.","Jing Yi said to Jing Zeyou, \"Big brother, we're heading home now.\" Jing Zeqian was still standing there.","Jing Yi looked at him calmly and said in a level voice, \"I didn't tamper with the sample after it was taken. Jun Jun can vouch for me. If you still don't believe me, you can ask big brother to check if I've bought any illegal substances recently.\"","As Jing Zeqian frantically tried to explain, Jing Yi continued, \"After you've thoroughly investigated this, you can look into Jiang Miaomiao if you want to.\"","Jing Zeyou's gaze towards Jing Zeqian held a hint of displeasure. What on earth had he said to Jing Yi to make her so angry?","Before Jing Zeqian could respond, Jing Yi had already walked past him with Jing Zejun.","Sensing the tense atmosphere, the doctor left after speaking, leaving only the two brothers in the room.","Jing Zeyou saw Jing Zeqian still holding the report, his eyes filled with desolation, lost in thought.","\"What do you plan to do?\" Jing Zeyou asked.","Jing Zeqian's shoulders slumped as he mumbled, \"Brother, she was the first person I brought into Startrack. After all these years, why would she do this?\" His hand tightly gripped the report.","Jing Zeyou sighed, \"Instead of guessing here, why don't you investigate it yourself? Or should I do it?\"","Jing Zeqian hesitated for a moment, then shook his head, refusing firmly, \"I'll do it.\" He had hurt his caring sister to get this result; he should at least look into it himself.","Jing Zeyou stepped forward and patted his shoulder, \"This isn't a trivial matter. Do what needs to be done.\" He didn't want Jing Zeqian to let the other party off lightly because of his relationship with Jiang Miaomiao.","Especially since it involved Jing Yi.","Jing Zeqian nodded, looking dejected, but Jing Zeyou didn't let him off the hook.","\"Also, did you say something very hurtful to Jing Yi?\" Jing Zeqian gave a bitter smile, \"Yes, I said she was being unreasonable; that she was presumptuous; and even if she would harm me, Jiang Miaomiao wouldn't...\"","Jing Zeyou's face tensed, his brows furrowed as he stared at Jing Zeqian with disapproval.","...","At the Jing family's dinner table, it was quieter than usual.","Lin Ruiqing had no appetite. She looked up at Jing Yi, who seemed no different from usual, eating with gusto, but very quietly. Lin Ruiqing didn't hear any of her usual comments about the food.","On the other side, Jing Zeqian also seemed off. Not only did he have no appetite, but why was he staring at Jing Yi with such a pained expression?","Could they be having a tiff?","As soon as dinner ended, Lin Ruiqing pulled Jing Zeyou to the study, with Jing Beicheng following close behind.","\"What did you say? Illegal substances?!\" The situation was much more serious than Lin Ruiqing had imagined. She turned to exchange a glance with Jing Beicheng, seeing the gravity in his eyes.","Jing Beicheng spoke up, \"Have you found out who's behind this?\" It couldn't just be Jiang Miaomiao alone going to such lengths.","For what purpose?","She was already Startrack's most resourceful and accomplished artist. What was the point of bringing down Jing Zeqian and Startrack now?","Jing Zeyou shook his head, \"Zeqian wants to investigate it himself.\"","Jing Beicheng frowned slightly, his expression serious, but he approved of Jing Zeqian investigating on his own. He was already the head of a company; he couldn't always hide behind the Jing family.","Lin Ruiqing turned to ask, \"What does this have to do with Jing Yi?\" Jing Zeyou explained Jing Yi's series of actions that day.","Lin Ruiqing seemed to recall something, \"No wonder Jing Yi was so hostile towards that Jiang Miaomiao!\" She believed it was Jing Yi's intuition that had led her to uncover this incident.","However, Lin Ruiqing wasn't worried about Jing Zeqian's close call. After all, he was sitting safely at the dinner table, so nothing serious had happened.","She was more concerned about Jing Yi's situation. \"Did that boy say something to make Jing Yi so angry?\" Jing Yi hadn't seemed as happy as usual during dinner.","Before he could even mention what Jing Zeqian had said to Jing Yi, Lin Ruiqing was already getting angry. If he told her, would his brother even be able to eat his meals in peace?","Jing Zeyou didn't hesitate at all and recounted word for word what Jing Zeqian had said to Jing Yi.","As expected, Lin Ruiqing was furious. Jing Beicheng, standing beside her, also darkened his expression.","\"What does he mean by 'even if Jing Yi would harm him, Jiang Miaomiao wouldn't'?! That's his sister! If it weren't for Jing Yi, Jing Zeqian would have been in jail by now!\"","She even used his full name. His brother was probably in big trouble now..."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Really Kicked Out","paragraphs":["In the Jing family home, Jing Zeyou's study.","Lin Ruiqing was scolding Jing Zeqian, who stood before her with slumped shoulders, not daring to utter a word in his defense.","\"You think you're so clever now? Your sister cares about you so much, and not only do you fail to thank her, but you mock her? What kind of brother are you?!\"","Jing Zeqian stood there like a quail, motionless.","\"You're so quick to defend your friend, huh? Ten years of friendship, you say? Didn't that end in betrayal too?!\" Lin Ruiqing grew increasingly agitated as she spoke: \"Yi Yi waited for you all morning, worried you might fall into someone's trap, and how do you repay her?! You accuse her without even asking what happened? Does she owe you something?\"","Jing Beicheng hurriedly supported Lin Ruiqing, fearing she might faint from anger. His eyes conveyed severity as he looked at Jing Zeqian.","\"You should know who your real family is by now.\"","Jing Zeqian's face suddenly turned pale. His father's single sentence carried more weight than all of his mother's scolding.","Jing Zeyou stood behind his parents, not speaking up for his brother. He felt that not joining Lin Ruiqing and the others in their criticism was already the greatest concession he could make.","Lin Ruiqing's breathing became rapid. She sat down on the sofa to calm her emotions. \"I heard from Zejun that after arguing with you, Yi Yi went straight to the hospital, worried that if too much time passed, they wouldn't be able to detect anything...\"","Thinking of Jing Yi's situation, Lin Ruiqing's voice became choked with emotion.","Jing Zeqian felt an indescribable sensation in his heart. He swallowed hard, forcing down the lump in his throat.","Looking at Jing Zeqian's expression, Lin Ruiqing grew increasingly irritated. She waved her hand dismissively, \"Forget it, just get out.\"","Jing Zeqian looked up, bewildered, his eyes slightly red. \"Where should I go?\" Lin Ruiqing didn't even glance at him, \"Wherever you want. Didn't you say you needed to investigate something? Go figure it out before you come back.\"","Jing Zeqian looked towards Jing Zeyou standing behind Lin Ruiqing, only to receive a helpless expression in return.","His father was even less likely to help him...","Downstairs, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were watching the newly aired 'Dear Family' reality show. Today was the premiere of the official edited version of the first episode.","Jing Yi kept glancing upstairs.","[Auntie called that fool upstairs quite a while ago. I wonder what they're talking about.]","Jing Zejun asked, \"What's wrong?\" Jing Yi shook her head but couldn't resist asking, \"What do you think they're saying up there?\"","The corners of Jing Zejun's mouth turned up. What else could they be doing but holding a criticism session?","At that moment, Jing Zeqian came downstairs with a suitcase, looking dejected. Jing Yi quickly turned her head, pretending to watch the show.","Jing Zejun looked over curiously, \"Second brother, where are you going so late?\" A flash of schadenfreude crossed his eyes.","Jing Zeqian had just opened his mouth to speak when Lin Ruiqing also came downstairs. \"Your second brother needs to go on a business trip for a while.\"","[Business trip?]","Jing Zeqian looked over at Jing Yi, who still hadn't turned to face him. He smiled bitterly, \"Yes, a business trip for a few days.\"","Jing Yi stole a glance at him and pursed her lips.","[What's this about? He hasn't really been kicked out, has he?]","Lin Ruiqing stood with her arms crossed, watching the person at the door. Ungrateful people need to be sent away for a few days to come to their senses!","\"So, I'm off?\" Jing Zeqian still hoped someone might ask him to stay, but even Jing Zejun just smiled and said goodbye.","Jing Zeqian could only slink away, dragging his suitcase out of the living room. Uncle Li was outside to open the door for him.","\"Uncle Li, I'm leaving.\"","Uncle Li smiled and bid Jing Zeqian farewell, \"Have a safe trip, Young Master Zeqian. The car is waiting for you at the entrance.\" Jing Zeqian sighed, realizing that truly no one in the house was going to ask him to stay.","However, this commotion did serve to distract from the harm Jiang Miaomiao had caused Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian's slender eyes gleamed with determination. He had to act quickly! Otherwise, he might really lose his place in the family!","More importantly, if he couldn't even enter the house now, how could he apologize to Jing Yi?","Meanwhile, after Jing Zeqian left, Jing Yi finally peeked towards the door. After a moment's thought, she still felt some sympathy, \"Auntie, it's so late now. Why not let Second Brother leave tomorrow?\"","Jing Yi had more or less figured out that this wasn't really a business trip, but rather Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng's way of standing up for her.","Lin Ruiqing sat down next to her to watch the show together. Hearing Jing Yi's words, she gently patted the back of her hand.","\"Why feel sorry for that boy? If we don't teach him a lesson, he'll keep being so self-righteous! Unable to tell right from wrong!\" The thought of Jing Zeqian still angered her, \"Besides, he's a grown man. What's there to be afraid of? Don't worry.\"","Jing Yi glanced at the door once more, then gave up. She was helpless in this situation too.","At the same time, in Jiang Miaomiao's apartment.","A man sat on the sofa, his hands resting on his knees, eyes narrowed. \"You're saying you failed?\"","Jiang Miaomiao sat nervously beside him, \"I was about to succeed when his fake sister suddenly burst in...\"","After changing clothes, Jiang Miaomiao had planned to find another opportunity, as the party had just begun. But when she came out, she found that both Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi had disappeared, and even Jing Zejun was nowhere to be seen.","Her assistant told her that the two seemed to have had a big argument and left one after the other.","\"I don't want to hear these excuses!\" the man scolded harshly, his tone seemingly frightening Jiang Miaomiao.","The man's face was as dark as storm clouds before a downpour. He raised his head, suppressing the urge to vent his emotions, and asked, \"What about the contents of the glass?\"","\"...It all spilled out.\"","At least she wasn't stupid enough to leave evidence in someone else's hands, but it seemed Jiang Miaomiao was no longer a useful pawn.","He didn't believe that Jing Zeqian hadn't noticed anything unusual about Jiang Miaomiao during this time. If they didn't succeed now, they probably never would.","\"The fake sister of Jing Zeqian you mentioned, is that Jing Yi?\" Jiang Miaomiao looked up at the man, \"Bo Qi, do you know her?\"","The man's gaze deepened as he recalled the girl at the Jing family party, the one Jing Zeqian had stopped from drinking.","Perhaps he needed to change his target.","Seeing the man remain silent, Jiang Miaomiao gently pushed his arm, \"Bo Qi, what are you thinking about?\"","The man's eyes flickered, and he put on the mask that Jiang Miaomiao was accustomed to seeing. He smiled and said, \"Nothing, I was just thinking about how to introduce you to my parents.\"","Jiang Miaomiao's worried eyes lit up, \"Really? You're not angry that I failed?\"","The man took Jiang Miaomiao's hands, gently caressing them, \"How could I be angry with you? You were only trying to help me. If this attempt didn't work, I'll just think of another way.\"","Jiang Miaomiao leaned gently into the man's embrace, saying softly, \"Bo Qi, you're so good to me.\"","Where Jiang Miaomiao couldn't see, the corners of the man's mouth curved into a mocking smile, but his voice remained as gentle as ever, \"Of course. How could I bear to let you and the baby suffer with me?\"","Jiang Miaomiao's face was filled with happiness, as if she had already envisioned their future together."]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Is She Still Angry","paragraphs":["\"Have you found out everything?\" Jing Zeyou looked at Jing Zeqian, who had come to the company early to find him. He had never felt his brother to be so clingy before.","It had only been a few days since he was kicked out, but he came to Hengjing every day to check in. Anyone who didn't know better might think he had been hired by Hengjing.","Jing Zeqian lay listlessly on the sofa, not even bothering to get up when someone came in to report on work. He was now like a stray dog, with no energy left to care about his image.","\"I found out. A man has been frequently entering and leaving Jiang Miaomiao's apartment recently. I had someone take photos.\" Jing Zeqian took a photo from his pocket and handed it to Jing Zeyou without getting up.","Jing Zeyou sighed and had to get up himself to take the photo. \"Wang Boqi?\" Jing Zeqian nodded lazily, \"That's right, it's that guy. He's Jiang Miaomiao's only channel to obtain those things.\"","He had checked all of Jiang Miaomiao's accounts and found no trace of any prohibited items.","Jing Zeqian continued, \"About six months ago, Wang Boqi started approaching Jiang Miaomiao and successfully won her over, probably for the plan at that party.\" No wonder Jiang Miaomiao had been acting so strangely lately.","\"Also, on the day of the party, Jiang Miaomiao arranged for many reporters. The plan was to notify the police for inspection immediately after I drank that glass of wine, while having the media capture images of me being arrested.\"","Jing Zeqian found it ironic that a friend he had known for nearly ten years would unhesitatingly turn against him because of a man.","\"But all of this was interrupted by Yiyi.\" And because of those 'ten years', he had doubted his sister and even hurt her.","Jing Zeyou looked at the man in the photo, his gaze sharp and filled with the authority of a leader. \"It seems the Wang family put a lot of effort into trying to bring us down.\"","Since they had set such an elaborate trap, it surely wasn't just aimed at Jing Zeqian or Startrack. Perhaps they had their sights set on the Jing family, or maybe Hengjing.","If something went wrong on Jing Zeqian's end, he and his family would certainly have to divert attention to deal with the situation. At the same time, it would be easier to infiltrate Hengjing internally. After all, they couldn't attend to everything at once.","It was indeed a grand scheme.","\"Brother, what should we do now?\" Jing Zeqian lounged on the sofa, attempting to pass the subsequent handling of the matter to Jing Zeyou.","Jing Zeyou glanced at him, \"Didn't you say you'd handle it yourself?\" Jing Zeqian made a bitter face. He had indeed made that boast, but now wasn't the situation too complex?","Jing Zeyou returned to his seat and continued dealing with the work at hand. \"You just need to handle Jiang Miaomiao. You have no evidence against the Wang family.\"","Jing Zeqian pondered for a moment and felt that Jing Zeyou's words made sense. \"Alright then.\" It was about time he had a talk with Jiang Miaomiao anyway. He had been planning to talk to her a few months ago.","However, there was still one more thing.","Jing Zeqian pursed his lips and asked tentatively, \"Is Jing Yiyi still angry with me?\"","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly, pausing his work. \"Shouldn't you be asking Yiyi herself whether she's angry or not?\"","Jing Zeqian slumped back onto the sofa, looking utterly powerless. \"I can't find her... She's not answering my calls or replying to my messages, and I can't go back home now.\"","\"Doesn't that mean she's still angry?\"","Jing Zeqian deflated even more.","Jing Zeyou continued to twist the knife, \"I heard from Junjun that Yiyi promised, if she couldn't present evidence to you, she would kowtow and apologize to Jiang Miaomiao?\"","Jing Zeqian became anxious, \"That was just said in anger. Even if I had to kowtow, I would never let her kowtow to Jiang Miaomiao!\"","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow, \"Is that so? But isn't she your friend of ten years? How long have you known Yiyi? Just a few months?\" Previously, he had stayed silent out of concern for the impact on their parents, but the proper procedures still needed to be followed.","Jing Zeqian slouched, his shoulders drooping. He knew his brother wouldn't let him off easily, but he had already resigned himself to the criticism. One more person joining in wouldn't make a difference, as long as Jing Yiyi could forgive him soon.","\"...Brother, can you put in a good word for me with Jing Yiyi?\"","Jing Zeyou continued with his work without looking up. \"Why don't you ask Junjun for help? They've been hanging out together these past few days.\" Yiyi had even taken her out for a drive.","\"As if that girl Junjun would help me!\"","Jing Zeqian had finally realized that Jing Zejun, who usually seemed so docile, could be more stubborn than anyone when she set her mind to it. She definitely wouldn't speak up for him unless Jing Yiyi relented.","Moreover, she had always treated Jing Yiyi like a sister. Now that he had upset her sister, getting even a pleasant expression from Jing Zejun would be considered a testament to her good nature.","Jing Zeyou chuckled lightly, \"I advise you to finish dealing with this matter as soon as possible and beg Mom and Dad to let you come back home. Otherwise, when the live stream starts, the whole country will know that you've made Yiyi angry.\" There might be even more people laughing at him then.","Thinking of that scene, Jing Zeqian felt a headache coming on!","He sprawled on the sofa, muttering, \"Find a chance to go home, find a chance to go home...\"","Jing Zeyou looked up at Jing Zeqian, truly worried that his brother might be losing it. \"Have you forgotten? Mom's birthday is coming up in a while.\"","Jing Zeqian suddenly sat up, his eyes brightening, \"That's right! Mom's birthday! She should be merciful enough to let me come home, right?\"","Jing Zeyou said slowly and deliberately, \"I rather think that if you don't prepare a nice gift, your father will be the biggest obstacle to you coming home.\"","Jing Zeqian's eyes widened, \"Right, right, right! I can't just think about coming home, I need to prepare a beautiful gift for Mom!\" With that, Jing Zeqian hurriedly got up to leave. \"Brother! I'm off!\"","Outside the door, Assistant Chen was about to knock when Jing Zeqian suddenly rushed out, startling him.","Assistant Chen looked in the direction Jing Zeqian had left, asking with some confusion, \"Mr. Jing, what's wrong with Mr. Jing Zeqian?\"","The corners of Jing Zeyou's mouth turned up, \"Don't mind him, he's just gone mad.\"","...","\"Zeqian, you were looking for me?\"","Upon hearing that Jing Zeqian was looking for her, Jiang Miaomiao felt nervous and scared. She didn't know if the incident with the wine had been discovered.","The Jing Zeqian before her seemed different from usual, his expression unprecedentedly serious.","Seeing Jiang Miaomiao enter, he gestured for her to sit on the sofa and poured her a glass of water.","Jing Zeqian's unusual behavior made Jiang Miaomiao feel uneasy. She hurriedly stood up to take the water glass, which was even filled with warm water.","Jiang Miaomiao forced a smile, \"Why the sudden thoughtfulness in pouring me water? I'm truly flattered.\"","Jing Zeqian's gaze remained serious, \"Haven't you been unable to drink coffee recently?\" Jiang Miaomiao laughed dryly, \"Yes, I haven't been drinking much.\"","Jing Zeqian looked at her and said calmly, \"Indeed, after all, it's not very suitable to drink too much coffee when you're pregnant.\"","Water spilled from the glass as Jiang Miaomiao visibly panicked, her smile becoming very forced. \"Zeqian, what kind of joke are you making? How could I be pregnant?\""]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Is Wang Boqi really that good","paragraphs":["Jing Zeqian stared at Jiang Miaomiao, \"Are you still not going to tell me the truth?\" Jiang Miaomiao's eyes flickered slightly, a bitter smile on her lips as she put the water glass on the table and said softly, \"When did you find out?\"","She had always anticipated this day, she should have known it couldn't be hidden forever.","\"Yesterday.\" Jiang Miaomiao asked again, \"So, you also know I put something in your drink?\"","Jing Zeqian nodded slowly. Jiang Miaomiao's eyes reddened slightly as she smiled at Jing Zeqian, \"Thank you for letting me save face.\"","Jiang Miaomiao knew that not being arrested at her doorstep yesterday was due to Jing Zeqian's mercy.","Jing Zeqian's lips curled in a mocking smile, \"Don't think so highly of me, I just wanted to know the reason.\" He looked at Jiang Miaomiao's belly, \"Is it because of him (her)?\"","Jiang Miaomiao smiled and shook her head, \"No.\" Her hand gently caressed her abdomen.","Jing Zeqian closed his eyes and took a deep breath, \"So, it's because of that man?\"","Jiang Miaomiao pursed her lips, her eyes full of apology, \"...I'm sorry.\"","Because of Jiang Miaomiao, he had hurt Jing Yiyi so much. If Jiang Miaomiao had 'stabbed' him once, hadn't he also 'stabbed' Jing Yiyi, who had protected him...","And now Jiang Miaomiao was telling him it was just for a man! For a moment, Jing Zeqian felt he was truly as stupid as a pig!","Sorry?","You think a simple 'sorry' is enough when you're ready to send me to prison? A 'sorry' is enough to bring down Startrack and Hengjing?","Jing Zeqian gritted his teeth, trying to keep himself as calm as possible, but the anger in his eyes was impossible to hide.","\"Jiang Miaomiao, do you remember? The first time I met you, you drank yourself sick for a role, ending up in the hospital. Later you told me that was your dream.\"","He scoffed, \"What? Has your dream now changed to being a housewife?\"","\"That role was so important to me! I've always been just a minor character, but someday I could stand center stage!\"","\"Mr. Jing, I will become Startrack's pride!\"","\"Today, as I receive the Best Actress award, the person I should thank the most is my boss!\"","Jiang Miaomiao felt a bit dazed. Yes, she had originally hoped to become an excellent actress, but why had that changed?","Jing Zeqian took a deep breath and asked, \"Is there anything else you want to say?\" Like, for instance, about the person behind all this.","Jiang Miaomiao shook her head lightly. She had nothing more to say, except to express her remorse to Jing Zeqian, \"I'm sorry...\"","Anger flashed in Jing Zeqian's eyes as he couldn't help but raise his voice, \"Is Wang Boqi really that great? You're willing to go to prison yourself rather than say one bad word about him?\"","The disappointment and resentment in his heart made Jing Zeqian burst out, \"I f***ing believed in you to the point where I was nearly deaf! Blind! And all you have to say is 'sorry'?!\"","Tears slid down Jiang Miaomiao's cheeks. She knew she owed Jing Zeqian too much, \"It's not like that, Zeqian. You know that even if I turned him in, neither you nor I have any evidence.\"","What's so good about Wang Boqi?","He's gentle, he's courteous, he's knowledgeable, but after a while, Jiang Miaomiao could see through it all. The patience was fake, the tenderness was fake, even marrying her was fake.","The scary part was, she was serious.","The sound of police sirens rose from downstairs. Jiang Miaomiao knew this conversation was over. She sighed in relief and stood up.","Jing Zeqian's lips were pressed tightly together as his gaze fell on Jiang Miaomiao's hands, \"What are you going to do about your child?\"","Jiang Miaomiao was startled for a moment, a faint smile on her face, \"I'll contact my parents. They will take care of this child.\" Her money was enough to raise this child.","Jing Zeqian looked up at her, \"I thought you would send it to the Wang family.\" Aren't you deeply in love with Wang Boqi? Don't you want to be the Wang family's daughter-in-law?","Send it to the Wang family?","The corners of Jiang Miaomiao's mouth turned up slightly, her eyes filled with mockery, \"In his eyes, this child has no use. He won't want it.\"","Someone was already knocking at the door. Jiang Miaomiao looked at Jing Zeqian with reddened eyes and said softly, \"I'm sorry, Zeqian. You should just consider that the girl from ten years ago is already dead.\"","Jiang Miaomiao was taken away.","This news quickly became a hot topic, and the contingency plan prepared by Jing Zeqian was simultaneously released on the official account.","[Suspected of possessing prohibited items?! How dare she?!]","[I don't believe it! That's Jiang Miaomiao!]","[Above, she was arrested right at Startrack's entrance...]","[But Startrack is really brave! Their PR response is so timely!]","[Of course, that's Young Master Jing. Would he cover up for his own artist?!]","[Who?! Jiang Miaomiao?! Why? I'm her fan!]","[Miaomiao, you're so foolish! You were making so much money, why did you do such a thing!]","The hot search on social media only briefly caught the attention of the Jing family members, as they had more important matters at hand - Lin Ruiqing's birthday party.","Jing Zeqian was finally allowed to return and attend the party. As he entered the banquet hall, he looked around, seemingly searching for someone.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were standing on either side of Lin Ruiqing.","Jing Yi was wearing a black ripple evening gown that emitted a soft glow. The layered tulle at the back swayed gently. Her dark hair was loosely tied up, revealing the fair skin of her back.","The dimples on her face, one deep and one shallow, combined with her overall look, made her appear both sweet and alluring.","Jing Zejun was wearing a Baroque-style vintage fishtail gown, adorned with layered diamond chains, perfectly showcasing the wearer's superior figure and gentle temperament.","\"Mrs. Jing, your two daughters are truly beautiful!\"","Lin Ruiqing smiled happily as she exchanged pleasantries with the guests attending the party.","Jing Yi maintained a polite smile, nodding slightly and briefly greeting the person opposite her.","This was the tenth time she had heard such a conversation tonight...","Soon after, the party officially began. As per custom, the host needed to give a short speech. Jing Beicheng took Lin Ruiqing's hand and led her to the center of the stage.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun followed arm in arm, listening to Lin Ruiqing thanking the guests. As Jing Yi listened, her mind began to wander.","Jing Zeqian watched Jing Yi from the side, noticing she was lost in thought again.","When the guests' applause rang out, Jing Yi came back to her senses and joined in clapping. She inadvertently caught sight of Jing Zeqian nearby.","Jing Zeqian looked at her, smiling ingratiatingly, but Jing Yi turned away expressionlessly.","Jing Zeqian's shoulders slumped dejectedly. She clearly hadn't forgiven him yet...","Meanwhile, Lin Ruiqing turned slightly, beckoning the two girls forward. She held their hands, her eyes filled with deep love and tenderness.","Lin Ruiqing smiled and said, \"In previous years, I only had one wish - to find Junjun.\" Jing Zejun's eyes showed a hint of emotion as she tightly held Lin Ruiqing's hands in return.","Lin Ruiqing then shifted her gaze to Jing Yi's face, \"This year, I also have only one wish. I hope that both my daughters will be healthy, happy, and successful in everything they do.\""]}]);
